help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015212078-Can-I-sell-my-models-on-other-marketplaces"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Lithuanian withholding: 15% for individuals, 10% for legal entities, 0% for Lithuanian tax residents; calculated by seller, earning type, and payout period.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/46197611945873-How-is-the-withholding-tax-calculated"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/35293756906257-Payout-Rate-System-Explained-Effective-September-15-2026", "label": "Payout rates"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/50374021634833-Payout-Rate-Update-September-15-2026-FAQ", "label": "Payout update FAQ"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/35430275704465-How-Referrals-Work-on-CGTrader", "label": "Referral payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.cgtrader.com/discover/sell-3d-models", "label": "Signup and costs"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015212078-Can-I-sell-my-models-on-other-marketplaces", "label": "Cross-listing policy"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015145157-Payout-fees", "label": "Transfer fees"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/46197611945873-How-is-the-withholding-tax-calculated", "label": "Withholding rates"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/46197617072913-To-which-earnings-does-withholding-tax-apply", "label": "Withholding scope"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/46191760965137-What-is-a-Custom-Enterprise-Deal-and-how-does-it-affect-my-earnings-as-a-seller", "label": "Enterprise earnings"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Standard share is 55–80%; referred buyers earn 85% for one year. Lithuanian withholding depends on seller status and earnings.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "3D model marketplace", "note": "Your rate is reviewed daily across