rs keep their IP rights.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cubebrush.co/hc/en-us/articles/360002565373-Cubebrush-Distribution-Agreement"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payouts run on the 1st or 15th after the $20 minimum. PayPal is listed; US direct deposit is marked “coming soon.”", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cubebrush.co/hc/en-us/articles/206816597-How-do-I-get-paid"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.cubebrush.co/hc/en-us/articles/206091848-How-much-do-I-make-on-each-sale", "label": "Earnings and fee"}, {"url": "https://cubebrush.co/open_store", "label": "Store pricing"}, {"url": "https://support.cubebrush.co/hc/en-us/articles/206816457-How-can-I-open-a-store-on-Cubebrush", "label": "Invitation process"}, {"url": "https://support.cubebrush.co/hc/en-us/articles/360002565373-Cubebrush-Distribution-Agreement", "label": "Distribution agreement"}, {"url": "https://support.cubebrush.co/hc/en-us/articles/206816597-How-do-I-get-paid", "label": "Payout schedule"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Direct sales pay 95% and marketplace-generated sales pay 70%. Each transaction has a $0.50 fee. Payouts run on the 1st or 15th after $20; PayPal is listed and US direct deposit is marked “coming soon.”","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Digital art assets", "note": "Sales from your own links or social posts cost much less than marketplace sales.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Per sale", "value": "50¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$20", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Cubebrush", "groups": [{"label": "Cubebrush", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70% of profits", "label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 95%", "label": "Your