_pa_are_paid/start", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://docs.daz3d.com/public/publishing/steps_to_publish/start", "label": "Submission and review"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The standard exclusive royalty is 50% of net sales; non-exclusive terms vary by product and top-seller bonuses apply.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "3D figures and content", "note": "Non-exclusive rates are lower and agreed per product.", "take": {"label": "Exclusive, net sales", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Standard deal", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly or twice monthly", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Daz 3D", "groups": [{"label": "Exclusive agreement", "rates": [{"note": "Top sellers get a 5–15% bonus", "label": "Exclusive, net sales", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures--fab","section_id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures","name":"Fab","summary":"Sell 3D models, materials, and other digital assets.","website_url":"https://www.fab.com/become-a-publisher","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-fab-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-product asset and pack sales through Fab listings.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/fab/publisher-get-started-in-fab"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Publisher receives 88% of product sale revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/fab/publisher-get-started-in-fab"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "unverified", "value": "The publisher guide does not specify a separate seller fee, but the linked Distribution Agreement could not be read in this review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/fab/publisher-get-started-in-fab"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "unverified", "value": "The linked Distribution Agreement could not be read in this review, so exclusivity remains unverified.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.fab.com/distribution-agreement"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout about 30 days after month-end at $100+; lower balances roll over. Any unpaid balance older than 1 year is paid regardless of the minimum. Refunds reduce payouts; tax/payment setup varies by region.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/fab/publisher-get-started-in-fab"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/fab/publisher-get-started-in-fab", "label": "Publisher setup and payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.fab.com/o/become-a-publisher", "label": "Publisher signup"}, {"url": "https://www.fab.com/legal", "label": "Legal documents"}, {"url": "https://www.fab.com/distribution-agreement", "label": "Distribution Agreement"}, {"url": "https://www.fab.com/refunds", "label": "Refund policy"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Publisher guide states an 88% share; the linked Distribution Agreement was not readable in this review, so seller fees and exclusivity remain unverified.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "3D assets on Fab", "note": "Fab’s distribution agreement could not be read, so exclusivity is not confirmed.", "take": {"label": "Product sales", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, $100 minimum", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Refunds", "value": "Taken from payouts", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Epic", "groups": [{"label": "Fab", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 88%", "label": "Product sales", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures--renderhub","section_id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures","name":"RenderHub","summary":"3D asset royalties rise with the number of products in a seller’s store.","website_url":"https://www.renderhub.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-renderhub-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-sale royalty increases by store item count.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/how-to-sell-3d-models-on-renderhub"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "55% for 1–50 items; 60% for 51–100; 65% for 101–200; 70% for 201+.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/how-to-sell-3d-models-on-renderhub"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public seller terms do not state a signup or listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/terms-of-use"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity is required; sellers can list elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/how-to-sell-3d-models-on-renderhub"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payouts start at $20 ($30 for bank transfer); discounts/refunds may reduce royalties, and failed-payment fees may be deducted.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/terms-of-use"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/how-to-sell-3d-models-on-renderhub", "label": "Seller tiers"}, {"url": "https://www.renderhub.com/info/terms-of-use", "label": "Payment terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Seller share is 55–70% by item count. Public terms state $20 minimum payout ($30 for bank transfer), but do not publish a monthly schedule. Discounts, refunds, and returned-payment costs can reduce royalties.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "3D model marketplace", "note": "Your rate improves as your store grows.", "take": {"label": "1–50 items", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$20", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "RenderHub", "groups": [{"label": "By store size", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 55%", "label": "1–50 items", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "51–100 items", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "101–200 items", "value": "35%", "percent": 35, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "201+ items", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "201+ items", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures--renderosity","section_id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures","name":"Renderosity","summary":"Digital assets with monthly royalty tiers based on vendor ranking.","website_url":"https://www.renderosity.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-renderosity-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-sale royalties; rank uses the vendor’s site revenue over the prior 90 days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://live.cdn.renderosity.com/media_library/Renderosity-Vendor-Policy-FINAL-20250929.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ranks 1–10: 70%; 11–25: 65%; 26–50: 60%; 51–100: 55%; 101+: 50%. Prime and approved Loyalty each add 5 points, up to 80%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://live.cdn.renderosity.com/media_library/Renderosity-Vendor-Policy-FINAL-20250929.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public Vendor Policy does not state a vendor signup or listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://live.cdn.renderosity.com/media_library/Renderosity-Vendor-Policy-FINAL-20250929.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public Vendor Policy does not state whether vendors may list the same products elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://live.cdn.renderosity.com/media_library/Renderosity-Vendor-Policy-FINAL-20250929.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Standard payouts are monthly after $60; optional mid-month payouts have extra fees. Prime pricing discounts products 40–50%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://live.cdn.renderosity.com/media_library/Renderosity-Vendor-Policy-FINAL-20250929.pdf"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://live.cdn.renderosity.com/media_library/Renderosity-Vendor-Policy-FINAL-20250929.pdf", "label": "Vendor Policy"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Base royalty depends on the vendor’s rolling 90-day site-revenue rank; eligible product programs can raise the split to 80%.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "3D content marketplace", "note": "Prime pricing discounts products by 40–50%.", "take": {"label": "New vendors", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Rank by", "value": "Last 90 days of sales", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$60", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Renderosity", "groups": [{"label": "By vendor rank", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Top 10 vendors", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Ranks 11–25", "value": "35%", "percent": 35, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Ranks 26–50", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Ranks 51–100", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Rank 101 and below", "label": "New vendors", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Bonuses", "rates": [{"note": "Prime and Loyalty add 5 points each", "label": "Best case", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Top 10 vendors", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures--superhive","section_id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures","name":"Superhive","summary":"Sell Blender add-ons and assets with optional seller plans.","website_url":"https://superhivemarket.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/superhivemarket-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-item asset sales; creator application and product review required.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/182-how-to-apply-to-become-a-creator"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Creator receives 70%, 80%, or 90% of the product price after processor charges, by plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/185-how-merchant-and-transaction-fees-are-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan is $0; Pro is $49/month; Ultimate is $199/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://superhivemarket.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity policy; creators may sell the same products elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/56-sell-products-on-other-sites"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Per item: $0.49 transaction fee plus 5.5%, 5%, or 4% merchant fee by plan; both are deducted before creator commission.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/185-how-merchant-and-transaction-fees-are-calculated"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://superhivemarket.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and commission"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/185-how-merchant-and-transaction-fees-are-calculated", "label": "Merchant and transaction fees"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/44-terms-of-use-creator", "label": "Creator terms"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/56-sell-products-on-other-sites", "label": "Cross-listing policy"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/182-how-to-apply-to-become-a-creator", "label": "Application and review"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/284-minimum-payout-thresholds", "label": "Payout threshold"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/46-how-and-when-creators-get-paid", "label": "Payout schedule"}, {"url": "https://support.superhivemarket.com/article/273-can-i-be-paid-as-a-creator-on-blender-market", "label": "Regional payout fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The creator share is calculated after the per-item transaction and plan-based merchant fees. Payout-provider and currency fees may also apply.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Blender add-ons and assets", "note": "Card and transaction fees come off first, then the plan share. Products are reviewed.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $49, or $199 a month", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Per item", "value": "49¢ + 4–5.5%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Superhive", "groups": [{"label": "Plans", "rates": [{"note": "+ 5.5% and 49¢ per item", "label": "Free plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "$49 a month; + 5% and 49¢", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "$199 a month; + 4% and 49¢", "label": "Ultimate plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Ultimate plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures--turbosquid","section_id":"3d-models-materials-and-textures","name":"TurboSquid","summary":"3D model marketplace with optional higher royalty programs.","website_url":"https://www.turbosquid.com/Sell-3D-Models","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-turbosquid-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-sale asset royalties; optional affiliate referrals.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/general-info/getting-paid/royalty-percentage/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic starts at 40%. Exclusive SquidGuild starts at 50% and rises to 60% above $10,000 lifetime sales. Affiliate sales add 15% for Basic or 20% for SquidGuild, reaching 80% on a qualifying sale of your own product.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/squidguild/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Account signup and uploads are free; sellers pay no listing cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/general-info/general-information-faqs/general-seller-faq/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic is non-exclusive. SquidGuild requires exclusivity across the seller’s 3D catalog, with limited exceptions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/squidguild/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Tax withholding may reduce royalties. Refunded sales and some remote-rendering costs can also reduce the royalty base.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/general-info/terms-agreements/publishing-agreement/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/general-info/getting-paid/royalty-percentage/", "label": "Base royalty and tax"}, {"url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/squidguild/", "label": "SquidGuild rates"}, {"url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/general-info/general-information-faqs/general-seller-faq/", "label": "Seller cost and Basic account"}, {"url": "https://resources.turbosquid.com/general-info/terms-agreements/publishing-agreement/", "label": "Publishing Agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 80% maximum requires the exclusive SquidGuild program and a qualifying affiliate sale.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "3D model marketplace", "note": "Affiliate referrals add 15% for Basic or 20% for SquidGuild to your share.", "take": {"label": "Basic", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "SquidGuild", "value": "Exclusive only", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Tax", "value": "May be withheld", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "TurboSquid", "groups": [{"label": "Basic, non-exclusive", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 40%", "label": "Basic", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "SquidGuild, exclusive", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "SquidGuild start", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 60%", "label": "Above $10,000 lifetime", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Your own referrals", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "Best case, SquidGuild", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "SquidGuild start", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--cgtrader-printable-models","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"CGTrader printable models","summary":"3D models sold with royalties based on recent seller earnings.","website_url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-print-models","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-cgtrader-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Printable 3D model sales; the rate tier also counts completed 3D projects and allocated subscription revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/35293756906257-Payout-Rate-System-Explained-Effective-September-15-2026"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard payout is 55–80% by rolling 365-day net sales; referred buyers earn 85% for 12 months.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/50374021634833-Payout-Rate-Update-September-15-2026-FAQ"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No monthly fees or listing costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.cgtrader.com/discover/sell-3d-models"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Hyperwallet fees: PayPal/Venmo $0.30; bank $0.80 basic or $4.10 international; wire 2% ($7.70 min, $23 max); FX 1.9–3.75%. Payoneer transfers below $100 cost $1.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015145157-Payout-fees"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller chooses the model license, such as Royalty-Free or Editorial, and retains ownership; CGTrader receives a non-exclusive license.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.cgtrader.com/pages/terms-and-conditions"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/35293756906257-Payout-Rate-System-Explained-Effective-September-15-2026", "label": "Payout rates"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/50374021634833-Payout-Rate-Update-September-15-2026-FAQ", "label": "Referral payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.cgtrader.com/discover/sell-3d-models", "label": "Setup and licensing"}, {"url": "https://help.cgtrader.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015145157-Payout-fees", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://www.cgtrader.com/pages/terms-and-conditions", "label": "Rights and licenses"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Standard platform cuts are 20–45%, calculated as 100% minus the published 55–80% seller payout; referral buyers earn 85% for one year.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Printable 3D models", "note": "Your rate is based on your last 365 days of sales.", "take": {"label": "New sellers", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "30¢", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Licenses", "value": "You choose", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "CGTrader", "groups": [{"label": "By sales in the last 365 days", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 55% at $0", "label": "New sellers", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 80% at $300,000", "label": "Top tier", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 85% for 12 months", "label": "Buyers you refer", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Top tier", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--cults","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"Cults","summary":"Sell downloadable 3D printing designs.","website_url":"https://cults3d.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/cults3d-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid digital downloads; creator sets the price and license for each model.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cults3d.com/en/upload"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Cults keeps 20%; creator receives 80% of the pre-VAT net price. VAT applies to the commission based on seller status and buyer location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cults3d.com/en/pages/vat-application-rules"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No subscription or fixed selling fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cults3d.com/en/upload"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "About 5% of the 20% commission covers banking costs; separate payout and currency-conversion fees depend on payment method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cults3d.com/en/payouts/methods"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain file ownership; licenses include Private, Commercial, No Derivatives, and Creative Commons options.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cults3d.com/en/licenses"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://cults3d.com/en/upload", "label": "Onboarding and commission"}, {"url": "https://cults3d.com/en/pages/vat-application-rules", "label": "Commission and VAT"}, {"url": "https://cults3d.com/en/licenses", "label": "License options"}, {"url": "https://cults3d.com/en/payouts/methods", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://cults3d.com/en/questions", "label": "Payout and license FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Official seller terms checked 2026-09-28; VAT and payout charges depend on seller location and payment method.","fee_percent":20,"fee_basis":"20% commission on the pre-VAT design price; seller payout costs can vary by method.","sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "3D printing files", "note": "VAT is charged on the commission, depending on where you and the buyer are.", "take": {"label": "Each sale", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Banking costs", "value": "Included", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Licenses", "value": "Private to commercial", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Cults", "groups": [{"label": "Cults", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80% before VAT", "label": "Each sale", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--gambody","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"Gambody","summary":"Sell STL models for 3D printing.","website_url":"https://www.gambody.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-gambody-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "STL sales through immediate Stock uploads or reviewed Premium models; Stock files have a 200 MB per-file limit.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.gambody.com/blog/new-stock-category-on-gambody/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Premium creator share is 50–80% exclusive or 35% general; Stock pays 80% of profit. Premium cuts shown are the remainder of the creator share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.gambody.com/page/rates"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Membership is free; Gambody charges no fee to offer products for sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.gambody.com/page/membership"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payout is requested; balances below $100 are normally held until threshold or 12 months. SWIFT costs $35; payment-agent charges, refunds, and chargebacks are deducted.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.gambody.com/page/membership"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller retains product ownership and grants the buyer a license; special deals can set additional license terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.gambody.com/page/membership"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.gambody.com/page/rates", "label": "Seller rates"}, {"url": "https://www.gambody.com/blog/new-stock-category-on-gambody/", "label": "Stock files"}, {"url": "https://www.gambody.com/page/membership", "label": "Fees, payouts, and licenses"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Premium platform cuts are the remainder of the published creator shares. Stock’s separate 80% profit-share basis is not included in the Premium fee range.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "STL models", "note": "Premium models are reviewed. Stock files go live right away.", "take": {"label": "General sellers", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Stock files", "value": "Up to 200 MB", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "SWIFT payout", "value": "$35", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Gambody", "groups": [{"label": "Premium models", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 35%", "label": "General sellers", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 50–80%", "label": "Exclusive sellers", "value": "20–50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Stock files", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "Of profit", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Exclusive sellers", "value": "20–50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--myminifactory","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"MyMiniFactory","summary":"3D printing files, crowdfunding, and creator memberships.","website_url":"https://www.myminifactory.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-myminifactory-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital file sales; objects are checked for printability and manually reviewed before publication.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/the-store-faq"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Current tiers: Upcoming 15%, Pro 12.5%, Studio 10%; legacy tier 12.5%. The fee is on the object price before VAT/sales tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/store-manager-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly tier prices: Upcoming $9.99, Pro $24.99, Studio $99.99, plus VAT; legacy tier is $24.99 plus VAT.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/premium-creator-tiers-faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sale processing: 3.49% + $0.49 over $3; 5% + $0.49 at $3 or less. Percentage payout fee is 0%; payout requests below $100 have a separate $2 fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/store-manager-fees"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Buyer rights vary by model and creator; commercial print rights may be granted separately by the creator.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.myminifactory.com/object/3d-print-scorcher-one-602069"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/store-manager-fees", "label": "Commission and processing"}, {"url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/premium-creator-tiers-faq", "label": "Tiers and prices"}, {"url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/the-store-faq", "label": "Review FAQ"}, {"url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/how-to-request-a-payout", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://creator.myminifactory.com/how-does-myminifactory-collect-vat/sales-tax", "label": "Fee basis"}, {"url": "https://www.myminifactory.com/object/3d-print-scorcher-one-602069", "label": "Example license terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Sale processing varies with the order amount. The percentage payout fee is 0%; the separate payout guide lists a flat $2 processing fee for requests below $100. Marketing-as-a-Service ad sales have separate tier-based commissions.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "3D printing files", "note": "Payouts under $100 cost $2. Fees are on the price before tax.", "take": {"label": "Upcoming plan", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$9.99 to $99.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "3.49% + 49¢", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Review", "value": "Manual", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "MyMiniFactory", "groups": [{"label": "By plan", "rates": [{"note": "$9.99 a month", "label": "Upcoming plan", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "$24.99 a month", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "12.5%", "percent": 12.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "$99.99 a month", "label": "Studio plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Studio plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--printables-clubs","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"Printables Clubs","summary":"Sell memberships supporting a 3D design catalog.","website_url":"https://www.printables.com/clubs","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-printables-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "An older Prusa Help page says creators need level 18 to start a Club; current creator terms do not confirm whether this still applies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.prusa3d.com/article/about_493458"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Printables keeps a 10% fee from Club payments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.prusa3d.com/page/printables-club-and-store-terms-and-conditions-for-creators_236503/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Creating and running a Club is free; there is no monthly fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-clubs-are-live-you-can-now-support-the-creators-you-love-on-printables_81063/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe and currency-conversion fees are additional and outside Printables’ control.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-clubs-are-live-you-can-now-support-the-creators-you-love-on-printables_81063/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators can set commercial or custom licenses by tier and exclude individual models from those license benefits.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-clubs-are-live-you-can-now-support-the-creators-you-love-on-printables_81063/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-clubs-are-live-you-can-now-support-the-creators-you-love-on-printables_81063/", "label": "Club fees and licenses"}, {"url": "https://help.prusa3d.com/article/about_493458", "label": "Clubs overview"}, {"url": "https://www.prusa3d.com/page/printables-club-and-store-terms-and-conditions-for-creators_236503/", "label": "Creator terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Official Prusa Club terms; payment-processing and conversion charges vary by payment method and location.","fee_percent":10,"fee_basis":"10% Printables fee on Club payments; Stripe and conversion fees are extra.","sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "3D design memberships", "note": "Older help pages say you need level 18 to start a Club.", "take": {"label": "Club payments", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Stripe, fees extra", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Licenses", "value": "Set per tier", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Printables", "groups": [{"label": "Printables", "rates": [{"label": "Club payments", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--printables-store","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"Printables Store","summary":"Sell individual 3D printing files.","website_url":"https://www.printables.com/store","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-printables-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "A 2023 launch post said new stores received one paid-model slot and had a $5 minimum; current creator terms do not confirm whether these limits remain.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-store_87810/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "20% Printables platform fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.prusa3d.com/page/printables-club-and-store-terms-and-conditions-for-creators_236503/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Opening a Store is free; no monthly seller fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-store_87810/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payments go through Stripe; Stripe processing and currency-conversion fees are additional.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-store_87810/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-model options: Standard personal use, Commercial use, and Commercial use with no derivatives.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-store_87810/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://blog.prusa3d.com/printables-store_87810/", "label": "Store fees and licenses"}, {"url": "https://www.prusa3d.com/page/printables-club-and-store-terms-and-conditions-for-creators_236503/", "label": "Creator terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Official Prusa Store terms; Stripe processing and currency-conversion charges vary by payment and location.","fee_percent":20,"fee_basis":"Printables platform fee per Store sale; Stripe and currency-conversion fees are extra.","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "3D printing files", "note": "In 2023, new stores got one paid-model slot and a $5 minimum price. That may have changed.", "take": {"label": "Each sale", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Stripe, fees extra", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Licenses", "value": "Personal or commercial", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Printables", "groups": [{"label": "Printables", "rates": [{"label": "Each sale", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"3d-printing-files--thangs","section_id":"3d-printing-files","name":"Thangs","summary":"3D model sales, memberships, and a subscription download pool.","website_url":"https://thangs.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/thangs-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital model sales, memberships, Bundle downloads, and optional physical Print Store orders.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thangs.com/resources/legal/terms-and-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Models: 30% under $5, 20% $5–$10, and 15% from $10; the official terms overlap at exactly $10. Memberships: 14% (eligible legacy plans: 8%); Bundle has no added platform fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thangs.com/resources/legal/terms-and-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid memberships below $10 add $5/month at $5–$9.99 or $30/month at $2–$4.99 while members remain; no monthly fee applies at $10+.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thangs.com/resources/legal/terms-and-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe 2.9% + $0.30 (recurring +0.5%); PayPal 3.49% + $0.49; Shopify 2.9% + $0.30 (Amex 3.9% + $0.30); taxable payments 0.4%; Stripe payout 0.25% + $0.25 plus cross-border; FX varies by provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thangs.com/resources/legal/terms-and-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators attach their own license file; paid memberships can grant commercial print rights. Bundle excludes commercial print rights.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thangs.com/resources/help-center"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://thangs.com/resources/legal/terms-and-conditions", "label": "Fees and memberships"}, {"url": "https://thangs.com/resources/help-center", "label": "Creator help"}, {"url": "https://thangs.com/resources/blog/what-license-files-can-i-attach-to-my-model", "label": "License files"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Official terms list 20% for $5–$10 and 15% at $10+, so the published tiers overlap at exactly $10. Memberships are 14% (8% only for eligible plans launched before Dec 4, 2023). Bundle has no added platform fee; 50% of subscription fees less processing enters a pool shared among creators whose models were downloaded.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "3D models and memberships", "note": "Memberships under $10 also pay a monthly fee of $5 to $30.", "take": {"label": "Models $10 and up", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Memberships", "value": "14%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Bundle", "value": "No extra fee", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Thangs", "groups": [{"label": "Model sales", "rates": [{"label": "Models under $5", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Models $5 to $10", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Models $10 and up", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Memberships", "rates": [{"label": "Memberships", "value": "14%", "percent": 14, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Eligible older plans", "value": "8%", "percent": 8, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Models under $5", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations--civitai-creator-monetization","section_id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations","name":"Civitai creator monetization","summary":"Eligible creators convert Buzz into a share of a monthly cash pool.","website_url":"https://civitai.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/civitai-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Creator Program converts eligible Buzz earnings to a monthly cash pool.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://civitai.red/creator-program"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Buzz extraction: first 100K free, next 900K 5%, next 4M 10%, above 5M 15%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://civitai.red/creator-program"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Cash-out eligibility is required, but official sources conflict: the user page says Creator Score >10K plus Green; the developer guide says ≥40K plus Bronze/Silver/Gold and excludes Founder/Free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://civitai.red/creator-program"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Buzz has no fiat value outside eligible Creator Program cash-out.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://civitai.red/content/buzz/terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "At $50 Ready to Withdraw, eligible creators receive an invitation to the payout partner.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://civitai.red/creator-program"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://github.com/civitai/civitai/blob/main/docs/features/creator-program.md", "label": "Creator Program guide"}, {"url": "https://civitai.red/content/buzz/terms", "label": "Buzz terms"}, {"url": "https://civitai.red/creator-program", "label": "Program rules"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current extraction fees are 0% on the first 100,000 Buzz, then 5%, 10%, and 15% across higher brackets. Official user and developer guides conflict on score and membership eligibility; threshold is unresolved. Payout-partner invitation follows $50 Ready to Withdraw.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "AI creator program", "note": "Earnings come from a monthly cash pool shared by eligible creators.", "take": {"label": "First 100K Buzz", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Buzz value", "value": "Only via program", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Eligibility", "value": "Sources differ", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Civitai", "groups": [{"label": "Buzz cash-out fee", "rates": [{"label": "First 100K Buzz", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Next 900K", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Next 4M", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Above 5M Buzz", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above 5M Buzz", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations--mindstudio","section_id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations","name":"MindStudio","summary":"Build AI agents and charge users for agent runs.","website_url":"https://www.mindstudio.ai/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-mindstudio-ai.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Price AI agent runs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/creator-economy-ai-monetizing-agent-apps"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% platform fee stated", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/creator-economy-ai-monetizing-agent-apps"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free; Individual $20/mo", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Models billed at cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Set price; paid runs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/creator-economy-ai-monetizing-agent-apps"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/creator-economy-ai-monetizing-agent-apps", "label": "Monetization terms"}, {"url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/pricing", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.mindstudio.ai/legal/terms-of-use", "label": "Terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"MindStudio says creators keep 100% of agent revenue with no platform fee or revenue share. Its account plans are Free and Individual ($20/month) plus model usage. The exact payment-processing treatment for creator sales is not stated in the public materials reviewed.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Official creator article states no platform fee","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Paid AI agents", "note": "Payment processing rates are not stated.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Individual", "value": "$20 a month", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Models", "value": "Billed at cost", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "Per run", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "MindStudio", "groups": [{"label": "MindStudio", "rates": [{"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations--pickaxe","section_id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations","name":"Pickaxe","summary":"Sell access to AI tools with plan-based fees and model credits.","website_url":"https://www.pickaxe.co/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-pickaxe-co.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "One-time / subs / usage", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pickaxe.co/learn/monetization"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain 90% Gold / 92% Pro / up to 98% Business; Business is $597/mo with a 6-month minimum.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pickaxe.co/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Gold $37/mo; Pro $147/mo; Business $597/mo with a 6-month minimum.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pickaxe.co/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Usage billed by Uses or Credits", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pickaxe.co/learn/credits-usage"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Connect Stripe for sales", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pickaxe.co/learn/monetization"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://pickaxe.co/pricing", "label": "Plans and share"}, {"url": "https://pickaxe.co/learn/monetization", "label": "Monetization fees"}, {"url": "https://pickaxe.co/learn/credits-usage", "label": "Usage billing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Gold and Pro retain 90% and 92%, equivalent to the published 10% and 8% fees. Business retains up to 98% and starts at $597/month with a six-month minimum; annual Gold/Pro prices are $29/$116 monthly. Credits and model use are separate. No additional Stripe fee is stated in the current rate guide.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Paid AI tools", "note": "Model usage is billed separately, by uses or credits.", "take": {"label": "Gold plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Gold", "value": "$37 a month", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Business", "value": "$597, 6-month minimum", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Your Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Pickaxe", "groups": [{"label": "By plan", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 90%", "label": "Gold plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 92%", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "8%", "percent": 8, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep up to 98%", "label": "Business, best case", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Business, best case", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations--poe-creator-monetization","section_id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations","name":"Poe creator monetization","summary":"Set a price for each monetized bot message on Poe.","website_url":"https://creator.poe.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/creator-poe-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-message bot earnings", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.poe.com/hc/en-us/articles/21921312368020-Poe-Creator-Monetization-FAQs"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Creator-set per-message price; earnings example shown per 1,000 messages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.poe.com/hc/en-us/articles/21921312368020-Poe-Creator-Monetization-FAQs"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No plan fee listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.poe.com/hc/en-us/articles/21921312368020-Poe-Creator-Monetization-FAQs"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Poe covers inference costs for Bot Query API calls; costs for other models may be covered by arrangement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creator.poe.com/docs/resources/how-we-cover-your-costs"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Eligible region; Stripe", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.poe.com/hc/en-us/articles/21921312368020-Poe-Creator-Monetization-FAQs"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.poe.com/hc/en-us/articles/21921312368020-Poe-Creator-Monetization-FAQs", "label": "Monetization FAQ"}, {"url": "https://poe.com/pages/earnings-tos", "label": "Earnings terms"}, {"url": "https://creator.poe.com/docs/resources/how-we-cover-your-costs", "label": "Running costs"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Creators set a price per message; the FAQ also shows the equivalent per 1,000 messages and a maximum of $10,000 per 1,000. Poe covers Bot Query API inference, and may cover other model costs by arrangement. Stripe payouts require $10 and arrive 30–45 days after month-end.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Paid AI bots", "note": "Poe covers model costs through its Bot Query API. Other models need an arrangement with Poe.", "take": {"label": "Price per message", "value": "You set", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Poe API costs", "value": "Covered", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Eligible regions", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Poe", "groups": []}}, {"id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations--promptbase","section_id":"ai-prompts-and-paid-ai-creations","name":"PromptBase","summary":"Sell AI prompts, agent skills, and custom jobs through different channels.","website_url":"https://promptbase.com/sell","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/promptbase-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Prompts / skills / jobs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://promptbase.com/sell"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "20 / 0 / 10% by channel", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://promptbase.com/support"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No seller plan listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://promptbase.com/support"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No extra sale fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://promptbase.com/support"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller review; payouts use Stripe or Zoneless (USDC).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://promptbase.com/knowledge-base/payouts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://promptbase.com/support", "label": "Fees and policies"}, {"url": "https://promptbase.com/sell", "label": "Seller overview"}, {"url": "https://promptbase.com/knowledge-base/payouts", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Marketplace sales take 20%, referral-link sales 0%, and custom jobs 10%. Stripe payouts need an account 30 days old and $30 available; Zoneless USDC pays daily without a minimum. Stripe early payout costs $3.99. Country support varies.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "AI prompts and skills", "note": "Sales through your own referral link are free.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Custom jobs", "value": "10%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Stripe or USDC", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Extra fees", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "PromptBase", "groups": [{"label": "PromptBase", "rates": [{"label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Your referral link", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Custom jobs", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Your referral link", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--adobe-exchange","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Adobe Exchange","summary":"Publish paid plugins for Adobe Creative Cloud apps.","website_url":"https://exchange.adobe.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/exchange-adobe-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Adobe Creative Cloud Marketplace charges a flat 10% fee on all transactions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.adobe.com/uxp/guides/how-to/distribution/adobe-marketplace/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public Creative Cloud Marketplace guide does not specify a separate plugin listing or submission fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.adobe.com/uxp/guides/how-to/distribution/listing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "FastSpring provides integrated commerce and acts as EU merchant of record for VAT; a separate processor rate is not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.adobe.com/uxp/guides/how-to/distribution/adobe-marketplace/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Free or paid perpetual plugins and subscriptions are supported.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.adobe.com/uxp/guides/how-to/distribution/listing/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.adobe.com/uxp/guides/how-to/distribution/adobe-marketplace/", "label": "Marketplace terms and fee"}, {"url": "https://developer.adobe.com/uxp/guides/how-to/distribution/listing/", "label": "Listing and purchase types"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Adobe states a flat 10% fee on Creative Cloud Marketplace transactions; FastSpring provides integrated commerce.","fee_percent":10,"fee_basis":"Adobe Creative Cloud Marketplace transaction value","sort_order":16,"card":{"tag": "Creative Cloud plugins", "note": "FastSpring runs checkout and handles EU VAT.", "take": {"label": "All transactions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Checkout", "value": "FastSpring", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sales", "value": "One-time or subscription", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Adobe", "groups": [{"label": "Creative Cloud Marketplace", "rates": [{"label": "All transactions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--atlassian-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Atlassian Marketplace","summary":"Sell Jira, Confluence, and other Atlassian apps.","website_url":"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-atlassian-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Forge: 0% on the first $1M lifetime Forge revenue, aggregated across the partner's qualifying Forge apps (no Connect modules, OAuth authentication, Forge UI), then 16% through Sep 30, 2026 and 17% from Oct 1. Connect: 20% through Sep 30, then 25%. Data Center and other products: 25%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/pricing-payment-and-billing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No current publishing fee is stated in the public partner setup or pricing guides.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/getting-started/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Paid via Atlassian has no separate processing charge listed; Paid via Vendor uses your own billing and processor.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/pricing-payment-and-billing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid via Atlassian, Paid via Vendor, or free. New Marketplace submissions have required Forge since Sep 17, 2025.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/listing-forge-successor-to-connect-apps/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/pricing-payment-and-billing/", "label": "Pricing and current rates"}, {"url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/getting-started/", "label": "Partner setup"}, {"url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/listing-forge-successor-to-connect-apps/", "label": "Forge-only submissions"}, {"url": "https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/forge/forge-platform-pricing/", "label": "Forge usage pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Only qualifying Forge apps (no Connect modules, OAuth authentication, and Forge UI) count toward the partner's lifetime $1M threshold. New submissions require Forge. Forge usage is billed separately above per-app monthly free allowances.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Jira and Confluence apps", "note": "The $1M counts all your qualifying Forge apps together. Forge usage fees can apply on top.", "take": {"label": "Forge, first $1M", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "New apps", "value": "Must use Forge", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Billing", "value": "Atlassian or your own", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Atlassian", "groups": [{"label": "Forge apps", "rates": [{"label": "First $1M lifetime", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Above $1M, until 30 Sep 2026", "value": "16%", "percent": 16, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Above $1M, from 1 Oct 2026", "value": "17%", "percent": 17, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}, {"label": "Other apps", "rates": [{"label": "Connect, until 30 Sep 2026", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Connect, from 1 Oct 2026", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Data Center and others", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above $1M, from 1 Oct", "value": "17%", "percent": 17, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--autodesk-app-store","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Autodesk App Store","summary":"Paid extensions and content for Autodesk products.","website_url":"https://apps.autodesk.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/apps-autodesk-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "The May 3, 2026 agreement sets commission at 0% of net fees after processor costs; Autodesk may change it.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apps.autodesk.com/Content/pdf/Publisher.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The current publisher agreement and public setup docs do not state whether a separate listing fee applies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apps.autodesk.com/Content/pdf/Publisher.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Autodesk designates the payment processor; its transaction cost is deducted before commission. The rate is not public.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apps.autodesk.com/Content/pdf/Publisher.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Publishers set prices; paid apps can use subscriptions or periodic payments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apps.autodesk.com/Content/pdf/Publisher.pdf"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://apps.autodesk.com/Content/pdf/Publisher.pdf", "label": "Publisher agreement, May 2026"}, {"url": "https://aps.autodesk.com/marketplace/publisher-center", "label": "Setup and payments"}, {"url": "https://aps.autodesk.com/marketplace/getting-started", "label": "Submission and payments"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The current agreement sets Autodesk’s commission to 0% of net fees after processor costs, subject to change.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Net app fee after processor costs","sort_order":17,"card":{"tag": "Autodesk extensions", "note": "Autodesk charges 0% under its May 2026 agreement, but payment costs are taken first.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Taken first, rate private", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Autodesk", "groups": [{"label": "Autodesk", "rates": [{"note": "Autodesk may change it", "label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--bubble-marketplace-plugins","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Bubble Marketplace plugins","summary":"Sell licensed plugins to Bubble builders.","website_url":"https://bubble.io/plugins","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/bubble-io.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Bubble retains 25% of all Plugin License payments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://manual.bubble.io/account-and-marketplace/marketplace-policies"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public Marketplace policies do not state whether a separate plugin listing fee applies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://manual.bubble.io/account-and-marketplace/marketplace-policies"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Bubble collects buyer payments; seller payouts use Stripe or approved PayPal. A separate processing rate is not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://manual.bubble.io/account-and-marketplace/account-and-billing/selling-on-the-marketplace"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Plugin licenses are one-time or monthly; seller earnings are remitted the following month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://manual.bubble.io/account-and-marketplace/marketplace-policies"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://manual.bubble.io/account-and-marketplace/marketplace-policies", "label": "Commission and payouts"}, {"url": "https://manual.bubble.io/account-and-marketplace/account-and-billing/selling-on-the-marketplace", "label": "Seller registration"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Bubble retains 25% of Plugin License payments and remits the remainder during the following month.","fee_percent":25,"fee_basis":"Plugin license payments","sort_order":15,"card":{"tag": "Bubble plugins", "note": "Bubble collects payment and pays sellers the following month.", "take": {"label": "Plugin licenses", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Stripe or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Licenses", "value": "One-time or monthly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Bubble", "groups": [{"label": "Bubble", "rates": [{"label": "Plugin licenses", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--canva-apps","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Canva apps","summary":"Apps monetized through paid Canva usage or approved external payments.","website_url":"https://www.canva.dev/docs/apps/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-canva-dev.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Accepted Premium Apps can earn recurring revenue; payments follow each program agreement and are processed monthly by Canva.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/developers/premium-apps-program/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Joining the Premium Apps Program is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/developers/premium-apps-program/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "External payment links are allowed only on supported platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.dev/docs/apps/accepting-payments/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Premium access uses gated, freemium, or credit-based models.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.dev/docs/apps/premium-apps/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.canva.com/developers/premium-apps-program/", "label": "Premium program and payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.canva.dev/docs/apps/premium-apps/", "label": "Eligibility and access"}, {"url": "https://www.canva.dev/docs/apps/premium-apps/implementing-monetization/", "label": "Usage compensation"}, {"url": "https://www.canva.dev/docs/apps/accepting-payments/", "label": "External payment links"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Canva pays accepted Premium Apps under individual program agreements; external checkout links work only on supported platforms.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Canva apps", "note": "Premium Apps earn from paid use. Terms are set in each program agreement.", "take": {"label": "Premium Apps program", "value": "Usage-based pay", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free to join", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Own payments", "value": "Some platforms only", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Canva", "groups": []}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--figma-plugins","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Figma plugins","summary":"Paid plugins and widgets sold through Figma Community.","website_url":"https://developers.figma.com/docs/plugins/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developers-figma-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Figma takes a flat 15% on Community plugin sales made through Figma Payments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/12067637274519-About-selling-Community-resources"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No plugin listing fee is stated. Paid resources require an approved individual account; Figma is not approving new paid-file sellers currently.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/12067637274519-About-selling-Community-resources"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "The 15% includes card processing and payouts; external payment-site costs depend on the seller’s provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/12067637274519-About-selling-Community-resources"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Approved individual creators can sell plugins from $2 in USD as one-time purchases or subscriptions; subscription plugins include a 7-day trial. Third-party checkout is allowed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/12067637274519-About-selling-Community-resources"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/12067637274519-About-selling-Community-resources", "label": "Paid plugins and fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Figma’s flat 15% applies only to sales through Figma Payments and includes payment processing, payouts, support, delivery, and tax handling; third-party sales have provider fees.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Community transaction through Figma Payments","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Figma plugins and widgets", "note": "Selling needs an approved individual account. Subscription plugins include a 7-day trial.", "take": {"label": "Figma Payments sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Lowest price", "value": "$2", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Included", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Own checkout", "value": "Allowed", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Figma", "groups": [{"label": "Figma Payments", "rates": [{"note": "Card fees included", "label": "Figma Payments sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--framer-plugins","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Framer plugins","summary":"Plugins sold through Framer’s creator marketplace.","website_url":"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/plugins/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-framer-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Framer’s current plugin guide says creators keep 100% of plugin revenue; Framer’s platform cut is 0%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.framer.com/help/articles/how-to-publish-a-plugin/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public plugin publishing guide does not state a listing or publishing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.framer.com/help/articles/how-to-publish-a-plugin/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public plugin guides do not state a payment processor or a separate processing rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.framer.com/help/articles/plugin-best-practices/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators set paid-feature pricing and include it in the Marketplace listing; paid plugin prices display in USD.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.framer.com/help/articles/plugin-best-practices/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.framer.com/help/articles/how-to-publish-a-plugin/", "label": "Plugin publishing and pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.framer.com/creators", "label": "Creator revenue share"}, {"url": "https://www.framer.com/help/articles/plugin-best-practices/", "label": "Listing expectations"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Framer states that plugin creators keep 100% of their revenue. Public plugin guides do not specify payment processing or separate listing fees.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Framer platform cut of plugin Marketplace earnings","sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Framer plugins", "note": "Framer takes nothing from plugin sales.", "take": {"label": "Platform cut", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it, in USD", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Framer", "groups": [{"label": "Framer", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100%", "label": "Platform cut", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--google-workspace-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Google Workspace Marketplace","summary":"Publish Workspace add-ons and charge through your own billing service.","website_url":"https://developers.google.com/workspace/marketplace","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developers-google-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "The Developer Agreement says Google charges no transaction fee on paid or free products; it states no standard sales share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://workspace.google.com/terms/marketplace/devtos/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "The Developer Agreement requires a non-refundable listing fee for paid and free products, but its fee-schedule link redirects to the SDK overview, which says there is no listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://workspace.google.com/terms/marketplace/devtos/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Developers can connect add-ons to their own billing system or an outside service; processor rates depend on that provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/add-ons/guides/editor-restrictions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Listings can be free, trial, paid, or free with paid features. Editor add-ons cannot charge users to install.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/marketplace/create-listing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/marketplace/how-to-publish", "label": "Publishing guide"}, {"url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/marketplace/create-listing", "label": "Pricing labels"}, {"url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/add-ons/guides/editor-restrictions", "label": "External billing"}, {"url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/marketplace/terms/policies", "label": "Seller requirements"}, {"url": "https://workspace.google.com/terms/marketplace/devtos/", "label": "Developer Agreement"}, {"url": "https://developers.google.com/workspace/marketplace/overview", "label": "Listing-fee statement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Google requires developers to identify themselves as the seller. Marketplace pricing is disclosed on the listing; Editor add-ons must use external billing rather than charging for installation.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Google Workspace add-ons", "note": "Google’s agreement mentions a listing fee, but its developer guide says there is none.", "take": {"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Listing fee", "value": "Unclear, terms conflict", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Billing", "value": "Your own service", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Add-ons", "value": "No paid installs", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Google", "groups": [{"label": "Google", "rates": [{"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--hubspot-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"HubSpot Marketplace","summary":"Integrations listed through HubSpot’s app partner program.","website_url":"https://developers.hubspot.com/docs/apps/developer-platform/list-apps","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developers-hubspot-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "The current Technology Partner Agreement says no fees or commissions are payable under the agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legal.hubspot.com/technology-program-agreement"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Every Technology Partner receives a free, dedicated HubSpot Marketplace listing page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.hubspot.com/hubfs/technology-partner-enablement/hubspot-technology-partner-program-guide.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Listings may require a separate subscription in the app’s connecting platform; any processor fees depend on that provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://knowledge.hubspot.com/marketplace/install-apps-in-the-hubspot-marketplace"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "App providers set their pricing; Marketplace listings show app tiers and any required provider subscription.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://knowledge.hubspot.com/marketplace/install-apps-in-the-hubspot-marketplace"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://legal.hubspot.com/technology-program-agreement", "label": "Partner fees"}, {"url": "https://developers.hubspot.com/hubfs/technology-partner-enablement/hubspot-technology-partner-program-guide.pdf", "label": "Marketplace listings"}, {"url": "https://knowledge.hubspot.com/marketplace/install-apps-in-the-hubspot-marketplace", "label": "App pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The partner agreement charges no program fees or commissions. Technology Partners receive a free listing page; app providers set pricing and may require a separate provider subscription.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "HubSpot integrations", "note": "HubSpot charges partners nothing. You bill customers yourself.", "take": {"label": "No commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free listing", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Your provider", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "HubSpot", "groups": [{"label": "HubSpot", "rates": [{"label": "No commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--jetbrains-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"JetBrains Marketplace","summary":"Sell licensed plugins for JetBrains IDEs.","website_url":"https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/plugins-jetbrains-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard commission is 15% of the vendor price before tax. JetBrains may change it with one month’s notice, up to 25%; high-revenue vendors may negotiate a custom formula.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/revenue-sharing-and-fees.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "JetBrains charges no development or Marketplace listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/revenue-sharing-and-fees.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "JetBrains processes sales taxes; public terms do not state a separate payment-processing rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/revenue-sharing-and-fees.html"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace supports free, freemium, paid, and externally paid plugins; paid licenses can use monthly or yearly subscriptions or a perpetual license.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/plugin-monetization.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/revenue-sharing-and-fees.html", "label": "Revenue share and payouts"}, {"url": "https://plugins.jetbrains.com/docs/marketplace/plugin-monetization.html", "label": "Licensing models"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The standard 15% applies to the vendor price before tax; JetBrains may set a different rate with one month’s notice, capped at 25%.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Vendor price before taxes; custom terms may differ","sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "JetBrains IDE plugins", "note": "JetBrains can raise the rate to 25% with one month’s notice. Large vendors can negotiate.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Licenses", "value": "Monthly, yearly, perpetual", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "JetBrains handles", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "JetBrains", "groups": [{"label": "JetBrains", "rates": [{"note": "Before tax", "label": "Standard", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--microsoft-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Microsoft Marketplace","summary":"Sell transactable SaaS through Microsoft billing.","website_url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/overview","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/learn-microsoft-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Microsoft charges a 3% standard store service fee when a customer buys a transactable offer through Marketplace; listing-only offers have no transaction through Microsoft.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/marketplace-faq-publisher-guide"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Microsoft states there is no cost to publish Marketplace offers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/marketplace-faq-publisher-guide"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "For transactable offers, Microsoft bills customers, handles collections and applicable taxes, and pays publishers. Listing-only sellers handle their own payments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/marketplace-commercial-transaction-capabilities-and-considerations"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Transactable SaaS supports flat-rate, per-user, or metered plans; listing-only offers send buyers to seller-managed billing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/plan-saas-offer"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/marketplace-faq-publisher-guide", "label": "Publisher fees"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/marketplace-commercial-transaction-capabilities-and-considerations", "label": "Service fee"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/partner-center/marketplace-offers/plan-saas-offer", "label": "SaaS billing plans"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 3% store fee applies to transact offers sold through Microsoft. Listing-only offers use the seller’s own sales and payment flow.","fee_percent":3,"fee_basis":"Microsoft Marketplace transacted offer sales","sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Business software", "note": "Microsoft handles billing, collection, and tax on offers sold through it.", "take": {"label": "Sales through Microsoft", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free to publish", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Billing", "value": "Microsoft bills buyers", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Plans", "value": "Flat, per user, metered", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Microsoft", "groups": [{"label": "Transactable offers", "rates": [{"label": "Sales through Microsoft", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}, {"label": "Listing-only offers", "rates": [{"label": "You bill customers", "value": "0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--salesforce-agentexchange-formerly-appexchange","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Salesforce AgentExchange (formerly AppExchange)","summary":"List Salesforce apps, APIs, and agent solutions.","website_url":"https://appexchange.salesforce.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/appexchange-salesforce-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "ISVforce: 15% revenue share or a fixed annual fee based on planned customer orgs/users. OEM: 25% of combined-solution revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=000394757&language=en_US&type=1"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current docs require a review fee for paid solutions and waive it for free solutions, but do not state the current amount. A 2023 Salesforce article quoted $999 per attempt; it is not confirmed as current.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/isvforce/guide/security-review-how-it-works.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Checkout uses Stripe and takes 15%; credit-card transactions add $0.30 each. Seller-managed payment processing depends on the seller’s provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/appexchange-checkout/checkout-manage-payments"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Choose Salesforce Checkout or manage billing and collections yourself, reporting orders through the Channel Order App.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://partners.salesforce.com/pdx/s/learn/article/appexchange-isv-partner-onboarding-guide-MCFQGJA5WXDNEOVETHGD7ZOVM43E?language=en_US"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://partners.salesforce.com/pdx/s/learn/article/appexchange-isv-partner-onboarding-guide-MCFQGJA5WXDNEOVETHGD7ZOVM43E?language=en_US", "label": "Partner onboarding and billing"}, {"url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/isvforce/guide/security-review-how-it-works.html", "label": "Security review"}, {"url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/blogs/2023/04/prepare-your-app-to-pass-the-appexchange-security-review", "label": "2023 review fee quote"}, {"url": "https://partners.salesforce.com/s/education/appinnovators/Checkout?language=en", "label": "Checkout fees"}, {"url": "https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/appexchange-checkout/checkout-manage-payments", "label": "Checkout and Stripe fees"}, {"url": "https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=000394757&language=en_US&type=1", "label": "ISVforce and OEM options"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"ISVforce offers 15% of app revenue or a fixed annual fee based on planned customer orgs/users. OEM takes 25% of combined-solution revenue. Salesforce Checkout is a separate transaction route.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Salesforce apps and agents", "note": "A 2023 article quoted a $999 security review fee, but current docs give no amount.", "take": {"label": "ISVforce apps", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Review fee", "value": "Paid apps, amount unclear", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Checkout", "value": "15% + 30¢ per card sale", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Or instead", "value": "Fixed yearly fee", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Salesforce", "groups": [{"label": "Revenue share", "rates": [{"note": "Or a fixed yearly fee", "label": "ISVforce apps", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Of combined revenue", "label": "OEM solutions", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}, {"label": "Salesforce Checkout", "rates": [{"note": "+ 30¢ per card sale", "label": "Checkout sales", "value": "15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "OEM solutions", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--shopify-app-store","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Shopify App Store","summary":"Sell apps to Shopify merchants.","website_url":"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/shopify-dev.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "0% on the first $1M in gross app revenue earned since Jan 1, 2025, then 15%. Prior-year Shopify app earnings of $20M or gross company revenue of $100M means 15% from the first dollar.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch/distribution/revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "$19 once per Partner account. No registration is required when you only build a custom app for one merchant.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch/distribution/revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "2.9% processing on all app billing, plus applicable sales tax; some regions add regulatory fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch/distribution/revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Public App Store apps use Shopify billing: subscriptions, usage charges, trials, or manual one-time billing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch/billing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch/distribution/revenue-share", "label": "Revenue share and fees"}, {"url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/launch/billing", "label": "App billing options"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The gross-revenue threshold applies across apps and associated Partner accounts and starts from January 1, 2025; high-volume exceptions apply.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Apps for Shopify stores", "note": "The $1M counts gross app revenue since 1 Jan 2025. Some regions add small regulatory fees.", "take": {"label": "First $1M", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$19 once", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "2.9% on app billing", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Large companies", "value": "15% from the first dollar", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Shopify", "groups": [{"label": "Revenue share", "rates": [{"label": "First $1M since 2025", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Above $1M", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Over $20M app sales or $100M revenue", "label": "Large developers", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}, {"label": "Processing", "rates": [{"label": "All app billing", "value": "2.9%", "percent": 2.9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above $1M", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--slack-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Slack Marketplace","summary":"List a commercial Slack integration with seller-defined pricing.","website_url":"https://api.slack.com/start/distributing","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/api-slack-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Slack lets developers charge but does not publish Marketplace commission or checkout terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.slack.dev/slack-marketplace/slack-marketplace-app-guidelines-and-requirements/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No current public listing fee is stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.slack.dev/slack-marketplace/slack-marketplace-app-guidelines-and-requirements/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Developers must handle app payments securely; public guide lists no processor or rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.slack.dev/slack-marketplace/slack-marketplace-app-guidelines-and-requirements/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Listings may be free, paid, freemium, trial, or included with the seller’s service subscription.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.slack.dev/slack-marketplace/slack-marketplace-app-guidelines-and-requirements/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.slack.dev/slack-marketplace/slack-marketplace-app-guidelines-and-requirements/", "label": "Listing and payment rules"}, {"url": "https://api.slack.com/slack-marketplace/using", "label": "Distribution and review"}, {"url": "https://docs.slack.dev/slack-marketplace/marketplace-terms-conditions/slack-marketplace-agreement/", "label": "Marketplace Agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Slack lets developers set the app pricing model and handle payments securely; the public guide does not specify Marketplace commission, checkout, or processor arrangements.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Slack integrations", "note": "Slack lets you charge but does not publish Marketplace fees.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "You handle them", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Slack", "groups": []}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--webflow-apps","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Webflow apps","summary":"Integrations reviewed for publication in Webflow’s app marketplace.","website_url":"https://developers.webflow.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developers-webflow-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public Webflow docs do not state a standard Marketplace app commission.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.webflow.com/apps/docs/marketplace-guidelines"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "The App Developer Workspace is free; purchased site plans cost standard rates.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.webflow.com/data/docs/developer-workspace"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public docs do not state a standard Marketplace payment-processing fee or provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.webflow.com/apps/docs/marketplace-guidelines"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "App listings must disclose any fees, subscriptions, and in-app purchases.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.webflow.com/apps/docs/marketplace-guidelines"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developers.webflow.com/apps/docs/marketplace-guidelines", "label": "Fees and disclosures"}, {"url": "https://developers.webflow.com/data/docs/developer-workspace", "label": "Developer workspace"}, {"url": "https://developers.webflow.com/apps/docs/marketplace/listing-your-app", "label": "Listing requirements"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Webflow requires clear fee disclosures but publishes no standard Marketplace app commission or processing rate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Webflow apps", "note": "Webflow does not publish a Marketplace commission.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free workspace", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Your fees", "value": "Must be disclosed", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Webflow", "groups": []}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--wix-app-market","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Wix App Market","summary":"Apps billed through Wix with an introductory revenue-share waiver.","website_url":"https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/dev-wix-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "For users who start at Wix and were not already paying elsewhere, developers keep 100% for the first 12 months, then 80%; Wix’s cut is 20% after year one.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps/launch-your-app/pricing-and-billing/payments-and-billing-faqs"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No developer listing or publishing fee is stated in the public monetization guide.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps/launch-your-app/pricing-and-billing/about-monetizing-your-app"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Revenue share is calculated after Wix’s 2.5% transaction fee and applicable sales tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps/launch-your-app/pricing-and-billing/payments-and-billing-faqs"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Wix billing supports recurring subscriptions, usage pricing, or both.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps/launch-your-app/pricing-and-billing/about-monetizing-your-app"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps/launch-your-app/pricing-and-billing/about-monetizing-your-app", "label": "Monetization and fees"}, {"url": "https://dev.wix.com/docs/build-apps/launch-your-app/pricing-and-billing/payments-and-billing-faqs", "label": "Billing FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The revenue-share rates apply only to users who start at Wix and are not already paying for the app elsewhere; the 2.5% transaction fee and applicable taxes are deducted first.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Apps for Wix sites", "note": "The first-year waiver is for users who start at Wix and were not already paying you elsewhere.", "take": {"label": "After year 1", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Wix fee", "value": "2.5% per payment", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Billing", "value": "Subscriptions or usage", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Wix", "groups": [{"label": "New Wix users", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100%", "label": "First 12 months", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "After year 1", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}, {"label": "Every payment", "rates": [{"note": "Taken before the share", "label": "Wix transaction fee", "value": "2.5%", "percent": 2.5, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "First 12 months", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--woocommerce-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"WooCommerce Marketplace","summary":"Commercial plugins and extensions sold through Woo’s marketplace.","website_url":"https://woocommerce.com/partners/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/woocommerce-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "WooCommerce pays vendors 70% of Product Net Revenue for Woo Marketplace sales, retaining 30% of that net amount.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://woocommerce.com/woo-vendor-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public Marketplace Vendor Agreement does not state a separate seller listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://woocommerce.com/woo-vendor-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Product Net Revenue is calculated after affiliate costs, refunds, reversals, payment processing fees, and taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://woocommerce.com/woo-vendor-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Woo Marketplace sells products or subscription access. Woo handles checkout and pays vendors monthly, within 30 days after month-end.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://woocommerce.com/woo-vendor-agreement/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://woocommerce.com/woo-vendor-agreement/", "label": "Vendor agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Woo calculates the 70% vendor share on Product Net Revenue after affiliate costs, refunds, reversals, processing fees, and taxes.","fee_percent":30,"fee_basis":"Product Net Revenue after listed deductions","sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "WooCommerce extensions", "note": "Woo takes its share after processing fees, refunds, affiliate costs, and taxes.", "take": {"label": "Of net revenue", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Charged on", "value": "After fees and refunds", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Woo", "groups": [{"label": "Woo Marketplace", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Of net revenue", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations--zoom-app-marketplace","section_id":"apps-plugins-and-integrations","name":"Zoom App Marketplace","summary":"Sell paid Zoom app subscriptions through the marketplace.","website_url":"https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developers-zoom-us.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Zoom takes 15% of gross retail sales, excluding taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/monetization/pricing-fees-faq/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Zoom’s public distribution and fee guides do not state a seller listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Zoom collects customer payments and handles taxes and commission; its public fee FAQ does not state a separate processor rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/monetization/pricing-fees-faq/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid subscriptions start at $0.99; a free plan is required. Seller payout account and buyers must be US-based; transactions use USD.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/monetization/pricing-fees-faq/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/monetization/pricing-fees-faq/", "label": "Commission and payment rules"}, {"url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/monetization/provisioning/", "label": "Subscriptions"}, {"url": "https://developers.zoom.us/docs/distribute/", "label": "Distribution"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Monetization requires a free plan, US-based seller payment account and buyers, and USD transactions.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Gross retail sales excluding taxes","sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Zoom apps", "note": "Zoom handles payment and tax. Sellers and buyers must be in the US.", "take": {"label": "Sales, before tax", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Lowest price", "value": "$0.99, plus a free plan", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Sellers", "value": "US only, in USD", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Zoom", "groups": [{"label": "Zoom collects payment", "rates": [{"label": "Sales, before tax", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"audiobooks--acx","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"ACX","summary":"Produce and distribute audiobooks through Audible, Amazon, and Apple Books.","website_url":"https://www.acx.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-acx-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "ACX distributes to Audible, Amazon, and Apple Books.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/how-royalties-work"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "New model: 50% exclusive and 30% non-exclusive for a-la-carte and membership earnings.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/how-royalties-work"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Production can be paid upfront, shared as royalties, or combined as royalty share plus.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/how-royalties-work"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Legacy titles remain at 40% exclusive / 25% non-exclusive until year-end 2026; all titles must then use the new model.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/audible-s-new-royalty-model"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Pay-for-production charges an agreed per-finished-hour fee; royalty share splits the applicable share with the producer.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/how-royalties-work"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/how-royalties-work", "label": "Royalties and production"}, {"url": "https://help.acx.com/s/article/audible-s-new-royalty-model", "label": "New model rules"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"New-model rates apply to newly claimed DIY titles, new users, new producer offers, and titles enrolled in the model; legacy terms expire at year-end 2026.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Audible audiobooks", "note": "With royalty share, you split your share with the narrator.", "take": {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Production", "value": "Paid or royalty share", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Old rates", "value": "End Dec 2026", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Stores", "value": "Audible, Amazon, Apple", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Audible", "groups": [{"label": "New model", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "Exclusive", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 30%", "label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "70%", "percent": 70, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Old model, until end of 2026", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 40%", "label": "Exclusive", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"note": "You keep 25%", "label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "75%", "percent": 75, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}], "second": {"label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "70%", "percent": 70, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"audiobooks--author-s-republic","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"Author's Republic","summary":"Keep 80% of royalties collected across retail, library, and streaming channels.","website_url":"https://www.authorsrepublic.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-authorsrepublic-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Global retail, library, and music-streaming distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/sell-audiobooks"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors receive 80% of earned royalties Author’s Republic collects from partners, not 80% of list price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/learn/faqs"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Completed audiobook distribution has no listing, submission, review, or referral fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/learn/faqs"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity contract; authors select distribution channels.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/sell-audiobooks"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Official page conflicts: cost section says $50–$400/PFH ($300–$2,500+ for six hours); its FAQ says $150–$400/PFH ($900–$2,500).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/create-audiobooks"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/learn/faqs", "label": "Royalties and fees"}, {"url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/sell-audiobooks", "label": "Channels"}, {"url": "https://www.authorsrepublic.com/create-audiobooks", "label": "Production pricing"}, {"url": "https://authorsrepublic.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/19712647429140--Distribution-Agreement-Tab", "label": "Channel options"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 80% is a share of earned royalties collected from retail, library, and streaming partners after their own payout terms. Completed-audio distribution has no listing or submission fee. Narrator production is optional and separately priced; Author’s Republic publishes a broad narrator range and example estimates. Royalties are paid monthly after the $10 minimum is reached.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Audiobook distribution", "note": "You get 80% of what stores pay Author’s Republic, not 80% of the list price.", "take": {"label": "Collected royalties", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "Quoted per hour", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Author’s Republic", "groups": [{"label": "Author’s Republic", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "Collected royalties", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"audiobooks--bookbaby-audiobooks","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"BookBaby audiobooks","summary":"Bookshop pays 75% on audiobook sales; finished-file upload costs $99.","website_url":"https://www.bookbaby.com/audiobooks","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-bookbaby-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "BookBaby Bookshop sells author-supplied audiobooks; Audible availability requires a separate sales discussion.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/audiobooks"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "BookBaby advertises 75% per Bookshop audiobook sale; Audible is available by request, but its rate is not public.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/audiobooks"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Existing finished-audio upload costs $99. Author narration is $500 plus $0.14 per word; actor narration is $500 plus $0.16 per word; AI voice cloning is $2,000 plus $0.06 per word.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/audiobooks"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "The currently posted 2022 distribution agreement grants exclusive rights for selected services, except author direct sales; either side may terminate on 24 hours notice.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/terms-of-service"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "BookBaby offers author, voice-actor, and AI voice-clone production; price depends on the chosen option and manuscript length.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/audiobooks"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/audiobooks", "label": "Sales, royalty, and narration"}, {"url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/terms-of-service", "label": "Distribution agreement, 2022"}, {"url": "https://support.bookbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/11100570069523-What-royalties-will-I-earn-for-sales-of-my-audiobook", "label": "Royalty article"}, {"url": "https://store.bookbaby.com/FairTrade", "label": "BookShop royalties"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The published 75% rate is for BookBaby Bookshop direct audiobook sales. The audiobook page asks authors to contact BookBaby about Audible distribution and does not publish those rates. The posted distribution agreement was last updated November 1, 2022; it grants exclusive representation for selected services but allows direct sales. Existing finished audio costs $99; production rates are separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Audiobooks", "note": "Audible is available on request, but its rate is not public.", "take": {"label": "BookShop sales", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Upload", "value": "$99", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Narration", "value": "From $500", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "For chosen stores", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "BookBaby", "groups": [{"label": "BookShop", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 75%", "label": "BookShop sales", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"audiobooks--kobo-writing-life-audiobooks","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"Kobo Writing Life audiobooks","summary":"Upload finished audiobooks directly to Kobo and earn from a-la-carte and token-based sales.","website_url":"https://www.kobo.com/writinglife","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-kobo-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct audiobook distribution through the Kobo store, a-la-carte sales, and token-based subscriptions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059385511-How-to-Upload-Your-Audiobook-Directly-on-Kobo"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "45% of list price at or above US $2.99; 35% below. Paid tokens pay 32%; free-trial tokens pay 0%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360058976032-What-will-my-earnings-be"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Official audiobook upload and royalty pages list no separate upload or distribution fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059385511-How-to-Upload-Your-Audiobook-Directly-on-Kobo"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Kobo does not require audio exclusivity; authors may use other platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360058976312"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct audiobook upload is being rolled out gradually; authors may need to request access from Kobo.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059385511-How-to-Upload-Your-Audiobook-Directly-on-Kobo"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360058976032-What-will-my-earnings-be", "label": "Royalty rates"}, {"url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360058976312", "label": "Audiobook FAQ"}, {"url": "https://kobowritinglife.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059385511-How-to-Upload-Your-Audiobook-Directly-on-Kobo", "label": "Upload and access"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US$2.99 a-la-carte threshold; other markets use localized price thresholds. Audio upload access is not yet enabled on every account.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Audiobooks", "note": "Direct audiobook upload is rolling out. You may need to ask Kobo for access.", "take": {"label": "$2.99 and up", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Rolling out", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Kobo", "groups": [{"label": "Kobo", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 45%", "label": "$2.99 and up", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 35%", "label": "Under $2.99", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 32%", "label": "Paid tokens", "value": "68%", "percent": 68, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 0%", "label": "Free-trial tokens", "value": "100%", "percent": 100, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Paid tokens", "value": "68%", "percent": 68, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"audiobooks--lantern-audio","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"Lantern Audio","summary":"Keep 75% of cash Lantern receives; distribution has a $199 setup fee.","website_url":"https://lanternaudio.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/lanternaudio-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Global audiobook retail and library distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lanternaudio.com/independent-publishing-services/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors receive 75% of cash Lantern receives; the amount varies by retail channel.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lanternaudio.com/independent-publishing-services/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "One-time $199 setup fee for audiobook distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lanternaudio.com/independent-publishing-services/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution is optional and non-exclusive.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lanternaudio.com/independent-publishing-services/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Audio preparation and production services cost extra at a quoted fee. Quarterly payments start after $50 accrues.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lanternaudio.com/independent-publishing-services/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://lanternaudio.com/independent-publishing-services/", "label": "Terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 75% is calculated from the cash Lantern receives from each retailer, not the retail price. Lantern gives examples: Audible pays Lantern 25% of list price; Apple pays 50%. Distribution setup is $199 once; additional audio preparation and production are optional and quoted separately.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Audiobook distribution", "note": "Audio preparation and production cost extra.", "take": {"label": "Cash received", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Setup", "value": "$199 once", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Quarterly, from $50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Lantern", "groups": [{"label": "Lantern", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 75%", "label": "Cash received", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"audiobooks--publishdrive-audiobooks","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"PublishDrive audiobooks","summary":"Keep full store royalties with a paid audiobook distribution plan.","website_url":"https://publishdrive.com/audiobook-distribution.html","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/publishdrive-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Global audiobook store distribution; library and subscription channels vary by plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://publishdrive.com/publish-audiobook.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscription plans pay the full store royalty; PublishDrive takes no commission.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/royalties-how-much-will-i-earn"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan covers one ebook only. Audiobook distribution starts with Starter at $16.99 monthly or $13.99 per month billed yearly, for up to three titles.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution is non-exclusive; creators can publish through other services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://publishdrive.com/book-distribution-services.html"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Finished audio is accepted. Apple digital narration is free for eligible ebooks distributed to Apple Books.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/apple-books-digital-narration"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://publishdrive.com/publish-audiobook.html", "label": "Audiobook distribution"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/royalties-how-much-will-i-earn", "label": "Royalty terms"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans", "label": "Plan prices"}, {"url": "https://publishdrive.com/book-distribution-services.html", "label": "Non-exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-to-upload-an-audiobook", "label": "Upload requirements"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/apple-books-digital-narration", "label": "Apple narration"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The free plan is for one ebook title and does not include audiobook distribution. Audiobooks require Starter or higher. The 100% share means the full royalty paid by each store, after the store calculates its own royalty; it does not mean 100% of list price.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Audiobook distribution", "note": "Audiobooks need a paid plan. The free plan covers one ebook.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Starter", "value": "$13.99 a month, yearly", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Apple narration", "value": "Free if eligible", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "PublishDrive", "groups": [{"label": "PublishDrive", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100% of store royalties", "label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"audiobooks--spotify-for-authors","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"Spotify for Authors","summary":"Publish audiobooks on Spotify, earn from direct purchases and subscription listening, or use Spotify’s limited free AI narration tools.","website_url":"https://authors.spotify.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/authors-spotify-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Spotify direct audiobook distribution includes a-la-carte purchases and Premium subscription listening.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spotify.com/legal/spotify-for-authors-opt-in-distribution-terms/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "A-la-carte pays 50% of suggested retail price. Subscription listening pays a pro-rata share of a Spotify-defined revenue pool based on consumption.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spotify.com/legal/spotify-for-authors-opt-in-distribution-terms/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Uploading finished audiobook files is free and unlimited.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.spotify.com/us/authors/article/uploading-audiobooks/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution is non-exclusive; authors retain ownership and may publish elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.spotify.com/us/authors/article/uploading-audiobooks/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Spotify digital narration is free for up to five English-language audiobooks for self-published US authors. A validated payment profile is required; additional titles require contacting support. Authors can distribute elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://authors.spotify.com/blog/creationtools"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.spotify.com/legal/spotify-for-authors-opt-in-distribution-terms/", "label": "Direct sales royalties"}, {"url": "https://support.spotify.com/us/authors/article/uploading-audiobooks/", "label": "Free upload terms"}, {"url": "https://support.spotify.com/us/authors/article/royalty-reports/", "label": "Royalty types"}, {"url": "https://support.spotify.com/us/authors/article/audiobook-creation-tools/", "label": "AI tool limits"}, {"url": "https://authors.spotify.com/blog/creationtools", "label": "Free narration tools"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Direct Spotify terms: 50% of suggested retail price for a-la-carte; subscription pool share varies by market and consumption.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Audiobooks on Spotify", "note": "Digital narration is free for up to five English-language audiobooks for US authors. A validated payment profile is required.", "take": {"label": "Single purchases", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "AI narration", "value": "Free, US English", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Spotify", "groups": [{"label": "Spotify", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50% of list price", "label": "Single purchases", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Paid by listening time", "label": "Premium listening", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Premium listening", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"audiobooks--streetlib-audiobooks","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"StreetLib audiobooks","summary":"Paid plans advertise 85% of net revenue; store payouts vary by channel.","website_url":"https://www.streetlib.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-streetlib-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution to global retailers, subscription services, and libraries.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.streetlib.com/distribution-partners"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscription and Lifetime plans advertise an 85% share of net revenue; retailer and sales-model payouts vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.streetlib.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Current pricing lists $99 per year or $299 once. A 2025 terms update charges EUR 0.20 per free audiobook download; older legal pages also describe a no-fixed-cost revenue-share path.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.streetlib.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "StreetLib is non-exclusive; authors choose and can change distribution channels.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.streetlib.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Upload finished chapter MP3 files; public audio production prices are not listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.streetlib.com/how-to-start-publishing/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.streetlib.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and share"}, {"url": "https://www.streetlib.com/distribution-partners", "label": "Channels"}, {"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/677-earnings", "label": "Net earnings"}, {"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/1505-agreement-update-2025", "label": "Free download fee"}, {"url": "https://www.streetlib.com/legalpolicy", "label": "Legal policy"}, {"url": "https://blog.streetlib.com/how-to-start-publishing/", "label": "File upload"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The current US pricing page lists Subscription at $99/year and Lifetime Access at $299, both with 85% of net revenue. Official legal/help material also describes a revenue-share route without fixed costs and charges EUR 0.20 per download of a free audiobook under the 2025 terms update. These are different options; confirm the selected plan and retailer rate in the StreetLib account. Retail audiobook earnings are calculated after store payout and StreetLib charges.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Audiobook distribution", "note": "What stores pay varies by channel and sales model.", "take": {"label": "Net revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$99 a year or $299 once", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Free downloads", "value": "€0.20 each", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "StreetLib", "groups": [{"label": "StreetLib", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Net revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"audiobooks--voices-by-inaudio-formerly-findaway-voices","section_id":"audiobooks","name":"Voices by INaudio (formerly Findaway Voices)","summary":"Global audiobook distribution with 80% of partner royalties received.","website_url":"https://www.voicesbyinaudio.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-voicesbyinaudio-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Global retail, subscription, library, and K-12 channels.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3222336"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors keep 80% of royalties INaudio receives from partners. Partner payout bases: 40 to 50% of list price for a-la-carte sales, 30 to 40% for subscriptions, and 25 to 45% of revenue-share receipts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3223552"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No separate setup or distribution fee is listed publicly; the published model keeps 20% of partner royalties.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3223552"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity agreement; authors choose their sales channels.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3222336"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Official pages cover distribution of finished audio and list no production service or price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3214336"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3222336", "label": "Ownership and channels"}, {"url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3223552", "label": "Partner royalty rates"}, {"url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3214336", "label": "Upload steps"}, {"url": "https://voicessupport.inaudio.com/en/articles/3220032", "label": "Free ISBN terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"80% applies to the royalties Voices by INaudio actually receives from each chosen partner, not to the audiobook list price. Partner payouts vary by channel and model; the current public pages do not list an upload or distribution fee. Authors can receive a free, non-transferable ISBN.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Audiobook distribution", "note": "Stores pay INaudio 25–50% of list price first, depending on the channel.", "take": {"label": "Partner royalties", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Upload", "value": "Finished audio", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "INaudio", "groups": [{"label": "INaudio", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80% of what stores pay", "label": "Partner royalties", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"beats-and-instrumentals--airbit","section_id":"beats-and-instrumentals","name":"Airbit","summary":"Sell beats through Airbit’s marketplace or a personal store.","website_url":"https://airbit.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/airbit-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic is free with up to 20 Marketplace beats. Platinum is $19.99/month or $7.99/month billed annually.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://airbit.com/s/prodbyidle"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Airbit takes 0% seller commission on Marketplace sales; Personal Store sales also have no Airbit share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://airbit.kayako.com/article/232-what-is-marketplace-commission"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "The 0% Marketplace seller commission applies to free Basic and paid Platinum accounts; there is no buyer commission.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creators.airbit.com/announcements-hub/airbit-waves-goodbye-to-marketplace-commission-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Marketplace pays monthly via PayPal, bank transfer, wire, or check; fees depend on the payout route. Personal Store sales go directly to PayPal or Stripe and are paid instantly, less provider fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.airbit.com/hc/en-us/articles/24166066340121-How-do-you-receive-payment-with-Airbit"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Sellers set beat licenses and can use custom, e-signed contracts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://airbit.com/s/BAESIKLI"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://airbit.com/s/BAESIKLI", "label": "Plans and store"}, {"url": "https://help.airbit.com/hc/en-us/articles/24166084124057-I-m-trying-to-sign-up-to-Platinum-for-7-99-but-it-s-trying-to-charge-me-19-99-How-can-I-get-the-new-price", "label": "Platinum billing"}, {"url": "https://creators.airbit.com/announcements-hub/airbit-waves-goodbye-to-marketplace-commission-fees", "label": "Commission update"}, {"url": "https://airbit.com/terms", "label": "Seller terms"}, {"url": "https://help.airbit.com/hc/en-us/articles/24166065550105-Are-there-any-fees-I-need-to-be-aware-of-when-receiving-payments", "label": "Processor and payout fees"}, {"url": "https://help.airbit.com/hc/en-us/articles/24166066340121-How-do-you-receive-payment-with-Airbit", "label": "Payout methods"}, {"url": "https://airbit.com/s/prodbyidle", "label": "Current plans"}, {"url": "https://airbit.kayako.com/article/232-what-is-marketplace-commission", "label": "Zero commission terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"0% marketplace seller commission; storefront processing costs are external.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Beats", "note": "Personal Store sales go straight to your PayPal or Stripe.", "take": {"label": "Seller commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Free plan", "value": "20 Marketplace beats", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Platinum", "value": "$7.99 a month, yearly", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Airbit", "groups": [{"label": "Airbit", "rates": [{"label": "Seller commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"beats-and-instrumentals--beatstars","section_id":"beats-and-instrumentals","name":"BeatStars","summary":"Sell and license beats, sound kits, and creator services.","website_url":"https://www.beatstars.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-beatstars-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter: $19.99/year or $4.99/month; Growth: $79.99/year or $8.99/month; Professional: $179.88/year or $19.99/month, before regional tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/7797168579227-How-Much-Does-BeatStars-Cost"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% base seller commission. On Marketplace sales, sellers may choose to cover all or part of the 12% subtotal service fee for buyers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/206363117-How-do-I-get-paid-for-my-music-sales"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace adds 12% of subtotal by default; sellers may cover some or all. No fee applies on Pro Pages or Blaze Players.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/17747783078171-Why-is-there-a-service-fee-on-the-Marketplace"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payments go to connected third-party accounts; PayPal or card-processing fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/35415062254619-Sales-Tax-FAQs"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Custom license agreements; sellers can offer beats, sound kits, and services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.beatstars.com/page/plans/starter/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.beatstars.com/page/plans/starter/", "label": "Plan prices"}, {"url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/206363117-How-do-I-get-paid-for-my-music-sales", "label": "Commission and payments"}, {"url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/17747783078171-Why-is-there-a-service-fee-on-the-Marketplace", "label": "Marketplace fee"}, {"url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/35415062254619-Sales-Tax-FAQs", "label": "Processor and tax fees"}, {"url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/7797168579227-How-Much-Does-BeatStars-Cost", "label": "Monthly and yearly plans"}, {"url": "https://help.beatstars.com/hc/en-us/articles/18757900719003-How-Do-I-Cover-The-Service-Fee-For-My-Customers", "label": "Covering the fee"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"0% base seller commission; Marketplace buyers pay 12% service fee, which sellers may choose to cover.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Beats and sound kits", "note": "You can cover some or all of the 12% Marketplace fee for your buyers.", "take": {"label": "Your sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$19.99 to $179.88 a year", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Pro Pages", "value": "No fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "PayPal or card rates", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "BeatStars", "groups": [{"label": "BeatStars", "rates": [{"label": "Your sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Buyers pay it unless you cover it", "label": "Marketplace fee", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Marketplace fee", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"beats-and-instrumentals--soundclick","section_id":"beats-and-instrumentals","name":"SoundClick","summary":"Sell and license music directly to fans.","website_url":"https://www.soundclick.com/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Artists sell songs, albums and beat licenses; a tip jar is also available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundclick.com/company/sclk_for_artists.cfm"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic is free; Premium is $10/month; Ultimate is $20/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundclick.com/company/sclk_for_artists.cfm"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "SoundClick keeps 30% on Free, 10% on Premium, and 0% on Ultimate sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundclick.com/company/sclk_for_artists.cfm"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal or Square transaction fees still apply. PayPal payouts are processed daily; earnings can stay in the SoundClick wallet.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundclick.com/faq.cfm"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "All plans allow unlimited track uploads. Artists set their download and license prices and terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundclick.com/company/sclk_for_artists.cfm"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.soundclick.com/faq.cfm", "label": "Plans, fees, and payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.soundclick.com/company/sclk_for_artists.cfm", "label": "Plans and features"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The current plan names are Basic (free), Premium ($10/month), and Ultimate ($20/month), with sales fees of 30%, 10%, and 0% respectively. PayPal or Square transaction fees still apply.","fee_percent":30,"fee_basis":"Free account sales; Premium and Ultimate reduce the commission","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Music and beats", "note": "PayPal payouts are processed daily.", "take": {"label": "Basic plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $10, or $20 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "PayPal or Square", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "SoundClick", "groups": [{"label": "By plan", "rates": [{"note": "Free", "label": "Basic plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "$10 a month", "label": "Premium plan", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "$20 a month", "label": "Ultimate plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Ultimate plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"beats-and-instrumentals--soundee","section_id":"beats-and-instrumentals","name":"Soundee","summary":"Sell beats, kits, and services through a marketplace or store.","website_url":"https://soundee.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/soundee-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace and storefronts for beats, kits, and creator services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundee.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free: $0. Starter: $7.99/month and Pro: $14.99/month, billed annually.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundee.com/sell-beats/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free: 30% on all sales. Starter and Pro: 10% Marketplace commission; Store sales are 0% commission plus any plan-specific Commerce Fee (0%–2%). Framer paid plans: 1%. Order Value is the buyer-paid amount after discounts, including VAT/sales tax and excluding processor fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundee.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Sellers connect their own PayPal or Stripe accounts; Soundee does not hold sale proceeds. Provider processing, payout, conversion, dispute and account fees vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundee.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Track upload limits: Free 10, Starter 50, Pro unlimited.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundee.com/sell-beats/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://soundee.com/sell-beats/pricing", "label": "Plans and features"}, {"url": "https://soundee.com/terms", "label": "Commission and provider fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Fees apply to Order Value: the buyer-paid amount after discounts, including VAT/sales tax and excluding payment-provider fees. Free plan: 30%; paid Marketplace: 10%; Store fees depend on plan and payment method.","fee_percent":30,"fee_basis":"Free plan sales; paid-plan Marketplace commission and Store Commerce Fees vary by channel","sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Beats and services", "note": "Fees are on the buyer’s total, including tax. Paid plans are billed yearly.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $7.99, or $14.99", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Your PayPal or Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "10, 50, or unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Soundee", "groups": [{"label": "Free plan", "rates": [{"note": "All sales", "label": "Free plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "Paid plans", "rates": [{"label": "Paid, Marketplace", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Store, PayPal", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Starter store, Stripe", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Pro store, Stripe", "value": "1%", "percent": 1, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Paid, Marketplace", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"beats-and-instrumentals--traktrain","section_id":"beats-and-instrumentals","name":"TRAKTRAIN","summary":"Sell beats, license types, sound kits, and sample packs through a store and marketplace.","website_url":"https://traktrain.com/sell-beats","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/traktrain-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free; 100 plan is $5.99 first month then $9/month, or $47.88 first year then $89.88/year; Unlimited is $9.99 first month then $19/month, or $95.88 first year then $179.88/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://traktrain.com/sell-beats"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free: 0% MP3 sales, 25% kits. 100 plan: 0% on first 100 beats, 25% from beat 101. Unlimited: 0% all sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://traktrain.com/sell-beats"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No buyer commission; payment providers may charge their own fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://traktrain.com/sell-beats"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payments go directly to the producer through PayPal or Stripe; provider fees apply. First Stripe payouts may take 6–7 days; later transfers usually 1–2 days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://traktrain.com/faq"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Free includes MP3 leases and up to 3 kits; paid plans add all contract types and custom contracts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://traktrain.com/sell-beats"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://traktrain.com/sell-beats", "label": "Plans and commissions"}, {"url": "https://traktrain.com/terms", "label": "Seller terms"}, {"url": "https://traktrain.com/about", "label": "Earnings model"}, {"url": "https://traktrain.com/faq", "label": "Sales and payment FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Seller share depends on plan and product: free kits take 25%; paid plan cuts vary.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Beats and sound kits", "note": "Payments go straight to you through PayPal or Stripe.", "take": {"label": "Unlimited plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $9, or $19 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "PayPal or Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Buyer fee", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "TRAKTRAIN", "groups": [{"label": "Free plan", "rates": [{"label": "MP3 sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Free plan, kits", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "100 plan", "rates": [{"label": "First 100 beats", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Beat 101 and up", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Unlimited plan", "rates": [{"label": "All sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Free plan, kits", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"browser-extensions--chrome-web-store","section_id":"browser-extensions","name":"Chrome Web Store","summary":"List Chrome extensions; sellers handle payments for paid features.","website_url":"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-chrome-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "New publisher registration is $5 once; adding members to an existing publisher is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.chrome.com/blog/cws-role-expansion-developer-dashboard"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid products are allowed. The developer is responsible for payment processing, records and taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/program-policies/terms"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Google does not process paid-product transactions through Chrome Web Store checkout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/program-policies/terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Chrome browser extensions; new listings and updates are subject to store review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/publish/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.chrome.com/blog/cws-role-expansion-developer-dashboard", "label": "Registration fee"}, {"url": "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/program-policies/terms", "label": "Paid products"}, {"url": "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/program-policies/accepting-payment", "label": "Payment rules"}, {"url": "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/publish/", "label": "Publishing and review"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The one-time publisher fee is $5; Google does not process paid-product transactions for Chrome Web Store publishers.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Chrome extensions", "note": "Chrome Web Store does not sell anything for you. You handle payments and taxes.", "take": {"label": "No store checkout", "value": "Your own checkout", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$5 once", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Your own provider", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Review", "value": "Required", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Google", "groups": []}}, {"id":"browser-extensions--firefox-add-ons","section_id":"browser-extensions","name":"Firefox Add-ons","summary":"List free Firefox add-ons and bill paid features through your provider.","website_url":"https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/extensionworkshop-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "AMO provides free hosting and update services for add-ons.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/about"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "AMO downloads stay free; developers can charge for features through a payment provider they choose.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/make-money-from-browser-extensions/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "AMO is free to download; paid features and donations use payment services chosen by developers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/make-money-from-browser-extensions/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Firefox desktop add-ons and add-ons compatible with Firefox for Android.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/submitting-an-add-on/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/about", "label": "Hosting and updates"}, {"url": "https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/make-money-from-browser-extensions/", "label": "Downloads and monetization"}, {"url": "https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/submitting-an-add-on/", "label": "Submission"}, {"url": "https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/signing-and-distribution-overview/", "label": "Signing and review"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"AMO hosts and distributes free downloads; developers manage paid features and payment providers.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Firefox add-ons", "note": "Add-ons are free to download. Charge for features through any payment service.", "take": {"label": "No store checkout", "value": "Your own checkout", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Downloads", "value": "Always free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Paid features", "value": "Your own provider", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Mozilla", "groups": []}}, {"id":"browser-extensions--microsoft-edge-add-ons","section_id":"browser-extensions","name":"Microsoft Edge Add-ons","summary":"Publish Edge extensions; third-party purchase APIs apply to specified sales.","website_url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/extensions-chromium/publish/publish-extension","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/learn-microsoft-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Microsoft charges no registration fee for extension submissions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/extensions/publish/create-dev-account"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Third-party purchase API required for physical goods/services and specified other payments; disclose paid offers and prices.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/legal/microsoft-edge/extensions/developer-policies"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Microsoft publishes no Edge Add-ons store transaction fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/legal/microsoft-edge/extensions/developer-policies"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Microsoft Edge extensions; API support varies by operating system.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/extensions/developer-guide/api-support"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/extensions/publish/create-dev-account", "label": "Developer account"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/legal/microsoft-edge/extensions/developer-policies", "label": "Paid features"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/extensions/developer-guide/api-support", "label": "Supported APIs"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/extensions/publish/publish-extension", "label": "Submission and certification"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The policy requires a secure third-party purchase API for physical goods/services and specified other payments. It does not publish an Edge Add-ons store transaction rate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Edge extensions", "note": "Microsoft publishes no store fee. Paid features use a payment provider you choose.", "take": {"label": "Store transaction fee", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Third-party provider", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Review", "value": "Certification", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Microsoft", "groups": []}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--acuity-scheduling","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Acuity Scheduling","summary":"Sell appointments from an independent scheduling page.","website_url":"https://acuityscheduling.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/acuityscheduling-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter $20/mo or $16 annual; Standard $34 or $27 annual; Premium $61 or $49 annual. USD, taxes extra.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://acuityscheduling.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Acuity says it charges no additional fee for payment features.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://acuityscheduling.com/features/payments"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Processor fees apply; Stripe, Square, and PayPal set rates that vary by provider and location. Venmo is a supported payment method, not a separate processor.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://acuityscheduling.com/features/payments"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Your own clients book through your scheduling page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://acuityscheduling.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://acuityscheduling.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and payments"}, {"url": "https://acuityscheduling.com/features/payments", "label": "Payment fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD pricing; Starter accepts payments. Annual prices are monthly equivalents; taxes and selected processor fees are extra.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Acuity payment-feature surcharge; processor fees are separate","sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Scheduling", "note": "Payment processor fees still apply.", "take": {"label": "Payment features", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Starter", "value": "$20 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Stripe, Square, PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Clients", "value": "Your own", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Acuity", "groups": [{"label": "Acuity", "rates": [{"label": "Payment features", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--cal-com-paid-bookings","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Cal.com paid bookings","summary":"Scheduling links with paid bookings through Stripe.","website_url":"https://cal.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/cal-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "The Free Individual plan includes Stripe and PayPal booking payments; annual Teams costs $12/user/month and Organizations $28/user/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cal.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Cal Pay, an app published by Cal.com, lists 0% commission. Cal.com does not publish a platform fee for its standard Stripe/PayPal booking integration.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cal.com/apps/cal-payments"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Standard booking payments use Stripe or PayPal; their processing fees vary by provider and are not listed on Cal.com’s pricing page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cal.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Bring your own clients; Stripe or PayPal collects payment when they book.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cal.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://cal.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and payments"}, {"url": "https://cal.com/apps/cal-payments", "label": "Cal Pay app"}, {"url": "https://cal.com/features/payments", "label": "Payment overview"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Free Individual supports Stripe/PayPal booking payments; Cal Pay separately lists a 0% commission; the standard integration rate is not published.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Scheduling", "note": "Cal.com does not publish a fee for its standard Stripe and PayPal apps.", "take": {"label": "Cal Pay app", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Free plan", "value": "Includes payments", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Teams", "value": "$12 a user a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Stripe or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Cal.com", "groups": [{"label": "Cal.com", "rates": [{"label": "Cal Pay app", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--calendly-paid-bookings","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Calendly paid bookings","summary":"Scheduling and payments for appointments with your own clients.","website_url":"https://calendly.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/calendly-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard is $10/seat/month with annual billing; it includes Stripe and PayPal payment integrations. Free does not list payment integrations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://calendly.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The current payment FAQ does not list a separate Calendly booking fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://calendly.com/help/payments-faq"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Payments go to Stripe or PayPal; processor fees follow each provider’s rates.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://calendly.com/help/payments-faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Use paid bookings with your own clients; they pay at booking through your connected Stripe or PayPal account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://calendly.com/help/payments-faq"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://calendly.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and payments"}, {"url": "https://calendly.com/help/payments-faq", "label": "Payments and payouts"}, {"url": "https://stripe.com/pricing", "label": "Stripe rates"}, {"url": "https://www.paypal.com/us/business/paypal-business-fees", "label": "PayPal rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Standard annual-billing price. Payments go directly to Stripe or PayPal; their processor fees are separate and depend on provider and payment details.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Scheduling", "note": "Calendly lists no booking fee. Stripe or PayPal fees apply.", "take": {"label": "Separate booking fee", "value": "No fee listed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Standard", "value": "$10 a seat a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Stripe or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Free plan", "value": "No payments", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Calendly", "groups": []}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--clarity","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Clarity","summary":"Expert advice calls sold at a per-minute rate.","website_url":"https://clarity.fm/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/clarity-fm.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Clarity’s current official payments pages do not publish a plan or subscription price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://clarity.fm/help/topics/6/payments-fees"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Clarity charges a 15% service fee for each completed call, deducted from the amount charged to the member.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://clarity.fm/help/topics/6/payments-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Payouts go to PayPal after 14 days; Clarity does not publish a separate card-processing rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://clarity.fm/help/articles/64/why-do-payments-take-too-long"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Members book experts through Clarity; callers pay by Visa, Mastercard or American Express.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://clarity.fm/help/topics/6/payments-fees"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://clarity.fm/help/topics/6/payments-fees", "label": "Fees and payments"}, {"url": "https://clarity.fm/help/articles/64/why-do-payments-take-too-long", "label": "Payout timing"}, {"url": "https://clarity.fm/help/articles/34/how-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payout method"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Expert call marketplace; 15% service fee per completed call; payout to PayPal after 14 days.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"15% of the amount charged for each completed call","sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Paid advice calls", "note": "Clarity charges by the minute and takes 15% of each call.", "take": {"label": "Completed calls", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "PayPal, after 14 days", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Clients pay", "value": "By card", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Clarity", "groups": [{"label": "Clarity", "rates": [{"label": "Completed calls", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--growthmentor","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"GrowthMentor","summary":"Offer mentoring sessions to growth-focused founders.","website_url":"https://www.growthmentor.com/faq/how-do-mentors-get-paid","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-growthmentor-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Mentors offer free first sessions and can set a paid rate after 3 reviews; charging over $100/hour requires 10 reviews.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.growthmentor.com/faq/how-do-mentors-get-paid"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "The recently updated mentor FAQ says there is no commission; the Terms say GrowthMentor currently retains 15%. The official pages conflict.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.growthmentor.com/faq/how-do-mentors-get-paid"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Payouts use Stripe and usually arrive in 2 to 7 business days; the FAQ does not state a separate Stripe processing rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.growthmentor.com/faq/how-do-mentors-get-paid"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Clients are GrowthMentor members; Stripe payout starts after a paid session is completed and marked.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.growthmentor.com/faq/how-do-mentors-get-paid"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.growthmentor.com/faq/how-do-mentors-get-paid", "label": "Mentor FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.growthmentor.com/terms-of-service", "label": "Terms of Service"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Mentor payouts; the current FAQ and Terms state conflicting commission rates.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Startup mentoring", "note": "The mentor FAQ says there is no commission, but the terms say GrowthMentor keeps 15%.", "take": {"label": "Sources disagree", "value": "0–15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "First sessions", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Paid rate", "value": "After 3 reviews", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Stripe, 2 to 7 days", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "GrowthMentor", "groups": []}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--intro","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Intro","summary":"Give paid advice through scheduled video sessions.","website_url":"https://intro.co/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/intro-co.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to join; no subscription fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://intro.co/experts"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "10% commission on bookings experts bring through their profile or custom link; 30% on marketplace bookings.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://intro.co/experts"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Payouts are automated through Stripe; the expert page does not publish a separate processing rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://intro.co/experts"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Bookings can come through the expert’s shared link or Intro’s invite-only marketplace.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://intro.co/experts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://intro.co/experts", "label": "Expert fees and payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Public expert pricing; commission depends on whether the expert brings the booking or Intro marketplace discovery does.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Paid expert calls", "note": "Intro takes less when you bring the client yourself.", "take": {"label": "Your own link", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Stripe, automatic", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Marketplace", "value": "Invite only", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Intro", "groups": [{"label": "Intro", "rates": [{"label": "Your own link", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Intro marketplace", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Intro marketplace", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--kajabi-coaching","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Kajabi coaching","summary":"Sell from your own Kajabi site.","website_url":"https://kajabi.com/features/coaching","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kajabi-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic $143/mo annual or $179 monthly; Growth $199 or $249; Pro $399 or $499. Annual prices are billed yearly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Kajabi takes no revenue share. Other payment providers (except PayPal and Kajabi Payments) add 2% on Basic, 1% on Growth, or 0.5% on Pro.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "US Kajabi Payments card processing: Basic 2.9% + $0.30; Growth 2.8% + $0.30; Pro 2.7% + $0.30. Rates vary by country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sell from your own Kajabi site to your own clients.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and payment fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD plan prices. No revenue share; other-provider add-on fees exclude PayPal and Kajabi Payments. US Kajabi Payments card rates are a regional reference.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Coaching on Kajabi", "note": "Kajabi takes no revenue share on its own payments.", "take": {"label": "Kajabi Payments", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Basic", "value": "$179 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ in US", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Clients", "value": "Your own", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Kajabi", "groups": [{"label": "Kajabi Payments or PayPal", "rates": [{"label": "Kajabi Payments", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Other payment providers", "rates": [{"label": "Other provider, Basic", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Growth", "value": "1%", "percent": 1, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pro", "value": "0.5%", "percent": 0.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Other provider, Basic", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--mentorcruise","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"MentorCruise","summary":"Mentorship subscriptions and one-off expert sessions.","website_url":"https://mentorcruise.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/mentorcruise-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "The fee guide does not list a separate mentor plan or subscription price; fees are deducted per sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.mentorcruise.com/article/61-what-fees-does-mentorcruise-take"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Mentorships average 16.6% of mentee price (usually a 20% markup); minimums/caps vary by monthly plan. Top plans over $800/month have a 10% markup, $100 minimum and $200 cap. MentorCruise’s flat fee on one-off sessions is $9–$39; custom sessions carry 10%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.mentorcruise.com/article/61-what-fees-does-mentorcruise-take"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe cards typically cost 2.9% + $0.30 to 3.5% + $0.30; ACH is 0.8% and stablecoins 1.5%. Rates vary by location. Borderless payouts usually cost 2%, with a $4 to $8 minimum.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.mentorcruise.com/article/45-payout"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Clients find mentors on MentorCruise; mentors can also offer custom sessions they created.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.mentorcruise.com/article/61-what-fees-does-mentorcruise-take"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.mentorcruise.com/article/61-what-fees-does-mentorcruise-take", "label": "Mentor fees"}, {"url": "https://help.mentorcruise.com/article/45-payout", "label": "Payouts and processing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Fee varies by product, plan amount and payout method; 16.6% is the published global average on mentorship transactions.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Mentorship", "note": "Plans over $800 a month have a 10% markup, capped at $200.", "take": {"label": "Mentorships, average", "value": "16.6%", "percent": 16.6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payout fee", "value": "About 2%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Custom sessions", "value": "10%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "MentorCruise", "groups": [{"label": "MentorCruise", "rates": [{"note": "Usually a 20% markup", "label": "Mentorships, average", "value": "16.6%", "percent": 16.6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Custom sessions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Flat fee", "label": "One-off sessions", "value": "$9–$39", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "One-off sessions", "value": "$9–$39", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--payhip-coaching","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Payhip coaching","summary":"Sell from your own Payhip storefront.","website_url":"https://payhip.com/features/coaching","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/payhip-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free $0/mo; Plus $29/mo; Pro $99/mo.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payhip.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan 5%; Plus 2%; Pro 0% Payhip transaction fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payhip.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe or PayPal also charge their standard processing rates on every plan; rates depend on provider and location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payhip.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Coaching sellers use their own store and clients; Payhip marketplace currently accepts digital products only.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/307-marketplace"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://payhip.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://payhip.com/features/sell-coaching", "label": "Coaching and storefront"}, {"url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/307-marketplace", "label": "Marketplace rules"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD monthly plans; the Payhip fee depends on plan. PayPal/Stripe fees are additional and vary by provider and location; marketplace listing does not currently support coaching products.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Coaching on Payhip", "note": "Payhip’s marketplace only lists digital products, not coaching.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $29, or $99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Stripe or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Clients", "value": "Your own", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Payhip", "groups": [{"label": "Plans", "rates": [{"label": "Free plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Plus plan", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pro plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Pro plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--podia-coaching","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Podia coaching","summary":"Sell from your own Podia site.","website_url":"https://www.podia.com/coaching","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-podia-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Annual billing: Mover $504/year ($42/mo); Shaker $1,008/year ($84/mo); Earthquaker $1,800/year ($150/mo).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.podia.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Mover charges 5%; Shaker and Earthquaker have no Podia transaction fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.podia.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe or PayPal standard processing is listed as 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction; it may vary by location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.podia.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sell coaching from your own Podia site to your own clients.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.podia.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.podia.com/pricing", "label": "Plans, coaching, and fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD annual plan prices. Podia fees depend on plan; Stripe/PayPal processing is separate and may vary by location.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Coaching on Podia", "note": "You sell coaching from your own Podia site.", "take": {"label": "Mover plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Mover", "value": "$42 a month, yearly", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Clients", "value": "Your own", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Podia", "groups": [{"label": "Podia", "rates": [{"label": "Mover plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Shaker and up", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Shaker and up", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--savvycal","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"SavvyCal","summary":"Scheduling links for a seller’s existing clients.","website_url":"https://savvycal.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/savvycal-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic $10; Premium $17/user/mo with annual billing; paid bookings require Premium.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://savvycal.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The official pricing and payments pages do not publish a separate SavvyCal booking fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://savvycal.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe domestic US card processing: 2.9% + $0.30; international cards and currency conversion add fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Your own clients; bookings are paid through your connected Stripe account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://savvycal.com/stripe"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://savvycal.com/pricing", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://savvycal.com/stripe", "label": "Paid bookings"}, {"url": "https://stripe.com/pricing", "label": "Stripe rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD; paid bookings require Premium at $17/user/month on annual billing. Stripe lists 2.9% + $0.30 for domestic US cards, with extra charges for international cards or currency conversion.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Scheduling", "note": "SavvyCal does not publish a separate booking fee.", "take": {"label": "Booking fee", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Premium", "value": "$17 a user a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Paid bookings", "value": "Premium only", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "SavvyCal", "groups": []}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--skillshare-1-on-1-sessions","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Skillshare 1-on-1 Sessions","summary":"Private sessions sold through Skillshare’s creator shop.","website_url":"https://www.skillshare.com/en/teach","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-skillshare-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "No seller plan price is listed; teachers need an approved teaching account and one published class.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/22969272481805-How-1-on-1-Sessions-Work"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "10% platform fee applies to the first $2,000 earned from 1-on-1 sessions each month; fees on earnings above that are credited back monthly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/226578788-When-and-how-do-I-receive-payments-from-Skillshare"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe: 2.9% + $0.30. Skillshare holds session payouts for 14 days after completion before funds reach Wise; USD Wise withdrawal is usually about $1, with FX fees varying.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/226578788-When-and-how-do-I-receive-payments-from-Skillshare"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sell through Skillshare; clients do not need a Skillshare membership.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/22969272481805-How-1-on-1-Sessions-Work"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/22969272481805-How-1-on-1-Sessions-Work", "label": "Session terms"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/226578788-When-and-how-do-I-receive-payments-from-Skillshare", "label": "Processing and payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD; session creators set the session price. The 10% platform fee is capped at the first $2,000 monthly 1-on-1 earnings, with fee credits above the threshold; processing and Wise withdrawal fees are separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Private sessions", "note": "Clients do not need a Skillshare membership to book.", "take": {"label": "First $2,000 a month", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Needs", "value": "A published class", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payout hold", "value": "14 days", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Skillshare", "groups": [{"label": "Skillshare", "rates": [{"label": "First $2,000 a month", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Credited back monthly", "label": "Above $2,000", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above $2,000", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--superprofile","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"SuperProfile","summary":"Sell coaching bookings and digital products from a link-in-bio store.","website_url":"https://superprofile.bio/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/superprofile-bio.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Plans list Starter free, Creator $4.99 for the first month then $29/month or $300/year, and Pro at custom pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/plans-billing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Indian accounts pay 5% platform fee plus GST and need a paid plan to sell. Global accounts pay no SuperProfile platform fee but need Creator ($29/month or $300/year).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/creating-a-superprofile-account"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Global payments go to connected Stripe, PayPal, Paystack or Coinbase accounts; their processing fees vary. The account guide does not itemize any India processing rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/creating-a-superprofile-account"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Bookings require Creator to publish; clients book through your profile link, an embed or Auto-DM.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/how-to-use-the-bookings-feature-in-superprofile"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/plans-billing", "label": "Plans and billing"}, {"url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/creating-a-superprofile-account", "label": "Regional fees"}, {"url": "https://iris.superprofile.bio/help/cosmofeed/articles/how-to-use-the-bookings-feature-in-superprofile", "label": "Bookings setup"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Platform fees and payment routing differ between automatically assigned Indian and Global accounts; published Creator pricing is in USD.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Link-in-bio store", "note": "You need the Creator plan to publish bookings.", "take": {"label": "Global accounts", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Creator plan", "value": "$29 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "India fee", "value": "Plus GST", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Stripe, PayPal, more", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "SuperProfile", "groups": [{"label": "SuperProfile", "rates": [{"note": "Creator plan needed", "label": "Global accounts", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Plus GST", "label": "Indian accounts", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Indian accounts", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--tidycal","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"TidyCal","summary":"Take bookings and sell sessions from a scheduling link.","website_url":"https://tidycal.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/tidycal-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free; Individual Lifetime $29; Agency Lifetime $79; Pro $12/month or $99/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tidycal.com/article/153-what-is-tidycal"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe paid bookings have a 1% TidyCal fee on Free and lifetime plans; 0% on Pro and PayPal. Some Stripe countries do not allow this fee. Lifetime users can pass the fee to clients or cover it.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tidycal.com/article/1069-does-tidycal-charge-a-fee-on-payments"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe processing fees are separate; PayPal sets its own processing fees. TidyCal does not publish a universal processor rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tidycal.com/article/1069-does-tidycal-charge-a-fee-on-payments"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Clients book through your TidyCal link; paid bookings connect to Stripe or PayPal.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tidycal.com/article/1069-does-tidycal-charge-a-fee-on-payments"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.tidycal.com/article/153-what-is-tidycal", "label": "Plans and billing"}, {"url": "https://help.tidycal.com/article/1069-does-tidycal-charge-a-fee-on-payments", "label": "Booking and processing fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Platform fee depends on plan, payment method and whether Stripe supports platform fees in the seller’s country.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Scheduling", "note": "Lifetime users can pass the 1% fee on to clients.", "take": {"label": "Free and lifetime", "value": "1%", "percent": 1, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Lifetime", "value": "$29 once", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Pro", "value": "$12 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "PayPal", "value": "No TidyCal fee", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "TidyCal", "groups": [{"label": "TidyCal, on Stripe", "rates": [{"label": "Free and lifetime", "value": "1%", "percent": 1, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pro plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "PayPal", "rates": [{"label": "Any plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Pro plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions--topmate","section_id":"coaching-consultations-and-paid-sessions","name":"Topmate","summary":"Sell calls, products, and services from a creator page.","website_url":"https://topmate.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/topmate-io.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No upfront or recurring fee is listed for creators.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://topmate.io/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Topmate charges 10% on sales through your profile or link and 20% on marketplace sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://topmate.io/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "The pricing comparison lists 2%/3% transaction fees but does not state which cases use each rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://topmate.io/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sales can come from your own profile or link, or from Topmate marketplace discovery.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://topmate.io/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://topmate.io/pricing", "label": "Creator pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Public pricing; direct-link and marketplace commissions differ; the 2%/3% transaction-fee basis is not stated.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Calls and products", "note": "Topmate lists 2% and 3% transaction fees but does not say when each applies.", "take": {"label": "Your own link", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2% or 3%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sales from", "value": "Your link or Topmate", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Topmate", "groups": [{"label": "Topmate", "rates": [{"label": "Your own link", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Topmate marketplace", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Topmate marketplace", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--dreame-stary-writing","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Dreame / Stary Writing","summary":"Publish pay-to-read fiction and apply for Stary writer contracts.","website_url":"https://www.starywriting.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-starywriting-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Pay-to-read income plus writing bonuses.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/activity/benefits"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public pages describe royalties and bonuses but do not list the base royalty percentage.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/activity/benefits"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No public author fee schedule was found.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Stories can publish from 200 words; authors can apply for a contract at 5,000 words.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/toBeWriter"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "An exclusive contract is required for Stary’s Basic Bonus; other deal terms vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/activity/benefits"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/", "label": "Writer program"}, {"url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/activity/benefits", "label": "Writer benefits"}, {"url": "https://www.starywriting.com/en/toBeWriter", "label": "Writer page"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Stary’s English writer page says stories can publish at 200 words and contracts can be requested at 5,000 words. The public benefits page lists pay-to-read earnings and bonuses but no base revenue share. Its Basic Bonus requires an exclusive contract; some bonus rules also depend on update targets and pay-to-read earnings.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Serial fiction", "note": "Dreame does not publish its base royalty rate.", "take": {"label": "Base royalty", "value": "Royalty not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Publish from", "value": "200 words", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Contract at", "value": "5,000 words", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Bonus needs", "value": "Exclusive contract", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Stary", "groups": []}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--globalcomix","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"GlobalComix","summary":"Creator shares vary by plan and by paid content or donations.","website_url":"https://globalcomix.com/publish","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/globalcomix-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Monetize paid comic access and PDF sales, plus reader donations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://globalcomix.com/publish"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan: 65% content and 92% donations. Professional plan: 70% content and 95% donations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://globalcomix.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan costs $0. Professional costs $19.99 per month; custom pricing requires contacting sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://globalcomix.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Open to creators and publishers who own or hold publishing rights to their comics.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://globalcomix.com/support/faq"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain rights and grant GlobalComix a non-exclusive license to display and promote uploaded work.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://globalcomix.com/terms-of-use"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://globalcomix.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and shares"}, {"url": "https://globalcomix.com/publish", "label": "Monetization and payouts"}, {"url": "https://globalcomix.com/publisher-terms-of-service", "label": "Publisher earnings"}, {"url": "https://globalcomix.com/support/faq", "label": "Rights and requirements"}, {"url": "https://globalcomix.com/terms-of-use", "label": "Content license"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current USD pricing: Free $0, Professional $19.99/month. Shares are for paid content and donations. Payouts start at $30; US Stripe payout fee is $2.25 + 0.25%; PayPal is about 3% to 4.5%, varying by country. Store and payout fees are separate from creator shares.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Comics", "note": "You must own or hold publishing rights to the comics you upload.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "35%", "percent": 35, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pro plan", "value": "$19.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Donations", "value": "5–8% cut", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "GlobalComix", "groups": [{"label": "Paid content", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 65%", "label": "Free plan", "value": "35%", "percent": 35, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Donations", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 92%", "label": "Free plan", "value": "8%", "percent": 8, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 95%", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Pro plan", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--goodnovel","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"GoodNovel","summary":"Contract rewards are public; the current revenue share percentage is not listed.","website_url":"https://www.goodnovel.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-goodnovel-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid chapter unlocks and contract rewards.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/writer_benefit"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Current share percentage is not listed on the 2026 rewards page. A 2020 guide says 50% profit share for contracts, with a 120k-word condition for non-exclusive books; current non-exclusive rewards use a 150k threshold.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/writer_benefit"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No public author fee schedule was found.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/writer_benefit"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors can apply after uploading more than 5,000 words.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/writer_benefit"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "The 2026 page offers exclusive and non-exclusive contracts; an older guide says non-exclusive books may appear elsewhere only as paid reads.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/writer_benefit"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/writer_benefit", "label": "Writer rewards, 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/book/GoodNovel-Author-s-Guidebook_21000005174/Exclusive-And-Non-Exclusive-Contracts_90205", "label": "Contract guide, 2020"}, {"url": "https://activity.webnovel.com/noah/844556559?tabIndex=0", "label": "Writer benefits"}, {"url": "https://www.goodnovel.com/book/GoodNovel-Author-s-Guidebook_21000005174/FAQ-About-Payment_93926", "label": "Payment FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 2026 Writer Benefits page says payments are made on the 10th of the following month, with a $200 bank minimum or $100 PayPal minimum. A current localized official payment FAQ says a $100 accumulated threshold and lists bank/Payoneer, so payout thresholds and methods conflict. Confirm the offered account terms.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Serial fiction", "note": "A 2020 guide said 50% profit share. The 2026 page does not list a rate.", "take": {"label": "Contract share", "value": "Share not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Apply at", "value": "5,000 words", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Contracts", "value": "Exclusive or not", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Fees", "value": "None stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "GoodNovel", "groups": []}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--inkitt-and-galatea","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Inkitt and Galatea","summary":"Publish serial fiction on Inkitt or apply for a separate Galatea deal.","website_url":"https://www.inkitt.com/writers","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-inkitt-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Inkitt reader subscriptions; selected Galatea publishing deals.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://inkitt.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/9887360213394-What-is-the-Author-Subscription-Program-and-how-can-I-join"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors keep 100% of Inkitt subscription earnings after payment processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.inkitt.com/author-subscription"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No Inkitt platform cut; payment processing fees apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.inkitt.com/author-subscription"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors can join the subscription program without application review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://inkitt.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/9887360213394-What-is-the-Author-Subscription-Program-and-how-can-I-join"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Inkitt subscriptions are non-exclusive; Galatea deal terms vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://inkitt.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/12845697390866-Is-there-any-contractual-obligation-exclusivity-clause-if-I-put-a-story-in-the-Subscription-Program"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.inkitt.com/author-subscription", "label": "Author subscription terms"}, {"url": "https://inkitt.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/9887360213394-What-is-the-Author-Subscription-Program-and-how-can-I-join", "label": "Access guide"}, {"url": "https://inkitt.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/12845697390866-Is-there-any-contractual-obligation-exclusivity-clause-if-I-put-a-story-in-the-Subscription-Program", "label": "Exclusivity guidance"}, {"url": "https://www.inkitt.com/writersblog/how-inkitt-publishes-your-books-from-preparation-to-promotion", "label": "Galatea terms"}, {"url": "https://inkitt.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/12756836931090-Galatea-Royalty-Payments-through-Tipalti", "label": "Galatea royalties"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 100% share applies only to Inkitt subscriptions and is before payment processing. Galatea is a separate selected publishing deal; its royalty share and rights are set by contract and are not publicly listed.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Serial fiction", "note": "Galatea publishing deals are separate, and their terms vary.", "take": {"label": "Subscription earnings", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "No review needed", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Still apply", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Inkitt", "groups": [{"label": "Inkitt", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100% after payment fees", "label": "Subscription earnings", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--kakuyomu","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Kakuyomu","summary":"Earn from Japanese web fiction through ad sharing and reader gifts.","website_url":"https://kakuyomu.jp/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kakuyomu-jp.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ad revenue sharing and reader gifts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/guide/loyalty_program"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors receive about 70% of ad sales; individual rewards depend on ad score.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/guide/loyalty_program"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to join; cash-out transfer fees apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/help/entry/faq_loyalty"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Writers abroad may join; cashing out needs a Japanese bank account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/help/entry/faq_loyalty"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors retain copyright and grant Kakuyomu a free, non-exclusive license to publish, distribute, copy, and promote their work.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/legal/tos"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/guide/loyalty_program", "label": "Royalty program"}, {"url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/help/entry/faq_loyalty", "label": "Program FAQ"}, {"url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/help/entry/gift_reward", "label": "Gift rewards"}, {"url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/legal/tos", "label": "Terms"}, {"url": "https://kakuyomu.jp/legal/guideline", "label": "Publishing guidelines"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"About 70% of ad sales is allocated to authors, then split by ad score; 1 reward is worth ¥1. Gift payouts vary with gifts and activity. Participation is free. Redeem from 100 rewards for BOOK☆WALKER coins, 500 for an Amazon gift card, or 3,000 for cash. Cash-out needs a Japanese bank account and has a transfer fee.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Japanese web fiction", "note": "Each author’s ad reward depends on an ad score. Reader gifts pay separately.", "take": {"label": "Ad revenue", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Cash out", "value": "Japanese bank needed", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Kakuyomu", "groups": [{"label": "Kakuyomu", "rates": [{"note": "Authors share about 70%", "label": "Ad revenue", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--pocket-fm","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Pocket FM","summary":"Publish audio fiction; writers earn under Pocket FM’s invite-based program.","website_url":"https://sherpa.pocketfm.com/faq","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/sherpa-pocketfm-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Audio series, coin earnings, and the Writers Benefit Program (WBP).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sherpa.pocketfm.com/faq"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "WBP earnings terms are handled by contract; no standard share is publicly listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sherpa.pocketfm.com/faq"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No public writer fee schedule was found in the Sherpa FAQ or service terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sherpa.pocketfm.com/faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Writers need an invitation to sign a WBP contract and earn through the program.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sherpa.pocketfm.com/faq"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "General service terms grant Pocket FM a non-exclusive license to user submissions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pocketfm.com/terms-of-service"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://sherpa.pocketfm.com/faq", "label": "Writer FAQ"}, {"url": "https://pocketfm.com/terms-of-service", "label": "Service terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Pocket FM’s Sherpa FAQ lists an invitation and WBP contract as the path to writer earnings, but the accessible public FAQ does not give a standard share or fee schedule. The general service terms grant a non-exclusive content license; a separate WBP contract may add rights or payment terms.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Audio fiction", "note": "Pocket FM pays writers under invite-only contracts.", "take": {"label": "Writer Benefit Program", "value": "Set by agreement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "By invitation", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Program", "value": "Writers Benefit", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Pocket FM", "groups": []}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--ream","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Ream","summary":"Sell reader memberships and ebooks directly to your audience.","website_url":"https://reamstories.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/reamstories-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Reader memberships and direct ebook sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/45-faqs-for-authors"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors keep 90% before payment processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/14-what-fees-does-ream-charge-authors"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Free to start; 10% platform fee plus typical processing of 2.9% + $0.30.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/14-what-fees-does-ream-charge-authors"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors set membership prices and benefits.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/45-faqs-for-authors"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity; authors can publish their work on other platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/56-are-there-exclusivity-agreements-on-ream"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/14-what-fees-does-ream-charge-authors", "label": "Fee breakdown"}, {"url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/45-faqs-for-authors", "label": "Author terms"}, {"url": "https://help.reamstories.com/article/56-are-there-exclusivity-agreements-on-ream", "label": "No exclusivity"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Ream is free to start and takes 10%; payment processing is typically another 2.9% plus $0.30, but varies by payment. Authors keep 90% before processing and may publish their Ream content elsewhere.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Reader memberships", "note": "You set your own membership prices and perks.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Ream", "groups": [{"label": "Ream", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 90% before card fees", "label": "Platform fee", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--tapas","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Tapas","summary":"Free comics and prose with ads and reader Ink support.","website_url":"https://tapas.io/publishing","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/tapas-io.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Creators can earn from ads and reader Ink support; merch shop applications are currently closed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creators.tapas.io/earning-money"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "About 70% of ad revenue goes to creators. Tapas takes no support cut; Ink support leaves 85% on web or 70% in apps after third-party fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/4408643923995-Support-Program"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Tapas offers free self-publishing for comics and written stories.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/115005476687-How-do-I-publish-on-Tapas"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Ads require age 18+ and 100 subscribers. Support requires 250 subscribers and staff approval.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/360007703773-Ad-Revenue"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain ownership and grant Tapas an ongoing non-exclusive license to publish their work.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/115005545248-Terms-of-Service"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.creators.tapas.io/earning-money", "label": "Earnings options"}, {"url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/360007703773-Ad-Revenue", "label": "Ad share"}, {"url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/4408643923995-Support-Program", "label": "Support share and fees"}, {"url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/115005476687-How-do-I-publish-on-Tapas", "label": "Publishing terms"}, {"url": "https://help.tapas.io/hc/en-us/articles/115005545248-Terms-of-Service", "label": "Creator rights"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Ad share is about 70%. For Ink support, creators receive all profit after third-party transaction fees: 85% of web payments after the 15% fee or 70% of in-app payments after the 30% fee. The merch page lists a 500-subscriber eligibility threshold, but applications are closed.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Comics and stories", "note": "Reader support needs 250 subscribers and staff approval.", "take": {"label": "Ads, about", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Ads need", "value": "100 subscribers", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Tapas", "groups": [{"label": "Tapas", "rates": [{"note": "You keep about 70%", "label": "Ads, about", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Payment fees: 15% web, 30% apps", "label": "Reader support", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Reader support", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--wattpad-originals","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Wattpad Originals","summary":"No public creator rate or fee schedule is listed for Wattpad Originals.","website_url":"https://creators.wattpad.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/creators-wattpad-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Selected CANVAS creators may join Originals under formal agreements and share revenue from paid access.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000070/a260509_2026q1xsharehold.htm"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The exact creator revenue-share percentage is not stated in public Originals disclosures.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000070/a260509_2026q1xsharehold.htm"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public Originals disclosures do not list a separate creator-side fee schedule.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000070/a260509_2026q1xsharehold.htm"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Selected CANVAS creators may be offered formal agreements; detailed eligibility and pitch criteria are not public.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000070/a260509_2026q1xsharehold.htm"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Wattpad-specific rights are contractual and not public; parent-company filings say some creator deals include exclusivity.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000028/wbtn-20251231.htm"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://creators.wattpad.com/", "label": "Creator portal"}, {"url": "https://www.wattpad.com/terms", "label": "Public terms"}, {"url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000070/a260509_2026q1xsharehold.htm", "label": "Shareholder letter, Q1 2026"}, {"url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997859/000199785926000028/wbtn-20251231.htm", "label": "2025 annual report"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Selected CANVAS creators may receive paid-access revenue under individual agreements. Public sources do not state a fixed creator share, fee, selection rules, or Wattpad-specific rights.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Paid serial fiction", "note": "Wattpad does not publish Originals rates.", "take": {"label": "Creator share", "value": "Share not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "Selected creators", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Deals", "value": "Formal agreements", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Some deals", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Wattpad", "groups": []}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--webnovel","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"Webnovel","summary":"Publish serial fiction; apply for a contract to earn from premium chapters.","website_url":"https://www.webnovel.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-webnovel-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Premium chapters, reader gifts, and contract bonuses.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://activity.webnovel.com/noah/844556559?tabIndex=0"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The author revenue share is set by contract; no standard percentage is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://inkstone.webnovel.com/academy/article/679806546888294400"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No public author fee schedule was found.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://activity.webnovel.com/noah/844556559?tabIndex=0"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Apply for a contract after 12,000 words; editors review the application.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://activity.webnovel.com/noah/844556559?tabIndex=0"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Signed works are exclusive and cannot be published or contracted elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://activity.webnovel.com/noah/844556559?tabIndex=0"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://activity.webnovel.com/noah/844556559?tabIndex=0", "label": "Author benefits and rules"}, {"url": "https://inkstone.webnovel.com/academy/article/679806546888294400", "label": "Premium revenue explainer"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The September 2026 author benefits page says a contract can be requested at 12,000 words. Revenue share is contract-specific; bank payout minimum is $200 and PayPal minimum is $100. Signed works cannot be published or contracted elsewhere.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Serial fiction", "note": "Your share is set in your contract. Webnovel does not publish a standard rate.", "take": {"label": "Writer revenue share", "value": "Set by agreement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Apply at", "value": "12,000 words", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Yes, when signed", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Earn from", "value": "Premium chapters", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Webnovel", "groups": []}}, {"id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction--webtoon-canvas","section_id":"comics-and-serialized-fiction","name":"WEBTOON CANVAS","summary":"Free comic publishing with ad revenue and reader Super Likes.","website_url":"https://www.webtoons.com/en/creators101/webtoon-canvas","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-webtoons-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators can earn from ads and Super Likes; Patreon integration is also available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/creators101/makemoney"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ads pay 50% of net ad revenue. Super Likes pay 70% of net after a standard 30% deduction from gross, excluding taxes, refunds and chargebacks. This gives 49% of gross (51% total deductions); WEBTOON may reduce the initial deduction.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://m.webtoons.com/en/terms/canvasTermsOfUsePolicy"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "CANVAS is open to creators; no publishing charge is listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/creators101/webtoon-canvas"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Viewer ads: 40,000+ views and 1,000+ subscribers per Creators 101; January 2026 Terms require over both. Super Likes: 500+ likes and age 18+.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://m.webtoons.com/en/creators101/makemoney"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain their work and grant WEBTOON a non-exclusive license to operate and promote CANVAS.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://m.webtoons.com/en/terms/canvasTermsOfUsePolicy"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/creators101/makemoney", "label": "Monetization options"}, {"url": "https://m.webtoons.com/en/terms/canvasTermsOfUsePolicy", "label": "CANVAS terms"}, {"url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/terms/adRevenueSharingPolicy", "label": "Ad revenue share"}, {"url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/creators101/webtoon-canvas", "label": "Publishing steps"}, {"url": "https://us.webtoons.com/en/creators101/webtoon-academy", "label": "Ownership FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/notice/detail?noticeNo=3567", "label": "Payout threshold update"}, {"url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/notice/detail?noticeNo=3621", "label": "2026 rollout notice"}, {"url": "https://www.webtoons.com/en/terms/superLikePolicy", "label": "Super Like terms"}, {"url": "https://m.webtoons.com/en/creators101/makemoney", "label": "Mobile creator guide"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Creators 101 lists viewer-ad eligibility as 40,000+ global monthly views and 1,000+ subscribers, while the January 2026 Terms require over 40,000 views and over 1,000 subscribers; the official pages conflict at the exact boundary. Super Likes require at least 500 likes and age 18+.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Comics", "note": "Super Likes pay 70% after an initial deduction of up to 30%. Ads also need over 1,000 subscribers; Super Likes need 500 likes and age 18+.", "take": {"label": "Ad revenue", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Ads need", "value": "40,000 views", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "WEBTOON", "groups": [{"label": "WEBTOON CANVAS", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50% of net", "label": "Ad revenue", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "30% first, then 30% of the remainder", "label": "Super Likes", "value": "Up to 51%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Super Likes, total fees", "value": "Up to 51%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"console-games--nintendo-eshop","section_id":"console-games","name":"Nintendo eShop","summary":"Publish Nintendo Switch games on the eShop.","website_url":"https://developer.nintendo.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-nintendo-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Nintendo sets the publisher terms in a publishing agreement; no public royalty percentage is listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.nintendo.com/the-process"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Portal and tools are free, and digital-only IARC ratings are free; development hardware costs extra.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.nintendo.com/faq"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Register, apply separately for Switch access, sign a publishing agreement, then submit the game for Nintendo review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.nintendo.com/the-process"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "The US Nintendo store currently lists games for Nintendo Switch and Nintendo Switch 2.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.nintendo.com/us/store/games/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.nintendo.com/faq", "label": "Signup, tools, and costs"}, {"url": "https://developer.nintendo.com/the-process", "label": "Access and review"}, {"url": "https://developer.nintendo.com/register", "label": "Registration"}, {"url": "https://www.nintendo.com/us/store/games/", "label": "Switch listings"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current public console-publishing terms; fees vary by private agreement and hardware.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Switch games", "note": "Nintendo sets the royalty in its publishing agreement, which is not public.", "take": {"label": "Publisher revenue share", "value": "Set by agreement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free tools", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Dev hardware", "value": "Extra cost", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Consoles", "value": "Switch and Switch 2", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Nintendo", "groups": []}}, {"id":"console-games--playstation-store","section_id":"console-games","name":"PlayStation Store","summary":"Apply to publish digital games on PlayStation.","website_url":"https://partners.playstation.net/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/partners-playstation-net.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "The current publisher revenue share is governed by the partner agreement; no public rate is listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sonyinteractive.com/en/news/blog/showing-your-game-to-playstation/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current partner, publishing, and development-kit costs are not listed in public PlayStation partner materials.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://partners.playstation.net/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Registration must be approved and the Global Developer and Publisher Agreement signed to access PlayStation development and publishing resources.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sonyinteractive.com/en/news/blog/showing-your-game-to-playstation/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Official storefront pages list PS5, PS4, and PS VR2 games.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.playstation.com/en-us/ps5/games/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://partners.playstation.net/", "label": "Partner portal"}, {"url": "https://sonyinteractive.com/en/news/blog/showing-your-game-to-playstation/", "label": "Approval and agreement"}, {"url": "https://www.playstation.com/en-us/ps5/games/", "label": "PS5 games"}, {"url": "https://www.playstation.com/en-us/ps4/ps4-games/", "label": "PS4 games"}, {"url": "https://www.playstation.com/en-us/ps-vr2/games/", "label": "PS VR2 games"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current public console-publishing terms; fees vary by private agreement and hardware.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "PlayStation games", "note": "Sony sets the share in its publisher agreement, which is not public.", "take": {"label": "Publisher revenue share", "value": "Set by agreement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Approval and agreement", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Consoles", "value": "PS5, PS4, PS VR2", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Sony", "groups": []}}, {"id":"console-games--xbox","section_id":"console-games","name":"Xbox","summary":"Publish console or PC games through ID@Xbox.","website_url":"https://www.xbox.com/en-US/developers/id","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-xbox-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Royalty terms are set by the Microsoft licensing agreement; no public rate is listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/onboarding/onboarding-complete-setup"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Xbox partner registration and ID@Xbox applications are free. Approved studios order dev kits separately through EDS; kit prices are not listed publicly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/onboarding/overview"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Every game needs an approved concept; accepted developers sign a Title Licensing Agreement and GDK license agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/onboarding/onboarding-join-id-at-xbox"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "The publishing path covers Xbox consoles and Xbox on PC.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/publishing-processes/managed-creators/overview"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/onboarding/overview", "label": "Partner signup"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/onboarding/onboarding-join-id-at-xbox", "label": "ID@Xbox approval"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/onboarding/onboarding-complete-setup", "label": "Dev kits and royalties"}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/gaming/game-publishing/publishing-processes/managed-creators/overview", "label": "Console and PC publishing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current public console-publishing terms; fees vary by private agreement and hardware.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Xbox and PC games", "note": "Royalties are in the Microsoft licensing agreement, which is not public.", "take": {"label": "Publisher royalties", "value": "Set by agreement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free to register", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Dev kits", "value": "Price not public", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Concept approval", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Microsoft", "groups": []}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--braip","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Braip","summary":"Brazilian checkout for digital and physical products.","website_url":"https://braip.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/braip-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Account is free. At R$300+ monthly withdrawals, fee is R$6.99 for 15-day or R$9.90 for 7-day settlement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://braip.com/termos_de_uso_new.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Published general fee: 9.9% + R$2.49 per transaction; seller-specific negotiated rates may differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.braip.com/termos_de_uso.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Card, Pix and boleto are supported; no separate public rate by payment method was found.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.braip.com/termos_de_uso.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Supports digital and physical products; public terms do not state a product-count cap.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.braip.com/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Terms mention taxes on user operations but do not explain seller collection and remittance duties.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://braip.com/termos-de-uso/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://braip.com/termos-de-uso/", "label": "Terms page"}, {"url": "https://www.braip.com/termos_de_uso.pdf", "label": "Fees and advances"}, {"url": "https://braip.com/termos_de_uso_new.pdf", "label": "Terms and withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://www.braip.com/", "label": "Platform FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Brazilian seller, BRL. General public transaction rate; negotiated rates may differ. At R$300+ monthly withdrawals, monthly fee is R$6.99 for 15-day or R$9.90 for 7-day settlement.","fee_percent":9.9,"fee_basis":"Public general transaction rate in BRL, before any negotiated seller rate.","sort_order":22,"card":{"tag": "Checkout, Brazil", "note": "The withdrawal fee applies once you withdraw R$300 or more a month.", "take": {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Per sale", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Withdrawal", "value": "R$6.99 or R$9.90", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "Card, Pix, boleto", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Braip", "groups": [{"label": "Braip", "rates": [{"note": "Negotiated rates can differ", "extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Per sale", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--classplus","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Classplus","summary":"Branded course app for Indian teachers and coaching institutes.","website_url":"https://classplusapp.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/classplusapp-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Official 2026 comparison lists Grow at ₹29,999/year and Enterprise at ₹39,999 for two years; confirm final feature quote.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classplusapp.com/growth/classplus-vs-online-teaching-platforms-india/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public pages do not list a per-sale platform rate; ask for full quote terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classplusapp.com/growth/classplus-vs-online-teaching-platforms-india/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Published plan totals exclude GST and payment-gateway charges; gateway rates are not listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classplusapp.com/growth/classplus-vs-online-teaching-platforms-india/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Grow lists unlimited online assessments; Enterprise adds MeetPro and semi-white-label iOS.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classplusapp.com/growth/classplus-vs-graphy/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public terms do not explain who collects and remits tax on seller transactions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classplusapp.com/tnc"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://classplusapp.com/growth/classplus-vs-graphy/", "label": "Plans and features"}, {"url": "https://classplusapp.com/growth/classplus-vs-online-teaching-platforms-india/", "label": "Plan comparison, 2026"}, {"url": "https://classplusapp.com/tnc", "label": "Terms of use"}, {"url": "https://classplusapp.com/new-web", "label": "App features"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"India. Grow is listed at ₹29,999/year; Enterprise at ₹39,999 for two years. Public comparison excludes GST and gateway charges; transaction pricing requires a quote.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":27,"card":{"tag": "Course apps, India", "note": "Classplus quotes each institute. GST and gateway charges are extra.", "take": {"label": "Per-sale terms", "value": "Request a quote", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Grow plan", "value": "₹29,999 a year", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Extras", "value": "GST and gateway", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Assessments", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Classplus", "groups": []}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--copecart","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"CopeCart","summary":"Sell products with a merchant checkout and partner program.","website_url":"https://www.copecart.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-copecart-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No monthly or annual fee; charges apply when a sale occurs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9061163-copecart-fee"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Base: 4.9% + €1; Klarna: 6.99% + €1. Risk tiers add 0%, 2%, 4% or 8% based on the account risk score.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/12048266-tier-structure-at-copecart"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Accepts cards, PayPal, SEPA, invoice, digital wallets and Klarna; no separate processor rate table is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9060730-payment-methods-at-copecart"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public fee pages do not state course, learner or product-count limits.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9061163-copecart-fee"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "CopeCart resells the product, invoices buyers and remits applicable transaction taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9054656-copecart-as-a-reseller-taxes"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9061163-copecart-fee", "label": "Vendor fees"}, {"url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/12048266-tier-structure-at-copecart", "label": "Risk tiers"}, {"url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9054656-copecart-as-a-reseller-taxes", "label": "Reseller and tax"}, {"url": "https://copecart.com/pro/terms_vendors_and_affiliate", "label": "Vendor terms"}, {"url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/en/articles/9060730-payment-methods-at-copecart", "label": "Payment methods"}, {"url": "https://help-eu.copecart.com/de/articles/9061163-copecart-gebuhr", "label": "Base and Klarna rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Eurozone seller, EUR. Base is 4.9% + €1; Klarna is 6.99% + €1. Risk tiers add a 0%, 2%, 4% or 8% surcharge based on risk score.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":25,"card":{"tag": "Merchant checkout", "note": "CopeCart resells your product, invoices buyers, and pays sales taxes.", "take": {"extra": "+ €1", "label": "Standard payments", "value": "4.9%", "percent": 4.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Risk surcharge", "value": "0% to 8%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "VAT", "value": "CopeCart pays it", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "CopeCart", "groups": [{"label": "Payments", "rates": [{"extra": "+ €1", "label": "Standard payments", "value": "4.9%", "percent": 4.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ €1", "label": "Klarna", "value": "6.99%", "percent": 6.99, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Added by risk tier", "rates": [{"label": "Tier 1", "value": "+ 0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Tier 2", "value": "+ 2%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Tier 3", "value": "+ 4%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Tier 4", "value": "+ 8%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ €1", "label": "Klarna", "value": "6.99%", "percent": 6.99, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--digistore24","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Digistore24","summary":"Sell digital products through an affiliate-ready checkout.","website_url":"https://www.digistore24.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-digistore24-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No setup or monthly fee; transaction charges apply when sales occur.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.digistore24.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Pricing starts at 2.9% + $1; the final rate varies by product, traffic source, and sales volume.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.digistore24.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "US Inc. charges 7.9% + $1; 9.9% + $1 when chargebacks exceed 1%. Additional payout, refund, chargeback, and vault costs may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.digistore24.com/hc/en-us/articles/23694606727057-Costs-on-Digistore24-Inc-US"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Reseller entities support digital and some physical products, services and events; a public product-count cap is not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.digistore24.com/hc/en-us/articles/23314370906897-Digistore24-reseller-overview"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Digistore24 resells eligible transactions and remits buyer VAT; seller tax duties still depend on business location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.digistore24.com/hc/en-us/articles/23522840526481-Distribution-of-gross-revenue"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.digistore24.com/pricing/", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.digistore24.com/hc/en-us/articles/23694606727057-Costs-on-Digistore24-Inc-US", "label": "US fee schedule"}, {"url": "https://help.digistore24.com/hc/en-us/articles/23314370906897-Digistore24-reseller-overview", "label": "Reseller regions"}, {"url": "https://help.digistore24.com/hc/en-us/articles/23522840526481-Distribution-of-gross-revenue", "label": "Revenue and VAT"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The pricing page advertises a 2.9% + $1 starting rate and says the final rate varies by product, traffic and sales volume. The US Inc. guide lists 7.9% + $1, rising to 9.9% above 1% chargebacks.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":24,"card":{"tag": "Affiliate-ready checkout", "note": "Digistore24 resells your product and pays buyer VAT.", "take": {"extra": "+ $1", "label": "Starting rate", "value": "2.9%", "percent": 2.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "High chargebacks", "value": "9.9% + $1", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "VAT", "value": "Digistore24 pays it", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Digistore24", "groups": [{"label": "Digistore24", "rates": [{"note": "Varies by product and traffic", "extra": "+ $1", "label": "Starting rate", "value": "2.9%", "percent": 2.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ $1", "label": "US company", "value": "7.9%", "percent": 7.9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"extra": "+ $1", "label": "US, over 1% chargebacks", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ $1", "label": "US company", "value": "7.9%", "percent": 7.9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--eduzz","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Eduzz","summary":"Sell courses and digital products in the Brazilian market.","website_url":"https://www.eduzz.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-eduzz-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No subscription or setup fee; sales, transfers and optional advances can incur charges.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.eduzz.com/taxas"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct sale: Basic 4.9%, Intermediate 6.9%, Unity 4.59% above R$1M/year; fixed fee R$2.49. Affiliate 8.9% + R$2.49; international 10.9% + R$3.99. The 4.9% commission is waived per item with original price up to R$30; R$2.49 per invoice remains. Help and plan pricing cover different plans; confirm selected plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/1260807397109-Quais-s%C3%A3o-as-taxas-cobradas-pela-Eduzz"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Official pricing does not list a separate processor rate. Official pages conflict on bank transfer charges: R$1.99 on pricing and R$9 in Help.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/1260807406729-Como-solicitar-transfer%C3%AAncia-banc%C3%A1ria"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic: 1 school/2GB; Intermediate: 3/250GB; Unity: unlimited schools/1TB.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.eduzz.com/taxas"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Producer handles taxes and invoices; Eduzz provides fiscal records in the dashboard.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/4402651955739-Como-funciona-a-Central-de-Documentos-Fiscais"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.eduzz.com/taxas", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/1260807397109-Quais-s%C3%A3o-as-taxas-cobradas-pela-Eduzz", "label": "Fee details"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/7333163583643-Quais-as-formas-de-pagamento-aceitas-pela-Eduzz", "label": "Payment methods"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/4402651955739-Como-funciona-a-Central-de-Documentos-Fiscais", "label": "Tax and invoices"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.eduzz.com/hc/pt-br/articles/1260807406729-Como-solicitar-transfer%C3%AAncia-banc%C3%A1ria", "label": "Transfers and payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Brazilian seller, BRL. Sale rates depend on plan, channel and ticket. Official pages conflict on transfer fee (R$1.99 pricing table vs R$9 Help article).","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":20,"card":{"tag": "Course checkout, Brazil", "note": "Eduzz pages give two different bank transfer fees.", "take": {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Basic, direct", "value": "4.9%", "percent": 4.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Transfer fee", "value": "R$1.99 or R$9", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Schools", "value": "1 on Basic", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Eduzz", "groups": [{"label": "Direct sales", "rates": [{"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Basic, direct", "value": "4.9%", "percent": 4.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Intermediate", "value": "6.9%", "percent": 6.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Unity, over R$1M a year", "value": "4.59%", "percent": 4.59, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Items up to R$30", "value": "0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Other sales", "rates": [{"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Affiliate sales", "value": "8.9%", "percent": 8.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ R$3.99", "label": "International", "value": "10.9%", "percent": 10.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ R$3.99", "label": "International", "value": "10.9%", "percent": 10.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--ezycourse","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"EzyCourse","summary":"Host courses, communities and coaching in one platform.","website_url":"https://ezycourse.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/ezycourse-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Essential is $97/month or $59/month billed annually ($708/year); 14-day free trial.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ezycourse.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% on direct sales; the Marketplace add-on charges its host 3.5% per marketplace sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ezycourse.com/article/creators-marketplace"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Gateway fees vary. EzyCourse Payments fees are set by EzyCourse and may change; third-party gateways set their own rates.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ezycourse.com/terms-use"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Essential includes unlimited courses, 2 communities, 1 coaching program and 5 digital products.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ezycourse.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe Tax can be enabled for every product type; the seller configures it in Stripe and EzyCourse.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ezycourse.com/article/stripe-tax-all-products"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ezycourse.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://ezycourse.com/terms-use", "label": "Gateway fees"}, {"url": "https://help.ezycourse.com/article/creators-marketplace", "label": "Marketplace fee"}, {"url": "https://help.ezycourse.com/article/stripe-tax-all-products", "label": "Stripe Tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Essential is $97 monthly or $59/month billed annually ($708/year), with a 14-day trial. Direct sales and marketplace sales have different platform fees.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Direct course sales; separate 3.5% fee for marketplace hosts","sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Courses and communities", "note": "Stripe Tax can be turned on for any product.", "take": {"label": "Direct sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Essential", "value": "$97 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Your gateway", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Courses", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "EzyCourse", "groups": [{"label": "EzyCourse", "rates": [{"label": "Direct sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Paid by the marketplace host", "label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--freshlearn","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"FreshLearn","summary":"Sell courses, communities and training from a hosted academy.","website_url":"https://freshlearn.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/freshlearn-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Start Free $0. Pro $49/month or $849 upfront every two years ($35/month equivalent); No Brainer $79/month or $1,199 upfront every two years ($49/month equivalent); No Brainer+ $149/month or $2,399 upfront every two years ($99/month equivalent); Enterprise by quote.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freshlearn.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% platform transaction fee on every plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freshlearn.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe, Razorpay and PayPal are supported; processor rates vary by method and country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freshlearn.com/features/payments"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited students; Free includes 1 product, 25 manual enrollments, and 5 sales pages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freshlearn.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "GST/VAT/sales-tax calculation is supported; Stripe auto-tax is listed only on No Brainer+.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freshlearn.com/features/payments"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://freshlearn.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://freshlearn.com/features/payments", "label": "Gateways and tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Pro is $49 monthly or $35/month equivalent on a two-year term billed $849 upfront; processor fees are extra.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Platform transaction fee; processor fees extra","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Course platform", "note": "Payment provider fees apply. Stripe auto-tax is on the top plan only.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "Free to $149 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Free plan", "value": "1 product", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Students", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "FreshLearn", "groups": [{"label": "Platform", "rates": [{"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--graphy","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Graphy","summary":"Host and sell courses, live classes, and digital products.","website_url":"https://graphy.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/graphy-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Current page: US Launch $49/month; India Launch ₹1,999/month billed yearly. A March 2025 India Help article also lists a ₹19,999 onboarding fee, absent from current pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://graphy.com/us/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "US plans list 0% platform fee. India Launch is 10% and Rise 5% per sale, or ₹10 minimum; GST is extra.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://graphy.com/us/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "India Graphy gateway is 1.8% + GST; UPI AutoPay adds ₹4. External gateway rates vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000151347/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited products and learners; contacts, admin seats and live-class minutes vary by plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://graphy.com/us/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Seller configures tax; Stripe can automate collection where available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000131919-how-to-configure-tax-details-within-the-graphy-platform-"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://graphy.com/us/pricing/", "label": "Prices and fees"}, {"url": "https://us.help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000131262-how-does-the-revenue-share-pricing-model-work-on-graphy-", "label": "India fees, 2025"}, {"url": "https://help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000151347/", "label": "India gateway charges"}, {"url": "https://help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000131919-how-to-configure-tax-details-within-the-graphy-platform-", "label": "Tax settings"}, {"url": "https://us.help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000119083-how-to-automate-tax-collection-on-graphy-using-stripe-", "label": "Stripe tax"}, {"url": "https://us.help.graphy.com/support/solutions/articles/1060000131283-how-to-setup-your-payment-gateway-on-graphy-", "label": "Regional gateways"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US plans are $49–$399/month with 0% platform fee. India plans are billed yearly: Launch ₹1,999/month at 10%, Rise ₹9,999/month at 5%; each sale has a ₹10 minimum plus GST. An older India Help article lists an onboarding fee omitted from current pricing.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":26,"card":{"tag": "Course platform", "note": "A 2025 India help page lists a ₹19,999 onboarding fee that current pricing does not show.", "take": {"label": "US plans", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "US plan", "value": "$49 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "India gateway", "value": "1.8% + GST", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Learners", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Graphy", "groups": [{"label": "US", "rates": [{"label": "US plans", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "India, plus GST", "rates": [{"note": "Or ₹10 minimum", "label": "India, Launch", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Or ₹10 minimum", "label": "India, Rise", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "India, Launch", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--heights-platform","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Heights Platform","summary":"Sell courses, challenges and digital products from your own site.","website_url":"https://www.heightsplatform.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-heightsplatform-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly/annual equivalent: Challenge $29/$19, Basic $49/$39, Pro $119/$99, Academy $499/$399; annual plans save 20%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.heightsplatform.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% platform transaction fee on every plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.heightsplatform.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe U.S. domestic cards: 2.9% + $0.30; international cards add 1.5%, conversion adds 1%. PayPal rates vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Challenge includes 1 course and 100 active students; Basic has unlimited courses and 5,000 active students. Higher tiers raise included active users.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.heightsplatform.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Heights is not a merchant of record; sellers handle tax compliance, and unsupported tax needs require an external checkout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.heightsplatform.com/terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.heightsplatform.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and limits"}, {"url": "https://support.heightsplatform.com/article/24-payment-settings/", "label": "Gateways and tax"}, {"url": "https://stripe.com/pricing", "label": "Stripe card rates"}, {"url": "https://www.heightsplatform.com/terms", "label": "Seller responsibilities"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Prices are monthly or annual equivalents; annual plans save 20%. Stripe rate shown is for U.S. domestic cards; international card and currency-conversion fees may apply.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Heights Platform transaction fee; processor charges extra","sort_order":15,"card":{"tag": "Course platform", "note": "Heights is not a merchant of record, so you handle tax.", "take": {"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$29 to $499 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Courses", "value": "Unlimited on Basic", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Heights", "groups": [{"label": "Platform", "rates": [{"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--hotmart","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Hotmart","summary":"Sell digital products with integrated checkout and affiliates.","website_url":"https://hotmart.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/hotmart-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No signup or monthly fee; product listings are free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://hotmart.com/en/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Same-currency rates vary by currency and ticket: USD/EUR/GBP over 15 use 9.9% + 1 unit; up to 15 use 9.9% + 0.10 unit. BRL over R$10 is 9.9% + R$2.49; up to R$10 is 20% with no fixed fee. Cross-currency conversion can change the charge.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/208298448/quais-sao-as-taxas-cobradas-pela-hotmart"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Hotmart Player is included in the fixed transaction fee from September 21, 2026; optional advances have a separate fee shown at selection.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/208298448/quais-sao-as-taxas-cobradas-pela-hotmart"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited product listings; supports courses, ebooks, subscriptions, events and more.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/215828518/como-cadastrar-meu-produto-na-hotmart"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Tax duties depend on creator, buyer and product location; Hotmart handles some buyer-region taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/20420081457549/vendas-globais-tudo-o-que-devo-saber-sobre-as-atualizaces-do-modelo-de-negocio-da-hotmart"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://hotmart.com/en/pricing", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/208298448/quais-sao-as-taxas-cobradas-pela-hotmart", "label": "Fee table"}, {"url": "https://hotmart.com/en/legal/payments-policy", "label": "Payment policy"}, {"url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/215828518/como-cadastrar-meu-produto-na-hotmart", "label": "Product formats"}, {"url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/360051146712/what-taxes-can-be-applied-to-a-purchase", "label": "Buyer tax"}, {"url": "https://help.hotmart.com/en/article/20420081457549/vendas-globais-tudo-o-que-devo-saber-sobre-as-atualizaces-do-modelo-de-negocio-da-hotmart", "label": "Creator tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Same-currency examples; fee changes with transaction currency and ticket. For cross-currency purchases, the final amount is converted to the buyer currency and may include third-party conversion costs.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":18,"card":{"tag": "Digital product checkout", "note": "Converting between currencies can change the fee.", "take": {"extra": "+ $1", "label": "Sales over $15", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Products", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Video player", "value": "Included", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Hotmart", "groups": [{"label": "USD, EUR, GBP", "rates": [{"extra": "+ $1", "label": "Sales over $15", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ 10¢", "label": "Sales up to $15", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Brazil", "rates": [{"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Over R$10", "value": "9.9%", "percent": 9.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Brazil, up to R$10", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Brazil, up to R$10", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--kajabi","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Kajabi","summary":"Sell courses, communities, and coaching from one site.","website_url":"https://kajabi.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kajabi-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic $179/mo ($143/mo annual); Growth $249 ($199 annual); Pro $499 ($399 annual).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% revenue share; third-party provider fee: 2% Basic, 1% Growth, 0.5% Pro where Kajabi Payments is available; PayPal excluded.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "US cards via Kajabi Payments: 2.9% + $0.30 Basic; 2.8% Growth; 2.7% Pro. Rates vary by country and method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic 5 products/2,500 contacts/1 community; Growth 50/25,000/1; Pro unlimited/100,000/3.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "With Kajabi Payments, Kajabi calculates/collects tax; the seller registers and files/remits. Current guide confirms a fee on successful Sales Tax-enabled offers but gives no amount; the Jan 2024 post lists $0.15 per taxable sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.kajabi.com/articles/sales/kajabi-payments/kajabi-payments-sales-tax-overview"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.kajabi.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and payment rates"}, {"url": "https://help.kajabi.com/articles/sales/kajabi-payments/kajabi-payments-sales-tax-overview", "label": "Sales tax fee"}, {"url": "https://payments.mykajabi.com/the-payments-pulse-jan-2024", "label": "Sales tax fee, 2024"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US sellers, USD. Current tax guide confirms a Sales Tax-enabled transaction fee but gives no amount; the 2024 launch post lists $0.15 per taxable sale.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"No revenue share; US third-party provider fees may apply on supported regions and plans.","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Courses and communities", "note": "Kajabi calculates and collects sales tax. You register, file, and pay it.", "take": {"label": "Kajabi Payments", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Basic", "value": "$179 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ in US", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Product limit", "value": "5 on Basic", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Kajabi", "groups": [{"label": "Kajabi Payments", "rates": [{"note": "No revenue share", "label": "Kajabi Payments", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Other payment providers", "rates": [{"label": "Other provider, Basic", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Growth", "value": "1%", "percent": 1, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pro", "value": "0.5%", "percent": 0.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Other provider, Basic", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--kartra","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Kartra","summary":"Courses, checkout and marketing in one hosted platform.","website_url":"https://kartra.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kartra-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Essentials is $59/month or $52/month billed annually; 30-day trial.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kartra.com/kartra-trial/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Essentials: 5% of monthly net sales and rebills; other paid plans: 0%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.kartra.com/en/articles/15368884-essentials-plan-transaction-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Connect an external processor such as Stripe; processor fees vary by provider, country and method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.kartra.com/en/articles/15368930-payments-stripe"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Essentials includes 500 contacts, 1 product and 1 course or membership; higher plans raise limits.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kartra.com/kartra-trial/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Tax rates are set by region; the seller is responsible for collection and remittance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.kartra.com/en/articles/15368566-charge-or-remove-sales-tax"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://kartra.com/kartra-trial/", "label": "Plans and limits"}, {"url": "https://support.kartra.com/en/articles/15368884-essentials-plan-transaction-fees", "label": "Essentials fee"}, {"url": "https://support.kartra.com/en/articles/15368930-payments-stripe", "label": "Stripe setup"}, {"url": "https://support.kartra.com/en/articles/15368566-charge-or-remove-sales-tax", "label": "Tax rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Essentials is $59 monthly or $52/month billed annually. The 5% fee is calculated monthly after refunds, chargebacks and partial refunds; processor fees are separate.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"Essentials net sales and rebills after refunds and chargebacks","sort_order":17,"card":{"tag": "Courses and marketing", "note": "You set tax rates and handle collection and payment.", "take": {"label": "Essentials plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Essentials", "value": "$59 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Your processor", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Course limit", "value": "1 on Essentials", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Kartra", "groups": [{"label": "Kartra", "rates": [{"note": "Of net sales after refunds", "label": "Essentials plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Other paid plans", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Other paid plans", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--kiwify","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Kiwify","summary":"Sell courses with checkout and video hosting.","website_url":"https://kiwify.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kiwify-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No signup or monthly fee; member area and video hosting are free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/quais-sao-as-taxas-da-plataforma-1ems3wq/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "8.99% + R$2.49 per approved sale; rate renegotiation is available above R$50,000 monthly sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/quais-sao-as-taxas-da-plataforma-1ems3wq/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Kiwify processes payments; each withdrawal request costs R$3.67, including failed requests.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/perguntas-frequentes-165uytc/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital products only; free member area includes video upload and streaming.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/perguntas-frequentes-165uytc/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller invoices buyers; Kiwify invoices its own platform and payment-intermediation fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/a-kiwify-emite-nota-fiscal-sobre-as-taxas-da-plataforma-1s1hyfl/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/quais-sao-as-taxas-da-plataforma-1ems3wq/", "label": "Fees"}, {"url": "https://kiwify.com.br/", "label": "Product and payment features"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/a-kiwify-emite-nota-fiscal-sobre-as-taxas-da-plataforma-1s1hyfl/", "label": "Invoice duties"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/perguntas-frequentes-165uytc/", "label": "Delivery FAQ"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/qual-valor-devo-emitir-na-nota-fiscal-para-o-meu-comprador-vjs931/", "label": "Buyer invoices"}, {"url": "https://ajuda.kiwify.com.br/pt-br/article/como-cadastrar-o-seu-produto-1lxh5g7/", "label": "Product setup"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Brazilian seller, BRL. Standard fee applies to approved sales; Pix/TED withdrawals and boleto refunds have a separate request fee.","fee_percent":8.99,"fee_basis":"Standard Kiwify fee per approved sale in BRL.","sort_order":19,"card":{"tag": "Course checkout, Brazil", "note": "Kiwify sells digital products only.", "take": {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Per sale", "value": "8.99%", "percent": 8.99, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Withdrawal", "value": "R$3.67 each", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Video hosting", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Kiwify", "groups": [{"label": "Kiwify", "rates": [{"note": "Lower above R$50,000 a month", "extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Per sale", "value": "8.99%", "percent": 8.99, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--learndash","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"LearnDash","summary":"Sell courses using a WordPress LMS.","website_url":"https://www.learndash.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-learndash-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Essentials $259/year; Pro $399/year; Elite $599/year. WordPress hosting is separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.learndash.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% platform revenue share; course payments go through your chosen gateway.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.learndash.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "The current pricing page lists Stripe and PayPal integrations; provider fees vary by payment method and country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.learndash.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited courses and learners; no per-student fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.learndash.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public LearnDash payment docs do not state who calculates, collects, or remits tax for course sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learndash.com/support/kb/core/uncategorized/payments/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://learndash.com/support/kb/core/uncategorized/payments/", "label": "Payment options"}, {"url": "https://learndash.com/support/kb/core/uncategorized/stripe-connect/", "label": "Stripe setup"}, {"url": "https://learndash.com/support/kb/core/courses/course-enrollment-mode/", "label": "External checkout"}, {"url": "https://www.learndash.com/pricing/", "label": "Pricing and integrations"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD. Current plugin plans require a WordPress site; hosting and payment-provider charges are separate. Public LearnDash payment docs state no policy assigning tax calculation, collection, or remittance.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"LearnDash platform revenue share; external gateway fees are separate.","sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "WordPress course plugin", "note": "LearnDash is a WordPress plugin. Payment provider fees apply.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "License", "value": "$259 a year", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Courses", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Hosting", "value": "Separate", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "LearnDash", "groups": [{"label": "Platform", "rates": [{"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--learnpress","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"LearnPress","summary":"Sell courses from your own WordPress site.","website_url":"https://thimpress.com/learnpress/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/thimpress-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free core; Pro bundle $299 lifetime/one site; 12 months updates; $209.30/year optional renewal. Add-ons from $19.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learnpresslms.com/pricing-plan/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% platform transaction fee; course sales use your own WordPress checkout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learnpresslms.com/blog/online-course-platform-comparison/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal included; Stripe add-on $39; WooCommerce add-on $49; processor rates vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learnpresslms.com/pricing-plan/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Free core supports unlimited courses and students; hosting is separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learnpresslms.com/blog/online-course-platform-comparison/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "No central LearnPress tax policy found; tax handling depends on your checkout provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://learnpresslms.com/docs/woocommerce-add-on-for-learnpress/setting/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://learnpresslms.com/prici