 Trainer and above: 0%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.learnworlds.com/product/features/checkout-and-payments/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe, PayPal, or Shopify; processor fees are separate and vary by provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.learnworlds.com/support/solutions/articles/12000027007-payment-gateways"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter: 1,000 active learners/month and 1 admin.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.learnworlds.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe Tax or Quaderno can calculate and collect checkout tax; seller handles tax obligations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.learnworlds.com/support/solutions/articles/12000081519-general-overview-taxes-and-vat-in-your-sales"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.learnworlds.com/pricing/", "label": "Plans and limits"}, {"url": "https://www.learnworlds.com/product/features/checkout-and-payments/", "label": "Fees and processors"}, {"url": "https://support.learnworlds.com/support/solutions/articles/12000027007-payment-gateways", "label": "Checkout providers"}, {"url": "https://support.learnworlds.com/support/solutions/articles/12000081519-general-overview-taxes-and-vat-in-your-sales", "label": "Tax options"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US sellers; USD; current public plans, enrollment fees, payment options, and tax handling checked on 2026-09-29.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Course platform", "note": "You handle sales tax. Stripe Tax or Quaderno can help.", "take": {"label": "Per enrollment, Starter", "value": "$5", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Starter", "value": "$29 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Your provider", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Learner limit", "value": "1,000 a month", "fact_k