6-09-30","comparison_basis":"Brazilian seller, BRL. Current fee guide states 6.99% + R$2.49; legal terms still state a 9.9% initial rate. Turbo may waive the 6.99% for approved sales up to R$50.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":23,"card":{"tag": "Course checkout, Brazil", "note": "Ticto’s fee guide and legal terms give different rates. Turbo can waive the fee on small sales.", "take": {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Fee guide", "value": "6.99%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Member area", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Tax", "value": "You handle it", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Ticto", "groups": [{"label": "Ticto", "rates": [{"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Fee guide", "value": "6.99%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Legal terms", "value": "9.9%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ R$2.49", "label": "Legal terms", "value": "9.9%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--tutor-lms","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Tutor LMS","summary":"Build and sell WordPress courses with a free core and paid licenses.","website_url":"https://tutorlms.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/tutorlms-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free core. Annual Pro: $199/1 site, $399/10, $799/unlimited. Lifetime: $499/$999/$1,999.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://tutorlms.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No percentage cut; annual or lifetime license pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://tutorlms.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe, PayPal, Paddle, Razorpay, Mollie, and more; processor rates vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://tutorlms.com/ecommerce/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited courses, learners, and instructors; paid licenses limit sites.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://tutorlms.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Native eCommerce supports regional and custom tax rates.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://tutorlms.com/ecommerce/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://tutorlms.com/pricing/", "label": "Prices and licenses"}, {"url": "https://tutorlms.com/ecommerce/", "label": "Gateways and tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD, annual Individual license starts at one WordPress site; lifetime and multi-site tiers cost more. Hosting and payment gateway charges are separate.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Tutor LMS course revenue","sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "WordPress course plugin", "note": "Tutor LMS charges for licenses, not sales.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Core", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Pro", "value": "$199 a year", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Lifetime", "value": "From $499", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Tutor LMS", "groups": [{"label": "Platform", "rates": [{"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--uteach","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Uteach","summary":"Build a branded course academy for creators or team training.","website_url":"https://uteach.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/uteach-io.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Paid pricing is custom-quoted; no public plan rate is listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uteach.io/faq"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Uteach keeps no transaction fee on course sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uteach.io/support/payments-and-sales/how-fast-i-get-paid"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Payment gateways include Stripe, PayPal, Paystack and Razorpay; processor rates vary by provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uteach.io/integrations"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Quotes depend on Academy or Team Training use and learner tier: 1–300, 300–1,000 or 1,000+.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uteach.io/faq"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "No native tax-rate field; prices are tax-inclusive, with Quaderno or external tax tools suggested.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uteach.io/support/payments-and-sales/charge-tax"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://uteach.io/faq", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://uteach.io/course-creation-platform?plan_id=377", "label": "Revenue and gateways"}, {"url": "https://uteach.io/integrations", "label": "Payment gateways"}, {"url": "https://uteach.io/support/payments-and-sales/charge-tax", "label": "Tax settings"}, {"url": "https://uteach.io/support/payments-and-sales/how-fast-i-get-paid", "label": "Payouts and fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Uteach states it keeps no transaction fee on course sales. Connected payment gateways charge their own processing rates. Academy and Team Training prices require a custom quote by learner count.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Course platform", "note": "Uteach quotes each customer. Prices include tax.", "take": {"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pricing", "value": "Custom quote", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Gateways", "value": "Stripe, PayPal, more", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Tax", "value": "External tools", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Uteach", "groups": [{"label": "Platform", "rates": [{"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms--zenler","section_id":"course-stores-and-teaching-platforms","name":"Zenler","summary":"Host courses, coaching and memberships.","website_url":"https://www.newzenler.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-newzenler-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter is $57/month or $47/month billed annually ($564/year); 30-day trial.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zenler.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% transaction fee on every plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zenler.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Connect Stripe or PayPal; payment-processing rates are set by the provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.zenler.com/en/articles/3806416-stripe-integration"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter: 5 courses, 1 community and 500 people; Pro and Premium: unlimited courses and people.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zenler.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Global tax rates are manual; Zenler can collect, report, and remit EU VAT when enabled. PayPal cannot use this option.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.zenler.com/en/articles/5821328-tax"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.zenler.com/pricing", "label": "Prices and limits"}, {"url": "https://support.zenler.com/en/articles/3806416-stripe-integration", "label": "Stripe setup"}, {"url": "https://support.zenler.com/en/articles/5520000-paypal-integration", "label": "PayPal and EU VAT"}, {"url": "https://support.zenler.com/en/articles/5821328-tax", "label": "Tax rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Starter monthly and annual billing are shown; annual billing is $564 upfront. The 30-day trial and external payment-processing fees are separate.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Zenler platform transaction fee; processor fees extra","sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Courses and coaching", "note": "Zenler can collect and pay EU VAT for you, but not with PayPal.", "take": {"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Starter", "value": "$57 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Stripe or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Starter limit", "value": "5 courses", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Zenler", "groups": [{"label": "Platform", "rates": [{"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace--domestika","section_id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","name":"Domestika","summary":"Propose a creative course; Domestika selects and produces approved courses.","website_url":"https://www.domestika.org/en/teach","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-domestika-org.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Creative courses; proposals are selected by Domestika.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.domestika.org/hc/en-us/articles/360003374577-Who-can-publish-a-course-on-Domestika"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Instructor revenue share is not listed publicly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.domestika.org/en/teachers"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Domestika covers production costs for approved courses.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.domestika.org/hc/en-us/articles/360003373718-Does-it-cost-to-teach-a-course-in-Domestika"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Instructor course-price control is not listed publicly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.domestika.org/en/teachers"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Proposals are reviewed; public payment terms are not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.domestika.org/hc/en-us/articles/360003412457-What-do-I-have-to-do-to-teach-a-course"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.domestika.org/en/teachers", "label": "Teacher program"}, {"url": "https://support.domestika.org/hc/en-us/articles/360003373718-Does-it-cost-to-teach-a-course-in-Domestika", "label": "Production costs"}, {"url": "https://support.domestika.org/hc/en-us/articles/360003374577-Who-can-publish-a-course-on-Domestika", "label": "Eligibility"}, {"url": "https://support.domestika.org/hc/en-us/articles/360003412457-What-do-I-have-to-do-to-teach-a-course", "label": "Proposal review"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Domestika accepts proposals from creative professionals and reviews them for fit and quality. It covers production costs after approving a course. Public sources do not state a standard revenue share, instructor price control, or payment schedule; selected instructors receive individual terms.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Creative courses", "note": "Domestika picks and produces courses. Pay terms are in each agreement.", "take": {"label": "Instructor share", "value": "Share not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Production", "value": "Paid by Domestika", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Proposal review", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Domestika", "groups": []}}, {"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace--insight-timer-courses","section_id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","name":"Insight Timer courses","summary":"Courses earn from MemberPlus listener activity.","website_url":"https://insighttimer.com/teacher","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/insighttimer-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "MemberPlus course plays", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664708-instructions-and-requirements-for-audio-courses"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Variable by plays, content type, and engagement; high return-rate scores can earn a bonus.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664874-how-can-teachers-earn-revenue-from-their-work-"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free teacher account", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664779-how-do-i-become-a-teacher-on-insight-timer-"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Learner FAQ says courses aren't sold individually; teacher edit guide says course pricing is editable.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664582-how-do-i-purchase-a-course-on-insight-timer-"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "2 free tracks rated 4.5+; profile review", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664708-instructions-and-requirements-for-audio-courses"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664708-instructions-and-requirements-for-audio-courses", "label": "Course earnings"}, {"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664874-how-can-teachers-earn-revenue-from-their-work-", "label": "Revenue terms"}, {"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664779-how-do-i-become-a-teacher-on-insight-timer-", "label": "Signup and review"}, {"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664582-how-do-i-purchase-a-course-on-insight-timer-", "label": "Learner FAQ"}, {"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000719010-can-i-edit-an-already-published-premium-audio-course-", "label": "Edit guide"}, {"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000664731-why-should-i-join-as-a-teacher-", "label": "Costs and exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://help.insighttimer.com/support/solutions/articles/67000717431-how-will-my-teacher-receive-my-donation-in-full-", "label": "Donation payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Course earnings vary by plays, content type, and engagement; a return-rate bonus is possible. Pricing docs conflict: the learner FAQ says courses aren't sold individually, while the teacher edit guide says course pricing is editable. Optional donations are separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Meditation courses", "note": "Earnings depend on plays and engagement. High return rates can add a bonus.", "take": {"label": "Engagement affects pay", "value": "Paid by plays", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "2 free tracks rated 4.5+", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Paid by", "value": "MemberPlus plays", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Insight Timer", "groups": []}}, {"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace--maven","section_id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","name":"Maven","summary":"Live cohorts taught by subject experts.","website_url":"https://maven.com/teach","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/maven-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid cohort, workshop, and self-paced course enrollments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/5593804-getting-paid"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Maven takes 10%; instructor keeps 90% before Stripe fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/5593804-getting-paid"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free until a student enrolls.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/5593804-getting-paid"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Set your price; Maven’s minimum is $200.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/6732396-pricing-your-course-workshop-or-self-paced-offering"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe required; course listing needs 100 leads or 2 sales plus quality review. Workshops are reviewed after publishing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/6333164-getting-your-course-or-workshop-listed-on-maven-s-discovery-site"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/5593804-getting-paid", "label": "Fees and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/6732396-pricing-your-course-workshop-or-self-paced-offering", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/6333164-getting-your-course-or-workshop-listed-on-maven-s-discovery-site", "label": "Listing review"}, {"url": "https://help.maven.com/en/articles/12240853-maven-expert-policy-guidebook", "label": "Instructor policy"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Maven takes 10% of each paid enrollment; instructors keep 90% before Stripe processing. US card processing starts at 2.9% + $0.30 and varies by payment method and location. Maven is free until a student pays. Paid offerings have a $200 minimum, and discovery-site listings are reviewed.","fee_percent":10,"fee_basis":"Paid enrollment price before Stripe processing fees","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Live cohort courses", "note": "A catalog listing needs 100 leads or 2 sales, plus a quality review.", "take": {"label": "Enrollments", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free until a sale", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Lowest price", "value": "$200", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Stripe, extra", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Maven", "groups": [{"label": "Maven", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 90% before Stripe fees", "label": "Enrollments", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace--outschool","section_id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","name":"Outschool","summary":"Live and recorded classes for children.","website_url":"https://teach.outschool.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/teach-outschool-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-enrollment revenue share", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/2382129-teacher-earnings-and-payments-policy"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "70% of class price", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/2382129-teacher-earnings-and-payments-policy"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No added teaching costs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/16057-prospective-educator-faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Teacher sets class price", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/14171122-outschool-payment-options-faqs-for-teachers"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "18+; eligible countries only", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/1638033-becoming-an-educator-on-outschool"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/2382129-teacher-earnings-and-payments-policy", "label": "Earnings policy"}, {"url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/14171122-outschool-payment-options-faqs-for-teachers", "label": "Pricing rules"}, {"url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/16057-prospective-educator-faq", "label": "Educator FAQ"}, {"url": "https://support.outschool.com/en/articles/1638033-becoming-an-educator-on-outschool", "label": "Eligibility"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Teacher gets 70% of Class Price; parent Marketplace Fee is separate. Payouts are USD via PayPal.","fee_percent":30,"fee_basis":"Class Price, excluding the parent Marketplace Fee","sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Classes for children", "note": "Only teachers 18 or older in eligible countries can join.", "take": {"label": "Class price", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Teachers", "value": "18+, some countries", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Outschool", "groups": [{"label": "Outschool", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Class price", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace--skillshare","section_id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","name":"Skillshare","summary":"Earn through class royalties, referrals, and paid 1-on-1 sessions.","website_url":"https://www.skillshare.com/en/teach","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-skillshare-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Class royalties require 50 followers and >400 paid-member minutes after a quality class in the past 18 months, or >650 minutes without one.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/4415798406285-Earn-From-Your-Teaching"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Teacher referrals pay 60% of a first-time member’s first-year payments after taxes or fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/21341949186061-Optimize-Teacher-Referrals"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No cost to publish a class.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.skillshare.com/en/teach"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Classes use subscriptions; tutors set 1-on-1 prices.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/22969272481805-How-1-on-1-Sessions-Work"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "1-on-1 sessions have a 10% platform fee plus payment processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/22969272481805-How-1-on-1-Sessions-Work"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/4415798406285-Earn-From-Your-Teaching", "label": "Teacher earnings"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/21341949186061-Optimize-Teacher-Referrals", "label": "Referral terms"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/46487542333837-Update-to-Skillshare-Teacher-Earnings", "label": "Royalty eligibility"}, {"url": "https://www.skillshare.com/en/teach", "label": "Free publishing"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/22969272481805-How-1-on-1-Sessions-Work", "label": "1-on-1 fee"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/15866985016845-How-do-I-apply-to-teach-a-class-on-Skillshare", "label": "Teacher application"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Class royalties come from a variable Teacher Fund. Eligibility requires 50 followers and more than 400 paid-member minutes after a quality class in the past 18 months, or more than 650 minutes otherwise. Referrals pay 60% of a new member’s first-year payments after taxes or fees. Teachers pay no class publishing fee; 1-on-1 sessions carry a 10% platform fee plus processing. New onboarding is paused in several categories.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Class subscriptions", "note": "Class royalties also need over 400 paid minutes watched.", "take": {"label": "Class royalties", "value": "Paid by watch time", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Royalties need", "value": "50 followers", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Referrals", "value": "60% of year one", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Skillshare", "groups": [{"label": "Skillshare", "rates": [{"note": "Paid by minutes watched", "label": "Class royalties", "value": "Paid by watch time", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Plus payment processing", "label": "1-on-1 sessions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"note": "You keep 60%", "label": "Referrals, year one", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "1-on-1 sessions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-5"}}}, {"id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace--udemy","section_id":"courses-and-workshops-with-a-marketplace","name":"Udemy","summary":"Sell courses through one-time purchases and selected subscription libraries.","website_url":"https://www.udemy.com/teaching/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-udemy-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Course sales plus Udemy Business, Personal Plan, and Starter subscription pools and eligible ad pools.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/115013221767-How-do-I-Earn-Revenue-From-Udemy-Business-and-Subscription-Plans"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Transactional: 37% marketplace, 97% instructor link. Udemy Business allocates 15% of monthly subscription revenue to its pool. Personal Plan and Starter subscription earnings use learner engagement; no fixed pool share is published. Starter ads allocate 25% of eligible net ad revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229605008-Instructor-revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No fee to create or host a course.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229605008-Instructor-revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Set a price tier; Udemy Deals may discount it.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229605668-Instructors-How-to-Set-The-Price-of-Your-Course"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid courses require Premium Instructor status and pass course review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229604948-How-to-become-a-Premium-Instructor"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229605008-Instructor-revenue-share", "label": "Instructor share"}, {"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/115013221767-How-do-I-Earn-Revenue-From-Udemy-Business-and-Subscription-Plans", "label": "Subscription pools"}, {"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229605668-Instructors-How-to-Set-The-Price-of-Your-Course", "label": "Price controls"}, {"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229232827-Instructor-Promotional-Agreements-and-Udemy-Deals-and-the-Udemy-Subscriptions-Program", "label": "Deals and exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229232927-Course-material-and-price-Rules-and-guidelines", "label": "Course review"}, {"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229604268-Submit-a-Course-for-Review", "label": "Premium Instructor"}, {"url": "https://support.udemy.com/hc/en-us/articles/229604948-How-to-become-a-Premium-Instructor", "label": "Eligibility"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Transactional shares apply to net sales after applicable taxes and fees. Udemy Business allocates 15% of monthly subscription revenue to its pool; Personal Plan and Starter subscriptions pay by learner engagement with no fixed share published. Eligible Starter ads allocate 25% of net ad revenue.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Course marketplace", "note": "Udemy Deals can discount your price. Paid courses need review.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace sale", "value": "63%", "percent": 63, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Price", "value": "Set tier", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Premium Instructor", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Udemy", "groups": [{"label": "Course sales", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 37%", "label": "Marketplace sale", "value": "63%", "percent": 63, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 97%", "label": "Your coupon link", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Subscriptions and ads", "rates": [{"note": "15% of revenue goes to instructors", "label": "Udemy Business", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "25% of ad revenue goes to instructors", "label": "Starter plan ads", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Paid by engagement", "label": "Personal Plan", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Paid by engagement", "label": "Starter subscription", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Your coupon link", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--amazon-merch-on-demand","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Amazon Merch on Demand","summary":"Earn product-specific royalties on branded merchandise sold through Amazon.","website_url":"https://merch.amazon.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/merch-amazon-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Sell branded merchandise through Amazon product pages", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games/merch"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free account; no out-of-pocket cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games/merch"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Royalty is offer price less applicable tax and Amazon costs; the linked product-level schedule requires access.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games/merch"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Amazon provides product pages, worldwide shipping and customer service", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games/merch"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "The linked official royalties resource exposes no public product-rate table.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://merch.amazon.com/resource/201858580"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://merch.amazon.com/", "label": "Program"}, {"url": "https://merch.amazon.com/resource/201858630", "label": "Royalty info"}, {"url": "https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games/merch", "label": "Account and royalties"}, {"url": "https://merch.amazon.com/resource/201858580", "label": "Royalty resource"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Amazon says royalty is the product offer price less applicable tax and Amazon costs; the exact product-level schedule is linked from the Developer page but requires account access. The accessible page confirms a free account, Amazon product pages, worldwide shipping and customer service.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Merch on Amazon", "note": "Amazon’s product royalty table needs an account to view.", "take": {"label": "Royalty after tax and product cost", "value": "Price minus costs", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Shipping", "value": "Amazon handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Royalty", "value": "Price minus costs", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Amazon", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--bonfire","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Bonfire","summary":"Free merchandise campaigns with optional tips and donations; separate paid Bonfire Pro stores.","website_url":"https://www.bonfire.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-bonfire-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Campaign and print-on-demand merchandise; Pro is separate", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/1614140-bonfire-basics"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free campaigns; Pro Essentials $9.99/mo or $99/year; Super $299/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/15179864-bonfire-vs-bonfire-pro"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Creator sets price; profit is retail less the product base cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/1614156-pricing-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Base cost covers making and printing; shipping varies by order", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/1614156-pricing-fees"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "8% fee applies only to optional donations. Super waives donation and self-fulfilled product fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/15179864-bonfire-vs-bonfire-pro"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/1614156-pricing-fees", "label": "Campaign fees and costs"}, {"url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/15179864-bonfire-vs-bonfire-pro", "label": "Pro plans"}, {"url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/1614157-how-payouts-work", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.bonfire.com/en/articles/1614140-bonfire-basics", "label": "Selling models"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Bonfire campaigns are free; profit depends on item base cost and campaign volume. Optional contributions have an 8% processing fee. PayPal payouts have a $5 minimum and Bonfire covers payout fees. Bonfire Pro is a separate US-only store: Essentials costs $9.99/month or $99/year; Super costs $299/year and offers higher margins. Pro uses Stripe for checkout.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":17,"card":{"tag": "Merch campaigns", "note": "Bonfire Super waives the 8% donation fee.", "take": {"label": "Taken from your price", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Campaigns", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Donation fee", "value": "8%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Pro", "value": "From $9.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Bonfire", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--contrado","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Contrado","summary":"Shopify-linked print-on-demand dropshipping with seller-set retail prices.","website_url":"https://www.contrado.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-contrado-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Shopify-connected dropshipping; no other integration listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.contrado.com/faq/224"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free dropshipping account; Shopify fees are separate", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.contrado.com/faq/224"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Standard profit tiers apply to quantities bought in one order: 20% for 1–10, 25% for 11–20, 35% for 21–49 and 40% for 50+ items. Large furniture and suitcases are excluded and receive a flat 20%; seller-set prices can raise profit.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.contrado.co.uk/faq/224"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller pays production and shipping per order", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.contrado.com/faq/224"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Shopify takes buyer payment; seller pays Contrado to fulfill", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.contrado.com/faq/224"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.contrado.com/faq/224", "label": "Costs and payment flow"}, {"url": "https://www.contrado.co.uk/faq/224", "label": "Profit tiers"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Contrado’s standard profit tiers apply to products bought together in one order: 20% for 1–10, 25% for 11–20, 35% for 21–49 and 40% for 50+. Large furniture and suitcases are excluded and receive a flat 20%; custom seller pricing can raise profit. Product and shipping costs vary. Shopify collects buyer payment, then the seller pays Contrado for production and shipping. Dropshipping has no app or subscription charge.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":19,"card":{"tag": "Print on demand for Shopify", "note": "Contrado suggests profit from 20% to 40%, but you set your own prices.", "take": {"label": "Production and shipping", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Store", "value": "Shopify only", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Profit", "value": "20–40% by quantity", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Contrado", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--displate","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Displate","summary":"Earn size-based commissions, with higher earnings on Share & Earn referrals.","website_url":"https://displate.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/displate-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace + referral links", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://displate.com/open-shop"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free artist account", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://displate.com/open-shop"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Regular collection: M $4.50 / L $9 / XL $14.50; taxes, fees and discounts may affect earnings.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://displate.com/about-faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Displate prints + ships", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://displate.com/open-shop"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "No seller processor rate listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://displate.com/about-faq"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://displate.com/open-shop", "label": "Artist signup"}, {"url": "https://displate.com/about-faq", "label": "Commission and payouts"}, {"url": "https://blog.displate.com/share-and-earn/", "label": "Share & Earn"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Regular collection commissions are $4.50 (M), $9 (L), and $14.50 (XL), before applicable taxes, fees, and discounts. Share & Earn adds 41% of net artwork price for referred purchases within 30 days, subject to taxes, fees, and discounts. PayPal payout requests start at $50 and take up to 45 days.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Metal posters", "note": "Taxes, fees, and discounts can lower these amounts.", "take": {"label": "Your pay, size M", "value": "$4.50", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Referrals", "value": "Pay more", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "Displate ships", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Displate", "groups": [{"label": "Regular collection", "rates": [{"label": "Your pay, size M", "value": "$4.50", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Size L", "value": "$9", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Size XL", "value": "$14.50", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Size XL", "value": "$14.50", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--fine-art-america-prints","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Fine Art America prints","summary":"Set a per-product markup; free account with optional $30 yearly upgrade.","website_url":"https://fineartamerica.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/fineartamerica-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print marketplace", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/products"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free; premium $30/year", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/how-much"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Set markup above base price", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/set-your-own-prices"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "FAA makes + ships products", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/products"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "FAA processes card payments", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/products"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/set-your-own-prices", "label": "Markup and earnings"}, {"url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/how-much", "label": "Account pricing"}, {"url": "https://fineartamerica.com/tour/products", "label": "Fulfilment"}, {"url": "https://fineartamerica.com/openanaccountinstaprints.html", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Your chosen markup is your earnings; Fine Art America deducts the product base price first. Optional premium features cost $30/year. The official payout page says PayPal or (US only) check, monthly on the 15th, with no minimum balance.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Art prints", "note": "You set a markup on each product and keep it.", "take": {"label": "You set your markup", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Premium", "value": "$30 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "FAA ships", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Fine Art America", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--fourthwall-merchandise","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Fourthwall merchandise","summary":"Sell branded products with catalog costs deducted from each sale.","website_url":"https://fourthwall.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/fourthwall-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Branded merch store", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fourthwall.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No monthly fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fourthwall.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Retail minus catalog cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fourthwall.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Fourthwall makes + ships", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fourthwall.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Cards: 2.9% + $0.30 domestic; 3.9% + $0.30 international", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.fourthwall.com/frequently-asked-questions/payments-and-pricing/transaction-fees"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://fourthwall.com/pricing/", "label": "Product pricing"}, {"url": "https://fourthwall.com/legal/terms-of-service", "label": "Payment terms"}, {"url": "https://help.fourthwall.com/frequently-asked-questions/payments-and-pricing/how-you-get-paid", "label": "Payout minimum"}, {"url": "https://help.fourthwall.com/frequently-asked-questions/payments-and-pricing/understanding-payout-timing-schedules-and-troubleshooting", "label": "Payout timing"}, {"url": "https://help.fourthwall.com/frequently-asked-questions/payments-and-pricing/transaction-fees", "label": "Transaction fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Physical products have no platform fee. Card processing is 2.9% + $0.30 domestic or 3.9% + $0.30 international; PayPal is 3.49% + $0.49 domestic / 4.99% + $0.49 international; BNPL is 6% + $0.30 plus 1% for international transactions. Processing applies to the amount charged at checkout. Stripe payouts go monthly by the 3rd business day after the $25 minimum; bill.com exceptions by the 5th working day ($35 minimum for BRL). Bank arrival is typically 1–3 business days in the US and 3–10 internationally.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Creator merch store", "note": "You set the price and keep what is left after product cost and card fees.", "take": {"label": "Price minus product cost", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "Fourthwall ships", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Fourthwall", "groups": [{"label": "Card fees", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "Domestic cards", "value": "2.9%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "International cards", "value": "3.9%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-5"}]}]}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--gelato","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Gelato","summary":"Print-on-demand fulfillment through connected ecommerce stores.","website_url":"https://www.gelato.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-gelato-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print-on-demand for connected stores", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996080-how-much-does-gelato-cost"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free; Gelato+ is $29.99 monthly or $239.88 per year in USD ($19.99/mo billed annually).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996313-how-much-does-gelato-subscription-cost"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Set retail price; profit after product, shipping, and store costs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996038-what-s-the-retail-price"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Gelato bills product and shipping separately; tax may apply", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996080-how-much-does-gelato-cost"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Your store collects payment; Gelato charges no sales commission", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.gelato.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996080-how-much-does-gelato-cost", "label": "Costs and payment flow"}, {"url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996313-how-much-does-gelato-subscription-cost", "label": "Gelato+ prices"}, {"url": "https://support.gelato.com/en/articles/8996038-what-s-the-retail-price", "label": "Pricing guidance"}, {"url": "https://www.gelato.com/pricing", "label": "No-commission pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US prices in USD; US and Norway subscriptions may have local tax added. Gelato+ annual billing is $239.88 upfront ($19.99/month equivalent). Customer checkout occurs in the connected store; Gelato bills the seller for product and shipping after receiving the order.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand fulfillment", "note": "Gelato bills product and shipping separately. Tax may apply.", "take": {"label": "Product and shipping", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Gelato+", "value": "$29.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Commission", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Checkout", "value": "Your store", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Gelato", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--gooten","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Gooten","summary":"Print-on-demand production and fulfillment for connected online stores.","website_url":"https://www.gooten.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-gooten-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Orders fulfilled from connected stores", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047739271-Payment-pricing-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No membership or hidden fees", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047739271-Payment-pricing-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Set retail price; keep the difference after production and shipping", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047739271-Payment-pricing-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Product price includes item and print; shipping and possible tax vary", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047739271-Payment-pricing-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Store takes buyer payment; Gooten bills card or PayPal and does not collect buyer sales tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047739271-Payment-pricing-and-taxes"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047739271-Payment-pricing-and-taxes", "label": "Fees and billing"}, {"url": "https://help.gooten.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047737791-Where-can-I-find-product-and-shipping-prices", "label": "Product and shipping prices"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Product and shipping prices vary by item, print, destination, and order. The connected store takes buyer payment; Gooten separately bills the seller for product and shipping. Gooten does not collect buyer sales tax; sellers must handle collection and remittance, while Gooten may charge sales tax on its own invoices where thresholds apply unless the seller has a valid reseller certificate. Storefront processing fees are separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":15,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand fulfillment", "note": "You keep your price minus production and shipping.", "take": {"label": "Production and shipping", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Membership", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Billing", "value": "Card or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "Not collected", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Gooten", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--inprnt","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"INPRNT","summary":"Curated artist print galleries with fixed per-product earnings.","website_url":"https://www.inprnt.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-inprnt-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist galleries require community approval or invitation", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/61-how-do-i-start-my-own-print-gallery"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The official earnings table does not list a separate platform or payment-processing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/69-how-much-will-i-earn"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Earnings schedule, stated as of 1 Nov 2023: 50% fine art prints; 30% most other items; frames pay $5.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/69-how-much-will-i-earn"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "INPRNT handles materials, production, shipping, and service", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/69-how-much-will-i-earn"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal withdrawals start at $100. Earnings clear 30 days after sale; requested payments can take up to 30 business days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/80-how-do-i-view-my-sales-and-withdraw-earnings"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/69-how-much-will-i-earn", "label": "Artist earnings"}, {"url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/80-how-do-i-view-my-sales-and-withdraw-earnings", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.inprnt.com/article/61-how-do-i-start-my-own-print-gallery", "label": "Gallery approval"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The official earnings table is effective November 1, 2023 and was last updated January 28, 2024; no newer schedule was confirmed. It lists 50% fine-art print earnings, 30% for most other items, and $5 for frames. Promotions or artist-set print prices can change earnings. Balances clear after 30 days; PayPal transfers may take up to 30 business days after request.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":18,"card":{"tag": "Curated art prints", "note": "Frames pay a fixed $5. This schedule is from November 2023.", "take": {"label": "Fine art prints", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "Approval or invite", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$100", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Funds clear", "value": "30 days", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "INPRNT", "groups": [{"label": "2023 schedule", "rates": [{"note": "You get 50%", "label": "Fine art prints", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "You get 30%", "label": "Most other items", "value": "70%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Most other items", "value": "70%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--printful","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Printful","summary":"Print-on-demand production for connected stores and Quick Stores.","website_url":"https://www.printful.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-printful-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Connected stores and Quick Stores", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.printful.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Growth is $24.99/month; free for one year after $12K in annual sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.printful.com/plans"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Set retail price; profit is retail less Printful fulfillment costs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.printful.com/hc/en-us/articles/50264607936785-How-does-the-Printful-billing-system-work"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Product price includes production; shipping, taxes, and extra services may add cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.printful.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Connected stores handle checkout; Quick Stores use Stripe. External processor rates vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.printful.com/hc/en-us/articles/50262145635601-How-do-I-accept-payments-for-my-orders"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.printful.com/pricing", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://help.printful.com/hc/en-us/articles/50264607936785-How-does-the-Printful-billing-system-work", "label": "Billing and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.printful.com/hc/en-us/articles/50262145635601-How-do-I-accept-payments-for-my-orders", "label": "Payment flow"}, {"url": "https://www.printful.com/plans", "label": "Growth price"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD plans. Growth is $24.99/month and becomes free for one year after $12,000 in annual sales. Connected stores charge buyers and Printful bills fulfillment separately. Quick Stores use Stripe and pay monthly when the balance exceeds $25.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand fulfillment", "note": "Growth is free for a year once you pass $12,000 in yearly sales.", "take": {"label": "Printful fulfillment", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Growth", "value": "$24.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Checkout", "value": "Your store", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Extra costs", "value": "Shipping, tax", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Printful", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--printify","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Printify","summary":"Print-on-demand fulfillment for connected shops or Printify Pop-Up Stores.","website_url":"https://printify.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/printify-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Connected stores; optional Printify Pop-Up Store", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://printify.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Premium is $39/month. Annual prices conflict: pricing page $24.99/month billed annually, Help $299/year, Terms $299.88/year; exact annual charge is unresolved.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://printify.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Set retail price; profit after fulfillment and sales-channel costs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/4483626302609-How-will-Printify-charge-me"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Provider product cost, shipping, and applicable taxes are charged per order", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/4483626302609-How-will-Printify-charge-me"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Connected stores handle checkout; Pop-Up checkout uses Stripe", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/12051129478417-What-is-Printify-Pop-Up-Store"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://printify.com/pricing/", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/4483626302609-How-will-Printify-charge-me", "label": "Store charges"}, {"url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/12051129478417-What-is-Printify-Pop-Up-Store", "label": "Pop-Up Store terms"}, {"url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/12051908094993-How-will-my-Pop-Up-Store-earnings-be-paid-out", "label": "Pop-Up payouts"}, {"url": "https://printify.com/blog/new-printify-premium/", "label": "Premium pricing, 2026"}, {"url": "https://printify.com/terms-of-service/", "label": "Premium agreement"}, {"url": "https://help.printify.com/hc/en-us/articles/4483625875601-How-does-Printify-s-Premium-plan-work", "label": "Premium prices"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Premium costs $39/month. Official sources conflict on annual billing: the pricing page shows $24.99/month billed annually, Help says $299/year, and the Terms list $299.88/year; the exact annual charge is unresolved. Connected stores pay the seller directly; Printify separately bills production and shipping. Pop-Up Store terms are distinct.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand fulfillment", "note": "Printify lists three different yearly prices for Premium.", "take": {"label": "Production and shipping", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Premium", "value": "$39 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Checkout", "value": "Your store", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Charged", "value": "Per order", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Printify", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--redbubble","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Redbubble","summary":"Sell made-to-order designs with account-tier fees on artist earnings.","website_url":"https://www.redbubble.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-redbubble-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace product markup", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/202270799-How-is-my-payment-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free account; fees after sales", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/202270799-How-is-my-payment-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly platform fee is 50% of earnings on Standard, 20% on Premium, and 0% on Pro.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/4412593541908-Do-I-have-to-pay-to-have-a-Redbubble-account"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard/Premium pay 50% of earnings from markup above 20%; Pro pays no extra markup fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/50959535480212-How-does-the-excess-markup-fee-get-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "No separate rate listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/202270799-How-is-my-payment-calculated"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/202270799-How-is-my-payment-calculated", "label": "Earnings and fees"}, {"url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/50959494599060-How-does-my-platform-fee-get-calculated", "label": "Fee calculation"}, {"url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/50959744156948-What-are-Account-Tiers", "label": "Account tiers"}, {"url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/4412593541908-Do-I-have-to-pay-to-have-a-Redbubble-account", "label": "Fee FAQ"}, {"url": "https://help.redbubble.com/hc/en-us/articles/50959535480212-How-does-the-excess-markup-fee-get-calculated", "label": "Markup fee"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Markup defaults to 10% of product base price and can be changed. Standard, Premium, and Pro platform fees are 50%, 20%, and 0% of monthly earnings; excess-markup fees apply above 20% markup for Standard and Premium. Total account fees are capped at $150/€150/£150 per payment period.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand marketplace", "note": "Pro accounts pay no platform fee and no extra markup fee.", "take": {"label": "Standard account", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "High markup", "value": "50% fee above 20%", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Not listed", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Redbubble", "groups": [{"label": "Monthly platform fee", "rates": [{"note": "Of your earnings", "label": "Standard account", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Premium account", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Pro account", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "Markup above 20%", "rates": [{"note": "Of the extra earnings", "label": "Standard and Premium", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}], "second": {"label": "Pro account", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--society6","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Society6","summary":"Curated print-on-demand marketplace; new artist applications are paused.","website_url":"https://society6.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/society6-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Curated POD; apps paused", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/how-do-i-become-an-artist-with-society6-6266671"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Plan price not published", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/articles/pricing-earnings-411401"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist pay = (base price minus discount) × markup: 10% for pillows, tapestries, framed art and posters; 5% for other products. Trade, wholesale and marketplace orders pay 5% of net sales. Markup is not a percentage royalty on the retail price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/updates-to-pricing-and-artist-earnings-effective-march-18-2025-6266641"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Society6 fulfils orders", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/updates-to-pricing-and-artist-earnings-effective-march-18-2025-6266641"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "No processor rate listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/articles/pricing-earnings-411401"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/updates-to-pricing-and-artist-earnings-effective-march-18-2025-6266641", "label": "Artist pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/how-do-i-become-an-artist-with-society6-6266671", "label": "Application status"}, {"url": "https://help.society6.com/en-US/articles/pricing-earnings-411401", "label": "Payouts and earnings"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"From March 18, 2025, artists receive 10% markup on pillows, tapestries, framed art, and posters; 5% on other products. Trade, wholesale, and marketplace orders pay 5% net commission. Society6 stopped deducting shipping from artist earnings. New applications are currently closed.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Curated print on demand", "note": "Your pay is (base price minus discount) × markup. Trade sales pay 5% of net sales. New artist applications are paused.", "take": {"label": "Your markup on base price", "value": "5–10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "New artists", "value": "Applications paused", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Trade sales", "value": "5% to you", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "Society6 ships", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Society6", "groups": [{"label": "Artist earnings", "rates": [{"label": "Your markup, most products", "value": "5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "Pillows, tapestries, framed art and posters", "label": "Your markup, selected products", "value": "10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "Of net sales", "label": "Your commission, trade and wholesale", "value": "5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--spreadconnect-formerly-spod","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Spreadconnect (formerly SPOD)","summary":"Print-on-demand fulfillment through connected stores and marketplaces.","website_url":"https://www.spreadconnect.app/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-spreadconnect-app.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print-on-demand for connected stores", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-us/articles/360020789020-How-much-does-Spreadconnect-cost-me"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No recurring platform cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-us/articles/360020789020-How-much-does-Spreadconnect-cost-me"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Set retail price; profit after order and storefront costs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-gb/articles/360020691160-How-is-your-order-price-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "First print area is free; additional areas cost $5/€5 each. Flex, Special Flex, or Flock adds $2.50/€2.50 once per order.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-us/articles/360020691160-How-is-your-order-price-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Store handles buyer checkout; Spreadconnect bills your payment method", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-gb/sections/360005573659-Invoicing-Payment"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-us/articles/360020789020-How-much-does-Spreadconnect-cost-me", "label": "Recurring and order costs"}, {"url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-gb/articles/360020691160-How-is-your-order-price-calculated", "label": "Profit formula"}, {"url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-gb/sections/360005573659-Invoicing-Payment", "label": "Billing"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/getting-started/how-is-the-product-price-calculated/", "label": "Print-area rules"}, {"url": "https://faq.spreadconnect.app/hc/en-us/articles/360020691160-How-is-your-order-price-calculated", "label": "Order costs"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Product and shipping vary by item, destination, and shipping option. The first print area is free; additional areas cost $5/€5 each. Flex, Special Flex, or Flock adds $2.50/€2.50 once per order, even across multiple Flex areas. Connected store fees are separate; Spreadconnect charges the seller after dispatch.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":16,"card":{"tag": "Print on demand, formerly SPOD", "note": "The first print area is included.", "take": {"label": "Order costs", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Extra print area", "value": "$5 each", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Special print", "value": "+ $2.50 an order", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Spreadconnect", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--spreadshirt-marketplace","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Spreadshirt Marketplace","summary":"Earn a design price when Spreadshirt sells a product with your artwork.","website_url":"https://www.spreadshirt.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-spreadshirt-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace design sales", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshirt.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to upload designs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.spreadshirt.com/hc/en-gb/articles/210769049-Earn-money-as-a-Marketplace-Designer"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Since Sep 15, 2025, design price varies by product category/quality, country, sales channel, and discounts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.spreadshirt.com/hc/en-gb/articles/21791323474332-Design-price-overview"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Spreadshirt prints + ships", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.spreadshirt.com/hc/en-gb/articles/210769049-Earn-money-as-a-Marketplace-Designer"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "No processor rate listed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshirt.com/terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.spreadshirt.com/terms", "label": "Partner Terms"}, {"url": "https://help.spreadshirt.com/hc/en-gb/articles/21791323474332-Design-price-overview", "label": "Design-price rules"}, {"url": "https://help.spreadshirt.com/hc/en-gb/articles/210769049-Earn-money-as-a-Marketplace-Designer", "label": "Marketplace"}, {"url": "https://help.spreadshirt.com/hc/en-us/articles/207905515-Payment-of-Your-Earnings", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Marketplace design price varies by product level/category, country, channel, and promotions under the model effective Sep 15, 2025. Monthly payout follows a currency-specific minimum.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Design marketplace", "note": "Since September 2025, your design price depends on the product, country, channel, and discounts.", "take": {"label": "Design pay also varies by region", "value": "Varies by product", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "Spreadshirt ships", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Price depends on", "value": "Product and country", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Spreadshirt", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--spreadshop","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Spreadshop","summary":"Set a margin on branded print-on-demand products in your own shop.","website_url":"https://www.spreadshop.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-spreadshop-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Branded print-on-demand shop", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/earning-money-as-a-shop-owner/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free storefront", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/why-is-spreadshop-free/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Set margin + volume bonus", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/earning-money-as-a-shop-owner/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "One print area is included in the base price; extra print areas add cost and shipping is charged separately.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/shop-settings/printing-costs-and-print-areas/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly after minimum: balance settles by the 15th working day; payout takes up to 15 more working days, and bank posting may take another 15.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/payment-of-your-earnings/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/", "label": "Earnings overview"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/base-price/", "label": "Base prices"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/payment-of-your-earnings/", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://go.spreadshop.com/", "label": "Fulfilment"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/earning-money-as-a-shop-owner/", "label": "Margin guide"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/earning-money-with-spreadshop/why-is-spreadshop-free/", "label": "Free storefront"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/shop-settings/printing-costs-and-print-areas/", "label": "Print-area costs"}, {"url": "https://www.spreadshop.com/helpcenter/checkouts-in-your-shop/shipping-times-and-costs/", "label": "Shipping costs"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Base price varies by product and includes one print area; creator-set margin is added above it. Payouts are monthly after the currency-specific minimum, with separate settlement, payment and bank-arrival windows.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand shop", "note": "You add your margin on top of the base price. Volume bonuses can add more.", "take": {"label": "You set your margin", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Extra prints", "value": "Cost more", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Spreadshop", "groups": []}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--spring","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Spring","summary":"Set a retail price and earn the difference after product base cost.","website_url":"https://www.spri.ng/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-spri-ng.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print-on-demand products", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kb.spri.ng/fans/articles/how-does-spring-work.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to list and sell", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kb.spri.ng/creators/articles/how-much-products-cost.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Retail minus base cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kb.spri.ng/creators/articles/how-much-products-cost.html"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Spring prints and ships", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kb.spri.ng/fans/articles/how-does-spring-work.html"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "PayPal/Payoneer payout details and any minimums are shown in the creator account; no public processing rate is listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kb.spri.ng/amaze-commerce/articles/payouts-faq.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://kb.spri.ng/creators/articles/how-much-products-cost.html", "label": "Base costs and earnings"}, {"url": "https://kb.spri.ng/fans/articles/how-does-spring-work.html", "label": "Fulfilment guide"}, {"url": "https://www.spri.ng/spring-faqs", "label": "Payout terms"}, {"url": "https://kb.spri.ng/amaze-commerce/articles/payouts-faq.html", "label": "Payout FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Creator profit is the retail price minus the product base cost. Earnings become available after an order ships; creators request payouts to PayPal or Payoneer. Current minimums and processing details appear in the creator account.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{