y rules"}, {"url": "https://teepublic.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115012518628-How-do-I-get-paid", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.teepublic.com/terms", "label": "Creator terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The earnings chart is in USD. The example is an Artisan account T-shirt: $4 regular or $2 on sale; other products have different fixed earnings and Apprentice/Pending accounts earn less on most products. PayPal or Payoneer pays the previous month’s sales on the 15th (nearest business day if it falls on a weekend or holiday); Payoneer payments below $20 may be deferred to the next monthly payout.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Print-on-demand marketplace", "note": "TeePublic pays a fixed amount per item. It varies by product and account.", "take": {"label": "Your pay per Artisan tee", "value": "$4", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "None listed", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, by the 15th", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "TeePublic ships", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "TeePublic", "groups": [{"label": "Artisan tee", "rates": [{"label": "Your pay per Artisan tee", "value": "$4", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "On sale", "value": "$2", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "On sale", "value": "$2", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--threadless-artist-shops","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Threadless Artist Shops","summary":"Open a free artist shop or earn 10% on Threadless Marketplace sales.","website_url":"https://www.threadless.com/artist-shops/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-threadless-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist shop + marketplace", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/665-how-do-artist-earnings-work"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/665-how-do-artist-earnings-work"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Shop: retail less base; market: 10%", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/665-how-do-artist-earnings-work"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Product manufacturing included", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/689-what-are-base-costs"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Shop base has 5% processing fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/689-what-are-base-costs"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/665-how-do-artist-earnings-work", "label": "Artist earnings"}, {"url": "https://artistshopshelp.threadless.com/article/689-what-are-base-costs", "label": "Base costs and processing"}, {"url": "https://www.threadless.com/about/terms-of-use/", "label": "Seller terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Artist Shop earnings are retail price minus product cost and a 5% processing fee on retail. Marketplace-only sales pay a fixed 10% of purchase price. PayPal pays monthly after a 15-day return window, between the 15th and 20th.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Artist shops", "note": "In your own artist shop, you set the price and keep the rest after base cost.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "90%", "percent": 90, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Shop processing", "value": "5% on base", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Production", "value": "Included", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Threadless", "groups": [{"label": "Threadless", "rates": [{"note": "You get 10%", "label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "90%", "percent": 90, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Your own shop", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Your own shop", "value": "Base cost", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand--zazzle","section_id":"creator-merchandise-and-print-on-demand","name":"Zazzle","summary":"Set royalties on made-to-order products and earn separately from referrals.","website_url":"https://www.zazzle.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-zazzle-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Royalties + referral income", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/zazzle_ambassador_and_creator_royalties_and_referrals-360037785973"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to open and list", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/the_benefits_of_zazzle_how_to_get_started_with_your_zazzle_store-220622707"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "5–50% physical; 5–99% digital", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/zazzle_ambassador_and_creator_royalties_and_referrals-360037785973"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Products made to order", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zazzle.com/terms/creator_license_agreement"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "A 35% to 50% Marketing Royalty Fee is deducted from Gross Royalty on referred sales. A separate Self-Promotion commission offsets it toward 35% to 50% combined earnings on Net Referral Sales. Rates above 10% also incur a 5% Excess Royalty Fee on Gross Royalty.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/ambassador_program_faqs_creator-37460907460631"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.zazzle.com/terms/creator_license_agreement", "label": "Creator License"}, {"url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/zazzle_ambassador_and_creator_royalties_and_referrals-360037785973", "label": "Royalty table"}, {"url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/the_benefits_of_zazzle_how_to_get_started_with_your_zazzle_store-220622707", "label": "Store setup"}, {"url": "https://www.zazzle.com/hc/article/ambassador_program_faqs_creator-37460907460631", "label": "Ambassador fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Physical-product royalties can be 5% to 50%; Instant Downloads 5% to 99%. The Marketing Royalty Fee is deducted from Gross Royalty on referred sales; a separate self-promotion commission offsets it toward 35% to 50% combined earnings on Net Referral Sales. Rates above 10% also incur an Excess Royalty Fee of 5% of Gross Royalty.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Made-to-order products", "note": "On referred sales, a 35–50% marketing fee comes off your royalty.", "take": {"label": "Your royalty, physical", "value": "5–50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Referral fee", "value": "35–50%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "High royalty", "value": "5% fee above 10%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Zazzle", "groups": [{"label": "Royalty you set", "rates": [{"label": "Your royalty, physical", "value": "5–50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Your royalty, digital", "value": "5–99%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Your royalty, digital", "value": "5–99%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"crowdfunding-creative-projects--backerkit","section_id":"crowdfunding-creative-projects","name":"BackerKit","summary":"Creative crowdfunding with integrated pledge management.","website_url":"https://www.backerkit.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-backerkit-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "All-or-nothing crowdfunding: backers are charged only when the project reaches its goal.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.backerkit.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "5% platform fee on total funds raised for crowdfunding.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.backerkit.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "US USD domestic processing is 2.9% + $0.30 per pledge; rates vary by currency and international card.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.backerkit.com/article/852-payment-processing-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Crowdfunding fees apply only when the goal is met; pledge manager charges are separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.backerkit.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Supported-country Stripe account and identity verification are required before launch.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.backerkit.com/article/723-requesting-a-review"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.backerkit.com/pricing", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.backerkit.com/article/852-payment-processing-fees", "label": "Processing fees"}, {"url": "https://help.backerkit.com/article/719-available-countries", "label": "Supported countries"}, {"url": "https://help.backerkit.com/article/798-how-do-i-receive-funds", "label": "Payout timing"}, {"url": "https://help.backerkit.com/article/723-requesting-a-review", "label": "Stripe and review"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US USD domestic-card example. Crowdfunding charges 5% plus processing only when the goal is met; rates vary by currency and card. A supported-country Stripe account and identity review are required before launch. Payout is typically within 14 days. Pledge Manager charges are separate.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"5% of total campaign funds raised; processing extra","sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Crowdfunding", "note": "Backers are charged only when the project reaches its goal.", "take": {"label": "If goal is met", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Missed goal", "value": "No fees", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Needs", "value": "Stripe account", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Pledge manager", "value": "Priced separately", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "BackerKit", "groups": [{"label": "BackerKit", "rates": [{"label": "If goal is met", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "US card processing", "value": "2.9%", "percent": 2.9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "US card processing", "value": "2.9%", "percent": 2.9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"crowdfunding-creative-projects--campfire","section_id":"crowdfunding-creative-projects","name":"CAMPFIRE","summary":"Japanese crowdfunding with service-specific fees and funding rules.","website_url":"https://camp-fire.jp/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/camp-fire-jp.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "AON / all-in", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/campfire%E6%8E%B2%E8%BC%89%E6%99%82%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Total creator fees: CAMPFIRE 17%, machi-ya 25%, Community 15%, Social Good 0%, Creation 0%; Entertainment 0–17%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/campfire%E6%8E%B2%E8%BC%89%E6%99%82%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "CAMPFIRE 12% platform + 5% processing; machi-ya 20% + 5%; Community 15% + 0%; rates before tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/campfire%E6%8E%B2%E8%BC%89%E6%99%82%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Social Good creators pay 0%; supporters pay 7% platform + 5% payment fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/campfire%E6%8E%B2%E8%BC%89%E6%99%82%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Project owners must be 18+ and have a Japanese address and phone, a bank account in their own name, and official photo ID. Corporate projects must provide company details; extra documents may be requested.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/%E3%83%97%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E7%AB%8B%E3%81%A1%E4%B8%8A%E3%81%92%E3%82%8B%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AE%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E8%B3%87%E6%A0%BC%E3%81%8C%E7%9F%A5%E3%82%8A%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/campfire%E6%8E%B2%E8%BC%89%E6%99%82%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99", "label": "Service fees"}, {"url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/%E3%83%97%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E7%AB%8B%E3%81%A1%E4%B8%8A%E3%81%92%E3%82%8B%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AE%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E8%B3%87%E6%A0%BC%E3%81%8C%E7%9F%A5%E3%82%8A%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84", "label": "Creator eligibility"}, {"url": "https://help.camp-fire.jp/hc/ja/%E3%83%97%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E3%81%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E5%BE%8C%E3%81%AE%E6%B5%81%E3%82%8C%E3%82%92%E6%95%99%E3%81%88%E3%81%A6%E3%81%8F%E3%81%A0%E3%81%95%E3%81%84", "label": "Payout schedule"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Standard CAMPFIRE: 12% service + 5% payment fees, tax extra. machi-ya: 20% + 5%. Community: 15%, no payment fee. Social Good: creator pays 0%; backers cover 7% + 5%. Other services can be custom. Standard payout is next month-end.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Crowdfunding, Japan", "note": "You need a Japanese address, phone number, and bank account.", "take": {"label": "CAMPFIRE", "value": "17%", "percent": 17, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Owners", "value": "18+, in Japan", "fact_key": 