isting fees"}, {"url": "https://itch.io/docs/creators/payments", "label": "Payments, share, and tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Default revenue share is 10%, but sellers can set 0–100%; processing fees are extra. VAT and payout tax rules differ by payment mode.","fee_percent":10,"fee_basis":"Default 10% of sales; the seller can choose any rate from 0% to 100%.","sort_order":20,"card":{"tag": "Games and creative work", "note": "You set itch.io’s share yourself. In Payouts mode, itch.io handles VAT.", "take": {"label": "Default share", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "About 2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts setup", "value": "$3 once", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "itch.io", "groups": [{"label": "itch.io share", "rates": [{"label": "Default share", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Any share you set", "value": "0–100%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Any share you set", "value": "0–100%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces--ko-fi-shop","section_id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","name":"Ko-fi Shop","summary":"Sell digital products directly to supporters through your Ko-fi page.","website_url":"https://ko-fi.com/features/shop","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/ko-fi-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "The Shop is free; Ko-fi Gold is $12/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ko-fi.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Shop fee: 5% on Free/Standard; Gold is 0% after opting out of the optional “Get all of Ko-fi” service fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002506494-Does-Ko-fi-take-a-fee"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal/Stripe processing is usually about 3% + $0.30; actual fees vary by account, location and currency.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002506494-Does-Ko-fi-take-a-fee"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Payments go directly to the creator; Ko-fi offers a creator Shop, not a public product marketplace.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004000994-What-is-Ko-fi"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creator handles sales tax/VAT; Ko-fi adds seller-set tax to Shop checkout but does not remit it.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/10792069957661-How-tax-works-on-Ko-fi"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ko-fi.com/pricing", "label": "Shop pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002506494-Does-Ko-fi-take-a-fee", "label": "Fees and processing"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360005506873-What-is-Ko-fi-Gold", "label": "Gold plan"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/10792069957661-How-tax-works-on-Ko-fi", "label": "Sales tax terms"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004000994-What-is-Ko-fi", "label": "Creator page"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Shop fee is 5% on Free/Standard; Ko-fi Gold is $12/month for 0% when its optional 5% service-fee setting is off. Processor fees are extra.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":22,"card":{"tag": "Creator shop", "note": "Payments go straight to you through PayPal or Stripe.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Gold plan", "value": "$12 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "About 3% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "You handle it", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Ko-fi", "groups": [{"label": "Shop fee", "rates": [{"l