 "Free $0/month; Plus $29/month; Pro $99/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payhip.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Platform fee: 5% Free, 2% Plus, 0% Pro.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payhip.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal or Stripe processing fees apply on every plan; the processor sets rates by account and market.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payhip.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace sales add no fee; the normal Payhip plan transaction fee still applies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/307-marketplace"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "From 2026-07-01, Payhip collects and remits Canadian GST/HST and PST. Sellers still handle Quebec QST if registered or required; sellers handle other taxes Payhip does not collect.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/393-canada-sales-tax"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://payhip.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and processor fees"}, {"url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/307-marketplace", "label": "Marketplace fees"}, {"url": "https://payhip.com/features/vat-taxes", "label": "Tax collection"}, {"url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/392-us-sales-tax", "label": "US sales tax update"}, {"url": "https://help.payhip.com/article/393-canada-sales-tax", "label": "Canadian sales tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller, USD; card processing is charged separately by Stripe or PayPal.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"Free plan platform fee; processor fees are additional.","sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Downloads, courses, memberships", "note": "Payhip collects Canadian sales tax from July 2026. You handle other taxes it does not collect.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pla