 successor or current fee terms were verified.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":17,"card":{"tag": "Former digital goods marketplace", "note": "The company behind SellSN was deregistered after bankruptcy. Current terms could not be confirmed.", "take": {"label": "Operator deregistered", "value": "Terms unconfirmed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Operator", "value": "Deregistered Jan 2026", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Seller site", "value": "Returned errors", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Successor", "value": "None found", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "SellSN", "groups": []}}, {"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces--sendowl","section_id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","name":"SendOwl","summary":"Deliver digital files and subscriptions from your own checkout.","website_url":"https://www.sendowl.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-sendowl-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Launch: table 10 GB/mo vs FAQ 20 GB; Grow: table 20 GB/mo vs FAQ 30 GB. Launch is $39/mo or $32.50/mo annually, with 5k orders and $10k sales/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sendowl.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No per-sale commission. Standard bandwidth overage is $1/GB; order or sales caps trigger a plan upgrade.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/what-fees-will-i-be-paying-to-sell-on-sendowl"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "US Stripe: 2.9% + $0.30. PayPal and non-US processor rates vary by seller and payment.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/what-fees-will-i-be-paying-to-sell-on-sendowl"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Discovery Engine is in development; current plan has no listing or sale fee, but SendOwl may revisit pricing after launch.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/discovery-listing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller registers, collects, files, and pays taxes; SendOwl calculates and tracks taxes from seller-configured rules.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/charging-us-tax"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.sendowl.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and limits"}, {"url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/what-fees-will-i-be-paying-to-sell-on-sendowl", "label": "Commission and fees"}, {"url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/discovery-listing", "label": "Discovery pricing note"}, {"url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/taxes-faq", "label": "Seller tax duties"}, {"url": "https://help.sendowl.com/help/charging-us-tax", "label": "Tax calculation"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD seller pricing; the official plan table and FAQ conflict on Launch and Grow bandwidth. Payment processing and overages are separate.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"No per-sale SendOwl commission; fixed plan and possible bandwidth overage apply.","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Digital delivery", "note": "Plans cap orders and yearly sales. Going over means moving to a bigger plan.", "take": {"label": "Per-sale commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "From $39 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Bandwidth", "value": "$1 per extra GB", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ in US", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "SendOwl", "groups": [{"label": "SendOwl", "rates": [{"label": "Per-sale commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces--skillshare-digital-products","section_id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","name":"Skillshare digital products","summary":"Teachers with a live class can sell downloadable products on Skillshare.","website_url":"https://www.skillshare.com/en/teach","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-skillshare-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No product listing fee; a live Skillshare class is required to sell digital products.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legal.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/28033393042829-Skillshare-Digital-Products-Terms-and-Conditions-for-Sellers"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "10% platform fee on the full amount charged, before payment-processing fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/226578788-When-and-how-do-I-receive-payments-from-Skillshare"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe: 2.9% + $0.30 per sale. Wise withdrawal is usually about $1 for USD; currency fees vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/226578788-When-and-how-do-I-receive-payments-from-Skillshare"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Skillshare is the product marketplace; each digital-product sale has the same 10% platform fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legal.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/28033393042829-Skillshare-Digital-Products-Terms-and-Conditions-for-Sellers"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller determines, collects, reports and remits applicable taxes on digital-product sales; Skillshare does not.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legal.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/28033393042829-Skillshare-Digital-Products-Terms-and-Conditions-for-Sellers"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/28431710764173-How-Digital-Products-Work", "label": "Product fee and eligibility"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/226578788-When-and-how-do-I-receive-payments-from-Skillshare", "label": "Processing and withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://legal.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/28033393042829-Skillshare-Digital-Products-Terms-and-Conditions-for-Sellers", "label": "Seller terms"}, {"url": "https://help.skillshare.com/hc/en-us/articles/205220897-Class-and-Content-Guidelines", "label": "Eligibility"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Per digital-product sale: 10% platform fee plus Stripe processing; Wise may charge a withdrawal fee.","fee_percent":10,"fee_basis":"10% of the full customer charge before payment-processing fees.","sort_order":23,"card":{"tag": "Products for teachers", "note": "Only teachers with a live Skillshare class can sell digital products.", "take": {"label": "All product sales", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Needs", "value": "A live class", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "You handle it", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Skillshare", "groups": [{"label": "Skillshare", "rates": [{"note": "Before card fees", "label": "All product sales", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces--stan-store","section_id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","name":"Stan Store","summary":"Sell digital products from a creator storefront.","website_url":"https://stan.store/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/stan-store.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Creator $29/mo or $300/yr; Pro $99/mo or $948/yr", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.stan.store/article/31-creator-vs-creator-pro"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% Stan transaction fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.stan.store/article/83-stan-stripes-transaction-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "US Stripe: 2.9% + $0.30; international +1.5%; recurring +0.5%. Payout: 0.25% + $0.25 ($1 minimum); +1% for cross-currency sales. PayPal: 3.49% plus a currency-fixed fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.stan.store/article/83-stan-stripes-transaction-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable: sales run through the creator’s Stan storefront", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.stan.store/article/31-creator-vs-creator-pro"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Optional Stripe tax calculation and checkout collection in supported regions; seller registration is required. Remittance duties are not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.stan.store/article/204-collecting-sales-tax-with-stan"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.stan.store/article/31-creator-vs-creator-pro", "label": "Plan pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.stan.store/article/83-stan-stripes-transaction-fees", "label": "Transaction and payout fees"}, {"url": "https://help.stan.store/article/204-collecting-sales-tax-with-stan", "label": "Sales tax guide"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD plans; US Stripe card purchase shown. Processor and payout fees vary by country, customer location and payment method.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Platform transaction fee; payment processing, payout fees and plan cost are separate","sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Creator storefront", "note": "Stan charges a monthly plan, not a cut. Stripe or PayPal fees apply to each sale.", "take": {"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$29 or $99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ in US", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "0.25% + 25¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Stan", "groups": [{"label": "Stan", "rates": [{"label": "Transaction fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Stripe fees", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "US cards", "value": "2.9%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "International cards", "value": "+ 1.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Recurring payments", "value": "+ 0.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces--the-leap","section_id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","name":"The Leap","summary":"A creator storefront for downloads and services.","website_url":"https://www.theleap.co/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-theleap-co.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free; Pro $19/mo; Elite $59/mo", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.theleap.co/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No platform commission on any plan", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.theleap.co/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe processing: 2.9%; fixed card fee is not stated", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.theleap.co/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Creator stores and discovery directory; no separate marketplace rate", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.theleap.co/discover/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Terms last modified 2024-03-11: Thinkific collects/remits tax only for Thinkific Payments; current payment and tax setup is not independently confirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.theleap.co/apps/terms-of-service/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.theleap.co/pricing/", "label": "Plans and Stripe fee"}, {"url": "https://www.theleap.co/discover/", "label": "Creator directory"}, {"url": "https://www.theleap.co/apps/terms-of-service/", "label": "Payment and tax terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD monthly plans; The Leap lists 2.9% Stripe processing. Its pricing page does not state a fixed card fee.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"The Leap takes no sales commission; its listed Stripe processing fee is separate.","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Creator storefront", "note": "Tax handling in The Leap’s terms dates from 2024 and could not be confirmed.", "take": {"label": "Platform commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $19, or $59 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Stripe", "value": "2.9% per sale", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Discovery", "value": "Creator directory", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "The Leap", "groups": [{"label": "The Leap", "rates": [{"label": "Platform commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces--whop","section_id":"digital-download-stores-and-marketplaces","name":"Whop","summary":"Sell access and digital products with integrated payments.","website_url":"https://whop.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/whop-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No setup or monthly fee on standard pay-as-you-go pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://whop.com/network/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No separate seller commission is itemized in current fee docs; seller terms refer to any service fee shown in Whop pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://whop.com/seller-terms/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "US cards: 2.7% + $0.30; international +1.5%; FX +1%; ACH 1.5% (max $5). Payouts: ACH $2.50; RTP 4% + $1; crypto/Venmo 5% + $1; wire $23. Financing partner: 15% per successful transaction.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.whop.com/fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "No separate marketplace-sale rate is listed; product sales use Whop’s published service and payment fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://whop.com/seller-terms/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Tax Service modes: Whop Collects and Remits or Whop Calculates; You Remit. Both cost 2%; only the first makes Whop tax-only merchant of record. Sellers retain tax obligations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://whop.com/seller-terms/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://whop.com/network/pricing/", "label": "Payment fees"}, {"url": "https://docs.whop.com/fees", "label": "Payout and add-on fees"}, {"url": "https://whop.com/seller-terms/", "label": "Seller and tax terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller, domestic USD card rate; international cards, FX, optional services, financing, and payout method can add fees.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Digital products and access", "note": "Whop lists payment and payout fees, but no separate platform cut.", "take": {"label": "Separate platform cut", "value": "No fee listed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Tax service", "value": "2% if you use it", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "ACH payout", "value": "$2.50", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Whop", "groups": [{"label": "Payments", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "US cards", "value": "2.7%", "percent": 2.7, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "International cards", "value": "+ 1.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Currency conversion", "value": "+ 1%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "Max $5", "label": "ACH bank payments", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "Optional", "rates": [{"label": "Tax service", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"note": "Per successful transaction", "label": "Financing partner", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "US cards", "value": "2.7%", "percent": 2.7, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--99designs","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"99designs","summary":"Design contests and projects with curated designer levels.","website_url":"https://99designs.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/99designs-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "For 1-to-1 projects, designer platform fee is 15% Entry, 10% Mid, or 5% Top level. New clients add 20% of the first $500 in paid invoices (maximum $100); waivers apply for contest finalists/winners or qualifying invitations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022206031-What-is-a-platform-fee"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Designer signup is free; applications are reviewed and accepted designers are assigned a level.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://99designs.com/designers"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "For 1-to-1 projects, clients also pay a fixed 5% platform fee. Payment-provider charges may vary by location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/204761265-What-fees-do-you-charge-for-1-to-1-Projects"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Designers get work through design contests, designer search, services, and direct 1-to-1 projects.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://99designs.com/designers"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Hyperwallet is required; the $25 minimum is tracked separately for US/EU earnings. Current official guides differ: one says released funds reach Hyperwallet within 5 business days; another says a 5-business-day review plus 1–2 more days. Bank delivery takes 1–5 business days; PayPal takes 1–2. Methods and fees vary by region.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/43258514355604-Setting-Up-Hyperwallet-Required-for-All-Designer-Payouts-by-January-19-2026"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022206031-What-is-a-platform-fee", "label": "Levels and fees"}, {"url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022018152-What-is-a-client-introduction-fee", "label": "Introduction fee"}, {"url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/204761265-What-fees-do-you-charge-for-1-to-1-Projects", "label": "Project fees"}, {"url": "https://99designs.com/designers", "label": "Signup and levels"}, {"url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/204108819-How-and-when-do-I-get-paid", "label": "Payout review"}, {"url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/204108829-Which-payment-providers-does-99designs-use", "label": "Hyperwallet"}, {"url": "https://support.99designs.com/hc/en-us/articles/43258514355604-Setting-Up-Hyperwallet-Required-for-All-Designer-Payouts-by-January-19-2026", "label": "Hyperwallet migration"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Hyperwallet is required. The 2026 migration guide says released funds reach Hyperwallet within 5 business days; another current payout guide describes a 5-business-day review plus 1–2 more days to Hyperwallet. After that, bank delivery is 1–5 business days and PayPal 1–2. The $25 minimum is tracked separately for US and EU earnings; methods and fees vary by region.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Design contests and projects", "note": "Clients also pay a 5% platform fee on 1-to-1 projects.", "take": {"label": "Entry level", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "New clients", "value": "+ up to $100", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "99designs", "groups": [{"label": "1-to-1 projects", "rates": [{"label": "Entry level", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Mid level", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Top level", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Top level", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--airgigs","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"AirGigs","summary":"Hire music producers, singers, and session musicians.","website_url":"https://www.airgigs.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-airgigs-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "10% for Top Rated or sellers featuring at least one service; otherwise 15%. $8 minimum per order.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/how-much-does-airgigs-charge-me"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "One-time $20 seller activation fee; no monthly or membership fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/how-much-does-airgigs-charge-me"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Account funding fee: 4.7% by card or 2.9% by ACH. Payout providers may charge separately.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/fund-your-account"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Music production marketplace for audio and multimedia services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.airgigs.com/terms_of_service"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payoneer: 3.99% (+$0.49 in some countries), typically Tue/Thu; currency conversion fees apply outside USD. PayPal: 3-day clearance, usually under 24h for final approval, then 12–24h after daily processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/what-does-payoneer-charge-sellers-to-receive-funds?version=latest"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.airgigs.com/terms_of_service", "label": "Terms and fees"}, {"url": "https://www.airgigs.com/", "label": "Documentation"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/how-much-does-airgigs-charge-me", "label": "Seller pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/fund-your-account", "label": "Funding rates"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/what-are-paypal-s-seller-fees-to-receive-funds", "label": "PayPal fees"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/what-does-payoneer-charge-sellers-to-receive-funds", "label": "Payoneer rates"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/what-happens-after-someone-orders-my-service", "label": "Payout guidance"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/how-and-when-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payout schedule"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/how-much-does-airgigs-charge-me-to-hire-a-service-provider?version=latest", "label": "Buyer fee"}, {"url": "https://help.airgigs.com/help/what-does-payoneer-charge-sellers-to-receive-funds?version=latest", "label": "Payoneer fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Seller commission is 10% or 15% with an $8 minimum, plus a one-time $20 activation fee. Buyers pay a separate non-refundable 4.7% service fee or $5 minimum. Account prefunding costs 4.7% by card or 2.9% by ACH; Payoneer payout fees are separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":17,"card":{"tag": "Music services", "note": "Buyers pay 4.7% by card or 2.9% by ACH to fund orders.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Activation", "value": "$20 once", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum fee", "value": "$8 per order", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payoneer", "value": "3.99%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "AirGigs", "groups": [{"label": "AirGigs", "rates": [{"note": "$8 minimum", "label": "Standard", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Or featuring a service", "label": "Top Rated", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Top Rated", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--artistree","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Artistree","summary":"Custom digital commission forms with optional marketplace discovery.","website_url":"https://artistree.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/artistree-io.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Official seller guides do not state a current commission fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Know-Before-You-Sell-4eea065f69e746e5a332f17b411da791"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Official public seller guides do not state a required seller-plan cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Know-Before-You-Sell-4eea065f69e746e5a332f17b411da791"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Official public seller guides do not state payment-processing or withdrawal charges", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Know-Before-You-Sell-4eea065f69e746e5a332f17b411da791"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sell custom digital work through your request form; marketplace listing requires application and verification", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Marketplace-FAQs-0692f12830b94d6a83226b27976a915a?pvs=25"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Official public seller guides do not state payout method or timing", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Know-Before-You-Sell-4eea065f69e746e5a332f17b411da791"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Know-Before-You-Sell-4eea065f69e746e5a332f17b411da791", "label": "Seller guide"}, {"url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Marketplace-FAQs-0692f12830b94d6a83226b27976a915a?pvs=25", "label": "Marketplace application"}, {"url": "https://artistree.notion.site/Artistree-Help-FAQs-99dafe0cf20e4104a8edefb140992a4e", "label": "Help center"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Artistree’s official seller guide covers custom digital products and services delivered through its request forms. Artists can apply separately to the marketplace, where Artistree verifies applicants. Its public seller pages reviewed do not state commission, required plan cost, payment-processing charges or payout timing. Third-party fee claims are excluded.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":15,"card":{"tag": "Art commissions", "note": "Artistree does not publish its seller fees.", "take": {"label": "Commission fee", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Marketplace", "value": "Application needed", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Artistree", "groups": []}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--artists-clients","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Artists&Clients","summary":"Browse artist commission slots and submit requests.","website_url":"https://artistsnclients.com/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current seller share is not published; an official 2014 post said the completed-job fee became 15%", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://medium.com/@artistsnclients/update-b7ebdc8b5603"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current account or listing cost is not stated in public seller materials", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistsnclients.com/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current processing, withdrawal and conversion charges are not stated; the 2014 post mentioned PayPal costs", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://medium.com/@artistsnclients/update-b7ebdc8b5603"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Commission-slot marketplace where buyers browse artist offers and request work", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://artistsnclients.com/browse"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current payout method and timing are not stated; official 2014 post mentioned auto-payouts on the 15th", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://medium.com/@artistsnclients/update-b7ebdc8b5603"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://artistsnclients.com/browse", "label": "Marketplace"}, {"url": "https://medium.com/@artistsnclients/update-b7ebdc8b5603", "label": "2014 fee update"}, {"url": "https://artistsnclients.com/", "label": "Platform site"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The official platform update from May 2014 raised the completed-commission fee to 15% and said automatic payouts, when used, ran on the 15th of the month. These are historical figures, not confirmed current terms. Current public seller pages show active commission listings but do not publish a current seller fee, signup cost, payment-provider charge or payout schedule.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Art commissions", "note": "A 2014 post said the fee was 15%. Current terms are not published.", "take": {"label": "Seller fee", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Artists&Clients", "groups": []}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--contra","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Contra","summary":"Commission-free creator projects with plan-based project fees.","website_url":"https://contra.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/contra-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Creator commission is 0%. Free plan: $15 for $1–$499 projects and $29 for $500+; Pro waives this fee. Depending on the project flow, the fee may be assigned to the client or Independent.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322934-fees-overview"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free account. Optional Contra Pro costs $29 monthly or $17 per month when billed annually.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322981-what-is-contra-pro"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Client payment fees: cards 2.9% + $0.30 domestic (+0.5% manually entered, +1.5% international, +1% currency conversion); ACH 0.8% capped at $5; SEPA 0.5% + $0.30 capped at $6; wallet 1.5%; crypto 2% Free / 1% Pro. Seller payout and conversion costs vary by method and location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322934-fees-overview"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Independents can invite existing clients and apply to jobs in Contra’s job feed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/11159973-bring-existing-clients-to-contra"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Standard payouts are free and include a 4-day safety hold. Faster payout costs 2% on Free and is free on Pro; transfer timing varies by method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contra.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322934-fees-overview", "label": "Fees and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322763-paid-projects", "label": "Payment rules"}, {"url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322981-what-is-contra-pro", "label": "Contra Pro"}, {"url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/11159973-bring-existing-clients-to-contra", "label": "Existing clients"}, {"url": "https://help.contra.com/en/articles/9322944-what-to-do-if-your-payout-on-contra-is-delayed", "label": "Payout timing"}, {"url": "https://contra.com/pricing", "label": "Fee schedule"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Creator project commission is 0%. Free plan project fees are $15 under $500 and $29 from $500; Pro waives them. Payment flow can assign the fee to client or Independent. Processing and payout charges vary by method and location.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Freelance projects", "note": "You or the client may pay the project fee, depending on the project.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pro", "value": "$29 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Fast payout", "value": "2% on Free", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Contra", "groups": [{"label": "Contra", "rates": [{"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Pro removes it", "label": "Per project, Free plan", "value": "$15–$29", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Per project, Free plan", "value": "$15–$29", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--designcrowd","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"DesignCrowd","summary":"Sell design services through contests and client projects.","website_url":"https://www.designcrowd.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-designcrowd-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "DesignCrowd retains 15% of designer payments, including place awards, participation payments, paid invitations, and tips.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/what-are-designcrowds-fees-for-designers"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Creating a DesignCrowd designer account is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/what-are-designcrowds-fees-for-designers"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout costs depend on provider and location. Official guidance lists 2% Payoneer FX and PayPal charges of at least 2.5%; PayPal fees vary by region.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/how-do-i-get-paid"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Designers get paid through contests, One Designer jobs, and paid invitations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/what-is-the-difference-between-a-design-contest-and-a-freelance-job"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Contest payments can be delayed by customer-requested changes, design QA or copyright checks, or contest-holder handover approval.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/why-is-my-payment-for-my-design-taking-longer-than-5-days"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/what-are-designcrowds-fees-for-designers", "label": "Commission and signup"}, {"url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/how-much-does-a-designer-get-paid", "label": "Earnings"}, {"url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/how-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/why-is-my-payment-for-my-design-taking-longer-than-5-days", "label": "Payment delays"}, {"url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help", "label": "Contests and jobs"}, {"url": "https://www.designcrowd.com/help/article/what-is-the-difference-between-a-design-contest-and-a-freelance-job", "label": "One Designer jobs"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"DesignCrowd deducts 15% from designer payments. Provider fees, currency conversion, and payout availability depend on location and payment method.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"All designer payments, including participation payments and tips","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Design contests and jobs", "note": "Payments can be delayed by revisions or copyright checks.", "take": {"label": "All designer payments", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payoneer FX", "value": "2%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Work from", "value": "Contests and jobs", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "DesignCrowd", "groups": [{"label": "DesignCrowd", "rates": [{"note": "Including tips", "label": "All designer payments", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--fiverr","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Fiverr","summary":"Sell services as gigs, including extras and tips.","website_url":"https://www.fiverr.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-fiverr-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Freelancer receives 80% of each completed order, including Gig Extras and tips: a 20% Fiverr cut.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/9234443621137-Your-earnings-page"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to join and list services; no subscription is required. Optional paid tools and Seller Plus are separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.fiverr.com/start_selling"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdrawals: PayPal $0; bank via Payoneer $1; Payoneer account $3. Provider and currency-conversion fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/360010530058-Withdrawing-your-earnings-managing-payout-methods"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Fiverr marketplace gigs; Fiverr Ads can promote listings for an added cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.fiverr.com/start_selling"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard funds clear 14 days after an order completes; eligible seller levels or paid programs may clear faster.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/34069565843985-How-Fiverr-works-for-freelancers"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.fiverr.com/start_selling", "label": "Listing costs and terms"}, {"url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/9234443621137-Your-earnings-page", "label": "Seller share"}, {"url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/360010530058-Withdrawing-your-earnings-managing-payout-methods", "label": "Withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/34069565843985-How-Fiverr-works-for-freelancers", "label": "Clearing period"}, {"url": "https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/4402267122449-Early-Payout", "label": "Early Payout"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Fiverr takes 20% of order earnings including tips and extras; payout method, currency conversion, early payout eligibility, and availability vary by account/location.","fee_percent":20,"fee_basis":"Completed order amount including extras and tips, before withdrawal or optional early-payout fees","sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Freelance gigs", "note": "Some seller levels and paid programs get paid faster.", "take": {"label": "Each order", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Funds clear", "value": "14 days", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Fiverr", "groups": [{"label": "Fiverr", "rates": [{"note": "Including extras and tips", "label": "Each order", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--freelancer","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Freelancer","summary":"Bid for hourly jobs, projects, and contests.","website_url":"https://www.freelancer.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-freelancer-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Hourly: 10%. Fixed-price and contests: 10% or $5 minimum. Preferred Recruiter: 15%; eligible new-client quote: 3%; qualifying referred-client offer: 0% on future projects. New-client offers exclude contests.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.freelancer.com/feesandcharges"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free signup; 6 bids/month. A $20 unreserved balance is required to bid. Optional memberships start at $4.99/month; higher-risk jobs may require more.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.freelancer.com/feesandcharges"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdrawals: PayPal, Skrill, Payoneer, Express $1; international wire $25. Wire minimum $500; most other methods $50. Inactive accounts may incur up to $14/month after 6 months.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.freelancer.com/feesandcharges"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace projects and contests; eligible new clients can qualify for 3% quote or 0% referral promotions, with conditions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.freelancer.com/feesandcharges"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "After release, transfers usually take 24 hours to 5 business days; the first withdrawal has a 15-day hold.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.freelancer.com/support/Payments/time-frames-after-withdrawal-processing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/feesandcharges", "label": "Fees and withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/membership/", "label": "Memberships"}, {"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/support/payments/how-to-withdraw-funds", "label": "Withdrawal methods"}, {"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/support/Payments/time-frames-after-withdrawal-processing", "label": "Transfer times"}, {"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/support/freelancer/payments/15-day-delay-for-withdrawals", "label": "First withdrawal"}, {"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/support/Payments/how-to-release-a-milestone-payment", "label": "Milestone release"}, {"url": "https://www.freelancer.com/support/employer/payments/what-does-your-withdrawal-status-mean", "label": "Payout schedule"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD headline fees; commission varies by project type and eligible new-client promotion. The $20 bid balance must remain unreserved; withdrawal thresholds and availability vary by method and location.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace", "note": "Your first withdrawal has a 15-day hold.", "take": {"label": "Hourly and fixed-price", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free, 6 bids", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Bid balance", "value": "$20 needed", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "$1", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Freelancer", "groups": [{"label": "Freelancer", "rates": [{"note": "At least $5 on fixed-price", "label": "Hourly and fixed-price", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Preferred Recruiter", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Eligible new clients", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "On future projects", "label": "Clients you refer", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Preferred Recruiter", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--guru","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Guru","summary":"Freelance projects with job fees tied to membership.","website_url":"https://www.guru.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-guru-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Base job fee by membership: Basic 9%, Basic+ 9%, Professional 7%, Business 6%, Executive 5%. The employer may agree to cover up to 5 percentage points, reducing the freelancer’s share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.guru.com/pricing-freelancer/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free Basic membership includes 10 bids per month; optional paid memberships add bids and features.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.guru.com/pricing-freelancer/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Employer handling fee is 2.9%; current pricing promises 100% cashback for eCheck or wire. An older help article also lists physical checks and 3% cashback.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.guru.com/pricing-employer/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Freelancers find work by searching jobs and sending quotes to employers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.guru.com/how-it-works-freelancer/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdrawals use PayPal, Payoneer debit card, US eCheck, non-US bank, or wire where available. Guru processes requests on business days; bank timing depends on method and location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.guru.com/help/freelancer/processing-time-and-fees/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.guru.com/pricing-freelancer/", "label": "Memberships and fees"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/help/freelancer/about-guru-freelancer/fees/job-fee", "label": "Fee split rules"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/terms-of-service/", "label": "Invoice fees"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/how-it-works-freelancer/", "label": "Job search"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/help/freelancer/non-u-s-bank-account/", "label": "Bank withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/help/freelancer/processing-time-and-fees/", "label": "Withdrawal timing"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/help/employer/handling-fees/", "label": "Employer fee"}, {"url": "https://www.guru.com/pricing-employer/", "label": "Employer cashback"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Employer fee is 2.9%; current pricing promises 100% cashback for eCheck or wire. An older help article also lists physical checks and 3% cashback.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace", "note": "Clients can agree to cover up to 5 points of your fee.", "take": {"label": "Basic", "value": "9%", "percent": 9, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free, 10 bids", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Clients pay", "value": "2.9% handling", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Client share", "value": "Up to 5 points", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Guru", "groups": [{"label": "By membership", "rates": [{"label": "Basic", "value": "9%", "percent": 9, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Basic+", "value": "9%", "percent": 9, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Professional", "value": "7%", "percent": 7, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Business", "value": "6%", "percent": 6, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Executive", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Executive", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--legiit","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Legiit","summary":"Sell digital services through a freelance marketplace.","website_url":"https://legiit.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/legiit-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Legiit deducts a 15% seller fee from the total sale amount.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legiit.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "General use is free; sellers may optionally buy Premium Seller for $27 per month. The 15% seller fee applies to completed sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legiit.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Third-party payment providers may add 3% (wallet payments are exempt); an affiliate-referred sale can add another 15%; withdrawals cost $3.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legiit.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Sell digital services through Legiit marketplace listings; affiliate links can also refer buyers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legiit.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "After the buyer marks an order complete, Legiit verifies payment within five days; if the buyer does not respond, completion is automatic after three days. Payout can take up to 72 more hours to appear.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://legiit.com/terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://legiit.com/terms", "label": "Seller terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Legiit’s 15% seller fee is based on total sale amount. Third-party processing may add 3%; affiliate referrals can add a separate 15% fee; withdrawals cost $3. Optional Premium Seller is $27/month.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Seller fee on total sale amount; affiliate fee may be additional","sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Freelance services", "note": "Payouts can take up to 72 hours after an order is verified.", "take": {"label": "Each sale", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Premium", "value": "$27 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Withdrawal", "value": "$3", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Legiit", "groups": [{"label": "Legiit", "rates": [{"label": "Each sale", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Affiliate sales", "value": "+ 15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Some payment methods", "value": "+ 3%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--malt","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Malt","summary":"Freelance projects with country-specific commissions.","website_url":"https://www.malt.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-malt-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Latest fee guide lists 5% standard; some FR/ES/BE projects start at 10% and fall to 5% after six months. Other official guides list 0% in UK/NL, 10% then 5%, and 2% for invited clients. The quote shows the applied fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29539691425938-How-do-the-Malt-service-fees-work-for-freelancers"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Malt’s public freelancer guides do not list a required monthly seller plan price; project commissions are shown in the quote.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29539691425938-How-do-the-Malt-service-fees-work-for-freelancers"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Freelancer commission is quoted before VAT; VAT on Malt service invoices depends on the billing entity, country, and tax status.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.malt.com/kb/guide/hy/how-billing-and-payment-works-in-malt-SSX7bbSGhm/Steps/2511352"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Find projects through Malt or invite existing clients to manage projects and payments on the platform.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29534412076178-How-do-I-invite-my-client-to-Malt"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout timing follows project terms: prepaid work pays after validation; eligible cash-advance projects pay within 10 days; other client invoice terms are usually 30–60 days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.malt.com/kb/guide/hy/how-billing-and-payment-works-in-malt-SSX7bbSGhm/Steps/2511352"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.malt.com/kb/guide/en/fees-at-malt-f7dgS6ukb2/Steps/2526624", "label": "Country fee table"}, {"url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29539691425938-How-do-the-Malt-service-fees-work-for-freelancers", "label": "General fee guide"}, {"url": "https://help.malt.com/kb/guide/hy/how-billing-and-payment-works-in-malt-SSX7bbSGhm/Steps/2511352", "label": "Billing and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29534412076178-How-do-I-invite-my-client-to-Malt", "label": "Client invitations"}, {"url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29536793928722-Malt-Open-Registration-and-onboarding-for-freelancers", "label": "Registration"}, {"url": "https://help.malt.com/hc/en-150/articles/29567589850002-What-are-Malt-service-fees-and-offers", "label": "Service fee offer"}, {"url": "https://help.malt.com/kb/guide/en/fees-at-malt-f7dgS6ukb2/Steps/2526624", "label": "Fee exceptions"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Project commissions vary by country and client relationship. The newer general guide lists 5% standard and 10% to 5% after six months for some FR/ES/BE projects; other official pages list UK/NL at 0% and invited clients at 2%. The quote shows the applied fee; VAT may apply.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace, Europe", "note": "Malt’s guides differ by country. Your quote shows the fee that applies.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "None listed", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "VAT", "value": "Depends on country", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "By project terms", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Malt", "groups": [{"label": "Malt", "rates": [{"label": "Standard", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Falls to 5% after six months", "label": "Some FR, ES, BE projects", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Clients you invite", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "UK and Netherlands", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "By country and client", "value": "0–10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--peopleperhour","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"PeoplePerHour","summary":"Find project clients with fees based on each relationship.","website_url":"https://www.peopleperhour.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-peopleperhour-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-buyer lifetime spend: 20% below £250; 7.5% from £250 to £5,000; 3.5% above £5,000. Fees exclude VAT; £1 minimum fee per invoice. Minimum AutoPay/hourly invoice payment is £6 excl. VAT.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205218337-Freelancer-commission-fees"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No signup, project-search, or offer-posting fee. 15 proposal credits are free monthly; more can be bought, but the public help page lists no price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205217547-How-many-proposals-can-I-send-in-a-month"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Minimum service fee is £1 per invoice, excluding VAT. PPH does not list a fixed withdrawal fee; international intermediary bank fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205218447-Withdrawing-Money"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Find buyers through the PeoplePerHour marketplace.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205218337-Freelancer-commission-fees"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Funds clear in about 14 working days; PPH processes requests within 2 working days. After approval: UK bank 24 hours, local/SEPA 1–3 days, international bank 3–7 days; PayPal/Payoneer usually minutes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205218447-Withdrawing-Money"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205218337-Freelancer-commission-fees", "label": "Commission tiers"}, {"url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205217547-How-many-proposals-can-I-send-in-a-month", "label": "Proposal credits"}, {"url": "https://support.peopleperhour.com/hc/en-us/articles/205218447-Withdrawing-Money", "label": "Withdrawals and timing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"GBP thresholds are based on a buyer’s lifetime billing total; fees exclude VAT. Withdrawal currency, bank fees, and final transfer time vary by payment method and destination.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace", "note": "Fees are before VAT, with a £1 minimum per invoice.", "take": {"label": "Under £250 per client", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Credits", "value": "15 free a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Funds clear", "value": "About 14 working days", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "PeoplePerHour", "groups": [{"label": "By total spent per client", "rates": [{"label": "Under £250 per client", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "£250 to £5,000", "value": "7.5%", "percent": 7.5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Over £5,000", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Over £5,000", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--skeb","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Skeb","summary":"Accept fan requests for commissioned art and voice work.","website_url":"https://skeb.jp/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/skeb-jp.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Request fee: 9.8% standard, 8.3% with either discount condition, 6.8% with both. Boost is separate, up to 13.6%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Account setup and request acceptance are free; request fee is deducted from creator payout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No extra client fee. Each withdrawal costs ¥458 to a Japanese bank or ¥254 to Kyash.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Built for existing fans; discovery and search are intentionally limited.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Earnings credit 10 seconds after delivery. Withdraw per work or monthly: Kyash/zero-time is instant; standard bank transfer takes 24 hours or more after a request, with possible delays.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en", "label": "Creator guide"}, {"url": "https://lp.skeb.jp/creator?locale=en", "label": "Creator guide, English"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"JPY requests. Request fees depend on creator conditions; eligible creators can receive to a Japanese bank or Kyash. Withdrawal timing varies by method and zero-time transfer eligibility.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Commissions, Japan", "note": "Boost is a separate fee of up to 13.6%.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "9.8%", "percent": 9.8, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Client fee", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Bank withdrawal", "value": "¥458", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Skeb", "groups": [{"label": "Skeb request fee", "rates": [{"label": "Standard", "value": "9.8%", "percent": 9.8, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "One discount", "value": "8.3%", "percent": 8.3, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Both discounts", "value": "6.8%", "percent": 6.8, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Both discounts", "value": "6.8%", "percent": 6.8, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--soundbetter","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"SoundBetter","summary":"Find clients for music production, mixing, and mastering.","website_url":"https://soundbetter.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/soundbetter-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Project and track fees are shown when submitting proposals or listing tracks; Storefront commission is 10%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundbetter.com/terms-of-use"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Storefront costs $9.99/month or $99/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://my.soundbetter.com/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Payment-provider processing fees are deducted separately; the provider sets the amount.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundbetter.com/terms-of-use"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Music services marketplace plus a creator storefront for digital goods and services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundbetter.com/terms-of-use"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Marketplace funds release after client approval or auto-completion after 14 days; Storefront payout timing follows the provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundbetter.com/terms-of-use"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://soundbetter.com/", "label": "Pricing and terms"}, {"url": "https://my.soundbetter.com/", "label": "Storefront pricing"}, {"url": "https://soundbetter.com/terms-of-use", "label": "Fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Marketplace project and track fees are disclosed in the seller flow; Storefront charges a separate subscription, 10% commission, and provider processing fees.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":16,"card":{"tag": "Music services", "note": "Project fees are shown when you send a proposal.", "take": {"label": "Storefront sales", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Storefront", "value": "$9.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Taken separately", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Funds release", "value": "After approval", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "SoundBetter", "groups": [{"label": "SoundBetter", "rates": [{"label": "Storefront sales", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Shown on each proposal", "label": "Projects", "value": "Shown in proposal", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Projects", "value": "Shown in proposal", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--truelancer","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Truelancer","summary":"Find freelance projects and sell professional services.","website_url":"https://www.truelancer.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-truelancer-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "The current fee page lists an 8–10% seller service fee by membership; older official terms from 2020 list 3–10%, so the exact current membership schedule is not consistent across official pages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/fee-charges"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-premium accounts get 20 free proposals monthly; extra proposal packs cost $4–$20. Paid membership programs are also offered.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/fee-charges"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdrawal fees vary: India INR bank transfer $0; Payoneer bank transfer $3; Payoneer account $0; USD bank transfer $25; PayPal charges its own fee. Currency conversion or bank fees may also apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/fee-charges"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Find work through freelance jobs and fixed-price service listings; platform payments go through the Truelancer wallet.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/terms-service"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Truelancer says it processes withdrawal requests within two days; final arrival time depends on the selected payment provider and bank.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://blog.truelancer.com/how-to-withdraw-money-from-your-truelancer-account/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/fee-charges", "label": "Fee table"}, {"url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/terms-service", "label": "Terms, 2020"}, {"url": "https://www.truelancer.com/legal/membership-policy", "label": "Membership policy"}, {"url": "https://blog.truelancer.com/how-to-withdraw-money-from-your-truelancer-account/", "label": "Withdrawals"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The current fee page lists 8–10% by membership, while the 2020 terms say 3–10%. Withdrawal methods and external provider charges vary by country and currency.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace", "note": "Truelancer’s fee page and its 2020 terms give different ranges.", "take": {"label": "By membership", "value": "8–10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Proposals", "value": "20 free a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payoneer", "value": "$3", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Withdrawals", "value": "2 days to process", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Truelancer", "groups": []}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--upwork","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Upwork","summary":"Find clients for hourly or fixed-price contracts.","website_url":"https://www.upwork.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-upwork-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace freelancer service fee is 0% to 15% per contract. Direct Contracts are 5%, or 0% with active Freelancer Plus.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211062538-Learn-about-the-Freelancer-Service-Fee"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Connects cost $0.15 each; most job proposals require them. Optional Freelancer Plus is $19.99/month, includes 100 Connects/month and 0% Direct Contract fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.upwork.com/pricing/freelancer"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdrawal fees vary: US bank free for US tax addresses or $2.99 for international addresses; local bank $0.99; USD wire $50; Instant Pay $2. Provider fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211060918-How-to-get-paid-on-Upwork"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace jobs or your own clients via Direct Contracts; marketplace clients may also pay a $0.99 to $14.99 contract initiation fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/26106318334611-What-is-the-Contract-Initiation-Fee-on-Upwork"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Hourly earnings are normally available 10 days after the weekly cycle; fixed-price funds clear 5 days after milestone approval.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211060918-How-to-get-paid-on-Upwork"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211062538-Learn-about-the-Freelancer-Service-Fee", "label": "Freelancer fees"}, {"url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211062898-Understanding-and-using-Connects", "label": "Connects"}, {"url": "https://www.upwork.com/pricing/freelancer", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211060918-How-to-get-paid-on-Upwork", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211063888-How-to-withdraw-earnings-with-Direct-to-Local-Bank", "label": "Local bank withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/26106318334611-What-is-the-Contract-Initiation-Fee-on-Upwork", "label": "Client contract fee"}, {"url": "https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/360025040794-Direct-Contracts-bring-a-client-to-Upwork", "label": "Direct Contracts fee"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US-dollar plan and Connects prices. Marketplace fee is set per contract and disclosed before acceptance; Direct Contracts have separate freelancer and client charges. Withdrawal options and timing vary by country.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace", "note": "Clients may also pay a $0.99 to $14.99 contract fee.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace contracts", "value": "0–15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Connects", "value": "15¢ each", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Freelancer Plus", "value": "$19.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Hourly pay", "value": "10 days after week", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Upwork", "groups": [{"label": "Upwork", "rates": [{"label": "Marketplace contracts", "value": "0–15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"note": "Direct Contracts", "label": "Your own clients", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Your own clients, Plus", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Your own clients", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--vgen","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"VGen","summary":"Artist commissions with built-in payments or PayPal.","website_url":"https://vgen.co/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/vgen-co.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "VGen charges artists a 5% service fee on commissions; this is separate from payment processing and international payout fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12820094917655-What-are-VGen-s-fees"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No upfront or monthly platform fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12820094917655-What-are-VGen-s-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "VGen Payments processing is 2.9% + $0.30; non-US artists also pay a country-dependent 1.5–2.5% payout fee. PayPal charges follow the artist’s PayPal terms; clients pay their own FX fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12820094917655-What-are-VGen-s-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Artists list commission services for discovery on VGen or share their profile to bring clients.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12883126316951-How-VGen-works"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "VGen Payments: $50 wallet minimum; manual payouts take up to 7–10 business days initially, then 3–5. PayPal funds reach the PayPal balance instantly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12758889287703-4-Set-up-your-payouts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12820094917655-What-are-VGen-s-fees", "label": "Fees"}, {"url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12758889287703-4-Set-up-your-payouts", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.vgen.co/hc/en-us/articles/12883126316951-How-VGen-works", "label": "Services and discovery"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 5% service fee applies to artist commission income. Payment processing, international payout charges, and PayPal fees depend on method and country; VGen Payments requires a $50 wallet balance to withdraw.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"VGen service fee on artist commission payments, before processor and international payout fees","sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Art commissions", "note": "Artists outside the US also pay a 1.5–2.5% payout fee.", "take": {"label": "Commissions", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "VGen", "groups": [{"label": "VGen", "rates": [{"note": "Before card fees", "label": "Commissions", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}]}}, {"id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions--workana","section_id":"digital-freelance-services-and-commissions","name":"Workana","summary":"Freelance projects with lower fees for repeat clients.","website_url":"https://www.workana.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-workana-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Published table lists 20% on $0–$300, 10% on $301–$3,000, and 5% from $3,000 per client. Prose says 5% applies above $3,000, leaving that exact boundary ambiguous.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041235874-How-is-the-commission-calculated-at-Workana"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Profile creation, job search, and proposals are free; optional benefits plans start at about $1/day for Explorer.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040846094-How-much-does-it-cost-to-use-Workana"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Clients pay a 4.5% service charge (minimum $2); payment-processing cost varies by method and country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040846094-How-much-does-it-cost-to-use-Workana"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Clients post marketplace projects or hire directly; all payments between the same client and freelancer count toward the commission tiers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041235874-How-is-the-commission-calculated-at-Workana"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Free-plan withdrawals run monthly on the 1st–5th; paid plans add mid-month or weekly withdrawals. Payoneer requires a $30 minimum balance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041400594-How-to-withdraw-your-Workana-earnings-Setup-and-payment-schedule"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041235874-How-is-the-commission-calculated-at-Workana", "label": "Commission tiers"}, {"url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040846094-How-much-does-it-cost-to-use-Workana", "label": "Plans and client charges"}, {"url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041937573-Methods-for-withdrawing-money", "label": "Payout methods"}, {"url": "https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041400594-How-to-withdraw-your-Workana-earnings-Setup-and-payment-schedule", "label": "Payout schedules"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Commission thresholds use the total USD paid by one client to one freelancer. The article prose says 5% above $3,000, while its table says $3,000 and up, so that exact boundary overlaps. Client processing and payout charges vary by country, method, and withdrawal plan.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Freelance marketplace", "note": "All payments from the same client count toward the lower rates.", "take": {"label": "First $300 per client", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Clients pay", "value": "+ 4.5%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly on Free", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Workana", "groups": [{"label": "By total paid per client", "rates": [{"label": "First $300 per client", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "$301 to $3,000", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Above $3,000", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above $3,000", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-1"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--amazon-kindle-direct-publishing","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing","summary":"Publish ebooks and print books on Amazon.","website_url":"https://kdp.amazon.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kdp-amazon-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks, paperback, and hardcover", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/earn"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks: 35% or eligible 70%. Print: 50% or 60% of list price, less printing; Expanded paperback distribution pays 40% less printing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/earn"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Eligible 70% ebook royalties deduct delivery costs; paperback and hardcover royalties deduct printing costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/earn"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No upload or title setup fee. Proof and author copies cost extra; optional services may also cost extra.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/earn"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "On Amazon.com, 70% ebooks must be $2.99–$12.99 and meet territory rules. Brazil, India, Japan, and Mexico also require KDP Select, which makes ebook rights exclusive while enrolled.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/help/topic/G200634560"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/earn", "label": "Royalties and costs"}, {"url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/help/topic/G200634500", "label": "Ebook royalties"}, {"url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/help/topic/G200634560", "label": "Ebook price limits"}, {"url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/help/topic/G201834330", "label": "Paperback royalties"}, {"url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/help/topic/GAVW3FZZAKA2KY3B", "label": "Hardcover royalties"}, {"url": "https://kdp.amazon.com/en_US/help/topic/G200798990", "label": "KDP Select"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Amazon.com prices in USD; print thresholds and ebook eligibility vary by marketplace.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Ebooks and print books", "note": "US prices shown. Some countries need KDP Select, which makes the ebook exclusive to Amazon.", "take": {"label": "Eligible ebooks", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "70% ebooks", "value": "$2.99 to $12.99", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Print", "value": "Printing cost taken", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Amazon", "groups": [{"label": "Ebooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%, less delivery", "label": "Eligible ebooks", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 35%", "label": "Standard ebooks", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Print", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%, less printing", "label": "US print under $9.99", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 60%, less printing", "label": "US print $9.99 and up", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 40%, less printing", "label": "Expanded Distribution", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Standard ebooks", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--apple-books-for-authors","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Apple Books for Authors","summary":"Publish ebooks directly to Apple Books.","website_url":"https://authors.apple.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/authors-apple-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks published directly to Apple Books", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://authors.apple.com/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "70% royalty on direct ebook sales at any list price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://authors.apple.com/measure"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "No file delivery fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://authors.apple.com/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Apple charges no hidden fees. Listed bank thresholds vary; all other bank territories and currencies require more than US$40.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://itunespartner.apple.com/books/support/44-payments"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "No ebook price bands or exclusivity requirement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://authors.apple.com/measure"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://authors.apple.com/", "label": "Publishing terms"}, {"url": "https://authors.apple.com/measure", "label": "Royalties and payments"}, {"url": "https://itunespartner.apple.com/books/support/44-payments", "label": "Payment thresholds"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Direct ebook sales on Apple Books; payment minimums vary by banking country and currency.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Ebooks", "note": "Some bank territories need more than $40 before Apple pays out.", "take": {"label": "Ebook sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Price limits", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Apple", "groups": [{"label": "Apple Books", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70% at any price", "label": "Ebook sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--barnes-noble-press","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Barnes & Noble Press","summary":"Self-publishing ebooks and print books for B&N readers.","website_url":"https://press.barnesandnoble.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/press-barnesandnoble-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks, paperback, and hardcover; no audiobook sales through B&N Press", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/19897122642971-Getting-Started-with-B-N-Press"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks: 70% at $0.99+. Print: 55% of list price minus per-book printing cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/5359658688923-Getting-Paid-for-Sales"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Print production cost is deducted from the 55% print royalty.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/5359736229531-Royalty-and-Payment-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No cost to use B&N Press.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/19897122642971-Getting-Started-with-B-N-Press"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive. Print books sell on bn.com and the app, not in physical B&N stores.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/19897122642971-Getting-Started-with-B-N-Press"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/19897122642971-Getting-Started-with-B-N-Press", "label": "Formats and channels"}, {"url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/5359736229531-Royalty-and-Payment-Terms", "label": "Royalty terms"}, {"url": "https://help-press.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/5359658688923-Getting-Paid-for-Sales", "label": "Payments"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"B&N Press list prices; print production cost varies by format and specifications.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Ebooks and print books", "note": "Print books sell on bn.com and the app, not in B&N stores.", "take": {"label": "Ebooks, $0.99 and up", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Print cost", "value": "Taken from your share", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Barnes & Noble", "groups": [{"label": "B&N Press", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Ebooks, $0.99 and up", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 55%, less printing", "label": "Print", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Print", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--blurb","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Blurb","summary":"Sell print-on-demand books and instant PDFs through Blurb; new ebook publishing is no longer available.","website_url":"https://www.blurb.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-blurb-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print books, magazines, journals, notebooks, and Instant PDFs. No new ebooks; existing titles remain for sale in the Blurb Bookstore and Apple Books.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.blurb.com/hc/en-us/articles/4688756829197-Are-Blurb-ebooks-still-supported"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Blurb Bookstore: creator keeps 100% of chosen markup after base print cost. External channels deduct their channel costs and discounts first.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blurb.com/asptandcs"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Printing is deducted from Bookstore sales. External retailer base prices include distributor charges, shipping, and retailer discounts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blurb.com/asptandcs"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No Bookstore listing fee. External channel program fees, if any, appear at checkout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blurb.com/asptandcs"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly payouts. USD PayPal threshold $25 with $1 fee; USD check threshold $25 with $5 fee. Other currencies differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.blurb.com/hc/en-us/articles/207796336-How-and-when-do-I-get-paid-for-my-book-sales"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.blurb.com/hc/en-us/articles/4688756829197-Are-Blurb-ebooks-still-supported", "label": "Ebook status"}, {"url": "https://www.blurb.com/asptandcs", "label": "Distribution agreement"}, {"url": "https://support.blurb.com/hc/en-us/articles/207796336-How-and-when-do-I-get-paid-for-my-book-sales", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://support.blurb.com/hc/en-us/articles/29011178069901-How-to-sell-your-Instant-PDF-through-Blurb", "label": "Instant PDF terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD payout examples for Blurb Bookstore; external channel deductions and payment thresholds vary by channel and currency.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Print on demand", "note": "Other stores take their costs and discounts first.", "take": {"label": "Your markup", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Listing", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Ebooks", "value": "No new ones", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "$1 fee", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Blurb", "groups": [{"label": "Blurb Bookstore", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100% above print cost", "label": "Your markup", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--bookbaby","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"BookBaby","summary":"Sell ebooks through global retailers and print books through BookBaby BookShop and Amazon POD.","website_url":"https://www.bookbaby.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-bookbaby-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks, print-on-demand books, and global retailer distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/sell-your-book/ebook-distribution"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "eBook retailers: author receives 100% of net wholesale receipts after retailer fees. BookShop eBook direct sales: BookBaby retains 15%, so author receives 85% of sale price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.bookbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/205517908-How-much-does-BookBaby-keep-from-my-ebook-sales"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Print BookShop sales pay 50% of retail. Amazon POD royalties are 10–15% of retail, depending on title and specifications.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/self-publishing/print-on-demand"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Global ebook distribution is $299. Print POD packages are $199 for BookShop or $399 for BookShop plus Amazon POD.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/self-publishing/print-on-demand"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "The online distribution agreement grants exclusive distribution representation while active, except for author direct sales; either party may terminate with 24 hours’ notice. Copyright stays with the author.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/terms-of-service"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/sell-your-book/ebook-distribution", "label": "Ebook pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/self-publishing/print-on-demand", "label": "Print prices and shares"}, {"url": "https://support.bookbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/205517908-How-much-does-BookBaby-keep-from-my-ebook-sales", "label": "BookShop ebook fee"}, {"url": "https://support.bookbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/206284847-How-much-money-will-I-receive-when-my-printed-book-sells", "label": "Print royalty terms"}, {"url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/terms-of-service", "label": "Distribution agreement, 2022"}, {"url": "https://www.bookbaby.com/ebooks", "label": "Ownership and exclusivity"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD service prices; royalty basis differs across ebook retailers, BookShop direct sales, and Amazon print-on-demand.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Ebooks and print", "note": "BookBaby represents your book exclusively while the deal is active. Either side can end it with 24 hours’ notice.", "take": {"label": "Ebook stores", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Ebooks", "value": "$299 to distribute", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Print", "value": "$199 or $399", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "While active", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "BookBaby", "groups": [{"label": "Ebooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100% of net", "label": "Ebook stores", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Direct ebook sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Print", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50% of retail", "label": "BookShop print", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "You keep 10–15% of retail", "label": "Amazon print on demand", "value": "85–90%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Direct ebook sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--bookvault","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Bookvault","summary":"Print-on-demand book production for direct sales and retailer distribution.","website_url":"https://bookvault.app/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/bookvault-app.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print-on-demand books sold through connected stores, the Great British Bookshop, and retailer distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://bookvault.app/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct sales have no Bookvault commission; retailer earnings equal retail price less retailer discount and print cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bookvault.app/fees-commission-selling-direct"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct orders incur production and shipping costs. Retailer orders deduct their trade discount and then print cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bookvault.app/how-do-i-work-out-my-royalty-/-publisher-compensation-per-book"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan: £19.95 per title setup. Indie: £24.95/month plus £4.95 per title. Pro: £89.95/month with no title setup fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://bookvault.app/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "For connected-store orders, customers pay the author’s store; Bookvault bills the author for production and shipping. Retailer distribution does not require print prepayment.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.bookvault.app/fees-commission-selling-direct"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.bookvault.app/fees-commission-selling-direct", "label": "Direct sale charges"}, {"url": "https://help.bookvault.app/how-much-does-it-cost-to-print-and-ship-my-book", "label": "Production and setup"}, {"url": "https://bookvault.app/", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://help.bookvault.app/how-do-i-work-out-my-royalty-/-publisher-compensation-per-book", "label": "Retailer pay"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"GBP plan prices; direct-sale earnings exclude the publisher’s own storefront payment processing and marketing costs.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Print on demand", "note": "For retail sales you get the price minus the retailer’s discount and print cost.", "take": {"label": "Direct sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Free plan", "value": "£19.95 per title", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Indie plan", "value": "£24.95 a month", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Retail pay", "value": "Price minus discount", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Bookvault", "groups": [{"label": "Bookvault", "rates": [{"note": "You pay printing and shipping", "label": "Direct sales", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--draft2digital","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Draft2Digital","summary":"Distribute ebooks and print books to multiple retailers.","website_url":"https://www.draft2digital.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-draft2digital-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks, audiobooks, and print-on-demand paperbacks", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://draft2digital.com/blog/draft2digital-and-smashwords-whats-the-difference/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks and audiobooks: D2D takes 15% of store payments. Print: author gets 45% of list less unit cost. Smashwords.com pays 75% or 40% of list.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://draft2digital.com/register/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Print unit cost is deducted; ebook and audio proceeds reflect store terms, taxes, and any surcharges.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://draft2digital.com/podcalc"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "New accounts pay a $20 activation fee including year one. After that, the annual maintenance fee is $12 when titles are active and the waiver threshold is not met.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://draft2digital.com/faq/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "No active titles waives the annual fee. For active titles, the FAQ says the $100 waiver threshold is book sales in the prior 12 months; the current agreement says it is royalties.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://draft2digital.com/register/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://draft2digital.com/faq/", "label": "Pricing and payouts"}, {"url": "https://draft2digital.com/register/", "label": "Distribution terms"}, {"url": "https://draft2digital.com/podcalc", "label": "Print calculator"}, {"url": "https://draft2digital.com/audiobook-terms-of-service/", "label": "Audiobook terms"}, {"url": "https://draft2digital.com/blog/draft2digital-and-smashwords-whats-the-difference/", "label": "Formats"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Ebook and audiobook share is calculated from retailer payments; print royalty is based on list price. Official FAQ and agreement differ on whether the $100 annual maintenance-fee waiver threshold uses book sales or royalties.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Book distribution", "note": "The yearly fee is waived above $100 in 12 months. The FAQ and agreement differ on how that is counted.", "take": {"label": "Ebooks and audiobooks", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$20, covers year one", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Yearly fee", "value": "$12 after year one", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Formats", "value": "Ebook, audio, print", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Draft2Digital", "groups": [{"label": "Draft2Digital", "rates": [{"note": "Of what stores pay", "label": "Ebooks and audiobooks", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 45%, less printing", "label": "Print", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Smashwords store", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 75% or 40%", "label": "Direct sales", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Print", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--google-play-books-partner-center","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Google Play Books Partner Center","summary":"Publish ebooks through Google Play Books.","website_url":"https://play.google.com/books/publish/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/play-google-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks are non-exclusive and can also sell through other retailers; audiobook sales are available only to select partners.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/1079107?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks: 70% in 60+ eligible countries after updated terms; default split is 52%, while 11 countries retain their current split.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/9331459?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Google charges no fee for the 70% ebook revenue split.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/9331459?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No cost to sell ebooks on Google Play.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/1079107?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "The 70% ebook share has no price band; updated terms and eligible-country rules apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/9331459?hl=en"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/9331459?hl=en", "label": "Revenue split"}, {"url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/1079107?hl=en", "label": "Costs and formats"}, {"url": "https://support.google.com/books/partner/answer/6009580?hl=en", "label": "Payments"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Ebook share varies by country and agreement; audio sales are limited to select partners.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Ebooks", "note": "The 70% share needs the updated terms and applies in over 60 countries.", "take": {"label": "Eligible countries", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Price limits", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Google", "groups": [{"label": "Ebooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%, after new terms", "label": "Eligible countries", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 52%", "label": "Default split", "value": "48%", "percent": 48, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Default split", "value": "48%", "percent": 48, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--ingramspark","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"IngramSpark","summary":"Print and ebook distribution to retailers and libraries.","website_url":"https://www.ingramspark.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-ingramspark-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print books and ebooks", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks earn 85% of net revenue received. Print compensation is list price less wholesale discount, printing, and market access fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Print sales deduct production cost, publisher-set wholesale discount, and a 1.875% market access fee on local list price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/hubfs/Rate%20Card_IngramSpark_2026.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No account or title setup fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/faqs"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Optional print-to-ebook conversion costs $0.60 per page; print cost varies by book specifications.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/pricing", "label": "Ebook royalties"}, {"url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/faqs", "label": "Setup and terms"}, {"url": "https://www.ingramspark.com/hubfs/Rate%20Card_IngramSpark_2026.pdf", "label": "Rate card, Feb 2026"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD rate card; ebook net receipts and print costs vary by retailer, print specification, and discount.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Print and ebook distribution", "note": "Print pay is list price minus your wholesale discount, printing, and the market access fee.", "take": {"label": "Ebook net revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Print fee", "value": "1.875% of list price", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Conversion", "value": "60¢ a page", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "IngramSpark", "groups": [{"label": "Ebooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Ebook net revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Print", "rates": [{"note": "Plus your discount and printing", "label": "Market access fee", "value": "1.875%", "percent": 1.875, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--kobo-writing-life","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Kobo Writing Life","summary":"Publish ebooks through Kobo’s self-service program.","website_url":"https://www.kobo.com/writinglife","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-kobo-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks and audiobooks", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kobo.com/kobo-writing-life/blog/frequently-asked-questions"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks: 70% under qualifying IPP terms, 45% standard, 20% public domain. Audiobooks: 45% a la carte at floor, 35% below, 32% subscription token.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kobo.com/kobo-writing-life/blog/frequently-asked-questions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebook royalty is based on list price excluding tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kobo.com/kobo-writing-life/blog/frequently-asked-questions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Ebook distribution and ePub conversion are free; audiobook publishing costs are not specified in the public FAQ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kobo.com/kobo-writing-life/blog/frequently-asked-questions"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Current FAQ lists a C$50 payout threshold. The service agreement, last updated in 2012, also lists price ceilings, price-matching rules, and withholding until $100; current applicability is unconfirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.kobo.com/kobo-writing-life/blog/frequently-asked-questions"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.kobo.com/kobo-writing-life/blog/frequently-asked-questions", "label": "Writing Life FAQ"}, {"url": "https://writinglife.kobo.com/resources/serviceAgreement.html", "label": "Service agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Ebook price floors vary by currency; audiobook royalty depends on price and sales model.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Ebooks and audiobooks", "note": "Kobo’s service agreement dates from 2012, so some of its rules may be out of date.", "take": {"label": "Qualifying ebooks", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Charged on", "value": "Price before tax", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "C$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Kobo", "groups": [{"label": "Ebooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Qualifying ebooks", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 45%", "label": "Standard ebooks", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 20%", "label": "Public domain", "value": "80%", "percent": 80, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Audiobooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 45%", "label": "At or above floor price", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 35%", "label": "Below floor price", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 32%", "label": "Subscription token", "value": "68%", "percent": 68, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Standard ebooks", "value": "55%", "percent": 55, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--lulu","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Lulu","summary":"Print books and ebooks sold directly or through retailer distribution.","website_url":"https://www.lulu.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-lulu-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print books and ebooks; Global Distribution sends eligible titles to retailer channels.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000262744-creator-revenue-guide"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Print: 80% of gross profit. Ebooks: 90% of revenue after retailer fees and markups.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000262744-creator-revenue-guide"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "For print, production and any distributor share are deducted before the 80/20 split. Lulu Bookstore print sales have no distribution fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000262744-creator-revenue-guide"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Publishing is free. First Global Distribution review costs $4.99 per new print book or ebook; revisions are not charged again. A print proof copy is also required.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000255456"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Global Distribution uses retailer-specific channels and rules; creators receive the channel-level revenue shown in Lulu pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000262744-creator-revenue-guide"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000262744-creator-revenue-guide", "label": "Revenue shares"}, {"url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000255456", "label": "Distribution fee"}, {"url": "https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000255507-ebook-creation-faq", "label": "Ebook royalties"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD examples; creator shares depend on format and whether sales use Lulu Bookstore or external retail distribution.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Print books and ebooks", "note": "Retail channels take their share before Lulu’s split.", "take": {"label": "Print profit", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Distribution", "value": "$4.99 review per book", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Lulu store", "value": "No distribution fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Lulu", "groups": [{"label": "Lulu", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80% after printing", "label": "Print profit", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 90% after store fees", "label": "Ebooks", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Ebooks", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--notion-press","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Notion Press","summary":"Paid publishing services for print books and ebooks, with plan-based author profit shares.","website_url":"https://notionpress.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/notionpress-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paperback, hardcover, and ebooks; India and international distribution plans are available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://notionpress.com/en/for-writers"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic Distribution: 60% of net profit. India/Global: 80%. Outpublish: 100% of net profit. Costs are deducted first.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://notionpress.com/en/for-writers"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Printing, retailer distribution, shipping, taxes, technology fees, and returns may be deducted before the author share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://notionpress.com/publishing-agreement"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Publishing services are paid packages; price depends on the selected plan, format, and services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://notionpress.com/publishing-agreement"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Payout threshold: ₹1,500 domestic or ₹10,000 international. Monthly earnings enter the wallet within 40 days of month-end; bank deposit takes 3 days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.notionpress.com/support/solutions/articles/4000189248-how-to-withdraw-my-earnings-"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://notionpress.com/en/for-writers", "label": "Rate examples"}, {"url": "https://notionpress.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/4000145847-how-much-will-i-earn-if-i-publish-on-the-notion-press-publishing-platform-", "label": "Help article"}, {"url": "https://notionpress.com/publishing-agreement", "label": "Agreement"}, {"url": "https://notionpress.com/en/outpublish", "label": "Package terms"}, {"url": "https://support.notionpress.com/support/solutions/articles/4000189248-how-to-withdraw-my-earnings-", "label": "Wallet and withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://support.notionpress.com/support/solutions/articles/4000156610-frequently-asked-questions-about-the-notion-press-platform", "label": "Payout thresholds"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"India/INR standard distribution plans; Outpublish is listed separately. The agreement says “Seventy percent (80%)”; current official help and pricing examples specify 60%/80%.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Publishing services, India", "note": "Printing, shipping, store fees, taxes, and returns come off before your share.", "take": {"label": "Basic plan", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Packages", "value": "Paid, by plan", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "₹1,500 in India", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Notion Press", "groups": [{"label": "Share of net profit", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 60%", "label": "Basic plan", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "India and Global", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 100%", "label": "Outpublish", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Outpublish", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--pothi","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"Pothi","summary":"Publish print books and ebooks; external print distribution is an optional paid service.","website_url":"https://pothi.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/pothi-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Print books and ebooks. Current ebook sales are through Pothi.com; extended distribution applies to print books.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pothi.com/faq/publishing-at-pothicom-ebook"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks: 75% of MRP on Pothi; 25% for other stores, though Pothi does not currently sell ebooks there.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pothi.com/faq/publishing-at-pothicom-ebook"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Print: 50% of Pothi-store profit; 80% of profit after partner costs. Free-shipping domestic orders use the partner-distribution rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pothi.com/faq/n55/how-much-royalty-do-i-get-if-i-publish-my-print-bo"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Publishing is free with ready files. Extended print distribution starts with a ₹1,500 setup fee; annual renewal and bulk-print charges depend on plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pothi.com/faq/n114/how-do-the-different-distribution-plans-compare"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard distribution’s ₹1,000 annual renewal is currently waived; Premium plans require yearly renewal and upfront purchase of 200 or 600 copies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://pothi.com/faq/n114/how-do-the-different-distribution-plans-compare"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://pothi.com/faq/n55/how-much-royalty-do-i-get-if-i-publish-my-print-bo", "label": "Print royalties"}, {"url": "https://pothi.com/faq/publishing-at-pothicom-ebook", "label": "Ebook share"}, {"url": "https://pothi.com/faq/n114/how-do-the-different-distribution-plans-compare", "label": "Distribution fees"}, {"url": "https://pothi.com/faq/publishing-at-pothi-com-general", "label": "Publishing costs"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"India, INR. Ebook and print shares use different formulas: ebooks pay by store and MRP; print pays a share of profit after production and, for partner sales, distribution costs. Free-shipping domestic print orders use the partner-distribution rate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":15,"card":{"tag": "Print books and ebooks, India", "note": "Premium print plans need an upfront order of 200 or 600 copies.", "take": {"label": "Ebooks on Pothi", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Print stores", "value": "₹1,500 setup", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Ebooks", "value": "Pothi store only", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Pothi", "groups": [{"label": "Ebooks", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 75% of MRP", "label": "Ebooks on Pothi", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Print", "rates": [{"note": "Of profit", "label": "Print, Pothi store", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "You keep 80% of profit", "label": "Print, partner stores", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Print, Pothi store", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--publishdrive","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"PublishDrive","summary":"Distribute books under a catalog-based subscription.","website_url":"https://publishdrive.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/publishdrive-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Ebooks, print books, and audiobooks", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Plans charge 0% distribution commission; publishers keep 100% of the store royalties received.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Retailer share and print production costs still apply; payout transaction and conversion fees depend on payment method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-will-i-get-paid"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Free: 1 ebook title / 3 ebook channels. Starter: 3 titles at $16.99/month or $13.99/month when billed yearly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "New free signups after Feb. 24, 2026 get 3 ebook channels; print and audio require a paid plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-much-publishdrives-distribution-pricing-plans", "label": "Plans and commission"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/royalties-how-much-will-i-earn", "label": "Royalty calculation"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/how-will-i-get-paid", "label": "Payment fees"}, {"url": "https://help.publishdrive.com/managing-your-payment-threshold", "label": "Minimum payout"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD plans; annual prices are monthly equivalents billed yearly; payout fees depend on method and country.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Book distribution", "note": "Print and audio need a paid plan.", "take": {"label": "Distribution commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Starter", "value": "$13.99 a month, yearly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Free plan", "value": "1 ebook", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Store fees", "value": "Still apply", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "PublishDrive", "groups": [{"label": "PublishDrive", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 100% of store royalties", "label": "Distribution commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--streetlib","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"StreetLib","summary":"Multi-format book distribution with plan-dependent earnings.","website_url":"https://www.streetlib.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-streetlib-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Ebooks and audiobooks; print publishing is limited by region.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/706-what-you-can-do-with-streetlib"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "New international Subscription and Lifetime plans pay 85% of digital net revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/425-create-modify-delete-account"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Retail/VAT costs come first; print channels deduct 45–51%, StreetLib from 10%, and printing cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/677-earnings"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "New international plans: $99/year or $299 lifetime, up to 100 ebook/audio titles.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/425-create-modify-delete-account"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "New plans apply outside Italy/DACH from Mar. 17, 2026. Print service is unavailable in the US and Canada.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/425-create-modify-delete-account"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/425-create-modify-delete-account", "label": "Plan terms"}, {"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/677-earnings", "label": "Earnings calculations"}, {"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/706-what-you-can-do-with-streetlib", "label": "Formats"}, {"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/683-how-to-publish-a-paper-book", "label": "Print availability"}, {"url": "https://help.streetlib.com/article/432-getting-paid-usa-canada", "label": "Payment thresholds"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"New accounts outside Italy/DACH from Mar. 17, 2026; plan prices are USD, print access varies by country.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Book distribution", "note": "These plans apply outside Italy and German-speaking countries from March 2026.", "take": {"label": "Digital net revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$99 a year or $299 once", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Titles", "value": "Up to 100", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Print", "value": "Not in US or Canada", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "StreetLib", "groups": [{"label": "StreetLib", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Digital net revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"ebooks-and-print-books--xinxii","section_id":"ebooks-and-print-books","name":"XinXii","summary":"eBook and audiobook distribution; current author terms could not be confirmed from accessible official pages.","website_url":"https://www.xinxii.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-xinxii-com.png","facts":[{"key"