e.roblox.com/docs/marketplace/marketplace-fees-and-commissions"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Marketplace creator share is 30–70% by price; in-game creator share is 30%; Limited resale creator royalty is 10%", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://create.roblox.com/docs/marketplace/marketplace-fees-and-commissions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "80 Robux upload fee (500 for emissive-mask items); non-Limited publishing advance is 5× standard. Plus or Premium is required to keep items on sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://create.roblox.com/docs/marketplace/marketplace-fees-and-commissions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "DevEx requires 30,000 Earned Robux; standard rate $0.0038 each; $0.0054 applies to eligible US 18+ earnings", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://create.roblox.com/docs/production/monetization/developer-exchange"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://create.roblox.com/docs/marketplace/marketplace-fees-and-commissions", "label": "Fees and commissions"}, {"url": "https://create.roblox.com/docs/marketplace/marketplace-policy", "label": "Publishing requirements"}, {"url": "https://create.roblox.com/docs/production/monetization/developer-exchange", "label": "Cash-out terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Robux; Marketplace share depends on item price, while in-game sales and resale use separate rates.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Avatar items", "note": "Robux cash out at about $0.0038 each.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace, by price", "value": "30–70%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Upload fee", "value": "80 Robux", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Needs", "value": "Plus or Premium", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Cash out", "value": "From 30,000 Robux", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Roblox", "groups": [{"label": "Avatar items", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 30–70%", "label": "Marketplace, by price", "value": "30–70%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 30%", "label": "In-game sales", "value": "70%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You get a 10% royalty", "label": "Limited resales", "value": "90%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "In-game sales", "value": "70%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"game-mods-worlds-and-virtual-items--second-life-marketplace","section_id":"game-mods-worlds-and-virtual-items","name":"Second Life Marketplace","summary":"Sell virtual goods through Second Life Marketplace.","website_url":"https://marketplace.secondlife.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/marketplace-secondlife-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "User-created goods are listed in Second Life Marketplace and priced in Linden Dollars (L$).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://marketplace.secondlife.com/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current Marketplace seller commission or share is not shown on the public policy page; its fee and listing policy requires login.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://marketplace.secondlife.com/listing_guidelines"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "The public Marketplace policy requires login for current listing/sale charges. Separate from that, public pricing lists 5% to sell L$ and 5% USD payout fee (minimum $3, maximum $500).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://secondlife.com/corporate/pricing?lang=en-US"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Marketplace earnings are in L$. LindeX exchanges L$ for Tilia USD balance; approved withdrawals to PayPal or other permitted accounts cost 5% (min $3, max $500) and usually take 5–10 business days, sometimes up to 30.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://secondlife.com/corporate/pricing?lang=en-US"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://marketplace.secondlife.com/", "label": "Marketplace"}, {"url": "https://marketplace.secondlife.com/listing_guidelines", "label": "Fee policy, login needed"}, {"url": "https://www.lindenlab.com/legal/second-life-terms-and-conditions", "label": "Currency and cash-out"}, {"url": "https://secondlife.com/corporate/billing", "label": "Billing policy"}, {"url": "https://secondlife.com/corporate/pricing?lang=en-US", "label": "LindeX fees"}, {"url": "https://secondlife.com/app/tos/tos.php", "label": "Tilia processing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Second Life Marketplace commission/listing charges require login. Separately, public pricing lists 5% to sell L$ and 5% to withdraw USD through Tilia (min $3, max $500); processing usually takes 5–10 business days.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Virtual goods", "note": "Current Marketplace fees are only shown after you log in.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace share", "value": "Sign in for fees", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Currency", "value": "Linden Dollars", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Sell L$", "value": "5%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "USD payout", "value": "5%, $3 to $500", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Linden Lab", "groups": []}}, {"id":"game-mods-worlds-and-virtual-items--vrchat-creator-economy","section_id":"game-mods-worlds-and-virtual-items","name":"VRChat Creator Economy","summary":"Sell virtual content and access through VRChat Credits.","website_url":"https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/creators-vrchat-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Approved creators sell listings, subscriptions and store products for VRChat Credits.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/faq/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Creators receive approximately 50% of user spending excluding VAT after payout; the amount varies with platform, fee path and rounding.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/payout/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Approximate fees: 40% when users buy Credits, 15.3% when spent, then a payout fee (about 1.5% for PayPal); currency, VAT and route can change the result.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/payout/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout requires 20,000 earned Credits; purchased or promotional Credits do not count. PayPal is documented; the payout guide also lists supported-country bank transfers, while the FAQ lists PayPal only. Tilia usually processes in 1–2 business days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/payout/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/payout/", "label": "Payouts and fees"}, {"url": "https://creators.vrchat.com/economy/faq/", "label": "Payment FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Approximate creator share of user spend, excluding VAT; payout route and platform affect the net result.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Virtual content", "note": "Creators get about half of what users spend, before VAT. It varies by platform and route.", "take": {"label": "About, after payout", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Buying Credits", "value": "40% fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Spending", "value": "15.3% fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "20,000 Credits", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "VRChat", "groups": [{"label": "Approximate fees", "rates": [{"label": "When users buy Credits", "value": "40%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "When Credits are spent", "value": "15.3%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "1.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--artstation-marketplace","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"ArtStation Marketplace","summary":"Sell digital products on the Marketplace or through an ArtStation-powered portfolio site; the seller share depends on plan and promotion source.","website_url":"https://www.artstation.com/marketplace","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-artstation-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital products sell per item through the Marketplace or an ArtStation-powered website.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.artstation.com/en/articles/16155081-digital-product-earnings-how-much-will-i-make-from-each-sale"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "The August 2026 Help table lists seller shares of 88% for Non-Pro Marketplace sales, 92% for Pro promoted sales and 95% for self-promoted or own-site sales. The Sell Goods page still lists 70% for Free and 80–95% for Pro, so the official pages differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.artstation.com/en/articles/16155081-digital-product-earnings-how-much-will-i-make-from-each-sale"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "A free plan can sell digital products. Pro starts at $9.95 per month and raises the seller share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.artstation.com/subscribe.html"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain ownership. The terms grant Epic a non-exclusive license to use content to provide, improve, and promote ArtStation.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/artstation-terms-of-service-eu-65335878bd2c.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Each order item costs $0.30. The same page FAQ says no-referrer Marketplace discovery pays a 15% commission, conflicting with the table’s 3% Pro promotion fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.artstation.com/en/articles/16155081-digital-product-earnings-how-much-will-i-make-from-each-sale"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.artstation.com/en/articles/16155081-digital-product-earnings-how-much-will-i-make-from-each-sale", "label": "Fees and seller shares"}, {"url": "https://www.artstation.com/subscribe.html", "label": "Free and Pro prices"}, {"url": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/artstation-terms-of-service-eu-65335878bd2c.pdf", "label": "Terms"}, {"url": "https://www.artstation.com/about/artists/sell-goods", "label": "Sell Goods page"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US sellers, USD. The August 2026 Help table and Sell Goods page list different shares; the Help article also gives a conflicting 15% no-referrer fee.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Art and digital products", "note": "Official pages give different rates, from 5% to 30%, plus 30¢ per item. Confirm your rate in your dashboard.", "take": {"label": "Sources disagree", "value": "5–30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pro plan", "value": "From $9.95 a month", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Per item", "value": "30¢", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Rights", "value": "You keep them", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "ArtStation", "groups": [{"label": "Help page, Aug 2026", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 88%", "label": "Marketplace, free plan", "value": "12%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 92%", "label": "Marketplace, Pro plan", "value": "8%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 95%", "label": "Your own promotion or site", "value": "5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Sell Goods page", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Free plan", "value": "30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 80–95%", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "5–20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--canva-creators","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Canva Creators","summary":"Contribute templates and elements to Canva’s content library.","website_url":"https://www.canva.com/creators/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-canva-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Accepted stock media earns royalties per unique, de-duplicated license, whether purchased or included in an eligible subscription.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/policies/contributor-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Royalty amounts vary by usage and Canva's model; there is no fixed contributor percentage. Template royalties are popularity-based.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/policies/contributor-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Creators must apply and be approved. Template applications are open; new Element Creator applications are paused, and Education Creator is a small beta. Public program terms list no seller fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/creators/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Accepted stock media is licensed non-exclusively; accepted templates are exclusive to Canva for three years.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/policies/contributor-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Refunds and chargebacks can reverse royalties; tax withholding depends on country and treaty. Terms list a $10 payout threshold, then $10 for non-SWIFT and $20 for SWIFT, so the threshold wording conflicts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.canva.com/policies/contributor-agreement/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.canva.com/policies/contributor-agreement/", "label": "Contributor agreement"}, {"url": "https://www.canva.com/creators/", "label": "Program status"}, {"url": "https://www.canva.com/creators/templates/", "label": "Template royalties"}, {"url": "https://www.canva.com/education/education-creator/", "label": "Education Creator beta"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Royalty amounts vary by usage; templates have a three-year exclusivity period, while other stock media is non-exclusive.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Templates and elements", "note": "The agreement says $10 for payouts, but its summary says $20 for SWIFT. Template royalties depend on popularity.", "take": {"label": "Licenses and templates", "value": "Usage-based royalties", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "Apply; templates open", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Templates", "value": "Canva only, 3 years", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$10; SWIFT wording differs", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Canva", "groups": []}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--creative-fabrica","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Creative Fabrica","summary":"Sell assets one by one and earn from subscriber downloads.","website_url":"https://www.creativefabrica.com/open-store/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-creativefabrica-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "July 2025 guide: 50% subscription pool weighted by downloads and asset points; fonts earn 5 points.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/16/Designer-Documentation-07_2025.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller page advertises 50% default single-sale share and 75% when the seller refers the buyer through an affiliate link.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/open-store/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Designer membership is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/4401898664722-Why-should-I-open-a-store-on-Creative-Fabrica"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive; sellers can list on other platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/open-store/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Latest payout guide (Jul 2025): PayPal payouts under $10 cost $0.50; Payoneer minimum $100; bank payouts require $120 including a $20 handling fee. Current tax/refund deductions need current terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029930872-How-do-I-make-a-payout-of-my-earnings"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/open-store/", "label": "Seller share overview"}, {"url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/16/Designer-Documentation-07_2025.pdf", "label": "Subscription pool guide"}, {"url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/designers-terms-conditions-v1-4/", "label": "Designer Terms v1.4"}, {"url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/4401898664722-Why-should-I-open-a-store-on-Creative-Fabrica", "label": "Seller earnings"}, {"url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360014515719-Tips-on-how-to-be-a-successful-seller-on-Creative-Fabrica", "label": "Affiliate commission"}, {"url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/designers-terms-conditions-v1-5/", "label": "Designer Terms v1.5"}, {"url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029930872-How-do-I-make-a-payout-of-my-earnings", "label": "Payout methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current seller page advertises 50% default single-sale share and 75% for seller-referred sales. Subscription earnings follow the July 2025 guide; latest posted Designer Terms expired 9 Apr 2026, so current deductions are not confirmed.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Design asset marketplace", "note": "Bank payouts need $120, including a $20 handling fee. PayPal payouts under $10 cost 50¢.", "take": {"label": "Single sales", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "50% pool, by downloads", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Creative Fabrica", "groups": [{"label": "Single sales", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "Single sales", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 75%", "label": "Via your affiliate link", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "rates": [{"note": "Split by downloads and points", "label": "Download pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}]}], "second": {"label": "Via your affiliate link", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--creative-market","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Creative Market","summary":"Sell design assets through a licensed marketplace.","website_url":"https://creativemarket.com/sell","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/creativemarket-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "General licenses cover photos, graphics, templates, themes, and add-ons.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201252590-Shop-Owner-License-FAQ"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Default share is 50% of list price; shop and product rates may vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201193714-All-About-Shop-Sales-Analytics"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No public setup or listing charge is stated; shop requests require portfolio review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201251700-Open-a-Shop-on-Creative-Market"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity lock-in; sellers may also sell on their own sites and elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creativemarket.com/sell"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Dashboard earnings exclude refunds; tax withholding may also apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201193714-All-About-Shop-Sales-Analytics"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.creativemarket.com/terms/shops", "label": "Shop agreement"}, {"url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201251700-Open-a-Shop-on-Creative-Market", "label": "Shop application"}, {"url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201193714-All-About-Shop-Sales-Analytics", "label": "Sales share and tax"}, {"url": "https://creativemarket.com/sell", "label": "No exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://support.creativemarket.com/hc/en-us/articles/201252590-Shop-Owner-License-FAQ", "label": "License guide"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Default shop share is 50% of list price; shop/product rates may vary. Enterprise-specific rates could not be confirmed from accessible current official terms.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Design asset marketplace", "note": "Shop and product rates can differ from the default.", "take": {"label": "Default", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Portfolio review", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Refunds", "value": "Taken from earnings", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Creative Market", "groups": [{"label": "Creative Market", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50% of list price", "label": "Default", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--design-bundles","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Design Bundles","summary":"Sell individual files or earn from member downloads.","website_url":"https://designbundles.net/store-register","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/designbundles-net.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Individual file sales and a monthly membership royalty pool.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Half of net membership income after payment processing funds the pool; each artist share depends on downloads. The public agreement does not state an individual-sale rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public seller agreement does not state a signup or listing charge.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "The seller agreement grants Design Bundles a non-exclusive license to distribute the submitted art.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Third-party processing fees are deducted before the membership pool is split; royalties are paid monthly through PayPal or Payoneer.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions", "label": "Designer agreement"}, {"url": "https://designbundles.net/store-register", "label": "Designer signup"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US designer, USD; member-pool share varies by downloads; individual sale commission is not stated publicly.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Design asset marketplace", "note": "Half of membership income, after card fees, is shared by downloads. Single-sale rates are not published.", "take": {"label": "Membership pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Design Bundles", "groups": [{"label": "Membership", "rates": [{"note": "Split by downloads", "label": "Membership pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--design-cuts","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Design Cuts","summary":"Design asset marketplace that closed in January 2025; Creative Market acquired its brand.","website_url":"https://www.designcuts.com/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Design Cuts closed on 16 January 2025. Creative Market acquired the brand and hosts the official closure notice. One duplicate page heading says 2024, but the main announcement says 2025 and describes download access through June 2025.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creativemarket.com/designcuts"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable to current sales: Design Cuts is closed and publishes no active standalone seller royalty schedule.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creativemarket.com/designcuts"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable to current selling: the Design Cuts marketplace closed; Creative Market has its own seller program.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creativemarket.com/designcuts"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable to current selling: no active standalone Design Cuts distribution or exclusivity program.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creativemarket.com/designcuts"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "The closure notice says sellers were paid within 24 hours of closure; the past-purchase download service was deactivated in June 2025.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://creativemarket.com/designcuts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.designcuts.com/", "label": "Design Cuts redirect"}, {"url": "https://creativemarket.com/designcuts", "label": "Closure announcement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Design Cuts closed on 16 January 2025. Creative Market acquired its brand; this is a closed marketplace, not a separate current seller option.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Closed marketplace", "note": "Design Cuts closed on 16 January 2025. Creative Market acquired the brand; its seller terms are separate. Past download access ended in June 2025.", "take": {"label": "Marketplace no longer active", "value": "Closed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Closed", "value": "16 Jan 2025", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Brand acquired", "value": "Creative Market", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Downloads ended", "value": "June 2025", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Design Cuts", "groups": []}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--deviantart-digital-products","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"DeviantArt digital products","summary":"Premium Downloads are repeat-sale digital products. A paid Core plan is required for new listings; your share depends on the plan.","website_url":"https://www.deviantart.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-deviantart-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Premium Downloads are per-sale digital products. New listings require an active Core membership.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/what-are-deviantarts-platform-fees"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators keep 80% on existing Non-Core listings, 88% with Core/Core+, 95% with Core Pro, and 97.5% with Core Pro+/Max, before processing and withdrawal fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/what-are-deviantarts-platform-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "New monetization listings require active paid Core. Current prices are on the official Core Membership page and vary by plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.deviantart.com/core-membership/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Buyers receive usage rights, not copyright; sellers retain all other rights. Public Premium Download guidance does not state a marketplace exclusivity requirement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/what-do-i-receive-when-purchasing-premium-downloads"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Each transaction adds $0.30 + 3.5% processing. PayPal, Stripe, or BitPay withdrawals add country- and currency-dependent payout fees; funds have a seven-day hold.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/en/article/what-is-the-difference-between-platform-processing-and-payout-fees"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/what-are-deviantarts-platform-fees", "label": "Platform fees"}, {"url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/en/article/what-is-the-difference-between-platform-processing-and-payout-fees", "label": "Processing fees"}, {"url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/what-are-payout-fees-and-how-are-they-calculated", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/how-do-i-withdraw-my-earnings", "label": "Withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://www.deviantartsupport.com/kb/en/article/what-do-i-receive-when-purchasing-premium-downloads", "label": "Buyer rights"}, {"url": "https://www.deviantart.com/core-membership/", "label": "Core prices"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Creator share depends on the Core tier and whether a listing is existing or newly created; processing and withdrawal fees are separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Art downloads", "note": "Shares are before processing and withdrawal fees.", "take": {"label": "Core and Core+", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New listings", "value": "Need paid Core", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "3.5% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Funds hold", "value": "7 days", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "DeviantArt", "groups": [{"label": "By plan", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "No Core, older listings", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 88%", "label": "Core and Core+", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 95%", "label": "Core Pro", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 97.5%", "label": "Core Pro+ and Max", "value": "2.5%", "percent": 2.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Core Pro+ and Max", "value": "2.5%", "percent": 2.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--envato-elements","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Envato Elements","summary":"Earn from subscriber downloads; new author applications are paused.","website_url":"https://author.envato.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/author-envato-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscriber-share pool, allocated using the relative points of downloaded items.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41376981009561-Envato-Elements-Author-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors collectively share 50% of base-tier Individual/Teams net revenue and 25% of Enterprise net revenue; each author gets a download-weighted portion.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41376981009561-Envato-Elements-Author-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "New author applications are paused; only direct invitations are possible. No new Elements signup is available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive; authors may sell their items elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41376981009561-Envato-Elements-Author-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Net pool excludes tax, refunds/reversals, affiliate and service costs, discounts, and processing fees; income/withholding tax and currency conversion costs may reduce payout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41376981009561-Envato-Elements-Author-Terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41376981009561-Envato-Elements-Author-Terms", "label": "Royalties and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000424683-Understanding-Earnings-on-Envato-Elements", "label": "Subscriber share"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only", "label": "Author intake status"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000424886-Withholding-Taxes-with-Envato-Elements-and-Envato-Market", "label": "Withholding and payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller, USD; author share comes from the base-tier subscription pool; new applications are paused.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Subscription library", "note": "Authors share a pool of net subscription revenue, split by downloads.", "take": {"label": "Shared pool, Individual/Teams", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New authors", "value": "Invitation only", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Split by", "value": "Download points", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Envato", "groups": [{"label": "Subscriber pool", "rates": [{"note": "Your share depends on downloaded items", "label": "Shared pool, Individual/Teams", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Your share depends on downloaded items", "label": "Shared pool, Enterprise", "value": "25%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Shared pool, Enterprise", "value": "25%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--envato-graphicriver","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Envato GraphicRiver","summary":"Sell individual design licenses on Envato Market.","website_url":"https://graphicriver.net/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/graphicriver-net.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Individual asset licenses at author-set item prices.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472343-Pricing-Your-Items-Responsibly"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors receive 50% of the item price before tax; the buyer fee is separate. Special deals may use different prices or author fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472943-Introduction-to-Earnings"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "New author signups are paused; Graphics is not in the current invitation categories. No new-seller signup is available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive; authors may sell their items on other sites.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41371538488473-Envato-Market-Author-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "US withholding may apply at payout; minimum payout is $50. Promotions may change the author fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472943-Introduction-to-Earnings"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472943-Introduction-to-Earnings", "label": "Market and Elements earnings"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472343-Pricing-Your-Items-Responsibly", "label": "Item price"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41371538488473-Envato-Market-Author-Terms", "label": "Author terms"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only", "label": "Author intake status"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000424886-Withholding-Taxes-with-Envato-Elements-and-Envato-Market", "label": "Withholding and payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller, USD; 50% of item price before tax; new GraphicRiver author applications are paused.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Design asset marketplace", "note": "Envato is not accepting new Graphics authors right now.", "take": {"label": "Of item price", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New authors", "value": "Signups paused", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Envato", "groups": [{"label": "Envato Market", "rates": [{"note": "Before tax; buyer fee is separate", "label": "Of item price", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--flaticon-contributor","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Flaticon Contributor","summary":"New contributor registrations are closed. Existing creators retain dashboard access, but current public royalty and license terms are not available; the indexed agreement is dated 2022.","website_url":"https://contributor.flaticon.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/contributor-flaticon-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "New contributor intake is closed. Current earnings for existing accounts are not stated on the public closed-registration page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/closed"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The only public contributor agreement located is dated 2022; it cannot confirm current rates for existing accounts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/terms/terms_20221110.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "New registrations are closed; existing contributors keep dashboard access.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/closed"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current exclusivity terms for existing accounts are not published on the accessible public contributor pages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current deductions and payout terms for existing accounts are not published on the accessible public contributor pages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/closed", "label": "Registration status"}, {"url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/terms/terms_20221110.pdf", "label": "Agreement, Nov 2022"}, {"url": "https://contributor.flaticon.com/", "label": "Contributor portal"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"New Flaticon contributor registration is closed; current earnings terms for existing accounts are not confirmed by current public documents.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Icons", "note": "Flaticon only shows current terms to existing creators.", "take": {"label": "New signups closed", "value": "Rate not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New creators", "value": "Closed", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Public terms", "value": "2022 copy only", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Existing users", "value": "Dashboard only", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Flaticon", "groups": []}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--freepik-contributor","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Magnific Contributor","summary":"Formerly Freepik Contributor; stock assets earn weighted subscriber-download royalties.","website_url":"https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/steps-to-create-your-account","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-magnific-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Premium asset downloads earn pay-per-download royalties from subscriber net revenue, weighted by asset type and subscriber activity.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/payment-information"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "50% of each subscriber net revenue amount forms the pool. A contributor earns according to weighted downloads by that subscriber: icons x1, photos/vectors/PSD x3, videos x12; other subscriber downloads count x3 in the denominator.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/payment-information"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Applicants need portfolio review and approval, then submit 150 to 200 initial assets. Public contributor steps list no seller fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/steps-to-create-your-account"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "For partner distribution, Magnific takes a non-exclusive distribution and sublicensing license; contributors retain ownership and may distribute elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/content-distribution"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard download royalties need a $25 / €50 invoice minimum; PayPal, Payoneer, or eligible SEPA transfer; paid two months after downloads. Partner distribution pays 50% of net, with no added deductions, at least every three months.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/docs/faqs-for-contributors"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/payment-information", "label": "Earnings formula"}, {"url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/steps-to-create-your-account", "label": "Application"}, {"url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/content-distribution", "label": "Partner distribution"}, {"url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/docs/faqs-for-contributors", "label": "Payouts and tax"}, {"url": "https://www.freepik.com/pikaso", "label": "Rebrand"}, {"url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/payment-methods-accepted-by-magnific", "label": "Payment methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Weighted contributor royalties; payout minimums are USD 25 or EUR 50, with individual tax treatment applied after earnings are shown.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Stock assets, formerly Freepik", "note": "Freepik Contributor is now Magnific. Payouts come two months after downloads.", "take": {"label": "Shared subscriber pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "150–200 assets to begin", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Magnific", "groups": [{"label": "Downloads", "rates": [{"note": "Videos count x12, photos x3, icons x1", "label": "Subscriber pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Partner distribution", "rates": [{"note": "Paid at least every three months", "label": "Of net revenue", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-5"}]}]}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--iconfinder","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Iconfinder (now Magnific)","summary":"The former Iconfinder homepage now redirects to Magnific’s icon catalog. Current seller terms are handled separately under Magnific Contributor.","website_url":"https://www.magnific.com/icons","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-magnific-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "The Iconfinder homepage currently redirects to Magnific’s icon catalog; no separate Iconfinder creator program is shown.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/?locale=en_US"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No current standalone Iconfinder creator share is published; Magnific Contributor rates do not establish terms for legacy Iconfinder uploads.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/sell-icons"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No current standalone Iconfinder seller fee schedule is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/sell-icons"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current Iconfinder-specific seller rights and exclusivity terms are not publicly listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/sell-icons"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current Iconfinder-specific deductions and payout terms are not publicly listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/sell-icons"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/?locale=en_US", "label": "Iconfinder redirect"}, {"url": "https://www.iconfinder.com/sell-icons", "label": "Old seller page"}, {"url": "https://www.magnific.com/ai/contributors/payment-information", "label": "Magnific payment terms"}, {"url": "https://www.magnific.com/icons", "label": "Icon catalog"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"No current Iconfinder-specific royalty schedule is public. Magnific Contributor’s schedule is separate and does not establish terms for legacy Iconfinder uploads.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Now part of Magnific", "note": "Iconfinder now redirects to Magnific. Magnific Contributor has its own terms.", "take": {"label": "Now Magnific", "value": "Moved", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-1"}, "lines": [{"label": "Site", "value": "Goes to Magnific", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Seller terms", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Iconfinder", "groups": []}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--the-noun-project","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"The Noun Project","summary":"Earn from single icon purchases, website subscriptions, API use, and optional Noun Studio downloads.","website_url":"https://thenounproject.com/creators/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/thenounproject-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Icons earn royalties from single purchases, website subscriptions, API calls, and optional Noun Studio derivative downloads.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thenounproject.com/legal/creator-terms/icons/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Current creator terms set 60% of net on single purchases and Noun Studio, and 50% of net on subscription/API use.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thenounproject.com/legal/creator-terms/icons/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Only selected creators are currently accepted. No contributor fee is listed on the public creator pages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thenounproject.com/creators/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators retain ownership and may grant additional non-exclusive licenses; The Noun Project’s license is non-exclusive.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thenounproject.com/legal/creator-terms/icons/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Net revenue deducts set expenses, which can include taxes, fees, disputes, chargebacks, and refunds. PayPal payout starts at $25 and is due by the end of the following month. The creator page still says 40% of shared subscription/API revenue, unlike the terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://thenounproject.com/legal/creator-terms/icons/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://thenounproject.com/legal/creator-terms/icons/", "label": "Creator terms"}, {"url": "https://thenounproject.com/creators/", "label": "Creator page"}, {"url": "https://help.thenounproject.com/hc/en-us/articles/200585056-How-do-I-get-paid", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.thenounproject.com/hc/en-us/articles/54426759425691-How-Noun-Studio-Supports-Creators", "label": "Noun Studio terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current creator terms set different shares for single purchases and subscription/API use; a creator page still shows a conflicting subscription rate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Icons", "note": "The creator page still says creators get 40% of subscriptions, which conflicts with the terms.", "take": {"label": "Single purchases", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "Selected creators", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Noun Project", "groups": [{"label": "Creator terms from 2 Sep 2026", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 60% of net", "label": "Single purchases", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 50% of net", "label": "Subscriptions and API", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Optional", "label": "Noun Studio downloads", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Subscriptions and API", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--ui8","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"UI8","summary":"Digital asset marketplace where designers list and sell design products.","website_url":"https://ui8.net/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/ui8-net.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Official marketplace listings sell digital design assets under named authors", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ui8.net/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current author revenue share is not stated in public UI8 pages", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ui8.net/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Required author signup, listing or subscription cost is not stated publicly", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ui8.net/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current author exclusivity terms are not stated in public UI8 pages", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ui8.net/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current payout threshold, deductions and tax terms are not stated publicly", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ui8.net/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ui8.net/", "label": "Asset marketplace"}, {"url": "https://ui8.net/category/ui-kits", "label": "Product listings"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"UI8 is an active design-asset marketplace. Current official public pages reviewed show products, prices and author names but do not state author revenue share, required seller cost, exclusivity, payout minimum or deductions. No rate has been inferred from third-party claims.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Design asset marketplace", "note": "UI8 does not publish its seller terms.", "take": {"label": "Author share", "value": "Share not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "UI8", "groups": []}}, {"id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets--vecteezy-contributor","section_id":"graphics-illustrations-and-design-assets","name":"Vecteezy Contributor","summary":"License vectors, photos, and video through two contributor programs.","website_url":"https://www.vecteezy.com/contributors","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-vecteezy-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Pro uses subscriber-share royalties allocated among a subscriber’s Pro downloads; Free uses pay-per-download royalties.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vecteezy.com/contributors"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Pro splits Pro revenue 50/50. Free PPD pays $5 per 1,000 photo/vector downloads and $10 per 1,000 video downloads; partner licensing may use separate terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vecteezy.com/contributors"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Apply with 10 sample resources; the public contributor pages list no seller signup or listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vecteezy.com/contributors"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "No exclusivity is required. The current contributor page says uploads are non-exclusive; an older agreement copy also describes optional approved exclusivity.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vecteezy.com/contributors"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Contributors can set a payout minimum from $25 to $2,000.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/27469902019988-Minimum-Payment-Threshold"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.vecteezy.com/contributors", "label": "Programs and rates"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360024753291-PPD-Free-vs-PPD-Pro", "label": "Earning models"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/article_attachments/44252228513300", "label": "Agreement copy, Aug 2025"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/27469902019988-Minimum-Payment-Threshold", "label": "Payout minimum"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029388311-What-payment-methods-do-you-offer-for-contributors", "label": "Payment methods"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360039323612-Contributor-Tax-Information", "label": "Tax and withholding"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360025811171-How-Are-PPD-Pro-Earnings-Calculated", "label": "Pro revenue calculation"}, {"url": "https://eezycontributors.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/20574579753236-Vecteezy-Contributor-Agreement", "label": "Contributor Agreement, Dec 2025"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"USD. Pro splits net subscriber revenue; the agreement identifies tax, refunds, chargebacks, discounts, and processing deductions. Free PPD pays listed amounts per download. Payout methods, tax withholding, and conversion costs depend on country; selectable payout minimum is $25–$2,000.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Vectors, photos, video", "note": "Pro earnings are split across each subscriber’s downloads.", "take": {"label": "Shared Pro subscriber pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "10 sample files", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25 to $2,000", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Vecteezy", "groups": [{"label": "Pro", "rates": [{"note": "You share 50%", "label": "Pro subscription pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Free downloads", "rates": [{"note": "Photos and vectors", "label": "Per 1,000 free downloads", "value": "$5", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Per 1,000 video downloads", "value": "$10", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Per 1,000 free downloads", "value": "$5", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--altstore-pal","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"AltStore PAL","summary":"Distribute notarized apps using your own hosting and checkout.","website_url":"https://developer.altstore.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-altstore-io.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Apple Developer Program membership is US$99 per year; developers host their own app packages, so hosting costs are separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/programs/whats-included/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "AltStore PAL charges 0% commission.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.altstore.io/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Apple may charge a 5% Core Technology Commission on applicable Japan/Brazil distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/terms/apple-developer-program-license-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "EU alternative distribution has a 5% Apple Core Technology Commission from Oct 1, 2026 or the developer’s later acceptance of updated terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/apps-in-the-eu/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "AltStore PAL is available in the EU, Japan, and Brazil. AltStore Classic is a separate worldwide sideloading option.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.altstore.io/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.altstore.io/", "label": "AltStore fees and regions"}, {"url": "https://faq.altstore.io/developers/distribute-with-altstore-pal", "label": "Developer requirements"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/programs/whats-included/", "label": "Apple membership price"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/apps-in-the-eu/", "label": "Apple EU terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/app-distribution-in-japan", "label": "Apple Japan terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/app-distribution-in-brazil", "label": "Apple Brazil terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/terms/apple-developer-program-license-agreement/", "label": "Apple developer agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"AltStore charges no marketplace commission. Apple membership, self-hosting, and region-specific CTC are separate: 5% applies to eligible Japan/Brazil distribution, and EU alternative distribution moves to 5% on Oct 1, 2026.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Alternative iPhone store", "note": "AltStore takes nothing. Apple still charges its membership and a 5% fee in some regions.", "take": {"label": "AltStore commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$99/yr Apple membership", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Hosting", "value": "You host the app", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Regions", "value": "EU, Japan, Brazil", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "AltStore", "groups": [{"label": "AltStore", "rates": [{"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Apple Core Technology Commission", "rates": [{"note": "From 1 Oct 2026", "label": "EU", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"note": "Where it applies", "label": "Japan and Brazil", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Apple fee", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-4"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--amazon-appstore-fire-tablets-and-fire-tv","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Amazon Appstore (Fire OS and Vega OS)","summary":"Distribute apps for Fire OS and Vega OS devices.","website_url":"https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-amazon-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Developer account registration is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/en/apps-and-games"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard developer share is 70%. SBAP pays 80% on current-period SBAP Sales up to $1M when prior-year aggregate SBAP Sales are below $1M; associated developer accounts count toward eligibility. Standard share applies above the cap.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/ja/support/legal/da"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Mobile/TV in-app products, including subscriptions, use the same 70% developer royalty (30% Amazon share); Movies & TV in-app products pay 80% (20% share). Eligible Small Business Accelerator developers receive 80% on applicable app revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/ja/support/legal/da"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscription in-app products use the standard 70% developer royalty (30% Amazon share), or 80% for eligible Small Business Accelerator developers. Movie/TV in-app products have a separate 80% royalty.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/ja/support/legal/da"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Amazon Appstore supports Fire OS and Vega OS. Amazon ended new distribution on its separate Android mobile-device store on August 20, 2025.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.amazon.com/docs/apps-and-games/documentation.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.amazon.com/en/apps-and-games", "label": "Account and Appstore"}, {"url": "https://developer.amazon.com/ja/support/legal/da", "label": "Developer Services Agreement"}, {"url": "https://developer.amazon.com/apps-and-games/small-business-program", "label": "Small Business Accelerator"}, {"url": "https://developer.amazon.com/docs/apps-and-games/documentation.html", "label": "Fire OS and Vega OS"}, {"url": "https://developer.amazon.com/zh/apps-and-games/blogs/2025/02/upcoming-changes-to-amazon-appstore-for-android-devices-and-coins-program", "label": "Android store end date"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Royalty is based on marketplace list price; the lower SBAP share depends on program eligibility and prior-year revenue.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Apps for Fire devices", "note": "The lower 20% rate is for developers with under $1M in sales the year before.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "Same as apps", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Devices", "value": "Fire OS and Vega OS", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Amazon", "groups": [{"label": "Apps, in-app, and subscriptions", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Standard", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Prior-year sales under $1M", "label": "Small Business Accelerator", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Movies and TV in-app items", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Small business", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--apple-app-store","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Apple App Store","summary":"Sell apps and subscriptions through Apple’s store.","website_url":"https://developer.apple.com/app-store/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-apple-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "$99 per Apple Developer Program membership year; eligible organizations may qualify for a waiver.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/help/account/membership/fee-waivers"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard App Store commission is 30%; transactions covered by Small Business, Video, Mini Apps, or News programs are 15%. Storefront-specific terms can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/programs/whats-included/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard IAP is 30% (15% eligible). Japan/Brazil: IAP 21% (10% eligible) plus 5% processing; alternative payments 21% (10% eligible), out-of-app offers 15% (10% eligible). Mainland China iOS/iPadOS from Mar 15, 2026: 25% standard, 12% eligible.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/terms/apple-developer-program-license-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Auto-renewing subscriptions are 30% in year one, then 15%; Small Business is 15% from the start. Japan/Brazil eligible renewals can use a 10% commission; Apple IAP adds 5% processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/terms/apple-developer-program-license-agreement/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "EU alternative marketplaces and Web Distribution incur a 5% Core Technology Commission from Oct 1, 2026 or the developer’s later acceptance of updated terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/apps-in-the-eu/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.apple.com/programs/whats-included/", "label": "Membership and standard fees"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/app-store/small-business-program/", "label": "Small Business Program"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/app-store/subscriptions/", "label": "Subscriptions"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/apps-in-the-eu/", "label": "EU terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/app-distribution-in-japan", "label": "Japan terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/app-distribution-in-brazil", "label": "Brazil terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/terms/apple-developer-program-license-agreement/", "label": "Developer Program License Agreement"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/help/account/membership/fee-waivers", "label": "Membership fee waivers"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US reference: $99/year, 30% standard and 15% eligible. Japan, Brazil and mainland China have separate rates; EU alternative distribution fees change Oct 1, 2026 or when later terms are accepted.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Apps and subscriptions", "note": "US prices shown. China, Japan, Brazil, and the EU have their own rates.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "15% after year 1", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Regions", "value": "Some differ", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Apple", "groups": [{"label": "US and most regions", "rates": [{"label": "Standard commission", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Also Video, Mini Apps, and News", "label": "Small Business Program", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "30% in the first year", "label": "Subscriptions after year 1", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}, {"label": "China", "rates": [{"note": "From 15 Mar 2026", "label": "In-app, standard", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "From 15 Mar 2026", "label": "In-app, eligible developers", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "Japan and Brazil", "rates": [{"note": "+ 5% payment processing", "label": "In-app, standard", "value": "21%", "percent": 21, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "+ 5% payment processing", "label": "In-app, eligible developers", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "10% for eligible developers", "label": "Offers outside the app", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "EU", "rates": [{"note": "From 1 Oct 2026", "label": "Other app marketplaces and web", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-5"}]}], "second": {"label": "Small business", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--aptoide","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Aptoide","summary":"Alternative app distribution with fees tied to installation channel.","website_url":"https://www.aptoide.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-aptoide-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Automated listing is free for eligible free apps already on Google Play and without IAP. Manual submission, ownership review, or an app with IAP requires an active Aptoide Connect subscription at US$69/€69 per year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/app-submission-faqs"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Paid app downloads are not supported; Aptoide Connect accepts free base apps monetized through in-app products.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/app-submission-faqs"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "IAP share by source: Android partner installs give 25% jointly to Aptoide/channel; D2C gives Aptoide 10%; iOS gives Aptoide 20%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/revenue-share-model-overview"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscriptions use the same source-based Aptoide share as other in-app purchases; payment-provider fees are separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/revenue-share-model-overview"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android partner and D2C channels; iOS distribution is Aptoide in the EU and AppArena in Japan. Japan/Brazil external IAP must be reported to Apple and carries a separate 5% fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/ios-app-submission"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/app-submission-faqs", "label": "Listing and in-app rules"}, {"url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/subscription", "label": "Subscription plan"}, {"url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/revenue-share-model-overview", "label": "Revenue share"}, {"url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/ios-app-submission", "label": "EU and Japan stores"}, {"url": "https://docs.connect.aptoide.com/docs/onboarding-guide-ios", "label": "iOS regions"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/apps-in-the-eu/", "label": "Apple EU terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/app-distribution-in-japan", "label": "Apple Japan terms"}, {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/support/app-distribution-in-brazil", "label": "Apple Brazil terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"IAP share depends on Android install channel or iOS marketplace; setup cost depends on app eligibility.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Alternative Android and iOS store", "note": "Aptoide sells in-app items, not paid apps. Its share depends on where the app was installed.", "take": {"label": "In-app, by install source", "value": "10–25%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$69/yr for some apps", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Paid apps", "value": "Not offered", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payment fees", "value": "Extra", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Aptoide", "groups": [{"label": "In-app purchases and subscriptions", "rates": [{"note": "Shared with the partner", "label": "Android partner installs", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Android direct installs", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "iOS", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "iOS", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--epic-games-store-for-mobile","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Epic Games Store for mobile","summary":"Distribute mobile games through Epic’s store, with fees based on Epic-processed sales.","website_url":"https://store.epicgames.com/en-US/mobile","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/store-epicgames-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "US$100 submission fee per product plus local tax. It is nonrefundable but recouped in a payment after the product earns at least US$1,000 from Epic Store purchases and in-game purchases through Epic Payment Platform.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/docs/epic-games-store/publishing-tools/organization-management/manage-org?lang=en-US&slug=dev-portal%2Corganization-management"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Epic’s share is 0% up to US$1M revenue per title per calendar year, then 12%. PC and mobile revenue combine for the title; the threshold resets January 1.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://store.epicgames.com/distribution/revenue-programs/revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "The 0%/12% schedule applies to titles using Epic’s payment system. Epic’s public schedule does not state a separate rate for transactions handled only by another provider.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://store.epicgames.com/distribution/revenue-programs/revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Epic publishes no separate mobile subscription rate; its public revenue schedule does not specify subscriptions as a distinct fee class.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://store.epicgames.com/distribution/revenue-programs/revenue-share"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android worldwide except legally restricted markets; third-party iPhone/iPad listings are EU-only. Epic’s own iOS store app is also in Japan and Brazil.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://store.epicgames.com/mobile?lang=en-US"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dev.epicgames.com/docs/epic-games-store/publishing-tools/organization-management/manage-org?lang=en-US&slug=dev-portal%2Corganization-management", "label": "Per-game fee"}, {"url": "https://store.epicgames.com/distribution/revenue-programs/revenue-share", "label": "Revenue share"}, {"url": "https://store.epicgames.com/mobile?lang=en-US", "label": "Mobile store"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Epic’s share is title-based per calendar year; the per-product submission fee and payment route also matter.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Mobile games", "note": "The $1M limit counts PC and mobile sales of one game together and resets each January.", "take": {"label": "First $1M a year", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$100 per game", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Applies to", "value": "Epic payments", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "No separate rate", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Epic", "groups": [{"label": "Sales through Epic payments", "rates": [{"note": "PC and mobile combined", "label": "First $1M per game a year", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Above $1M per game a year", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above $1M a year", "value": "12%", "percent": 12, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--google-play","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Google Play","summary":"Distribute Android apps with store billing and subscriptions.","website_url":"https://play.google.com/console/about/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/play-google-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "US$25 one-time Play Console registration fee; verification and account requirements apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/6112435?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Until the new model reaches a region, the legacy schedule remains 15% on the first US$1M in annual earnings and 30% above that.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/112622?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "New-model service fees for paid apps/games and nonrecurring purchases are 10–20% for new installs and 10–25% for existing installs, by tier/program. Subscriptions are 10%. Play Billing adds 5% in the US, UK, and EEA; external-link schedules differ by tier, with further program details forthcoming.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/16954621?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscriptions are 10% under the new model, plus the billing fee where applicable; markets before rollout stay on the prior 15% subscription fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/112622?hl=en"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android. Rollout: US/UK/EEA June 30, 2026; Australia/Japan September 30, 2026; South Korea December 31, 2026; rest of world September 30, 2027. The rollout date defines a new install.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/16954621?hl=en"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/6112435?hl=en", "label": "Registration fee"}, {"url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/16954621?hl=en", "label": "New fee model and rollout"}, {"url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/112622?hl=en", "label": "Fees by market"}, {"url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/14372887?hl=en", "label": "External offers fees"}, {"url": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/16470497?hl=en", "label": "US external links fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Fees vary by install cohort, earnings tier, program, billing method, and market rollout date.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Android apps and games", "note": "Rates depend on install date, tier, and region. The new model reached the US, UK, and EEA on 30 Jun 2026.", "take": {"label": "New installs", "value": "10–20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$25 once", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Billing fee", "value": "+ 5% in US, UK, EEA", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "New rates", "value": "By region, until 2027", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Google", "groups": [{"label": "US, UK, and EEA", "rates": [{"note": "By tier or program", "label": "Paid apps and in-app, new installs", "value": "10–20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "By tier or program", "label": "Paid apps and in-app, existing installs", "value": "10–25%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"note": "US, UK, and EEA", "label": "Google Play billing fee", "value": "+ 5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "Regions still on the old model", "rates": [{"label": "First $1M a year", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Above $1M a year", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}], "second": {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-4"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--huawei-appgallery","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Huawei AppGallery","summary":"Distribute Android apps to Huawei devices.","website_url":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/appgallery/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/huawei-appgallery.svg","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "No general AppGallery developer signup or annual listing price found in Huawei’s public developer and merchant terms; paid services may have separate charges.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/app/agc-help-getstarted-0000001100316670"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "The currently linked public AppGallery agreement template (version dated June 30, 2020) lists paid-download commission at 20% for Education apps and 30% for Games and other listed categories. Taxes, channel deductions, and refunds are deducted first; seller-specific terms can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://terms-dre.platform.hicloud.com/agreementservice/developer/getAgreementTemplate?agrType=1005&country=ove&language=en_us&version=2020063002"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "The same public template lists in-app digital content, including subscriptions, at 20% for Education apps, 50% for Games in mainland China, and 30% for Games elsewhere and other listed categories; deductions and seller terms can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://terms-dre.platform.hicloud.com/agreementservice/developer/getAgreementTemplate?agrType=1005&country=ove&language=en_us&version=2020063002"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Subscriptions are included in the agreement’s in-app purchase schedule: 20% Education, 50% mainland-China Games, and 30% other listed categories/markets. Confirm the current seller-specific agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://terms-dre.platform.hicloud.com/agreementservice/developer/getAgreementTemplate?agrType=1005&country=ove&language=en_us&version=2020063002"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android apps for Huawei devices; publishers choose supported regions. Paid sales require Huawei Merchant Service enrollment and an agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/appgallery/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/app/agc-help-getstarted-0000001100316670", "label": "Registration and merchant setup"}, {"url": "https://terms-dre.platform.hicloud.com/agreementservice/developer/getAgreementTemplate?agrType=1005&country=ove&language=en_us&version=2020063002", "label": "2020 fee agreement"}, {"url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/appgallery/", "label": "Distribution and regions"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The published fee schedule is a 2020 agreement template; confirm current seller terms and regional deductions.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Apps for Huawei devices", "note": "The only public rates are from a 2020 agreement. Ask Huawei for your current terms.", "take": {"label": "Public template from 2020", "value": "Seller-specific terms", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Games in China", "value": "Up to 50%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Paid sales", "value": "Needs an agreement", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Huawei", "groups": [{"label": "2020 public agreement", "rates": [{"label": "Education apps, paid downloads", "value": "20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Games and other apps, paid downloads", "value": "30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Education apps, in-app", "value": "20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Games in mainland China, in-app", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Games elsewhere and other apps, in-app", "value": "30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "2020 public terms", "value": "20–50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--one-store","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"ONE store","summary":"Android app distribution with store or developer billing.","website_url":"https://dev.onestore.co.kr/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/dev-onestore-co-kr.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "ONEstore’s public developer pages do not state a general signup or annual listing price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onestorecorp.com/en/about/corp/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Published content fee is 20%; eligible SMEs and individual developers with monthly transaction volume at or below US$5,000 pay 10%. Paid-download terms are not itemized separately.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onestorecorp.com/news/presskit/2026/2026-02-02.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "ONEstore in-app purchases: 20%, or 10% for eligible developers at or below US$5,000 monthly volume. The published media-app fee is 6%; supported external payment is 5%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onestorecorp.com/en/about/corp/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Published subscription fee is 10% (90:10 split). Supported external payment has a separate 5% fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onestorecorp.com/en/about/corp/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android. Flagship ONEstore is Korea-focused; ONE Global is separate, with expansion to 120+ countries planned.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.onestorecorp.com/about/global/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://onestorecorp.com/en/about/corp/", "label": "Store fees"}, {"url": "https://onestorecorp.com/news/presskit/2026/2026-02-02.html", "label": "Small developer rate"}, {"url": "https://onestorecorp.com/en/about/osc/", "label": "Korea and global stores"}, {"url": "https://www.onestorecorp.com/en/sv/foreco/", "label": "Checkout and payment fees"}, {"url": "https://www.onestorecorp.com/about/global/", "label": "ONE Global plan"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Korea-focused ONEstore fees vary by content type, payment route, and monthly transaction volume; ONE Global is separate.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Android apps in Korea", "note": "Rates are for ONE store in Korea. ONE Global is a separate store.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "10%", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Market", "value": "Mainly Korea", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "ONE store", "groups": [{"label": "Korea", "rates": [{"label": "Standard", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Up to $5,000 a month", "label": "Small developers", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Media apps", "value": "6%", "percent": 6, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}, {"label": "Other payment options", "rates": [{"label": "Supported external payment", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Small developers", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--rustore","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"RuStore","summary":"Android app distribution and in-app payments focused on Russia.","website_url":"https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-rustore-ru.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "RuStore states that publishing and hosting free or paid apps is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/publishing-and-verifying-apps"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Nonresident companies pay 15% on paid apps; additional Russian tax may be withheld when RuStore must act as tax agent.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/monetization/monetization-foreign-company"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Nonresident companies pay 15% on in-app purchases; additional Russian tax may be withheld when RuStore must act as tax agent.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/monetization/monetization-foreign-company"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Nonresident companies pay 15% on subscriptions; additional Russian tax may be withheld when RuStore must act as tax agent.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/monetization/monetization-foreign-company"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android. Foreign-company monetization requires a request, moderator approval, and a signed additional agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/monetization/monetization-foreign-company"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/publishing-and-verifying-apps", "label": "Free publishing"}, {"url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/developers/monetization/monetization-foreign-company", "label": "Fees for foreign companies"}, {"url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/en/legal/developers-agreement", "label": "Developer agreement"}, {"url": "https://www.rustore.ru/help/developers/publishing-and-verifying-apps/app-publication/new-version-app/paid-app", "label": "Paid apps"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The 15% schedule is for approved nonresident companies; Russian tax may also be withheld.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Android apps in Russia", "note": "Rates are for companies outside Russia. Russian tax may also be taken.", "take": {"label": "Companies outside Russia", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free to publish", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Tax", "value": "Russian tax may apply", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Selling", "value": "Needs approval", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "RuStore", "groups": [{"label": "Companies outside Russia", "rates": [{"label": "Paid apps", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "In-app purchases", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}]}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--samsung-galaxy-store","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Samsung Galaxy Store","summary":"Sell apps and in-app content to Samsung device owners.","website_url":"https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/overview.html","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/developer-samsung-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No sign-up or annual publishing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/faq.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Samsung Checkout paid-app sales: Samsung receives 20% of net sales proceeds after customary tax and other deductions. Custom agreements can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/faq.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Samsung Checkout in-app items: Samsung receives 20% of net sales proceeds after customary tax and other deductions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/faq.html"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscription services: developer share is 85% of net sales proceeds, so Samsung’s share is 15%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/faq.html"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Galaxy Store distributes Android apps to Samsung Galaxy phones and tablets; seller publishing is managed in Seller Portal.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/faq.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.samsung.com/galaxy-store/faq.html", "label": "Pricing and seller terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Samsung Checkout shares apply to net proceeds after customary taxes and deductions; custom agreements can differ.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Apps for Galaxy devices", "note": "Samsung takes its share from net sales, after tax. Custom deals can differ.", "take": {"label": "Apps and in-app", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free to publish", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Charged on", "value": "Net sales, after tax", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "In-app items", "value": "20%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Samsung", "groups": [{"label": "Samsung Checkout", "rates": [{"label": "Paid apps", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "In-app items", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Subscriptions", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}], "second": {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-4"}}}, {"id":"mobile-app-stores--skich-store","section_id":"mobile-app-stores","name":"Skich Store","summary":"Alternative mobile game store with developer onboarding.","website_url":"https://skich.app/store","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/skich-app.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "No public developer page lists an onboarding or annual listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://skich.app/for-developers"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "unverified", "value": "Developer commission is in the unreadable agreement; the 15% claim is unverified.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.skich.store/Skich_DistributionAgreement.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "unverified", "value": "In-app purchase rate is not verifiable from readable official terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.skich.store/Skich_DistributionAgreement.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "unverified", "value": "Subscription rate is not verifiable from readable official terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.skich.store/Skich_DistributionAgreement.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Android worldwide; iOS marketplace currently live in Europe. Developer inquiry and Skich’s Distribution Agreement are required.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://skich.app/for-developers"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://developer.skich.store/Skich_DistributionAgreement.pdf", "label": "Distribution agreement (PDF)"}, {"url": "https://skich.app/for-developers", "label": "Developer onboarding"}, {"url": "https://skich.app/store", "label": "Store availability"}, {"url": "https://dev.skich.io/trust-safety", "label": "Trust and safety"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current developer fee terms are in the Distribution Agreement, but its PDF link is unreadable. Accessible developer pages do not publish the fee schedule.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Alternative game store", "note": "Fee terms are in an agreement file we could not read. Ask Skich for current terms.", "take": {"label": "Agreement inaccessible", "value": "Fee not confirmed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Agreement", "value": "Required", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Platforms", "value": "Android; iOS in Europe", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Skich", "groups": []}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--amuse","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Amuse","summary":"Distribute unlimited music through annual artist plans.","website_url":"https://www.amuse.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-amuse-io.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Music distribution to streaming stores and social platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.amuse.io/en/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist $23.99/year for 1 artist; Artist Plus $39.99/year for 2; Professional $59.99/year for 3 artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.amuse.io/en/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Active paid plans keep 100% of standard distribution royalties. When a subscription expires or is cancelled, existing releases stay online with a 25% royalty commission; no new releases can be uploaded.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.amuse.io/en/articles/107705-what-happens-if-i-cancel-my-subscription"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Artist plan Content ID keeps 15%; Artist Plus and Professional keep 100%. Non-subscriber split payouts carry 15%. Optional fees: cover license $14.99, mastering $5.99/track, Store Sync $9.99/release on Artist. Withdrawal fees are usually $1–$8 and can reach $15, varying by country and method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.amuse.io/en/articles/107766-fees-processing-times-and-payment-statuses"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "All plans allow unlimited releases. The Artist plan covers one artist.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.amuse.io/en/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.amuse.io/en/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://support.amuse.io/en/articles/107705-what-happens-if-i-cancel-my-subscription", "label": "Cancellation commission"}, {"url": "https://support.amuse.io/en/articles/107757-ugc-matching-content-id-social-media-monetization", "label": "Content ID"}, {"url": "https://support.amuse.io/en/articles/107766-fees-processing-times-and-payment-statuses", "label": "Payout fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"100% standard royalties on active paid plans; 25% commission after cancellation.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Active paid subscription; a 25% royalty commission applies after cancellation or expiry","sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Withdrawal fees are usually $1 to $8, depending on country and method.", "take": {"label": "Active paid plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "$23.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Content ID", "value": "15% on Artist plan", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Amuse", "groups": [{"label": "Amuse", "rates": [{"label": "Active paid plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "And no new uploads", "label": "After plan ends", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "After plan ends", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--awal","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"AWAL","summary":"Selected artists distribute recordings under a revenue-sharing agreement.","website_url":"https://www.awal.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-awal-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital distribution for selected artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apply.awal.com/submit-form/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "No fixed signup or annual distribution price is published; commercial terms are provided through an individual agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apply.awal.com/submit-form/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "AWAL pays artists 85% of gross digital-distribution receipts it receives (15% service share).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apply.awal.com/submit-form/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Monthly accountings are available 45 days after month-end; balances below £50 roll forward. Contractual costs, taxes, and third-party adjustments may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apply.awal.com/submit-form/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Application and acceptance are required; AWAL works with a selected group of artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://apply.awal.com/submit-form/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://apply.awal.com/submit-form/", "label": "Application and agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Selected artists keep 85% of gross distribution receipts under individual terms.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"gross digital-distribution receipts received by AWAL","sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Selective distribution", "note": "Balances under £50 roll over to the next month.", "take": {"label": "Gross digital receipts", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Access", "value": "Selected artists", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Fee", "value": "Individual agreement", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Statements", "value": "45 days after month", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "AWAL", "groups": [{"label": "AWAL", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Gross digital receipts", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--bandcamp","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Bandcamp","summary":"Sell digital music and merchandise directly to fans.","website_url":"https://bandcamp.com/artists","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/bandcamp-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct-to-fan sales of digital music, physical merchandise, and live-stream tickets.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://bandcamp.com/artists"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist account: free. Bandcamp Pro: $10/month. Label accounts start at $20/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://bandcamp.com/pro"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital sales: 15%, dropping to 10% after reaching $5,000 in sales and while at least $5,000 is sold in the trailing 12 months. Physical goods: 10%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://get.bandcamp.help/en/articles/15263193-what-are-bandcamp-s-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Processor fees are usually 4%–6%. PayPal payouts are normally sent 24–48 hours after a sale, with monthly payouts also available. Collection-society amounts may apply based on the buyer’s location.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://get.bandcamp.help/en/articles/15263080-how-do-i-get-paid-on-bandcamp-and-how-often"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "The official artist and pricing pages reviewed do not list a total release-count limit.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://bandcamp.com/pro"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://bandcamp.com/artists", "label": "Sales and fees"}, {"url": "https://bandcamp.com/pro", "label": "Plan prices"}, {"url": "https://get.bandcamp.help/en/articles/15263193-what-are-bandcamp-s-fees", "label": "Fee schedule"}, {"url": "https://get.bandcamp.help/en/articles/15263080-how-do-i-get-paid-on-bandcamp-and-how-often", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Digital fee: 15%, falling to 10% after qualifying $5,000 trailing-12-month sales; physical fee is 10%.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Digital sales before the $5,000 trailing-year threshold; physical goods are 10%","sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Direct-to-fan music", "note": "Bandcamp Pro is $10 a month. Label accounts start at $20 a month.", "take": {"label": "Digital sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "Usually 4–6%", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "24 to 48 hours", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Bandcamp", "groups": [{"label": "Bandcamp", "rates": [{"label": "Digital sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "While you sell $5,000 a year", "label": "After $5,000", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Physical goods", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "After $5,000", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--cd-baby","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"CD Baby","summary":"Distribute music with a one-time fee for each release.","website_url":"https://cdbaby.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/cdbaby-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital music distribution with optional social-video monetization, sync, and publishing-royalty collection.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/213125406-How-much-does-CD-Baby-cost"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "One-time fee per release: $9.99 single or $14.99 album; no account subscription. Optional CD Baby Boost is $39.99/release; FastForward is $29.99 for priority support and delivery for one year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/213125406-How-much-does-CD-Baby-cost"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "CD Baby keeps 9% of download, streaming, and SoundExchange revenue; 15% of MLC revenue; 30% of social-video revenue received by CD Baby; and 40% of sync-placement revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/213125406-How-much-does-CD-Baby-cost"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Weekly payouts after a chosen Pay Point; payment-method minimums are $1 ACH/EFT, $3 local-bank rails, and $20 SWIFT. Fees: PayPal $2.50, non-US local-currency bank $3, wires $10–$25, legacy check $5; default withholding is 24% US or 30% non-US without valid tax info.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/211074743-How-do-I-get-paid-from-CD-Baby"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Pay once per release; CD Baby does not charge an annual artist-account or distribution subscription fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/213125406-How-much-does-CD-Baby-cost"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/213125406-How-much-does-CD-Baby-cost", "label": "Release prices and commission"}, {"url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/44604712062349-What-is-Social-Video-Monetization", "label": "Social video and payouts"}, {"url": "https://support.cdbaby.com/hc/en-us/articles/211074743-How-do-I-get-paid-from-CD-Baby", "label": "Payouts and tax"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"One-time release fees plus separate cuts by revenue type (9% standard, 15% MLC, 30% social video, 40% sync).","fee_percent":9,"fee_basis":"Download, streaming, and SoundExchange revenue; separate rates apply to MLC, social video, and sync","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "You pay once per release. Albums cost $14.99.", "take": {"label": "Stores and streaming", "value": "9%", "percent": 9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Per release", "value": "$9.99 single, once", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Account fee", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Weekly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "CD Baby", "groups": [{"label": "CD Baby", "rates": [{"label": "Stores and streaming", "value": "9%", "percent": 9, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "MLC royalties", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Social video", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sync placements", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Social video", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--distrokid","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"DistroKid","summary":"Distribute music to streaming and download stores.","website_url":"https://distrokid.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/distrokid-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Distributes music to streaming and download services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://distrokid.com/product/distrokid/plans-and-pricing-2"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "US annual plans: Musician $24.99 (1 artist), Musician Plus $44.99 (2 artists), and Ultimate $89.99 (5+ artists).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://distrokid.com/product/distrokid/plans-and-pricing-2"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "DistroKid takes 0% of standard store and streaming royalties. Optional Social Media Pack monetization keeps 20% of UGC revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/360013649253-How-Much-of-My-Earnings-Does-DistroKid-Keep"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Social Media Pack costs $4.95 per single or $14.95 per album, per year, plus its 20% UGC share. Withdrawal fees vary by route ($1.12–$29.21), the minimum is $6, and FX fees can reach 3%; tax withholding may also apply. Other paid extras include a $0.99/song/year Discovery Pack, $7.95/album/year Store Maximizer, and $12/year cover licensing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/360013648853-Is-There-a-Fee-When-I-Withdraw-My-Earnings"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Plans allow unlimited song uploads; Musician covers one artist, Musician Plus two, and Ultimate 5–100 artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/6184398375571-Which-Features-are-Available-for-each-Plan"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://distrokid.com/product/distrokid/plans-and-pricing-2", "label": "US pricing"}, {"url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/6184398375571-Which-Features-are-Available-for-each-Plan", "label": "Plan limits"}, {"url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/360013649253-How-Much-of-My-Earnings-Does-DistroKid-Keep", "label": "Royalty share and Social Pack"}, {"url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/360013534274-What-Are-Album-Extras", "label": "Release extras"}, {"url": "https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/360013648853-Is-There-a-Fee-When-I-Withdraw-My-Earnings", "label": "Withdrawal fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"0% of standard store royalties; Social Media Pack takes 20% plus its annual fee.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Standard store and streaming royalties; optional Social Media Pack has a separate 20% share","sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Extras like Store Maximizer and Discovery Pack cost more and are optional.", "take": {"label": "Stores and streaming", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "$24.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$6", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "DistroKid", "groups": [{"label": "DistroKid", "rates": [{"label": "Stores and streaming", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "Plus $4.95 per single each year", "label": "Social Media Pack", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Social Media Pack", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--ditto-music","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Ditto Music","summary":"Distribute unlimited music with an annual artist plan.","website_url":"https://dittomusic.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/dittomusic-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Distributes music to streaming, download, and social platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dittomusic.com/en/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter $19/year for 1 artist; Pro $59/year for 2; Labels $109/year for up to 5 artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dittomusic.com/en/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Artists keep 100% of streaming and download royalties. Pro and Labels plans take 15% of publishing and sync royalties.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dittomusic.com/en/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdraw by bank transfer, PayPal, or Payoneer. The withdrawal minimum is £25 (£30 for SWIFT); UK, US, and most European bank withdrawals cost £0.75. Other-region fees vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.dittomusic.com/en/articles/4424698-how-do-i-withdraw-royalties"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "All plans allow unlimited releases. Starter covers one artist; higher plans allow more artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dittomusic.com/en/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dittomusic.com/en/pricing", "label": "Plans and royalties"}, {"url": "https://support.dittomusic.com/en/articles/4424698-how-do-i-withdraw-royalties", "label": "Payouts and fees"}, {"url": "https://support.dittomusic.com/en/articles/4283907-what-is-the-minimum-amount-i-can-withdraw", "label": "Minimum payout"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"0% on streaming/downloads; Pro and Labels take 15% of publishing/sync.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Streaming and download royalties; Pro/Labels publishing and sync administration has a 15% fee","sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "UK, US, and most European bank withdrawals cost £0.75.", "take": {"label": "Streaming and downloads", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "$19 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "£25", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Ditto", "groups": [{"label": "Ditto", "rates": [{"label": "Streaming and downloads", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "Pro and Labels plans", "label": "Publishing and sync", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Publishing and sync", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--horus-music","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Horus Music","summary":"Distribute unlimited music by subscription or pay per release.","website_url":"https://www.horusmusic.global/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-horusmusic-global.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital music distribution", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/music-distribution/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited Artist plan: £20/year; Label from £30/year. Pay per release: single £25, EP £35, album £45.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard distribution pays artists 100% of royalties. Invite-only Artist & Label Services use an 80/20 split.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "March 2026 terms for accounts outside the UK list a £10 payout minimum and £3 fee per payment. That article says future payments use Western Union only, while current payment terms and the January 2026 FAQ list Convera or PayPal. UK fees and minimum are not published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/horus-music-india-and-western-union/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist plans cover unlimited singles, EPs, and albums; a pay-per-release option is also offered.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/pricing/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/pricing/", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/music-distribution/", "label": "Distribution terms"}, {"url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/payment-terms/", "label": "Payment terms"}, {"url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/horus-music-india-and-western-union/", "label": "March 2026 payout update"}, {"url": "https://www.horusmusic.global/faq/how-do-you-pay-me-my-royalties/", "label": "January 2026 FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"GBP. Artist subscriptions cover unlimited releases; pay-per-release is also offered. Current FAQ lists Convera or PayPal and a £10 minimum outside the UK; the March 2026 page lists a £3 fee and Western Union, conflicting with newer terms. UK minimum and fees are not published.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Standard artist distribution royalty fee","sort_order":18,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Payouts outside the UK have a £10 minimum and a £3 fee.", "take": {"label": "Standard distribution", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Artist plan", "value": "£20 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Per single", "value": "£25", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Horus Music", "groups": [{"label": "Horus Music", "rates": [{"label": "Standard distribution", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Invite-only services", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Invite-only services", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--landr-distribution","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"LANDR Distribution","summary":"Distribute unlimited releases with an annual plan.","website_url":"https://www.landr.com/music-distribution/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-landr-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital distribution to 150+ streaming, social, and download services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.landr.com/digital-distribution"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution Basic is $24/year and Pro is $45/year in USD/CAD. LANDR Studio includes unlimited distribution from $8.25/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.landr.com/hc/en-us/articles/31618416509975-How-much-does-it-cost-to-distribute-music-with-LANDR"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscribers to a Distribution plan keep 100% of store net income. Free or à-la-carte releases carry a 15% commission. For cancelled subscriptions whose releases remain live, current terms allow the greater of 15% of monthly net royalties or a $4 monthly maintenance fee, after 30 days’ written notice; resubscribing stops that charge.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.landr.com/terms-of-service"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Content ID keeps 20% for Premium subscribers and 30% for non-Premium users. Tipalti withdrawal fees and minimums vary: listed fees range from $1.55 to $40.24, with $1–$15 minimums by method; processing takes 1–7 business days.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.landr.com/hc/en-us/articles/13294162065175-How-do-I-withdraw-my-earnings-from-LANDR"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution subscriptions include unlimited releases; music can remain online after cancellation under the fees in LANDR’s current terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.landr.com/digital-distribution"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.landr.com/hc/en-us/articles/31618416509975-How-much-does-it-cost-to-distribute-music-with-LANDR", "label": "Plan prices"}, {"url": "https://www.landr.com/terms-of-service", "label": "Royalty and Content ID"}, {"url": "https://support.landr.com/hc/en-us/articles/13294162065175-How-do-I-withdraw-my-earnings-from-LANDR", "label": "Withdrawal fees"}, {"url": "https://www.landr.com/digital-distribution", "label": "Release limits"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Paid plans keep 100% of store net; free/à-la-carte takes 15%; canceled releases may incur the greater of 15% or $4/month.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Active paid Distribution subscription; other commission and post-cancellation maintenance terms apply","sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "If you cancel, LANDR can charge 15% of royalties or $4 a month to keep your music online.", "take": {"label": "Paid plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "$24 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Content ID", "value": "20–30%", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "LANDR", "groups": [{"label": "LANDR", "rates": [{"label": "Paid plan", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "Or single paid releases", "label": "Free releases", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "After cancelling", "rates": [{"note": "Whichever is higher", "label": "Or $4 a month", "value": "15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Free releases", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--onerpm","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"ONErpm","summary":"Music and video distribution paid from generated revenue.","website_url":"https://onerpm.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/onerpm-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Emerging is self-service distribution; higher service tiers are selective and negotiated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onerpm.com/how-it-works/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "No registration, annual, or upload fees for Emerging.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onerpm.com/how-it-works/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Current FAQ says creators receive 85% on downloads, 70% on YouTube and 50% on other video. The current standard agreement says 80% of net digital-distribution receipts, 70% on YouTube and 50% on other video; the download share differs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onerpm.com/onerpm-answers-common-questions/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "A global Tipalti guide lists PayPal availability, a $200 USD minimum, $5 e-check/$26 wire fees and possible 3% FX. A 2025 Brazil guide says Tipalti became the only method from May 2025 with a $50 minimum. Current global route and minimum are unclear.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dashboard.onerpm.com/assets/files/EN_Tipalti_new_payment_solution_Artist_Guide.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Emerging allows unlimited audio and video uploads; no registration, annual, or upload fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://onerpm.com/how-it-works/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://onerpm.com/how-it-works/", "label": "Tiers and upload fees"}, {"url": "https://onerpm.com/onerpm-answers-common-questions/", "label": "Royalty shares"}, {"url": "https://dashboard.onerpm.com/assets/files/EN_Tipalti_new_payment_solution_Artist_Guide.pdf", "label": "Tipalti guide"}, {"url": "https://blog.onerpm.com/pt/dicas-e-truques/tipalti-onerpm/", "label": "Brazil Tipalti guide"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The current FAQ and standard distribution agreement differ on download-store share: 85% vs 80% of net receipts. YouTube/video rates align at 70%/50%. Payout routes and minimums also vary by source and country.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Music and video distribution", "note": "ONErpm’s FAQ and agreement give different shares for downloads.", "take": {"label": "Sources disagree", "value": "15–20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50 to $200", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "ONErpm", "groups": [{"label": "Emerging", "rates": [{"label": "Downloads, FAQ", "value": "15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Digital, agreement", "value": "20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "YouTube", "value": "30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Other video", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "YouTube", "value": "30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--record-union","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Record Union","summary":"Pay per release to reach selected or worldwide music stores.","website_url":"https://www.recordunion.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-recordunion-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital music distribution to selected global music services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.recordunion.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Top Dog: $14/year for 1–2 tracks, $17 for 3–5, $20 for 6–12, then $1.50 per added track/year (up to 99). World Domination: $19/$24/$29 for those same tiers, then $1.50 per added track/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.recordunion.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist share can be selected from 85% to 92.5% of gross receipts (7.5% to 15% service share).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.recordunion.com/terms-and-conditions/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Optional UPC is $10; the Royalty Upgrade price is not published. Royalties are paid by PayPal only; seller may also pay bank, currency-conversion, and transfer costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.recordunion.com/terms-and-conditions/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Top Dog covers seven services; World Domination covers 20+. Annual price scales with track count and store coverage.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.recordunion.com/pricing/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.recordunion.com/pricing/", "label": "Plans and pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.recordunion.com/terms-and-conditions/", "label": "Royalty and payment terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Artist selects an 85–92.5% gross-receipts share; annual price scales by track count/store plan.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":17,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "The price of the royalty upgrade is not published.", "take": {"label": "Standard", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "From $14 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Stores", "value": "7 or 20+ services", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "PayPal only", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Record Union", "groups": [{"label": "Record Union", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 85%", "label": "Standard", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"note": "You keep 92.5%", "label": "Royalty upgrade", "value": "7.5%", "percent": 7.5, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Royalty upgrade", "value": "7.5%", "percent": 7.5, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--reverbnation","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"ReverbNation","summary":"Music distribution included in a paid artist membership.","website_url":"https://www.reverbnation.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-reverbnation-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Music distribution with artist-promotion tools.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/distribution"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Single distribution is $9.95/year; Album is $19.95 in year one then $49.95/year. Premium is currently $99.75/year (50% off the $199.50 annual price).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Current terms pay 100% while subscribed to Distribution; 80% if not subscribed when ReverbNation receives the sales proceeds.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout fees range from $0.50 plus percentage to $26 by route; currency conversion may add up to 3%. Minimum payout is $5 after fees/tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.reverbnation.com/hc/en-us/articles/50929302039065-Getting-Paid-on-ReverbNation"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Single/Album packages cover one release each; Premium includes unlimited releases.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/distribution"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/pricing", "label": "Premium pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/distribution", "label": "Prices and packages"}, {"url": "https://www.reverbnation.com/terms", "label": "Distribution terms"}, {"url": "https://help.reverbnation.com/hc/en-us/articles/50929302039065-Getting-Paid-on-ReverbNation", "label": "Payout fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"100% while Distribution is active; 80% if the subscription is inactive when proceeds arrive.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"distribution proceeds while subscribed to the Distribution service","sort_order":16,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Premium includes unlimited releases. The current price is a 50% discount.", "take": {"label": "While subscribed", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Single", "value": "$9.95 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Premium", "value": "$99.75 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$5", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "ReverbNation", "groups": [{"label": "ReverbNation", "rates": [{"label": "While subscribed", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Not subscribed", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Not subscribed", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--routenote","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"RouteNote","summary":"Distribute music free or pay per release to keep more royalties.","website_url":"https://routenote.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/routenote-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Distributes music to streaming and download stores, with an optional YouTube Content ID route.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-much-does-routenote-cost/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free: $0. Premium per release: $10 single (1 track), $20 EP (2–6), $30 album (7–18), or $45 extended album (19+); then $9.99 yearly per release from year two.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-much-does-routenote-cost/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free keeps 85% of net revenue (15% RouteNote share); Premium keeps 100% of streaming and download revenue.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/what-percentage-does-routenote-take/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal or bank transfer through Wise/Payoneer. Payments run monthly from the 15th–20th when earnings reach $50. Transaction, PayPal, and currency-conversion fees vary; there is no single fixed payout fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-can-i-receive-payment-what-are-the-payment-options/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Premium price bands are based on release size: 1, 2–6, 7–18, or 19+ tracks. Uploads can be completed in more than one session.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-much-does-routenote-cost/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-much-does-routenote-cost/", "label": "Prices and renewals"}, {"url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/what-percentage-does-routenote-take/", "label": "Artist shares"}, {"url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-can-i-monetise-with-youtube-through-routenote/", "label": "Content ID share"}, {"url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/are-there-any-transaction-fees/", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://support.routenote.com/kb-article/how-can-i-receive-payment-what-are-the-payment-options/", "label": "Payout methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Free pays 85%; Premium is per release/annual renewal and pays 100%.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Free distribution; Premium pays an upfront fee and annual release renewal to retain 100%","sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Premium costs more for longer releases and renews yearly from year two.", "take": {"label": "Free plan", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Premium", "value": "$10 to $45 a release", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Renewal", "value": "$9.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "RouteNote", "groups": [{"label": "RouteNote", "rates": [{"label": "Free plan", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Premium", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Premium", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--soundcloud-for-artists","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"SoundCloud for Artists","summary":"Distribute music and monetize SoundCloud listening.","website_url":"https://artists.soundcloud.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/artists-soundcloud-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist plans include distribution to stores and SoundCloud monetization.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundcloud.com/getstarted/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist is $39/year; Artist Pro is $99/year (monthly equivalents $3.25 and $8.25 billed annually).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundcloud.com/getstarted/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Artists receive 100% of SoundCloud and external-platform distribution earnings.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.soundcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/42552179413787-SoundCloud-for-Artists-Payout-Fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout processing is $0.50 US ACH, $1 Canada EFT, $3.75 for PayPal and listed regional transfers, $10 SWIFT, or $25 SWIFT in China/Ukraine.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.soundcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/42552179413787-SoundCloud-for-Artists-Payout-Fees"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist: two distributed/monetized tracks per month. Artist Pro: unlimited distribution and monetization.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundcloud.com/getstarted/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://soundcloud.com/getstarted/pricing", "label": "Plan comparison"}, {"url": "https://help.soundcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/42552179413787-SoundCloud-for-Artists-Payout-Fees", "label": "Royalties and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.soundcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360051642434-Subscription-Management", "label": "Billing terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"100% of distribution royalties; payment processing fees vary by payout route.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"SoundCloud and external distribution earnings","sort_order":13,"card":{"tag": "Distribution and streaming", "note": "The cheaper Artist plan distributes two tracks a month. Artist Pro is unlimited.", "take": {"label": "Distribution earnings", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$39 or $99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Artist plan", "value": "2 tracks a month", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "US payout", "value": "50¢", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "SoundCloud", "groups": [{"label": "SoundCloud", "rates": [{"label": "Distribution earnings", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--soundon","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"SoundOn","summary":"Music distribution with a free revenue-share plan or annual subscriptions.","website_url":"https://www.soundon.global/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-soundon-global.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital music distribution with TikTok promotion and monetization tools.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundon.global/?group=getting_started"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Lite is free; Core is $30/year; Max is $75/year, billed annually.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundon.global/?lang=en"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "English plan page: Lite retains 90%; Core and Max retain 100%. The official pt-BR page says Core retains 90%; the royalty share is inconsistent across current localized pages.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundon.global/?lang=en"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Public payout methods and minimums vary by country: USD $10, GBP £7, EUR €10, BRL R$50, IDR Rp140,000, AUD A$14, NZD NZ$16, CAD C$13. Methods include PayPal, Payoneer, bank transfer, and local wallets. No provider-fee schedule is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundon.global/knowledge/faq?group=earnings_insights&lang=es-MX&question=minimum_payout_threshold%2Cunable_withdraw_renenue"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Lite supports one artist; Core up to two; Max starts at five and supports up to 500. Core and Max include unlimited releases.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.soundon.global/?group=getting_started"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.soundon.global/?group=getting_started", "label": "Plan pricing"}, {"url": "https://www.soundon.global/knowledge/faq?group=earnings_insights&lang=es-MX&question=minimum_payout_threshold%2Cunable_withdraw_renenue", "label": "Payment methods"}, {"url": "https://www.soundon.global/?lang=en", "label": "English plan page"}, {"url": "https://www.soundon.global/?lang=pt-BR", "label": "Portuguese plan page"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Lite keeps 90%; Max 100%; current English and pt-BR Core pages disagree.","fee_percent":10,"fee_basis":"Lite streaming earnings","sort_order":14,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "SoundOn’s English and Portuguese pages show different shares for Core.", "take": {"label": "Sources disagree", "value": "0–10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0, $30, or $75 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$10", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Artists", "value": "1 to 500", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "SoundOn", "groups": [{"label": "English plan page", "rates": [{"label": "Lite, free", "value": "10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Core and Max", "value": "0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}, {"label": "Portuguese plan page", "rates": [{"label": "Core", "value": "10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--soundrop","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Soundrop","summary":"Distribute songs and manage supported cover-song licensing.","website_url":"https://soundrop.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/soundrop-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Music distribution to major stores and social platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundrop.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "$4.99 per track once; no annual subscription. Cover-song licensing is included.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundrop.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Soundrop retains 15% of gross revenue after marketplace costs and applicable publishing/mechanical licensing costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundrop.com/music-services-agreement"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout guide (updated Aug 2024) lists U.S./non-U.S. bank $2, local-currency wire $10, USD wire $25, and PayPal free. Default threshold is $20; users can set $20–$1,000. The guide does not show a newer fee revision.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.soundrop.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056351552-How-to-enter-payment-and-tax-information"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "No annual release cap is stated publicly; each track is priced separately.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://soundrop.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://soundrop.com/pricing", "label": "Price and service share"}, {"url": "https://soundrop.com/music-services-agreement", "label": "Distribution agreement"}, {"url": "https://support.soundrop.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056351552-How-to-enter-payment-and-tax-information", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://support.soundrop.com/hc/en-us/articles/38254141141901-How-much-does-Soundrop-cost", "label": "Service costs"}, {"url": "https://support.soundrop.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002611226-Getting-Paid-from-Soundrop", "label": "Payout schedule"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"$4.99 per track; 15% of receipts after marketplace and licensing costs.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"track revenue after marketplace and applicable licensing costs","sort_order":15,"card":{"tag": "Music and cover songs", "note": "PayPal payouts are free. Bank payouts cost $2.", "take": {"label": "Gross revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Per track", "value": "$4.99 once", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Cover songs", "value": "Licensing included", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$20", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Soundrop", "groups": [{"label": "Soundrop", "rates": [{"note": "After store and licensing costs", "label": "Gross revenue", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--symphonic-distribution","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Symphonic Distribution","summary":"Music distribution with self-service and tailored partner plans.","website_url":"https://symphonic.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/symphonic-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Digital music and music-video distribution.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://symphonic.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter is $29.99/year for one primary artist; Partner is an application-only custom deal. Beatport costs an extra $10/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://symphonic.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter retains 100% of standard major-DSP royalties. Partner terms are custom. Music-video payouts are 70% of net royalties. Starter UGC/Content ID pays 70% to the artist (30% Symphonic share).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://symphonic.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter UGC/Content ID commission is 30%. Video delivery is $25 per Spotify-only or Vevo-only video, or $95 for the larger network; Spotify rush is $15. Beatport access is $10/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://symphonic.com/starter/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Starter: one primary artist and unlimited audio releases. Partner: unlimited primary artists and releases. Video uploads are unlimited but charged per video.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://symphonic.com/pricing/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://symphonic.com/pricing/", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://symphonic.com/video-distribution/", "label": "Music video prices"}, {"url": "https://symphonic.com/starter/", "label": "Starter terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Starter keeps 100% of major-DSP royalties; UGC and music-video rates differ.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Starter major-DSP music royalties","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Partner plans are by application with custom terms.", "take": {"label": "Starter, major stores", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Starter", "value": "$29.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Music video", "value": "$25 to $95 each", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Beatport", "value": "$10 a month", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Symphonic", "groups": [{"label": "Starter", "rates": [{"label": "Starter, major stores", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "YouTube and social", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}, {"label": "Music videos", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Video royalties", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "YouTube and social", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-4"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--too-lost","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"Too Lost","summary":"Music distribution with monthly or yearly plans.","website_url":"https://toolost.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/toolost-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Music distribution to streaming and download services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://toolost.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist is $2.99/month or $19.99/year; Label is $5.99/month or $35.99/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://toolost.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Too Lost takes 0% of master-recording royalties; the artist receives 100% before taxes and payment fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.toolost.com/hc/en-us/articles/45091220772500-Does-Too-Lost-Take-a-Cut-of-My-Earnings"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Wallet minimum is $3. Tipalti: $5.32 US / $25 international, with a $100 method minimum. US PayPal, Stripe, Manifest, and Venmo: $1 + 2.7%, capped at $2. International PayPal: $1 + 2.7%, capped at $22; international Stripe: $2 + 2.5%, capped at $22. Bank fees may also apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.toolost.com/hc/en-us/articles/4670922449812-What-Are-the-Fees-for-Each-Payout-Method"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Artist: one artist and unlimited releases. Label: unlimited artists and releases.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://toolost.com/pricing/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://toolost.com/pricing/", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://help.toolost.com/hc/en-us/articles/45091220772500-Does-Too-Lost-Take-a-Cut-of-My-Earnings", "label": "Royalty terms"}, {"url": "https://help.toolost.com/hc/en-us/articles/4670922449812-What-Are-the-Fees-for-Each-Payout-Method", "label": "Payout fees"}, {"url": "https://help.toolost.com/hc/en-us/articles/45091756068756-How-Do-I-Withdraw-My-Earnings", "label": "Payout minimum"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"0% master royalty cut before taxes/payment fees; plan and payout charges are separate.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"master-recording royalties before taxes and payout fees","sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "You keep 100% before taxes and payment fees.", "take": {"label": "Master royalties", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "$19.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$3", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "$1 + 2.7%, max $2", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Too Lost", "groups": [{"label": "Too Lost", "rates": [{"label": "Master royalties", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--tunecore","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"TuneCore","summary":"Distribute music through annual plans or per-release fees.","website_url":"https://www.tunecore.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-tunecore-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Music distribution through unlimited annual plans or pay-per-release plans.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006503487-How-much-does-TuneCore-cost"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "US annual plans: Rising Artist $24.99, Breakout Artist $44.99, Professional $54.99/year. Pay-per-release: $24.99/single or $44.99/album for year one; albums renew at $56.49/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006503487-How-much-does-TuneCore-cost"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "TuneCore takes 0% of standard store and streaming royalties. For YouTube Content ID and other Social Platforms, artists keep 80% and TuneCore keeps 20%; there is no extra annual fee for this monetization.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006693208-Are-there-any-recurring-fees-associated-with-monetizing-my-audio"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdrawals use Payoneer. Fees vary by method and country: US PayPal is $0.25/transaction; other PayPal routes are 2% up to $20, with a $1 minimum. Bank transfer fees range by country; prepaid card is $1/transaction with a $2 minimum.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006508087-How-do-I-withdraw-my-money"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Rising Artist, Breakout Artist, and Professional are unlimited annual distribution plans. Per-release plans renew annually; albums renew at a higher rate after year one.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006503487-How-much-does-TuneCore-cost"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006503487-How-much-does-TuneCore-cost", "label": "US pricing"}, {"url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006693208-Are-there-any-recurring-fees-associated-with-monetizing-my-audio", "label": "Social platform split"}, {"url": "https://support.tunecore.com/hc/en-us/articles/115006508087-How-do-I-withdraw-my-money", "label": "Withdrawal fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"0% standard store royalties; social-platform monetization takes 20%.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Standard music-store and streaming royalties; social-platform monetization retains 20%","sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Albums on per-release pricing renew at $56.49 a year.", "take": {"label": "Stores and streaming", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "From $24.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Per release", "value": "$24.99 a single", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Payoneer", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "TuneCore", "groups": [{"label": "TuneCore", "rates": [{"label": "Stores and streaming", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "YouTube and social", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "YouTube and social", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"music-sales-and-distribution--unitedmasters","section_id":"music-sales-and-distribution","name":"UnitedMasters","summary":"Music distribution with paid artist tiers and partnership options.","website_url":"https://unitedmasters.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/unitedmasters-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Distribution to 50+ or 150+ music services by plan.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://unitedmasters.com/en/select/artists"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "DEBUT+ $19.99/year; SELECT $59.99/year; PARTNER by invitation on negotiated terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://unitedmasters.com/en/select/artists"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "DEBUT+ and SELECT keep 100% of standard streaming royalties.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://unitedmasters.com/en/select/artists"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "ACH: $1 in the US; some regional transfers: $4; SWIFT: $10 to $25; PayPal fees vary. US-issued Visa Direct: 1% ($1.50 minimum). Optional Real-Time Royalties: 5% of monthly payout for eligible US artists.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.unitedmasters.com/hc/en-us/articles/11982227837459-Why-was-I-charged-a-fee-when-I-cashed-out-my-earnings"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Unlimited releases; DEBUT+ covers 50+ services and SELECT covers 150+.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://unitedmasters.com/en/select/artists"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://unitedmasters.com/en/select/artists", "label": "Plans and terms"}, {"url": "https://support.unitedmasters.com/hc/en-us/articles/29986532327827-What-are-the-benefits-of-each-UnitedMasters-membership-plan", "label": "Membership terms"}, {"url": "https://support.unitedmasters.com/hc/en-us/articles/11982227837459-Why-was-I-charged-a-fee-when-I-cashed-out-my-earnings", "label": "Cash-out fees"}, {"url": "https://support.unitedmasters.com/hc/en-us/articles/50688467434771-Visa-Direct-Payouts", "label": "Visa Direct fees"}, {"url": "https://unitedmasters.com/en/real-time-royalties", "label": "Real-Time Royalties"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"DEBUT+/SELECT retain 100% of standard royalties; PARTNER is invite-only and negotiated.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"standard paid-plan streaming royalties","sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Music distribution", "note": "Some artists are invited to Partner deals with negotiated terms.", "take": {"label": "Paid plans", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$19.99 or $59.99 a year", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "US payout", "value": "$1 by ACH", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Uploads", "value": "Unlimited", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "UnitedMasters", "groups": [{"label": "UnitedMasters", "rates": [{"label": "Paid plans", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--beehiiv","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"beehiiv","summary":"Publish newsletters with paid subscriptions and ads.","website_url":"https://www.beehiiv.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-beehiiv-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid subscriptions and ad network", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Launch is free through 2,500 subscribers; Scale starts at $43/month billed annually at a selected tier, with up to 100,000 subscribers shared across workspace publications. Enterprise is custom above 100,000.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "0% beehiiv fee on paid subscriptions; the feature starts on Scale", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "US Stripe card fee: 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction; other Stripe rates vary", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators set subscription tiers, prices, currencies, benefits, and billing options", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/support/article/23080261008279"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/support/article/23874462928663-plan-types-and-subscriber-plan-tier-pricing?via=wfe7Bkx", "label": "Subscriber tiers"}, {"url": "https://www.beehiiv.com/support/article/23080261008279", "label": "Subscription setup"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US creator, USD, Scale entry tier billed annually; the plan price changes with subscriber tier.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Paid-subscription platform fee; Stripe processing is additional","sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Newsletters", "note": "The free Launch plan covers up to 2,500 subscribers.", "take": {"label": "Paid subscriptions", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Paid subs need", "value": "Scale plan", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Scale", "value": "From $43 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "beehiiv", "groups": [{"label": "beehiiv", "rates": [{"label": "Paid subscriptions", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--buttondown","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"Buttondown","summary":"Send a newsletter with an optional paid subscription feature.","website_url":"https://buttondown.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/buttondown-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid newsletter subscriptions", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.buttondown.com/paid-subscriptions"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Newsletter is free for the first 100 subscribers; paid subscriptions are a $9/month add-on", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://buttondown.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Buttondown takes 0% of subscription revenue; the paid-subscription add-on is billed monthly", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://buttondown.com/features/paid-subscriptions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "US Stripe domestic cards: 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction; other card rates vary", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Fixed subscriptions can be monthly/yearly; pay-what-you-want is a one-time amount; per-email billing charges for each send.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.buttondown.com/paid-subscriptions"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://buttondown.com/pricing", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://buttondown.com/features/paid-subscriptions", "label": "Paid subscriptions"}, {"url": "https://docs.buttondown.com/paid-subscriptions", "label": "Stripe setup"}, {"url": "https://stripe.com/pricing", "label": "Stripe rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US creator, USD, paid subscriptions; Buttondown uses the creator’s connected Stripe account.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"No revenue share; $9/month paid-subscription add-on plus Stripe processing","sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Newsletters", "note": "You can charge monthly, yearly, per email, or pay what you want.", "take": {"label": "Subscription revenue", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Paid add-on", "value": "$9 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Free plan", "value": "100 subscribers", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Buttondown", "groups": [{"label": "Buttondown", "rates": [{"label": "Subscription revenue", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--ghost","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"Ghost","summary":"Run a publication with paid member subscriptions.","website_url":"https://ghost.org/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/ghost-org.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid publication memberships using Stripe", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ghost.org/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "At 1,000 members, Publisher is $29/month billed annually. The comparison table lists Starter/Publisher at 1,000, Business at 10,000, Custom unlimited; the overview conflicts on Business.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ghost.org/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Ghost charges 0% on paid memberships", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ghost.org/integrations/stripe/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "US Stripe domestic cards: 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction; other card rates vary", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators set monthly and yearly prices; Publisher supports three paid tiers", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ghost.org/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ghost.org/pricing", "label": "Plans and terms"}, {"url": "https://ghost.org/integrations/stripe/", "label": "Stripe integration"}, {"url": "https://stripe.com/pricing", "label": "Stripe rates"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US creator, USD, Ghost(Pro) Publisher at 1,000 members; Stripe standard domestic card processing.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Ghost platform fee; Stripe card processing and Ghost(Pro) hosting are separate","sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Publications and newsletters", "note": "Ghost prices its plans by the number of members.", "take": {"label": "Paid memberships", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Publisher", "value": "$29 a month, yearly", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Paid tiers", "value": "3 on Publisher", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Ghost", "groups": [{"label": "Ghost", "rates": [{"label": "Paid memberships", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--kit","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"Kit","summary":"Sell paid newsletters and digital products by email.","website_url":"https://kit.com/commerce","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/kit-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid newsletters, subscriptions, and digital products", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kit.com/features/commerce/paid-newsletter"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free supports paid newsletters and up to 10,000 subscribers; Creator is $33/month at the 1,000-subscriber tier", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kit.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Kit charges a 0.6% platform fee on paid-newsletter transactions", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kit.com/features/commerce/paid-newsletter"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "US total charge is 3.5% + $0.30 per sale, including card processing; currency rates vary", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.kit.com/en/articles/6085844-sell-your-products-in-different-currencies"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators set monthly, annual, or custom prices and can offer multiple subscription tiers", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://kit.com/features/commerce/paid-newsletter"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://kit.com/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://kit.com/features/commerce/paid-newsletter", "label": "Newsletter fees"}, {"url": "https://help.kit.com/en/articles/6085844-sell-your-products-in-different-currencies", "label": "Currency fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US creator, USD, paid newsletter transactions; Kit bundles card processing and its fee in the 3.5% + $0.30 total.","fee_percent":0.6,"fee_basis":"Kit platform portion of the bundled 3.5% + $0.30 USD transaction cost","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Email and paid newsletters", "note": "Kit’s 3.5% + 30¢ total already includes card processing.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0.6%", "percent": 0.6, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Free plan", "value": "Up to 10,000 subs", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Total fee", "value": "3.5% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Creator plan", "value": "$33 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Kit", "groups": [{"label": "Kit", "rates": [{"note": "Inside the 3.5% + 30¢ total", "label": "Platform fee", "value": "0.6%", "percent": 0.6, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--medium-partner-program","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"Medium Partner Program","summary":"Paywalled writing earning from member reading and engagement.","website_url":"https://medium.com/earn","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/medium-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Eligible paywalled stories earn from member reading/listening time, engagement, and Boosts", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/360036691193-Medium-Partner-Program-earnings-calculation"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Active Medium membership required: US Member $5/month or $50/year; Friend $15/month or $150/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004545567-Become-a-Medium-Member"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "No fixed per-story rate; earnings vary with member activity and the story’s engagement", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/360036691193-Medium-Partner-Program-earnings-calculation"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe payout minimum $10; payouts usually start by the 10th and take 5–7 business days. Verified tax details and supported bank country required.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/25267297935895-Medium-Partner-Program-payouts"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable: readers buy a Medium-wide membership; writers do not set its price", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004545567-Become-a-Medium-Member"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/360036691193-Medium-Partner-Program-earnings-calculation", "label": "Earnings formula"}, {"url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/25267297935895-Medium-Partner-Program-payouts", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/39121627791639-Medium-Partner-Program-eligibility", "label": "Eligibility"}, {"url": "https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004545567-Become-a-Medium-Member", "label": "Membership pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US writer, USD, active Medium membership required for Partner Program enrollment.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Paywalled writing", "note": "Earnings depend on how long members read and engage with your stories.", "take": {"label": "Member reading and activity", "value": "Paid by engagement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Needs", "value": "Medium membership", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$10", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Price", "value": "Set by Medium", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Medium", "groups": []}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--note","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"note","summary":"Japanese paid writing, memberships, and reader support.","website_url":"https://note.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/note-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid articles, magazines, memberships, and tips", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/360011358873-%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%B3%E3%83%84%E3%82%92%E8%B2%A9%E5%A3%B2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AB%E5%BC%95%E3%81%8B%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Memberships are free to run; subscription magazines require note Premium at ¥500/month", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/900000163906-%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AF"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "10% for articles, magazines, tips, and memberships; 20% for subscription magazines, after payment fees", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/360011358873-%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%B3%E3%83%84%E3%82%92%E8%B2%A9%E5%A3%B2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AB%E5%BC%95%E3%81%8B%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payment-method fee is deducted from creator sales before note’s platform fee; cards 5%, carrier 15%, PayPay/Amazon Pay 7%, points 10%, PayPal 6.5%. Payout fee ¥270.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/360011358873-%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%B3%E3%83%84%E3%82%92%E8%B2%A9%E5%A3%B2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AB%E5%BC%95%E3%81%8B%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators set content and membership prices; standard range ¥100–¥50,000, with higher limits for Premium/Pro", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/900000164086-%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%E3%81%AB%E9%96%A2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E3%82%88%E3%81%8F%E3%81%82%E3%82%8B%E3%81%8A%E5%95%8F%E3%81%84%E5%90%88%E3%82%8F%E3%81%9B"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/360011358873-%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%B3%E3%83%84%E3%82%92%E8%B2%A9%E5%A3%B2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AB%E5%BC%95%E3%81%8B%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E6%89%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%96%99", "label": "Fees"}, {"url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/900000163906-%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AF", "label": "Memberships and magazines"}, {"url": "https://www.help-note.com/hc/ja/articles/900000164086-%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%E3%81%AB%E9%96%A2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E3%82%88%E3%81%8F%E3%81%82%E3%82%8B%E3%81%8A%E5%95%8F%E3%81%84%E5%90%88%E3%82%8F%E3%81%9B", "label": "Pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Japan-based creator, JPY; payment fee depends on the buyer’s selected method.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Paid writing, Japan", "note": "Payment method fees come off first, from 5% for cards to 15% for carrier billing.", "take": {"label": "Articles and memberships", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, "lines": [{"label": "Premium", "value": "¥500 a month", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Card fee", "value": "5% first", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payout fee", "value": "¥270", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "note", "groups": [{"label": "note", "rates": [{"label": "Articles and memberships", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscription magazines", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Subscription magazines", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-3"}}}, {"id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing--paragraph","section_id":"newsletters-and-paid-writing","name":"Paragraph","summary":"Publish writing and manage an email subscriber list.","website_url":"https://docs.paragraph.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/docs-paragraph-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "variable", "value": "Current product docs describe a site, newsletter and subscriber list, not paid memberships. Terms allow publisher transactions, but current paid-feature availability is unclear.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://paragraph.com/terms-of-use"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free: $0/2,000 subscribers; Starter: $20 monthly or $16 monthly billed annually/10,000; Growth: $100/$80/100,000; Scale: $200/$160/250,000; Enterprise custom.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.paragraph.com/account/plans-and-credits"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current public terms do not list a creator revenue-share percentage.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://paragraph.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current terms do not name a processor for publisher offers; a 2023 guide mentions Stripe.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://paragraph.com/terms-of-use"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current terms do not list membership billing intervals; a 2023 guide describes monthly and yearly tiers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://paragraph.com/terms-of-use"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.paragraph.com/account/plans-and-credits", "label": "Plans and features"}, {"url": "https://paragraph.com/pricing", "label": "Plan pricing"}, {"url": "https://paragraph.com/content-guidelines", "label": "Membership terms"