r an annual subscriber", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vimeo.com/hc/en-us/articles/12425768622481-Vimeo-OTT-pricing-breakdown"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "1h upload free; 10h $99, 25h $149, or 50h $199", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.vimeo.com/hc/en-us/articles/12425768386065-How-to-purchase-more-video-upload-hours-on-Vimeo-OTT"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.vimeo.com/hc/en-us/articles/12425768622481-Vimeo-OTT-pricing-breakdown", "label": "OTT fees"}, {"url": "https://help.vimeo.com/hc/en-us/articles/12425768386065-How-to-purchase-more-video-upload-hours-on-Vimeo-OTT", "label": "Upload hours"}, {"url": "https://help.vimeo.com/hc/en-us/articles/12427212660369-Getting-paid-with-Vimeo-OTT", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US dollar examples. Enterprise contracts, payment methods, currencies and branded-app fulfillment can change the total.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Branded streaming service", "note": "App store purchases pay the store’s commission instead of the card fee.", "take": {"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Rentals and sales", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Web card fee", "value": "2.5% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Upload", "value": "1 hour free", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Vimeo", "groups": [{"label": "Rentals and purchases", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Rentals and sales", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "rates": [{"note": "$12 for a yearly subscriber", "label": "Per subscriber a month", "value": "$1", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "Web card fee", "value": "2.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Per subscriber a month", "value": "$1", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-4"}}}, {"id":"selling-video-subscriptions-rentals-and-downloads--vplayed","section_id":"selling-video-subscriptions-rentals-and-downloads","name":"VPlayed","summary":"White-label OTT software with a one-time licence and no platform revenue share.","website_url":"https://www.vplayed.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-vplayed-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "One-time licence; VPlayed does not publish a standard amount and requires a sales quote.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vplayed.com/online-video-platform.php"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "VPlayed advertises zero platform revenue share and no commission on creator earnings.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vplayed.com/transactional-video-on-demand-platform.php"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Payment gateways are third-party integrations; their processing rates are not published by VPlayed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vplayed.com/micro-drama-ott-app.php"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "VPlayed advertises no per-user fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vplayed.com/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Cloud or on-premise deployment is available; infrastructure allowance and cost are project-specific.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.vplayed.com/online-video-platform.php"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.vplayed.com/transactional-video-on-demand-platform.php", "label": "Monetization and revenue share"}, {"url": "https://www.vplayed.com/online-video-platform.php", "label": "Hosting options"}, {"url": "https://www.vplayed.com/micro-drama-ott-app.php", "label": "License and gateways"}, {"url": "https://www.vplayed.com/", "label": "Fee claims"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Custom white-label deployment; licence, hosting and payment-provider costs depend on the project.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "White-label streaming", "note": "Payment gateway fees still apply.", "take": {"label": "Revenue share", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "License", "value": "One-time, by quote", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Per user", "value": "No fee", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Hosting", "value": "Cloud or your servers", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "VPlayed", "groups": [{"label": "VPlayed", "rates": [{"label": "Revenue share", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns--craftsuprint","section_id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","name":"Craftsuprint","summary":"Marketplace for printable card kits and craft designs.","website_url":"https://www.craftsuprint.com/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "unverified", "value": "Current seller signup and listing costs could not be verified because the official marketplace was inaccessible.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.craftsuprint.com/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "unverified", "value": "Current seller share and royalty terms could not be verified because the official marketplace was inaccessible.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.craftsuprint.com/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "unverified", "value": "Current seller payment-processing terms could not be verified because the official marketplace was inaccessible.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.craftsuprint.com/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "unverified", "value": "Current exclusivity terms could not be verified because the official marketplace was inaccessible.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.craftsuprint.com/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.craftsuprint.com/", "label": "Marketplace"}, {"url": "https://www.craftsuprint.com/amanda-davis/", "label": "Designer profile"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The official marketplace returned 403 to public retrieval; current seller fees and terms remain unavailable in accessible official pages.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Card kits and craft designs", "note": "Craftsuprint’s site blocked access, so its terms could not be checked.", "take": {"label": "Official terms inaccessible", "value": "Share unconfirmed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Site", "value": "Blocked access", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Seller terms", "value": "Not checked", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Not checked", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Craftsuprint", "groups": []}}, {"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns--creative-fabrica-craft-files","section_id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","name":"Creative Fabrica craft files","summary":"Sell craft files through single purchases and subscriptions.","website_url":"https://www.creativefabrica.com/crafts/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-creativefabrica-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Designer membership is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/4401898664722-Why-should-I-open-a-store-on-Creative-Fabrica"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Default single-sale share is 50%; a sale referred through your affiliate link pays 75% total, including 25% affiliate commission. Subscription downloads also earn revenue, but their formula is not public.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360014515719-Tips-on-how-to-be-a-successful-seller-on-Creative-Fabrica"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "No separate per-sale processing rate is stated. PayPal payouts under $10 cost $0.50; bank transfers cost $20 with a $100 minimum; Payoneer minimum is $100.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029930872-How-do-I-make-a-payout-of-my-earnings"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Designers may sell their work on other marketplaces.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/open-store/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/open-store/", "label": "Earnings and exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/4401898664722-Why-should-I-open-a-store-on-Creative-Fabrica", "label": "Membership and rates"}, {"url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360014515719-Tips-on-how-to-be-a-successful-seller-on-Creative-Fabrica", "label": "Affiliate commission"}, {"url": "https://help.creativefabrica.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029930872-How-do-I-make-a-payout-of-my-earnings", "label": "Payout methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Single-sale share is 50% by default or 75% via a seller affiliate link; subscription earnings vary, and payout charges depend on method.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Craft files", "note": "Subscription downloads also earn money, but the formula is not public.", "take": {"label": "Single sales", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Bank payout", "value": "$20 fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Creative Fabrica", "groups": [{"label": "Single sales", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "Single sales", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 75%", "label": "Via your affiliate link", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Via your affiliate link", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns--design-bundles-craft-files","section_id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","name":"Design Bundles craft files","summary":"Sell craft files through marketplace sales and a subscription royalty pool.","website_url":"https://designbundles.net/craft","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/designbundles-net.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public partner terms do not state a current seller signup, listing, or monthly price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Partner terms (last updated Aug 2023) allocate 50% of net membership income after processing costs to a download pool; individual shares vary. No ad-hoc rate is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Aug 2023 partner terms say processing is deducted before the membership pool; current mechanics are not reconfirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Aug 2023 partner terms grant a non-exclusive licence; current seller terms are not reconfirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://designbundles.net/designer-termsconditions", "label": "Partner terms, 2023"}, {"url": "https://designbundles.net/craft", "label": "Craft marketplace"}, {"url": "https://designbundles.net/termsandconditions", "label": "Site terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current site terms point to partner terms last updated Aug 2023; the ad-hoc commission rate is not published and pool shares vary by downloads.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Craft files", "note": "Single-sale rates are not published. The partner terms were last updated in 2023.", "take": {"label": "Membership pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No, in 2023", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Terms", "value": "From Aug 2023", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Design Bundles", "groups": [{"label": "Membership", "rates": [{"note": "Split by downloads", "label": "Membership pool", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns--lovecrafts","section_id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","name":"LoveCrafts","summary":"Sell knitting and crochet patterns with fixed and sales-based fees.","website_url":"https://www.lovecrafts.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-lovecrafts-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Pattern listings are free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://designers.lovecrafts.com/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "The official chart lists 4% + $0.35 per USD sale and a 5% seller fee in the monthly sales band, but says these rates apply from June 1, 2022. Current rates are unconfirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-us/pages/designer-handbook-payment-pricing-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal charges and currency-conversion costs may apply; the public schedule does not itemize the transaction-cost components.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-eu/pages/designers-terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Designers retain copyright. The standard listing licence is non-exclusive; any exclusivity agreement must be separately written.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-eu/pages/designers-terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-us/pages/designer-handbook-payment-pricing-taxes", "label": "Fees and payments"}, {"url": "https://content.prod.lovecrafts.co/lovecrafts/Zq0l5kaF0TcGIqIl_Screenshot-2022-04-21-at-10.55.58.png?auto=format%2Ccompress", "label": "Fee chart"}, {"url": "https://designers.lovecrafts.com/", "label": "Designer accounts"}, {"url": "https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-us/pages/designer-handbook-copyright-legal", "label": "Copyright terms"}, {"url": "https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-eu/pages/designers-terms", "label": "Designer terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller, USD. The linked fee chart says its rates apply from June 1, 2022; 2026 handbook text does not confirm they remain current. GBP/EUR thresholds also differ.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Knitting and crochet patterns", "note": "LoveCrafts’ fee chart is dated June 2022, so current rates are not confirmed.", "take": {"extra": "+ 35¢", "label": "Per sale, 2022 chart", "value": "4%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Listing", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "LoveCrafts", "groups": [{"label": "2022 fee chart", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 35¢", "label": "Per sale, 2022 chart", "value": "4%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Monthly sales band", "label": "Seller fee", "value": "5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Seller fee", "value": "5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns--ravelry","section_id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","name":"Ravelry","summary":"Sell downloadable knitting and crochet patterns through Ravelry.","website_url":"https://www.ravelry.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-ravelry-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current seller start cost is not stated in public official pages reviewed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ravelry.com/help/search?query=selling+patterns"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current fee schedule is linked from seller help, but requires sign-in", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ravelry.com/help/search?query=selling+patterns"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal is the only processor; sellers also pay Ravelry invoices via PayPal", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ravelry.com/help/search?query=selling+patterns"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current exclusivity terms are not accessible in public seller help", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.ravelry.com/help/search?query=selling+patterns"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.ravelry.com/help/search?query=selling+patterns", "label": "Seller help"}, {"url": "https://www.ravelry.com/about/terms", "label": "Terms"}, {"url": "https://blog.ravelry.com/100000-patterns-sold-the-ravelry-pattern-store/", "label": "2009 fee post"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Seller help links to a sign-in-only fee page; the public 2009 fee schedule is historical, not current pricing.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Knitting and crochet patterns", "note": "Ravelry’s seller fee page needs a login.", "take": {"label": "Seller fee schedule", "value": "Sign in for fees", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Payments", "value": "PayPal only", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Ravelry", "groups": []}}, {"id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns--ribblr","section_id":"sewing-knitting-and-craft-patterns","name":"Ribblr","summary":"Sell interactive knitting and crochet patterns.","website_url":"https://ribblr.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/ribblr-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free account; no shop or listing fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ribblr.com/help/general-getting-started-can-i-sell-my-patterns-on-ribblr-how-can-i-open-a-shop"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Sale fee starts at 4%, with a $0.25 minimum per pattern. $elFee can reduce the fee to zero through referral rewards.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ribblr.com/paymentspolicy"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Ribblr uses Stripe Connect; Stripe processing and currency conversion fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ribblr.com/paymentspolicy"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Patterns remain the designer’s and are non-exclusive.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://ribblr.com/help/general-getting-started-can-i-sell-my-patterns-on-ribblr-how-can-i-open-a-shop"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ribblr.com/paymentspolicy", "label": "Seller fees"}, {"url": "https://ribblr.com/help/my-shop-shop-basics-what-is-selfee", "label": "$elFee rules"}, {"url": "https://ribblr.com/help/general-getting-started-can-i-sell-my-patterns-on-ribblr-how-can-i-open-a-shop", "label": "Shop fees and rights"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller, USD; $elFee can reduce the listed sale fee.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Interactive patterns", "note": "Referral rewards through $elFee can bring your fee down to zero.", "take": {"label": "Each sale", "value": "4%", "percent": 4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Minimum fee", "value": "25¢ a pattern", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Ribblr", "groups": [{"label": "Ribblr", "rates": [{"note": "At least 25¢ a pattern", "label": "Each sale", "value": "4%", "percent": 4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--cleverbridge","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Cleverbridge","summary":"Sell software with an enterprise merchant of record.","website_url":"https://www.cleverbridge.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-cleverbridge-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Transaction-based custom quote; no public fixed fee schedule.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Rate varies by transaction volume, payment mix, currencies, and customer locations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Global payment processing and platform services are included in the transaction-based quote.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Cleverbridge acts as merchant of record and handles global tax and regulatory compliance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Optional partner and digital-marketing add-ons are available. Their price and seller payout timing/method are not public.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/contact-us"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/pricing", "label": "Pricing and services"}, {"url": "https://grow.cleverbridge.com/contact-us", "label": "Sales contact"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Enterprise merchant of record", "note": "Cleverbridge quotes each seller based on volume, currencies, and customer locations.", "take": {"label": "By volume and sales mix", "value": "Custom quote", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No public fee", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "Cleverbridge handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Cleverbridge", "groups": []}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--creem","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Creem","summary":"Sell software globally with merchant of record checkout.","website_url":"https://www.creem.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-creem-io.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "$0 monthly and setup fees; Partner plan uses custom pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creem.io/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard fee is 3.9% + $0.40 per successful transaction; Partner plan offers lower custom rates.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creem.io/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Transaction rate includes payment processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creem.io/terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Creem is merchant of record and calculates, collects, and remits applicable indirect taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creem.io/terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "No international-card surcharge. Standard payouts run on the 1st and 15th; several methods have 0% payout fees. Partner plan offers on-demand payouts. Seller pays bank, FX, and third-party receiving costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.creem.io/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.creem.io/pricing", "label": "Pricing and payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.creem.io/terms", "label": "Merchant Terms"}, {"url": "https://www.creem.io/", "label": "Product overview"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Creem is the merchant of record. Larger sellers can get lower custom rates.", "take": {"extra": "+ 40¢", "label": "Per sale", "value": "3.9%", "percent": 3.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Intl. cards", "value": "No extra fee", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "1st and 15th", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Creem", "groups": [{"label": "Standard", "rates": [{"note": "Processing included", "extra": "+ 40¢", "label": "Per sale", "value": "3.9%", "percent": 3.9, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--dodo-payments","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Dodo Payments","summary":"Handle software checkout, subscriptions, and sales tax.","website_url":"https://dodopayments.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/dodopayments-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "$0 fixed cost on Standard; analytics and reporting are included.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dodopayments.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "US cards and wallets: 4% + $0.40. India INR cards and UPI: 4% + $0.15 plus international payment fees. US ACH: 1.5%, capped at $15; EU SEPA: 1.5%, capped at €15. Bank-debit fees replace card fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dodopayments.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard processing is included; international cards add 1.5%, PayPal/BNPL add 3%, and subscriptions add 0.5%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dodopayments.com/nl/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Dodo is merchant of record and handles applicable global tax calculation, filing, and remittance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dodopayments.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Extras: +1.5% international, +3% PayPal/BNPL, +0.5% subscriptions; ACH/SEPA is 1.5% capped and replaces the card fee. Refunds $1; disputes $30, Visa RDR $18. Payouts are free at $1,000+, $5 below that; USD SWIFT $25 and non-USD FX applies. Optional services have separate charges.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dodopayments.com/nl/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dodopayments.com/nl/pricing", "label": "Rates and payouts"}, {"url": "https://dodopayments.com/pricing", "label": "Plan and pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Dodo is the merchant of record. Payouts under $1,000 cost $5.", "take": {"extra": "+ 40¢", "label": "US cards and wallets", "value": "4%", "percent": 4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "International", "value": "+ 1.5%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "PayPal and BNPL", "value": "+ 3%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Dodo", "groups": [{"label": "Payments", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 40¢", "label": "US cards and wallets", "value": "4%", "percent": 4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "+ international payment fees", "extra": "+ 15¢", "label": "India cards and UPI", "value": "4%", "percent": 4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "US ACH, or EU SEPA up to €15", "label": "Bank debit, max $15", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Extra charges", "rates": [{"label": "International cards", "value": "+ 1.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "PayPal and buy now, pay later", "value": "+ 3%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "+ 0.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}], "second": {"label": "Bank debit, max $15", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--fastspring","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"FastSpring","summary":"Sell software with a quoted merchant of record rate.","website_url":"https://fastspring.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/fastspring-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Revenue-share pricing; no minimum volume. Fixed monthly/setup fee is not publicly stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fastspring.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Individual flat rate is quoted by transaction type and sales volume; no public standard percentage.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fastspring.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Quote includes payment processing, international payments, local methods/currencies, subscriptions, fraud tools, and B2B invoicing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fastspring.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "FastSpring acts as merchant of record and handles global tax collection and remittance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fastspring.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Default twice-monthly payouts (15th and month-end); weekly or monthly options. $100 minimum; 14-day settlement and 45-day first-payout hold. Transfer methods vary by region; a 2.5% currency conversion fee applies when store and payout currencies differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.fastspring.com/docs/receive-payouts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://fastspring.com/pricing/", "label": "Pricing and services"}, {"url": "https://developer.fastspring.com/docs/receive-payouts", "label": "Payout schedule"}, {"url": "https://developer.fastspring.com/docs/set-up-your-payout-account", "label": "Transfer methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Payouts are twice a month by default, with a $100 minimum and a 45-day hold on the first one.", "take": {"label": "By volume and sale type", "value": "Custom quote", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No public fee", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "FastSpring handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Currency fee", "value": "2.5% when converted", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "FastSpring", "groups": []}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--freemius","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Freemius","summary":"Software checkout with licensing and tax remittance.","website_url":"https://freemius.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/freemius-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No setup or monthly fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freemius.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "SaaS/apps share is progressive: 4.7% on the first $50k/month, then 4.5%, 4%, 3%, 2%, 1%, and 0.5% on sales above $100k. WordPress/templates add 2.3% (7% starting share). Platform share excludes tax.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freemius.com/help/documentation/getting-started/our-pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Gateway fees are separate and vary by method; Freemius reports a 3.5% average effective rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freemius.com/help/documentation/getting-started/our-pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Freemius acts as reseller/MoR and automates sales-tax and VAT compliance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freemius.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Paid around the 10th, two months after the sales month, if the $100 minimum is met. Payout fees vary by method; chargebacks cost $15 via Stripe or $20 via PayPal.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://freemius.com/terms/vendor/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://freemius.com/pricing/", "label": "Rates and services"}, {"url": "https://freemius.com/help/documentation/getting-started/our-pricing/", "label": "Progressive rates"}, {"url": "https://freemius.com/help/documentation/selling-with-freemius/your-earnings/", "label": "Payout schedule"}, {"url": "https://freemius.com/terms/vendor/", "label": "Payout and chargeback fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":4.7,"fee_basis":"SaaS platform share on first $50k monthly gross; gateway fees extra","sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Software sales and licensing", "note": "Freemius is the merchant of record. Payouts come about two months after the sales month.", "take": {"label": "First $50k a month", "value": "4.7%", "percent": 4.7, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Gateway fees", "value": "Extra, about 3.5%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "WordPress", "value": "+ 2.3%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Freemius", "groups": [{"label": "SaaS and apps", "rates": [{"label": "First $50k a month", "value": "4.7%", "percent": 4.7, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Steps down from 4.5% to 1% in between", "label": "Above $100k a month", "value": "0.5%", "percent": 0.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "WordPress and templates", "rates": [{"label": "Starting share", "value": "7%", "percent": 7, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Above $100k a month", "value": "0.5%", "percent": 0.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--fungies","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Fungies","summary":"Sell digital products with hosted checkout and managed taxes.","website_url":"https://fungies.io/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/fungies-io.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No setup/monthly fee or minimum; storefront and all listed features included.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fungies.io/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard fee is 5% + $0.50 per sale; rate is negotiable at higher sales volume.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fungies.io/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "One fee includes processing, tax, fraud screening, chargebacks, and platform features; no extra charge for international, subscription, or payment method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fungies.io/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Fungies is merchant of record and calculates, collects, remits, and files taxes.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://fungies.io/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Daily automatic is the default in supported countries; weekly/monthly/manual schedules vary. First payout typically takes 7–14 days, and country speed and minimums vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.fungies.io/getting-paid/payouts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://fungies.io/pricing/", "label": "Fees and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.fungies.io/getting-paid/payouts", "label": "Payout schedule"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "One fee covers processing, tax, fraud checks, and chargebacks.", "take": {"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Per sale", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Extra fees", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Daily by default", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Fungies", "groups": [{"label": "Standard", "rates": [{"note": "Lower at higher volume", "extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Per sale", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--lemon-squeezy","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Lemon Squeezy","summary":"Sell software, subscriptions, and downloads with managed sales tax.","website_url":"https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-lemonsqueezy-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "$0 monthly; custom pricing for high volume, large businesses, or products under $10.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Direct store sales: 5% + $0.50 on total order value. Marketplace sales: 30% flat, replacing standard fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/marketplace"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Base fee includes card processing and currency-conversion costs; extra transaction surcharges can apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Lemon Squeezy is the merchant of record and collects/remits sales tax and VAT.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Extras: +1.5% international and PayPal; +0.5% subscriptions; +5% recovered-cart sales and +3% merchant affiliate sales. Payouts twice monthly, $50 minimum; US bank free, non-US bank 1%, US PayPal $0.50, non-US PayPal 3% capped at $30.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/fees"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/pricing", "label": "Store pricing"}, {"url": "https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/fees", "label": "Fees and payouts"}, {"url": "https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/getting-paid", "label": "Payout schedule"}, {"url": "https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/marketplace", "label": "Marketplace commission"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Lemon Squeezy is the merchant of record. Payouts are twice a month, with a $50 minimum.", "take": {"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Direct sales", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "International", "value": "+ 1.5%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "+ 0.5%", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Lemon Squeezy", "groups": [{"label": "Sales", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Direct sales", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Replaces the standard fee", "label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Extra charges", "rates": [{"label": "International and PayPal", "value": "+ 1.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "value": "+ 0.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Recovered carts", "value": "+ 5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Affiliate sales", "value": "+ 3%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-5"}]}], "second": {"label": "Marketplace sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--paddle","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Paddle","summary":"Sell software and subscriptions with a merchant of record.","website_url":"https://www.paddle.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-paddle-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "$0 monthly or setup fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.paddle.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "5% + $0.50 per Checkout sale; custom rates for large/fast-growing businesses. Products under $10 or invoicing require custom pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.paddle.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Payment processing and supported payment methods are included in the all-in fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.paddle.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Paddle handles global sales tax collection, filing, and remittance as merchant of record.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.paddle.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Monthly payouts: balance is checked on the 1st and sent by the 15th when it meets the seller-set $100 minimum. Help pages list wire/Payoneer; current developer onboarding also lists PayPal. Wire is usually free on local-currency routes, but cross-border SWIFT can cost $15; Payoneer/provider fees and up to 1.5% payout-currency conversion can apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://developer.paddle.com/build/go-live-checklist/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.paddle.com/pricing", "label": "Checkout rate"}, {"url": "https://www.paddle.com/help/manage/get-paid/when-and-how-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payouts and fees"}, {"url": "https://www.paddle.com/paddle-101", "label": "Setup fee FAQ"}, {"url": "https://developer.paddle.com/build/go-live-checklist/", "label": "Payout methods"}, {"url": "https://www.paddle.com/help/manage/get-paid/is-there-a-fee-taken-for-payouts", "label": "Wire and conversion fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Paddle is the merchant of record, so it handles sales tax. Items under $10 need custom pricing.", "take": {"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Per checkout sale", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "$0 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "Paddle handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, $100 minimum", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Paddle", "groups": [{"label": "Checkout", "rates": [{"note": "Processing included", "extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Per checkout sale", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--paypro-global","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"PayPro Global","summary":"Software checkout with a quoted merchant of record plan.","website_url":"https://payproglobal.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/payproglobal-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Business-specific quote; no public setup or monthly price schedule.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payproglobal.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Transaction share is quoted per seller; no standard percentage is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payproglobal.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Global payment processing, local methods, and currency support are included in the quoted service.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payproglobal.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPro Global acts as reseller/MoR and handles sales taxes, VAT, and invoices.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payproglobal.com/faq/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Standard contract is one year with no cancellation fee. Payouts are usually on the 15th monthly. Fees vary by method: Payoneer $2, WebMoney 3.5% + $5, wire $21, North American ACH $3, PayPal free in US/Canada or 2% internationally (max $20); currency conversion may add cost.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://payproglobal.com/faq/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://payproglobal.com/pricing/", "label": "Custom pricing"}, {"url": "https://payproglobal.com/faq/", "label": "Contract and payouts"}, {"url": "https://developers.payproglobal.com/docs/platform-overview/withdrawal-options/", "label": "Withdrawal fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Payout fees depend on the method, from free PayPal in the US to $21 for a wire.", "take": {"label": "Set per seller", "value": "Custom quote", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Contract", "value": "One year", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, around the 15th", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "PayPro handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "PayPro", "groups": []}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--polar","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Polar","summary":"Bill subscriptions and usage with merchant of record checkout.","website_url":"https://polar.sh/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/polar-sh.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "$0 Starter; Pro $20/mo, Growth $100/mo, Scale $400/mo.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://polar.sh/resources/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "For organizations created on/after May 27, 2026: Starter 5% + $0.50; Pro 3.8% + $0.40; Growth 3.6% + $0.35; Scale 3.4% + $0.30. Earlier organizations retain 4% + $0.40 and +0.5% on subscriptions unless they upgrade.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://polar.sh/resources/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Base platform rate includes standard payment processing; non-US cards add 1.5%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://polar.sh/resources/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Polar is merchant of record and handles indirect tax compliance for sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://polar.sh/resources/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout providers charge $2/month with active payouts and 0.25% + $0.25 per payout; conversion adds 0.25% in EU or 1% elsewhere. Disputes cost $15; transaction fees remain on refunds. Early Member subscriptions add 0.5%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://polar.sh/features/finance"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://polar.sh/resources/pricing", "label": "Plans and fees"}, {"url": "https://polar.sh/features/finance", "label": "Processor and payouts"}, {"url": "https://polar.sh/legal/payment-processor-partners", "label": "Stripe processing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Rates below apply to organizations created on or after May 27, 2026. Earlier organizations keep 4% + $0.40 and the 0.5% subscription surcharge unless they upgrade.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record", "note": "Polar is the merchant of record. Payout providers charge $2 a month plus a small fee per payout.", "take": {"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Free plan", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plans", "value": "$0 to $400 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Non-US cards", "value": "+ 1.5%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "Polar handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Polar", "groups": [{"label": "Accounts from 27 May 2026", "rates": [{"extra": "+ 50¢", "label": "Starter, free", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ 40¢", "label": "Pro, $20 a month", "value": "3.8%", "percent": 3.8, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ 35¢", "label": "Growth, $100 a month", "value": "3.6%", "percent": 3.6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "Scale, $400 a month", "value": "3.4%", "percent": 3.4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Older accounts", "rates": [{"note": "+ 0.5% on subscriptions", "extra": "+ 40¢", "label": "All plans", "value": "4%", "percent": 4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "Scale plan", "value": "3.4%", "percent": 3.4, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--stripe-managed-payments","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Stripe Managed Payments","summary":"Add merchant of record handling to Stripe checkout.","website_url":"https://docs.stripe.com/payments/managed-payments","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/docs-stripe-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No setup fees or monthly minimum; pay per successful transaction.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/managed-payments"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Managed Payments adds 3.5% per successful transaction to standard Stripe processing fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/managed-payments"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Standard Stripe processing is extra; US domestic card pricing starts at 2.9% + $0.30 and varies by country/payment method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe’s Sold through Link entity is the merchant of record and handles indirect taxes in supported countries.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/managed-payments"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe Billing and some local payment methods cost extra; Managed Payments can be applied to selected transactions, markets, or products.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://stripe.com/managed-payments"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://stripe.com/managed-payments", "label": "Fees and services"}, {"url": "https://stripe.com/pricing", "label": "Stripe processing prices"}, {"url": "https://docs.stripe.com/payments/managed-payments", "label": "Eligibility"}, {"url": "https://support.stripe.com/questions/managed-payments-pricing?locale=en-GB", "label": "Fee and subscription details"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":3.5,"fee_basis":"Managed Payments surcharge; standard Stripe processing is extra","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Merchant of record add-on", "note": "Stripe becomes the merchant of record for tax. Stripe Billing costs extra.", "take": {"label": "On top of Stripe fees", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No monthly fee", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Stripe fees", "value": "From 2.9% + 30¢ in US", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sales tax", "value": "Stripe handles it", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Stripe", "groups": [{"label": "Managed Payments", "rates": [{"label": "On top of Stripe fees", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Standard Stripe processing", "rates": [{"note": "Varies by country and method", "extra": "+ 30¢", "label": "US cards", "value": "2.9%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-3"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services--verifone-2checkout","section_id":"software-and-saas-checkout-services","name":"Verifone 2Checkout","summary":"Choose payment processing, subscriptions, or a merchant of record plan.","website_url":"https://www.2checkout.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-2checkout-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free sign-up; no setup or monthly fee; charges apply when you make sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.2checkout.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "2Sell 3.5% + $0.35; 2Subscribe 4.5% + $0.45; 2Monetize and Enterprise are quote-based.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.2checkout.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Base fee covers standard cards and PayPal; localized payment methods can have separate prices.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.2checkout.com/pricing/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "2Monetize includes global tax and regulatory compliance; tax duties depend on plan and MoR or PSP model.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.2checkout.com/global-payments/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Some seller countries add 2% for buyers outside the seller country. Published plans list weekly payouts by wire, ACH, PayPal, or Payoneer; the merchant FAQ says actual timing depends on the agreement. Localized methods and add-ons can cost extra.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.2checkout.com/merchant-support/faq/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.2checkout.com/pricing/", "label": "Plans, fees, and payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.2checkout.com/global-payments/", "label": "Service models"}, {"url": "https://www.2checkout.com/merchant-support/faq/", "label": "Payout methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller; USD; standard online sales unless a plan or method is named.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Checkout and merchant of record", "note": "Only 2Monetize makes Verifone the merchant of record that handles global tax.", "take": {"extra": "+ 35¢", "label": "2Sell", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Cross-border", "value": "+ 2% in some countries", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Weekly", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Verifone", "groups": [{"label": "Plans", "rates": [{"note": "One-time sales", "extra": "+ 35¢", "label": "2Sell", "value": "3.5%", "percent": 3.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Subscriptions", "extra": "+ 45¢", "label": "2Subscribe", "value": "4.5%", "percent": 4.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Includes global tax handling", "label": "2Monetize and Enterprise", "value": "Custom quote", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"extra": "+ 45¢", "label": "2Subscribe", "value": "4.5%", "percent": 4.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--apify-store","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"Apify Store","summary":"Sell automation and scraping Actors by event or usage.","website_url":"https://docs.apify.com/actors/publishing/monetize","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/docs-apify-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Pay-per-event and usage pricing remain active; all rental Actors retire October 1, 2026.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.apify.com/actors/running/actors-in-store"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators receive 80% of user-paid Actor fees, less run costs; Apify retains 20%. Partner terms can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.apify.com/legal/store-publishing-terms-and-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Invoices are monthly; minimum is $20 for PayPal or Wise and $100 for other methods. Transfer fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.apify.com/actors/publishing/monetize/monthly-payouts"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Actor run costs reduce creator earnings unless passed through to users.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.apify.com/legal/store-publishing-terms-and-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators must complete identity and KYC checks before receiving payouts.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.apify.com/actors/publishing/monetize/monthly-payouts"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.apify.com/legal/store-publishing-terms-and-conditions", "label": "Creator share and payouts"}, {"url": "https://docs.apify.com/actors/publishing/monetize", "label": "Monetization models"}, {"url": "https://docs.apify.com/actors/publishing/monetize/monthly-payouts", "label": "Payout rules and fees"}, {"url": "https://docs.apify.com/actors/running/actors-in-store", "label": "Pricing and rental end"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Apify retains 20% of Actor fees, then deducts corresponding run costs unless passed through to users. Pay-per-event and usage stay active; all rental Actors retire October 1, 2026.","fee_percent":20,"fee_basis":"Fees paid for monetized Actors","sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Scrapers and automations", "note": "Your share is after run costs, unless you pass them on to users. Payouts need an identity check.", "take": {"label": "Actor fees", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Run costs", "value": "Taken from earnings", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Lowest payout", "value": "$20 via PayPal or Wise", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Rentals", "value": "End 1 Oct 2026", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Apify", "groups": [{"label": "Apify Store", "rates": [{"note": "Partner terms can differ", "label": "Actor fees", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--appsumo","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"AppSumo","summary":"Launch software and digital-product deals through AppSumo.","website_url":"https://sell.appsumo.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/sell-appsumo-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Most partner offers are lifetime deals; annual and other deal structures are also available.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sell.appsumo.com/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Revenue share is negotiated by product category and expected performance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sell.appsumo.com/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "There is no listing fee or product-count limit; AppSumo commissions apply to sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.appsumo.com/article/112-partner-costs-and-revenue"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "AppSumo uses Ramp to send payments; methods and currencies vary. Sales pay the first week of the month 60 days after month-end, minus refunds; transaction and FX fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.appsumo.com/article/101-partner-payments"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "AppSumo reviews applications for product quality, market fit, and partner stability.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://sell.appsumo.com/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://sell.appsumo.com/", "label": "Offer types and share"}, {"url": "https://help.appsumo.com/article/112-partner-costs-and-revenue", "label": "No listing fee"}, {"url": "https://help.appsumo.com/article/101-partner-payments", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Revenue share is negotiated by product category and expected performance. There is no upfront listing fee; payouts follow Net 60 after month-end.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Software deals", "note": "AppSumo sets its share per partner. Refunds come out of your payout.", "take": {"label": "By category and deal", "value": "Negotiated rate", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No listing fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Deals", "value": "Mostly lifetime", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "60 days after month end", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "AppSumo", "groups": []}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--aws-marketplace","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"AWS Marketplace","summary":"Sell cloud software through AWS procurement and billing.","website_url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/listing-fees.html","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/aws-amazon-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Offers include SaaS, AMI, containers, machine learning, data, and professional services.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/listing-fees.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Public rates: SaaS and Data Exchange 3%; AMI, container, and ML 20%. Private offers: 3%, 2%, or 1.5% by contract value; renewals 1.5%. Fees use pre-tax Total Contract Value (TCV).", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/listing-fees.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller registration is required; paid sellers need an eligible location, tax details, and bank information.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/user-guide-for-sellers.html"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "CPPO adds 0.5%; South Korea adds 1%. India: standard rates plus 18% GST in INR. Private professional services cost 0.5%, or 0% in qualifying multi-product offer sets.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/listing-fees.html"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "New product submissions require AWS review and seller approval before publication.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/product-submission.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/listing-fees.html", "label": "Listing rates and regional fees"}, {"url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/pricing-overview.html", "label": "Pricing models"}, {"url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/user-guide-for-sellers.html", "label": "Seller registration"}, {"url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/india-seller-faq.html", "label": "India GST"}, {"url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/marketplace/latest/userguide/product-submission.html", "label": "Product review"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Rates are 3% for public SaaS/Data Exchange, 20% for public AMI/container/ML, and 3%/2%/1.5% for private offers by pre-tax TCV. Private professional services are 0.5%, or 0% in qualifying multi-product offer sets. CPPO and regional uplifts apply; India adds 18% GST in INR.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Cloud software", "note": "Fees are on the pre-tax contract value. AWS reviews new products before they go live.", "take": {"label": "Public SaaS and data", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Registration required", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Partner offers", "value": "+ 0.5%", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "India", "value": "+ 18% GST", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "AWS", "groups": [{"label": "Public offers", "rates": [{"label": "Public SaaS and data", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Servers, containers, ML", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Private offers", "rates": [{"label": "New offers, by contract value", "value": "1.5–3%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Renewals", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "0% in qualifying bundles", "label": "Professional services", "value": "0.5%", "percent": 0.5, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}, {"label": "Extra charges", "rates": [{"label": "Channel partner offers", "value": "+ 0.5%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "South Korea", "value": "+ 1%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-4"}]}], "second": {"label": "Servers, containers, ML", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--dealify","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"Dealify","summary":"Run lifetime, annual, credit-based, or free software deals.","website_url":"https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-dealify-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Dealify supports lifetime, annual, credit-based, and free offers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Dealify promotes fair commissions but publishes no seller percentage.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public seller page states no standard listing or setup fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public seller page gives no processing fees or payout schedule.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Sellers submit deals through Dealify’s partnership form.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dealify.com/pages/run-a-deal", "label": "Seller terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Dealify promotes fair commissions and flexible deal types but publishes no seller rate, setup fee, or payout schedule.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Software deals", "note": "Dealify does not publish its commission.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Deals", "value": "Lifetime, annual, credits", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Partnership form", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Dealify", "groups": []}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--dealmirror","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"DealMirror","summary":"Sell software, plugins, and digital-product deals on DealMirror.","website_url":"https://dealmirror.com/how-vendorship-works/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/dealmirror-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Accepts SaaS, lifetime deals, plugins, themes, graphics, and bundles.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealmirror.com/how-vendorship-works/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Vendor page advertises up to 70%; its FAQ says vendors receive 50% per sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealmirror.com/how-vendorship-works/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No fixed listing fee is stated; the vendor page excludes PayPal fees and taxes from its no-extra-cost claim.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealmirror.com/how-vendorship-works/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Vendor guide: USD bank transfer in the first week monthly; its 60-day clause concerns deal closure. FAQ: PayPal after a successful 60-day deal with no complaint.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealmirror.com/vendor-guide/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Vendors sign terms; submitted products require approval before publication.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://dealmirror.com/vendor-guide/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://dealmirror.com/how-vendorship-works/", "label": "Vendor offers"}, {"url": "https://dealmirror.com/vendor-guide/", "label": "Vendor terms and payouts"}, {"url": "https://dealmirror.com/vendors-frequently-asked-questions/", "label": "FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The vendor page advertises up to 70%, while its FAQ says 50%. Vendor terms calculate share on the discounted net price; payout details also conflict.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Software and plugin deals", "note": "DealMirror’s vendor page and FAQ give different shares. PayPal fees and taxes are extra.", "take": {"label": "Sources disagree", "value": "30–50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fixed fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Approval needed", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "DealMirror", "groups": [{"label": "DealMirror share", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "FAQ", "value": "50%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Up to 70% for you", "label": "Vendor page", "value": "30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--google-cloud-marketplace","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"Google Cloud Marketplace","summary":"Sell cloud software, data, and services through Google Cloud billing.","website_url":"https://cloud.google.com/terms/marketplace-revenue-share-schedule","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/cloud-google-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Integrated SaaS supports subscription, usage-based, or combined pricing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/integrated-saas/select-pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Eligible partners: 3% on standard offers at any TCV and new private offers under $1M; 2% on new private offers from $1M to under $10M; 1.5% on new private offers at $10M+ and qualifying renewals, channel shifts, or migrations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cloud.google.com/terms/marketplace-revenue-share-schedule"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public partner docs reviewed do not state a separate listing or onboarding price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/get-started"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payouts go to a bank account, typically on the 21st of each month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/receive-payments"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Producer Portal access requires a signed Marketplace vendor agreement, approved Solution Validation form, and completed project info form.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/integrated-saas/select-pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://cloud.google.com/terms/marketplace-revenue-share-schedule", "label": "Vendor revenue schedule"}, {"url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/receive-payments", "label": "Billing and payouts"}, {"url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/integrated-saas/select-pricing", "label": "SaaS pricing models"}, {"url": "https://docs.cloud.google.com/marketplace/docs/partners/get-started", "label": "Partner requirements"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Eligible partners pay 3% on standard offers at any TCV and new private offers under $1M, with lower rates on larger new private deals and qualifying renewals, migrations, and channel shifts.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Cloud software and data", "note": "Google bills customers and pays you by bank transfer each month.", "take": {"label": "Standard offers", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, around the 21st", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Vendor agreement", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Google", "groups": [{"label": "Standard offers", "rates": [{"note": "Any contract value", "label": "Standard offers", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "New private offers", "rates": [{"label": "Under $1M", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "$1M to $10M", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Private, $10M and up", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Other", "rates": [{"label": "Qualifying renewals and migrations", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Private, $10M and up", "value": "1.5%", "percent": 1.5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--rapidapi","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"RapidAPI","summary":"Charge for API access with free, subscription, or pay-per-use plans.","website_url":"https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/monetizing-your-api-on-rapidapicom","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/docs-rapidapi-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "API providers can offer free, pay-per-use, freemium, or paid subscription plans.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/monetizing-your-api-on-rapidapicom"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Rapid takes 25% of all API Hub payments; the fee includes payment processing and platform costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/payouts-and-finance"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Creating a RapidAPI account is free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/account-creation-and-settings"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal payout fee varies by country; it can be 2% of the payout, capped at $20. Refunds or disputes can also reduce payout.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://rapidapi.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/19308532866068-How-are-payouts-calculated"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal is the only payout method; sales are processed at the end of the following month and paid in the first week of the second month after sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/payouts-and-finance"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/payouts-and-finance", "label": "Fees and payouts"}, {"url": "https://rapidapi.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/19308532866068-How-are-payouts-calculated", "label": "PayPal payout fee"}, {"url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/monetizing-your-api-on-rapidapicom", "label": "API pricing plans"}, {"url": "https://docs.rapidapi.com/docs/account-creation-and-settings", "label": "Free account"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Rapid takes 25% of API Hub payments. Creating a RapidAPI account is free. PayPal payouts can add a country-dependent fee up to 2%, capped at $20; sales are processed after the following month and paid in the second month.","fee_percent":25,"fee_basis":"API Hub marketplace payments","sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Paid APIs", "note": "The 25% includes payment processing. Payouts arrive about five weeks after the month ends.", "take": {"label": "All payments", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "PayPal only", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "PayPal fee", "value": "Up to 2%, max $20", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "RapidAPI", "groups": [{"label": "API Hub", "rates": [{"note": "Processing included", "label": "All payments", "value": "25%", "percent": 25, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--snowflake-marketplace-apps","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"Snowflake Marketplace apps","summary":"Sell Snowflake apps and data with subscription or usage billing.","website_url":"https://docs.snowflake.com/en/en/collaboration/provider-listings-pricing-model","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/docs-snowflake-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid listings support usage-based pricing and subscriptions, including one-time or recurring access.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-listings-pricing-model"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "Snowflake deducts a transaction fee; each provider sees its fee schedule in Snowsight under Admin, Billing & Terms, Fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-transactions-invoicing-collections"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "A Stripe Express payout account is required; Snowflake charges no additional fee for the connected account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-transactions-invoicing-collections"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payout follows 30 days after full customer payment, minus Snowflake fees, taxes, and permitted adjustments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-transactions-invoicing-collections"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid providers need an approved profile in an eligible country; public paid listings also require Snowflake approval.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-becoming"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-transactions-invoicing-collections", "label": "Transaction fees and payouts"}, {"url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-listings-pricing-model", "label": "Pricing models"}, {"url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/collaboration/provider-becoming", "label": "Eligibility and approval"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Snowflake keeps a transaction fee whose rate is visible only to providers in Snowsight. Payout follows 30 days after the customer pays in full.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Snowflake apps and data", "note": "Snowflake shows each provider its fee inside Snowsight, not publicly.", "take": {"label": "Provider fee in Snowsight", "value": "Shown in dashboard", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Payouts", "value": "30 days after payment", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payout account", "value": "Stripe, no extra fee", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Approval needed", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Snowflake", "groups": []}}, {"id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces--stacksocial","section_id":"software-saas-and-api-marketplaces","name":"StackSocial","summary":"Promote software offers through StackSocial and its publisher network.","website_url":"https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-stacksocial-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Merchant offers include marketplace listings, curated placements, publisher distribution, affiliates, and commerce content.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public merchant page lists no standard seller commission or revenue share.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public merchant page lists no standard listing or setup fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Seller processing fees, refunds, and payout timing are not listed on the merchant page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Merchants can apply for StackSocial listings and promotional partnerships.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.stackcommerce.com/advertise", "label": "Merchant listings"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"StackCommerce offers listings and promotional campaigns, but its public merchant page lists no standard seller fees or payout schedule.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Software deals and promotion", "note": "StackSocial does not publish seller terms.", "take": {"label": "Partner terms", "value": "Fee not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Reach", "value": "Publisher network", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Apply", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "StackSocial", "groups": []}}, {"id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components--code-market","section_id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components","name":"Code.market catalog","summary":"List digital products for discovery; buyers complete purchases on the merchant’s site.","website_url":"https://code.market/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/code-market.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "A catalog that refers buyers to third-party merchants; legacy author sales and payouts have ended.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://code.market/page/change-log"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Code.market does not collect product payments; merchants may pay it a referral commission, but the rate is not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://code.market/page/terms-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Catalog listing fee is not stated; optional paid placements and other Code.market services are separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://code.market/page/terms-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public catalog listing exclusivity terms are not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://code.market/page/terms-conditions"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "The third-party merchant handles product checkout, delivery, licensing, refunds, and support.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://code.market/page/terms-conditions"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://code.market/page/terms-conditions", "label": "Catalog and referral terms"}, {"url": "https://code.market/page/change-log", "label": "Sales status"}, {"url": "https://code.market/pricing", "label": "Services and placements"}, {"url": "https://code.market/catalog", "label": "Public catalog"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Code.market is a referral catalog; the third-party merchant completes the product sale.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Product catalog", "note": "Code.market now only lists products. Buyers pay on your own site.", "take": {"label": "Rate not disclosed", "value": "Referral commission", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Checkout", "value": "On your own site", "fact_key": "fact-5"}, {"label": "Placements", "value": "Paid, optional", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Author sales", "value": "Ended", "fact_key": "fact-1"}], "owner": "Code.market", "groups": []}}, {"id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components--codegrape","section_id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components","name":"CodeGrape","summary":"Sell scripts, themes, plugins, app source, and other digital assets.","website_url":"https://www.codegrape.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-codegrape-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-file marketplace sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codegrape.com/faqs/selling"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Creators receive 60% of sale proceeds; CodeGrape keeps 40%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codegrape.com/legal-information/membership-agreement"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Author status is required; any author signup or listing fee is not stated publicly.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codegrape.com/faqs/selling"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "CodeGrape advertises no exclusivity lock-in; sellers may also sell elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codegrape.com/sell"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Withdraw at any time via PayPal or Wise after $50; payout fees are not stated. Special-deal commissions may differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codegrape.com/sell"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.codegrape.com/faqs/selling", "label": "Seller FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.codegrape.com/sell", "label": "Author program"}, {"url": "https://www.codegrape.com/legal-information/membership-agreement", "label": "Membership Agreement"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"CodeGrape pays 60% of sale proceeds; withdrawals start at $50.","fee_percent":40,"fee_basis":"CodeGrape retains the remaining 40% of sale proceeds.","sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Code marketplace", "note": "Withdraw any time through PayPal or Wise.", "take": {"label": "All sales", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "CodeGrape", "groups": [{"label": "CodeGrape", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 60%", "label": "All sales", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components--codester","section_id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components","name":"Codester","summary":"Sell scripts, code, themes, plugins, app source code, and graphics.","website_url":"https://www.codester.com/info/seller","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-codester-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-sale commissions; Codester handles checkout and file delivery.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codester.com/info/seller"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Sellers receive 70% of eligible sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codester.com/info/seller"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Membership is free and sellers do not pay to offer products for sale.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codester.com/info/member_terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "No exclusivity required; creators may sell through other channels.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codester.com/info/seller"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Payouts are requested at $50 or more; Payoneer or payment agents are available, and $500+ can use bank transfer. Seller covers taxes and currency conversion; special-deal rates can vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.codester.com/info/member_terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.codester.com/info/seller", "label": "Seller program"}, {"url": "https://www.codester.com/info/author", "label": "Author guide"}, {"url": "https://www.codester.com/info/member_terms", "label": "Membership terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Codester seller terms; payout method and applicable taxes vary.","fee_percent":30,"fee_basis":"Codester seller commission is 70% of eligible sales.","sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Code marketplace", "note": "Codester runs checkout and file delivery. Special deals can use other rates.", "take": {"label": "Eligible sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Codester", "groups": [{"label": "Codester", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Eligible sales", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components--envato-codecanyon","section_id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components","name":"Envato CodeCanyon","summary":"License creative assets through Envato Market.","website_url":"https://codecanyon.net/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/codecanyon-net.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-item license sales", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472943-Introduction-to-Earnings"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors retain 50% of the item price before withholding tax; the buyer fee is separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472943-Introduction-to-Earnings"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Envato says Code authors are not part of the current invitation intake.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "The Market author agreement is non-exclusive; authors may sell elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41371538488473-Envato-Market-Author-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly payouts require a $50 minimum; local-currency conversion adds a 1.9% markup. Bank and provider fees depend on payout method.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/20535795834393-Getting-Started-with-the-Envato-Payout-System"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472943-Introduction-to-Earnings", "label": "Pricing, share, and payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41371538488473-Envato-Market-Author-Terms", "label": "Documentation"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041052771-Becoming-an-Envato-Author-FAQs", "label": "Application status"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only", "label": "Application status, Sep 2026"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/20535795834393-Getting-Started-with-the-Envato-Payout-System", "label": "Payouts and fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Authors retain 50% of the item price before tax. The buyer fee is separate; payouts have a $50 minimum and route-dependent charges.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Code marketplace", "note": "Envato is not inviting new Code authors right now.", "take": {"label": "Of item price", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New authors", "value": "Not invited now", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Envato", "groups": [{"label": "Envato Market", "rates": [{"note": "Before tax; buyer fee is separate", "label": "Of item price", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-components--sellmyapp","section_id":"source-code-scripts-and-developer-co