ow-much-do-i-earn-from-each-sale"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No separate upload or listing fee is stated in the public contributor guides; its share of each sale is listed separately.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/contributors-onboarding-guide"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive by default; exclusive items can also be sold on your own site or as physical copies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-the-difference-between-non-exclusive-stock-content-and-exclusive-stock-content"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid monthly on the 15th–18th in USD via Wise, PayPal, or Payoneer. Choose a $25 or $100 threshold; provider fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-payout-threshold"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/how-much-do-i-earn-from-each-sale", "label": "Per-item shares"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-the-marketplace-subscription-plan", "label": "Subscription pool"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-the-difference-between-non-exclusive-stock-content-and-exclusive-stock-content", "label": "Exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/how-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-the-difference-between-uploading-and-publishing-a-content-item", "label": "Onboarding"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/does-motionelements-commission-contributors-works", "label": "Sales model"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/contributors-onboarding-guide", "label": "Onboarding and share"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-payout-threshold", "label": "Payout threshold"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Per-item share: 50% non-exclusive / 70% exclusive; subscription pool pays 50% of net.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Stock music and sounds", "note": "Exclusive items can still be sold on your own site.", "take": {"label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Optional", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, 15th to 18th", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "MotionElements", "groups": [{"label": "Per item", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Exclusive", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "rates": [{"note": "Of net subscription revenue", "label": "Subscription pool", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs--pond5-audio","section_id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs","name":"Pond5 audio","summary":"Music and sound effects earn 30%; optional dataset licenses pay 20%.","website_url":"https://www.pond5.com/royalty-free-music/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-pond5-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-license sales, subscriptions, partner programs, and dataset deals.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Music and sound effects: 30%; dataset licenses: 20%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free Pond5 seller account; no upload fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/faq/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Audio can be sold on other platforms; Pond5 exclusivity applies to footage.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.pond5.com/sell-stock-footage"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Regular payouts run monthly on the 15th at a $25 balance: PayPal, Payoneer, or Skrill. Skrill deducts 4%; partner and dataset terms can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/", "label": "Royalties and payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.pond5.com/sell-stock-footage", "label": "Exclusivity and terms"}, {"url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/faq/", "label": "Signup and payout FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Per-license share: 30% music/SFX; 20% datasets. Regular payout threshold: $25.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Stock music and sounds", "note": "Dataset deals are optional. Skrill payouts lose 4%.", "take": {"label": "Music and sound effects", "value": "70%", "percent": 70, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Pond5", "groups": [{"label": "Pond5", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 30%", "label": "Music and sound effects", "value": "70%", "percent": 70, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 20%", "label": "Dataset licenses", "value": "80%", "percent": 80, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Dataset licenses", "value": "80%", "percent": 80, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs--productioncrate","section_id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs","name":"ProductionCrate","summary":"Free and paid media library; its public terms describe assets owned by ProductionCrate.","website_url":"https://www.productioncrate.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-productioncrate-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free and paid access to a library of media elements that the terms describe as owned by ProductionCrate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/terms.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "The terms describe ProductionCrate-owned media, and its FAQ says its team produces the catalog; no public third-party creator marketplace is presented.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/terms.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable to the public offer: no third-party creator listing program is presented.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/terms.html"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable to the public offer: media is licensed from ProductionCrate, with no public creator submission terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/terms.html"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_applicable", "value": "Not applicable to the public offer: no third-party creator payout program is presented.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/terms.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://app.productioncrate.com/terms.html", "label": "Terms and ownership"}, {"url": "https://app.productioncrate.com/questions-answers.html", "label": "Membership FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/questions-answers.html", "label": "Library FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.productioncrate.com/terms.html", "label": "Current terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"This directory classification is an inference from current terms and catalog pages: the public product is a company-owned media library, with no creator marketplace or payout program presented.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Company-made media library", "note": "ProductionCrate makes its own library and does not sell creators’ work.", "take": {"label": "In-house content library", "value": "No creator marketplace", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Library", "value": "Made in-house", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Submissions", "value": "None offered", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "No creator payouts", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "ProductionCrate", "groups": []}}, {"id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs--songtradr","section_id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs","name":"Songtradr","summary":"Songtradr Marketplace closes September 30, 2026; new licensing deals are invite-only.","website_url":"https://www.songtradr.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-songtradr-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Marketplace closes September 30, 2026; dashboard access then ends.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15327029-the-future-of-songtradr-marketplace-for-artists-what-you-need-to-know-and-do"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "New licensing placements are invite-only and require a separate Master Services Agreement; no current public creator percentage is stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15306637-what-happens-to-the-licensing-deals-i-ve-already-opted-into"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No seller fee is stated for the invite-only licensing deals.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15327029-the-future-of-songtradr-marketplace-for-artists-what-you-need-to-know-and-do"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "New placements are invite-only; selected creators sign a separate Master Services Agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15306637-what-happens-to-the-licensing-deals-i-ve-already-opted-into"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Request final withdrawal by September 30; after that, balances require manual recovery. Thresholds are $2 US / $5 outside the US, with $1 / $4 fees. Closure guidance allows 7–10 business days, while a general FAQ still says requests were to be paid by September 1.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15327077-how-can-i-withdraw-my-earnings-before-the-close-of-marketplace"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15306188-the-future-of-songtradr-marketplace-for-artists-what-you-need-to-know-and-do", "label": "Closure notice"}, {"url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15306637-what-happens-to-the-licensing-deals-i-ve-already-opted-into", "label": "Licensing transition"}, {"url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15262665-common-withdrawal-q-a", "label": "Withdrawal fees"}, {"url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15327077-how-can-i-withdraw-my-earnings-before-the-close-of-marketplace", "label": "Final withdrawal deadline"}, {"url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15327085-what-is-the-minimum-payment-threshold-for-withdrawals", "label": "Withdrawal thresholds"}, {"url": "https://support.songtradr.com/en/articles/15327029-the-future-of-songtradr-marketplace-for-artists-what-you-need-to-know-and-do", "label": "Closure deadlines"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"No public creator rate for new curated deals; Marketplace closes 30 September 2026.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Music licensing", "note": "After the marketplace closes, remaining balances need manual recovery.", "take": {"label": "Licensing placements", "value": "Set by agreement", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Marketplace", "value": "Closes 30 Sep 2026", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "New deals", "value": "Invite only", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Last withdrawal", "value": "By 30 Sep 2026", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Songtradr", "groups": []}}, {"id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs--splice-sound-partners","section_id":"stock-music-sound-effects-and-sample-packs","name":"Splice sound partners","summary":"Curated samples and packs; Splice contacts selected creators with deal details.","website_url":"https://splice.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/splice-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Samples and packs are licensed through Splice credit-based plans; eligible creators can submit content for review.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/8652643-how-do-i-submit-my-own-samples-packs-to-sell-on-splice"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Exact creator split is not public. Each Variation costs one Splice credit, which Splice says counts as payment to the original sample creator.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/12997523-how-to-use-variations-in-the-splice-sounds-plugin-now-in-beta"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "The public submission page lists no seller fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/8652643-how-do-i-submit-my-own-samples-packs-to-sell-on-splice"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Creators submit samples or packs for review; Splice contacts selected creators with more information. Public exclusivity terms are not listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/8652643-how-do-i-submit-my-own-samples-packs-to-sell-on-splice"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Public payout timing, method, and deductions are not listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/8652643-how-do-i-submit-my-own-samples-packs-to-sell-on-splice"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/8652643-how-do-i-submit-my-own-samples-packs-to-sell-on-splice", "label": "Submission terms"}, {"url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/8652639-how-do-credits-work", "label": "Credit rules"}, {"url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/12997860-faq-splice-sounds-plugin-now-in-beta", "label": "Creator payment FAQ"}, {"url": "https://support.splice.com/en/articles/12997523-how-to-use-variations-in-the-splice-sounds-plugin-now-in-beta", "label": "Variation payments"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Creator split is not public; selected creators get terms after review.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Samples and packs", "note": "Splice shares deal terms only with creators it selects.", "take": {"label": "Creator rate", "value": "Rate not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Submissions", "value": "Reviewed", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Pricing", "value": "One credit per sample", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Splice", "groups": []}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--adobe-stock-video","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Adobe Stock video","summary":"License stock video under standard, custom-plan, and optional Free Collection terms.","website_url":"https://contributor.stock.adobe.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/contributor-stock-adobe-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Stock video licenses are sold through Adobe Stock plans, credit packs, and on-demand purchases.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://helpx.adobe.com/stock/contributor/payments-earnings/royalties-pricing/royalty-rates-assets.html"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard video royalty is 35% of net licensed price. Custom plans pay 35% of attributable price or a flat rate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://helpx.adobe.com/stock/contributor/payments-earnings/royalties-pricing/royalty-rates-assets.html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to join and upload; there is no contributor listing charge.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.stock.adobe.com/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Adobe states the creator partnership is non-exclusive; the artist keeps control of the work.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.stock.adobe.com/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Request payout at $25 after at least 45 days from first sale. PayPal, Payoneer, or Skrill; provider availability varies by region.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://helpx.adobe.com/stock/contributor/payments-earnings/payment-taxes/payment-requirements.html"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://helpx.adobe.com/stock/contributor/payments-earnings/royalties-pricing/royalty-rates-assets.html", "label": "Royalty rates"}, {"url": "https://helpx.adobe.com/stock/contributor/payments-earnings/royalties-pricing/pricing-payment-guidelines.html", "label": "Free Collection rates"}, {"url": "https://contributor.stock.adobe.com/", "label": "Cost and exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://helpx.adobe.com/stock/contributor/payments-earnings/payment-taxes/payment-requirements.html", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Standard video licenses pay 35% of net licensed price. Custom plans may use attributable pricing or a flat amount. The optional 2026 Free Collection pays video contributors 7 credits for one year or 16 credits for perpetual use.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Stock video", "note": "Custom plans pay 35% or a flat rate.", "take": {"label": "Video", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Adobe", "groups": [{"label": "Standard licenses", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 35%", "label": "Video", "value": "65%", "percent": 65, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--blackbox","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"BlackBox","summary":"Distributes footage to partner agencies and takes commission only on sales.","website_url":"https://www.blackbox.global/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-blackbox-global.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Footage is distributed through partner agencies; earnings come from their licenses.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blackbox.global/faq"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "BlackBox takes a 15% commission plus an approximately 3% transaction fee on monthly net sales; the balance is distributed pro rata by contributor ownership.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blackbox.global/terms-of-service"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free membership; no subscription fee.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blackbox.global/faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard content gets a non-exclusive license; jointly created content gets an exclusive license if accepted. Creators retain copyright.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blackbox.global/terms-of-service"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "not_public", "value": "Payout methods, minimum, and timing are not published in the public FAQ or terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.blackbox.global/terms-of-service"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.blackbox.global/faq", "label": "Contributor FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.blackbox.global/terms-of-service", "label": "Fees and license terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"BlackBox takes a 15% commission and approximately 3% transaction fee on monthly net sales, then distributes the remaining balance pro rata by the contributors’ ownership share. Payout terms are not public.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Monthly net sales; ~3% transaction fee also applies","sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Footage distribution", "note": "BlackBox only earns when your footage sells through its partner agencies.", "take": {"extra": "+ about 3%", "label": "Of net sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Sells through", "value": "Partner agencies", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Rights", "value": "You keep copyright", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "BlackBox", "groups": [{"label": "BlackBox", "rates": [{"note": "The 3% is a transaction fee", "extra": "+ about 3%", "label": "Of net sales", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--dissolve","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Dissolve","summary":"Curated stock footage and photos; current creator share terms are not published.","website_url":"https://dissolve.com/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Contributors earn royalties when licensed content sells.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://communication.dissolve.com/hubfs/Contributor%20Guide%20%282019%29.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "not_public", "value": "A current creator percentage is not published in the public contributor materials.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://communication.dissolve.com/hubfs/Contributor%20Guide%20%282019%29.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "A current seller or listing fee is not published in the public contributor materials.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://communication.dissolve.com/hubfs/Contributor%20Guide%20%282019%29.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "The contributor guide describes an exclusive contributor option alongside regular submissions.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://communication.dissolve.com/hubfs/Contributor%20Guide%20%282019%29.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "The latest public contributor guide found is from 2019: it says payment was due in the second half of the next month. Current public payout methods, minimum and schedule are not stated.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://communication.dissolve.com/hubfs/Contributor%20Guide%20%282019%29.pdf"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://communication.dissolve.com/hubfs/Contributor%20Guide%20%282019%29.pdf", "label": "Contributor guide, 2019"}, {"url": "https://dissolve.com/", "label": "Marketplace"}, {"url": "https://dissolve.com/creators", "label": "Creator page"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The public contributor guide is from 2019. No current public royalty percentage, contributor fee or payout schedule was found; the old guide describes optional exclusive batches.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Curated stock footage", "note": "Dissolve’s last public contributor guide is from 2019.", "take": {"label": "Creator share", "value": "Share not disclosed", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Optional", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Dissolve", "groups": []}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--envato-videohive","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Envato VideoHive","summary":"Envato Market authors keep half the item price, excluding the buyer fee.","website_url":"https://videohive.net/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/videohive-net.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-item licenses on Envato Market.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472343-Pricing-Your-Items-Responsibly"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Authors keep 50% of the item price; the buyer fee is separate.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472343-Pricing-Your-Items-Responsibly"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Open applications are paused; current invitation eligibility for Video authors is unspecified.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive; authors may sell their items elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41371538488473-Envato-Market-Author-Terms"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Paid monthly on the 15th after a $50 minimum; bank transfer or PayPal. Payout fees vary by method and country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/20535795834393-Getting-Started-with-the-Envato-Payout-System"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000472343-Pricing-Your-Items-Responsibly", "label": "Author fee"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/41371538488473-Envato-Market-Author-Terms", "label": "Author terms"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/20535795834393-Getting-Started-with-the-Envato-Payout-System", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041052771-Becoming-an-Envato-Author-FAQs", "label": "Application status"}, {"url": "https://help.author.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/53981083605913-Author-applications-are-paused-new-authors-join-by-invitation-only", "label": "Application status, Sep 2026"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Authors receive 50% of the item price before tax; Envato adds a separate buyer fee. New author applications are paused, and payouts require $50.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Video templates", "note": "Envato is not taking open applications right now.", "take": {"label": "Of item price", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New authors", "value": "Applications paused", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Envato", "groups": [{"label": "Envato Market", "rates": [{"note": "Before tax; buyer fee is separate", "label": "Of item price", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--motion-array","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Motion Array","summary":"Download-based royalties; Motion Array is not accepting new artist applications.","website_url":"https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/motionarray-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Royalties are based on downloads; new artist applications are currently closed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Earnings vary with downloads; no fixed creator percentage is published.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Seller fees are not stated on the public artist page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive catalog; artists may sell on other platforms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly PayPal or Payoneer once earnings exceed $50 USD; lower balances roll forward.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://motionarray.com/become-a-producer/", "label": "Artist terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Artist earnings vary by asset downloads; Motion Array publishes no fixed royalty percentage. New artist applications are closed. Monthly payout is available above $50 USD via PayPal or Payoneer.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Video templates", "note": "Motion Array pays by downloads and does not publish a fixed share.", "take": {"label": "No fixed creator share", "value": "Paid by downloads", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New artists", "value": "Closed", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Motion Array", "groups": []}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--motionelements","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"MotionElements","summary":"Stock assets pay 50% by default or 70% when listed as exclusive.","website_url":"https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/selling-your-works-with-us","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/help-motionelements-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-item licensing; separate subscription and partner programs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/selling-your-works-with-us"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-item sales: 50% non-exclusive or 70% exclusive. Global Content+ pays 50% of net license fees, with plan-specific subscription calculations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/how-much-do-i-earn-from-each-sale"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "No upfront listing fee is stated. The FAQ says no commission, while the per-item terms give creators 50% or 70%; the meaning of commission is unclear.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/does-motionelements-commission-contributors-works"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Non-exclusive by default. Exclusive items can be sold through MotionElements, your own site, or as hard copies.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-the-difference-between-non-exclusive-stock-content-and-exclusive-stock-content"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly, 15th to 18th; $25 or $100 threshold; Wise, PayPal, or Payoneer. Provider fees may apply.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-payout-threshold"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/how-much-do-i-earn-from-each-sale", "label": "Royalty rates"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-the-difference-between-non-exclusive-stock-content-and-exclusive-stock-content", "label": "Exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/selling-your-works-with-us", "label": "Contributor program"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/how-to-set-up-payment-information", "label": "Payout setup"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/how-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payout timing"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/does-motionelements-commission-contributors-works", "label": "Commission FAQ"}, {"url": "https://help.motionelements.com/en/contributor/docs/what-is-payout-threshold", "label": "Payout threshold"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Creators receive 50% of per-item non-exclusive sales or 70% of exclusive sales. The help page also says it does not commission contributor works, but its use of commission is unclear; no upfront listing fee is stated.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Stock video and templates", "note": "Exclusive items can still be sold on your own site.", "take": {"label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "No fee stated", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Optional", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, 15th to 18th", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "MotionElements", "groups": [{"label": "Per item", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 50%", "label": "Non-exclusive", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "Exclusive", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Subscriptions", "rates": [{"note": "Of net license fees", "label": "Global Content+", "value": "50%", "percent": 50, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--pond5","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Pond5","summary":"License footage with optional marketplace exclusivity for a higher video share.","website_url":"https://www.pond5.com/sell-stock-footage","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-pond5-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Stock video is licensed directly, through subscriptions, and through partner programs; some partner/dataset payouts follow separate terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "30% non-exclusive or 40% exclusive for video licenses. Dataset earnings are 20%; partner and extended-license earnings can use separate terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Free to create an artist account, upload footage, and start selling.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.pond5.com/sell-stock-footage"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Exclusivity is optional. The 40% rate requires footage to be exclusive to Pond5/Shutterstock marketplaces; direct sales on your own site remain allowed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/pond5-exclusive-video-artist-program/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Regular earnings pay on the 15th when the balance is at least $25. PayPal, Payoneer, or Skrill; Skrill deducts 4%. Partner/dataset payment timing can differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/payout-overview/", "label": "Share and payouts"}, {"url": "https://contributor.pond5.com/getting-started/pond5-exclusive-video-artist-program/", "label": "Exclusive program"}, {"url": "https://www.pond5.com/sell-stock-footage", "label": "Signup and uploads"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Video creators receive 30% of net revenue for non-exclusive clips or 40% for exclusive clips. Partner, subscription, and dataset programs can use separate terms; regular sales pay monthly at a $25 balance.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Stock footage", "note": "Exclusive means only Pond5 and Shutterstock. You can still sell on your own site.", "take": {"label": "Non-exclusive video", "value": "70%", "percent": 70, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "Optional", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$25", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Pond5", "groups": [{"label": "Video", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 30%", "label": "Non-exclusive video", "value": "70%", "percent": 70, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 40%", "label": "Exclusive video", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Datasets", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 20%", "label": "Dataset earnings", "value": "80%", "percent": 80, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Exclusive video", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--shutterstock-video","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Shutterstock video","summary":"Video royalty levels rise with licensed downloads and reset each January.","website_url":"https://submit.shutterstock.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/submit-shutterstock-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Per-download licensing. Some video downloads pay a $0.10 minimum when the level percentage would be lower.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/12136655-why-am-i-still-seeing-0-10-earnings-at-higher-levels"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Six video earnings levels range from 15% to 40%, based on current-year video downloads; levels reset each January.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594604-how-much-will-i-be-paid-as-a-contributor-to-shutterstock"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Contributor account and video submissions are free.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594647-how-do-i-submit-video-for-review"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Shutterstock is non-exclusive; contributors keep copyright and can sell the same work elsewhere.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/12136338-what-is-shutterstock-s-content-exclusivity-policy"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Automatic monthly payouts use the account setting, but payout help does not state its floor. Terms v9 sets $35 electronically or $500 by check; some countries also wait 90 days from first approval. Official pages conflict on the minimum.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10617435-how-do-i-get-paid-for-my-work"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594604-how-much-will-i-be-paid-as-a-contributor-to-shutterstock", "label": "Earnings levels"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594647-how-do-i-submit-video-for-review", "label": "Video submission"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/12136338-what-is-shutterstock-s-content-exclusivity-policy", "label": "Exclusivity"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10617435-how-do-i-get-paid-for-my-work", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10617495-how-do-i-sell-my-work-on-shutterstock", "label": "Registration and minimum"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/12136655-why-am-i-still-seeing-0-10-earnings-at-higher-levels", "label": "Minimum per download"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594609-how-much-will-i-earn-per-download", "label": "Plans and earnings"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594678-submitter-terms-of-service-version-9", "label": "Terms v9 minimums"}, {"url": "https://submit.shutterstock.com/help/en/articles/10594583-why-is-my-account-in-a-90-day-waiting-period", "label": "90-day wait"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Video licenses pay one of six annual levels from 15% to 40%; some large subscription downloads still pay a $0.10 minimum. Level count resets each January.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Stock video", "note": "Some downloads pay a 10¢ minimum. Levels reset on 1 January.", "take": {"label": "By yearly downloads", "value": "60–85%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Levels", "value": "Reset each January", "fact_key": "fact-2"}], "owner": "Shutterstock", "groups": [{"label": "Six levels", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 15%", "label": "Level 1", "value": "85%", "percent": 85, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 40%", "label": "Level 6", "value": "60%", "percent": 60, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates--storyblocks-contributor-program","section_id":"stock-video-and-motion-templates","name":"Storyblocks contributor program","summary":"Subscription royalties are variable; video stays non-exclusive and the agreement includes dataset and model use.","website_url":"https://contribute.storyblocks.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/contribute-storyblocks-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Subscription revenue pool, with separate dataset and machine-learning revenue terms.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contribute.storyblocks.com/contributor-license"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Member Library earnings come from a revenue pool; each contributor share varies by the value/downloads of their content relative to others. The pool size and exact share are proprietary. The agreement uses 60% only as an example.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contribute.storyblocks.com/contributor-license"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "No required seller fee is listed in the public contributor guide or agreement.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contribute-faq.storyblocks.com/en/articles/16561983-how-to-sell-your-footage-on-storyblocks"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Video is non-exclusive and removable on 30 days notice; the agreement also grants dataset and model-training rights.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contribute.storyblocks.com/contributor-license"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "Member Library payouts are monthly around the 15th; Payoneer requires $10, while thresholds for PayPal, bank, wire, check and eCheck vary. AI/model-product payouts are semiannual; third-party processing fees are deducted.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://contribute-faq.storyblocks.com/en/articles/4554522-how-and-when-do-i-get-paid"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://contribute-faq.storyblocks.com/en/articles/16561983-how-to-sell-your-footage-on-storyblocks", "label": "Contributor guide"}, {"url": "https://contribute.storyblocks.com/contributor-license", "label": "Video agreement"}, {"url": "https://contribute-faq.storyblocks.com/en/articles/4554832-what-is-the-contributor-license-agreement", "label": "Exclusivity summary"}, {"url": "https://contribute-faq.storyblocks.com/en/articles/4554522-how-and-when-do-i-get-paid", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Member Library payouts come from a proprietary subscription pool and vary with contributor downloads; the contract does not publish individual shares. Separate dataset and model-product pools have their own terms. Member Library pays monthly; generative-AI payouts are semiannual.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Stock video subscription", "note": "Your share of the pool depends on your downloads. Storyblocks does not publish the pool size.", "take": {"label": "Based on downloads", "value": "Shared revenue pool", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Exclusive", "value": "No, for video", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "AI training", "value": "Included", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Storyblocks", "groups": []}}, {"id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets--classful","section_id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets","name":"Classful","summary":"Sell teaching resources and self-paced courses.","website_url":"https://classful.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/classful-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free signup; no monthly seller subscription for resource or course sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classful.com/sell-products/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller keeps 95% on resources and 80% on courses, before payment processing.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classful.com/teach-on-classful/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Resources: 5% fee + Stripe 2.9% + $0.30. Courses: 20% fee + Stripe 2.9% + $0.30.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classful.com/teach-on-classful/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe payout instructions are generally sent monthly; actual transfer timing is not guaranteed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://classful.com/terms/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://classful.com/sell-products/", "label": "Resource fees and tax"}, {"url": "https://classful.com/teach-on-classful/", "label": "Course fees"}, {"url": "https://classful.com/terms/", "label": "Payouts and refunds"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller. Resource sales: 5% Classful fee plus Stripe; courses: 20% plus Stripe. Classful says it collects and remits sales tax in all 50 states for resource sales.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Resources and courses", "note": "Classful says it collects and pays US sales tax on resource sales.", "take": {"label": "Resources", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Classful", "groups": [{"label": "Classful", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 95% before Stripe", "label": "Resources", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 80% before Stripe", "label": "Courses", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Courses", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets--made-by-teachers","section_id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets","name":"Made By Teachers","summary":"Original teaching-resource marketplace; new seller signups are currently paused.","website_url":"https://madebyteachers.com/join-and-sell-today/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current seller-plan prices are not listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://madebyteachers.com/plans/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Current seller page advertises up to 80% royalties; exact plan rates are not listed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://madebyteachers.com/plans/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller page says there are no platform fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://madebyteachers.com/plans/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal pays monthly after $50 earned, usually in weeks 2–3; PayPal fee is 2% up to a country cap.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://madebyteachers.com/seller-faq/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://madebyteachers.com/plans/", "label": "Seller plans"}, {"url": "https://madebyteachers.com/seller-faq/", "label": "Eligibility and payouts"}, {"url": "https://madebyteachers.com/join-and-sell-today/", "label": "Onboarding"}, {"url": "https://madebyteachers.com/faq/", "label": "Membership FAQ"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"The seller page advertises up to 80% royalties and says there are no platform fees, but it does not list current plan prices or tier rates. The plans page says new sellers are not being added; the FAQ says sellers can sign up. Monthly PayPal payouts start at $50; PayPal charges 2% up to a country cap.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Teaching resources", "note": "Made By Teachers is not adding new sellers right now.", "take": {"label": "Up to 80% for you", "value": "From 20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "New sellers", "value": "Paused", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Platform fees", "value": "None", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$50", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Made By Teachers", "groups": []}}, {"id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets--teacherfuel","section_id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets","name":"TeacherFuel","summary":"Sell Canadian curriculum teaching resources.","website_url":"https://www.teacherfuel.ca/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-teacherfuel-ca.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free plan; Pro CA$12.99/month or CA$129/year. School CA$299/year intro price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Current pricing shows 80% Free, 90% Pro and 100% School share. Dec 2024 terms still say 80% after processing for all sellers.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe processing is separate; exact rate is not published. Separate ClassDrop fee: 7.5% Free/Pro, 0% School.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Resource seller payouts are monthly through Stripe Connect.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/terms-of-service"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/pricing", "label": "Plans and commissions"}, {"url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/how-it-works", "label": "Seller payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.teacherfuel.ca/terms-of-service", "label": "Terms, Dec 2024"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"CAD. Current pricing lists 20% marketplace commission on Free, 10% on Pro and 0% for school-verified sellers; older December 2024 terms still state an 80% seller share after processing for all sellers. ClassDrop is separate and has separate fees.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Canadian teaching resources", "note": "TeacherFuel’s December 2024 terms still say 80% for every seller.", "take": {"label": "By plan", "value": "0–20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pro", "value": "CA$12.99 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "ClassDrop fee", "value": "7.5%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Monthly, Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "TeacherFuel", "groups": [{"label": "Current pricing page", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "Free plan", "value": "20%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 90%", "label": "Pro plan", "value": "10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 100%", "label": "School plan", "value": "0%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets--teachers-pay-teachers","section_id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets","name":"Teachers Pay Teachers","summary":"Teaching resources sold by independent teacher-authors.","website_url":"https://www.teacherspayteachers.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-teacherspayteachers-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic seller costs $29 once; Premium costs $59.95/year.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/360044219891-Seller-Fees-and-Payout-Rates"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Seller receives 55% on Basic and 80% on Premium sales.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/360044219891-Seller-Fees-and-Payout-Rates"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Basic: $0.30 per resource. Premium: $0.15 per resource on orders under $3; none at $3 or more.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/360044219891-Seller-Fees-and-Payout-Rates"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Monthly Hyperwallet payouts; available methods depend on seller country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/360042881711-How-do-I-sell-on-TPT"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/360044219891-Seller-Fees-and-Payout-Rates", "label": "Seller fees"}, {"url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/360042881711-How-do-I-sell-on-TPT", "label": "Payouts"}, {"url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/47531321175700-Sales-Tax-Overview-Step-by-Step", "label": "Sales tax duties"}, {"url": "https://help.teacherspayteachers.com/hc/en-us/articles/47532451969812-Sales-Tax-and-Your-Store", "label": "Sales tax rules"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US seller fees in USD. TPT collects/remits tax in marketplace-facilitator states; sellers may have duties in other states based on nexus.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Teaching resources", "note": "Premium sellers pay a 15¢ fee only on orders under $3.", "take": {"label": "Basic seller", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Basic", "value": "$29 once", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Premium", "value": "$59.95 a year", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Per resource", "value": "30¢ on Basic", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "TPT", "groups": [{"label": "Teachers Pay Teachers", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 55%", "label": "Basic seller", "value": "45%", "percent": 45, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "Premium seller", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Premium seller", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets--tes-resources","section_id":"teaching-resources-and-worksheets","name":"Tes Resources","summary":"Sell teaching resources with royalties based on trailing annual sales.","website_url":"https://www.tes.com/teaching-resources","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-tes-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "Current author pages do not publish a seller subscription or setup price.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.tes.com/teaching-resources/become-an-author"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Royalty: 60% below £1,000, 70% at £1,000–£5,999.99, 80% at £6,000+ rolling 12-month sales; after VAT/GST.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.tes.com/policies/help/selling-resources-faq"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "20p/20c fee per sale below £3/$3, including seller-discounted resources.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.tes.com/policies/help/selling-resources-faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Withdrawals start above £10/$10; one request weekly. Bank delivery: 5–7 working days UK, 10–12 international.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.tes.com/policies/help/selling-resources-faq"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.tes.com/policies/help/selling-resources-faq", "label": "Royalties and withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://www.tes.com/teaching-resources/become-an-author", "label": "Author signup"}, {"url": "https://www.tes.com/policies/resources-and-teach", "label": "Tax and royalties"}, {"url": "https://www.tes.com/teaching-resources/author-royalty", "label": "Royalty tiers"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Royalties are paid in the listing currency. The current author page confirms monthly rolling 12-month tiers; fee amounts come from the official FAQ last updated in 2024.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Teaching resources", "note": "Your tier is updated each month from the last 12 months of sales.", "take": {"label": "Under £1,000 a year", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Small sales", "value": "20p under £3", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "£10", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Tes", "groups": [{"label": "By 12-month sales, after VAT", "rates": [{"note": "You keep 60%", "label": "Under £1,000 a year", "value": "40%", "percent": 40, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 70%", "label": "£1,000 to £5,999", "value": "30%", "percent": 30, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "You keep 80%", "label": "£6,000 and up", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "£6,000 and up", "value": "20%", "percent": 20, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--buy-me-a-chai","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Buy Me a Chai","summary":"Take direct UPI support from Indian fans.","website_url":"https://www.buymeachai.in/","icon_path":null,"facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No monthly fee is stated; the official page says there are no fees.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.buymeachai.in/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "0% platform fee; the site describes its service as having no fees or middlemen.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.buymeachai.in/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Supporters pay creators directly through UPI; BuyMeAChai says it does not process payments.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.buymeachai.in/"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "UPI payments go straight to the creator’s bank account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.buymeachai.in/"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.buymeachai.in/", "label": "Product and fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Indian creators receiving direct UPI support; no platform fee is listed.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"BuyMeAChai platform fee; payments go directly to creators through UPI.","sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "UPI tips, India", "note": "Buy Me a Chai does not handle payments. Fans pay you directly by UPI.", "take": {"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payments", "value": "UPI, direct", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Money goes", "value": "Straight to your bank", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Buy Me a Chai", "groups": [{"label": "Buy Me a Chai", "rates": [{"label": "Platform fee", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--buy-me-a-coffee","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Buy Me a Coffee","summary":"One-time support and recurring fan memberships.","website_url":"https://buymeacoffee.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/buymeacoffee-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No monthly fee", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/8105744-how-to-calculate-charges-on-your-payment"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "5% platform fee per support transaction", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/8105744-how-to-calculate-charges-on-your-payment"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "US Stripe processing is 2.9% + $0.30; payout processing is 0.5%; international payments add 1% and subscriptions add 0.5%. Creators can cover or pass card fees to supporters.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/8105744-how-to-calculate-charges-on-your-payment"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Payout request starts at $10. First payout takes about 7–14 days including one-time review. After approval, guides say bank transfer takes 3–5 business days or 2–7 business days; the general payout guide says transfers go to Stripe each Wednesday.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/6364717-when-are-payouts-processed"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/8105744-how-to-calculate-charges-on-your-payment", "label": "Fees"}, {"url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/6364717-when-are-payouts-processed", "label": "Payout rules"}, {"url": "https://help.buymeacoffee.com/en/articles/10182730-what-is-buy-me-a-coffee-and-how-does-it-work", "label": "Weekly transfers"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US Stripe example. Platform, processing, international, subscription, and payout charges differ; payout guides give different bank timing.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"All support transactions before processing and payout fees","sort_order":1,"card":{"tag": "Tips and support", "note": "Payouts add 0.5%, and international payments add 1%.", "take": {"label": "Each payment", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "$10", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Buy Me a Coffee", "groups": [{"label": "Buy Me a Coffee", "rates": [{"label": "Each payment", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--donorbox","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Donorbox","summary":"Raise donations with forms, campaigns, events and memberships.","website_url":"https://donorbox.org/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/donorbox-org.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard is free; Pro is $150/month with discounted yearly billing; Premium is custom-priced.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://donorbox.org/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Standard: forms and donation pages 2.95%, events and memberships 3.95%; Pro: 1.75% and 2%; Premium: 1.6% and 2%. US ACH platform fees are capped at $25.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://donorbox.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360020292992-How-much-does-Donorbox-cost-What-are-its-fees"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "US domestic USD: Stripe cards 2.9% + $0.30; registered nonprofits 2.2% + $0.30 except AmEx (3.5%). ACH 0.8%, capped at $5; PayPal cards 2.89% + $0.49 (nonprofits 1.99% + $0.49). Donors may cover fees; other rates vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://donorbox.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360020292992-How-much-does-Donorbox-cost-What-are-its-fees"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Donations go to connected Stripe or PayPal accounts; those processors set payout timing. Donorbox does not hold funds.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://donorbox.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360020294412-I-m-missing-donation-funds-donations-have-not-been-transferred-to-my-bank-account"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://donorbox.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360020292992-How-much-does-Donorbox-cost-What-are-its-fees", "label": "Platform and processing fees"}, {"url": "https://donorbox.org/pricing", "label": "Plans"}, {"url": "https://donorbox.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360020294412-I-m-missing-donation-funds-donations-have-not-been-transferred-to-my-bank-account", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US domestic USD unless noted; platform fees vary by plan and feature, and processors charge separately.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":9,"card":{"tag": "Donations", "note": "Registered nonprofits get lower card rates. Donors can choose to cover fees.", "take": {"label": "Standard, donations", "value": "2.95%", "percent": 2.95, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pro", "value": "$150 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Via Stripe or PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Donorbox", "groups": [{"label": "Donations and forms", "rates": [{"label": "Standard, donations", "value": "2.95%", "percent": 2.95, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pro", "value": "1.75%", "percent": 1.75, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Premium, donations", "value": "1.6%", "percent": 1.6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Events and memberships", "rates": [{"label": "Standard", "value": "3.95%", "percent": 3.95, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Pro and Premium", "value": "2%", "percent": 2, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Premium, donations", "value": "1.6%", "percent": 1.6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--github-sponsors","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"GitHub Sponsors","summary":"Collect one-time and monthly sponsorships for open-source work.","website_url":"https://github.com/sponsors","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/github-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Sponsors can choose one-time or monthly payments to a developer or organization.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.github.com/en/sponsors/sponsoring-open-source-contributors/about-sponsorships-fees-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Personal-account sponsorships have 0% GitHub fee. Organization card sponsorships cost up to 6% total; invoicing removes the 3% card-processing portion, leaving 3%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.github.com/en/sponsors/sponsoring-open-source-contributors/about-sponsorships-fees-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Organization fee includes 3% card processing and 3% GitHub service processing; invoice billing avoids the card-processing portion.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.github.com/en/sponsors/sponsoring-open-source-contributors/about-sponsorships-fees-and-taxes"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe Connect payouts usually start on the 22nd monthly; the first payout follows a 60-day hold. ACH or wire pays on the third Thursday after a $100 threshold. Cross-border minimums and country rules may differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/github-terms/github-sponsors-additional-terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://docs.github.com/en/sponsors/sponsoring-open-source-contributors/about-sponsorships-fees-and-taxes", "label": "Fees and billing"}, {"url": "https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/github-terms/github-sponsors-additional-terms", "label": "Payment timing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"GitHub Sponsors; fees depend on whether a sponsor pays from a personal or organization account.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":10,"card":{"tag": "Open-source sponsorships", "note": "Payouts usually start on the 22nd of each month.", "take": {"label": "Personal accounts", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Sponsors", "value": "One-time or monthly", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Invoiced orgs", "value": "3%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "First payout", "value": "60-day hold", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "GitHub", "groups": [{"label": "GitHub Sponsors", "rates": [{"label": "Personal accounts", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "Includes 3% card processing", "label": "Organizations, by card", "value": "6%", "percent": 6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Organizations, invoiced", "value": "3%", "percent": 3, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Organizations, by card", "value": "6%", "percent": 6, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--ko-fi","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Ko-fi","summary":"Receive tips directly through Stripe or PayPal.","website_url":"https://ko-fi.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/ko-fi-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Free account; optional Ko-fi Gold is $12/month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360005506873-What-is-Ko-fi-Gold"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Free mode: 0% one-time tips and 5% on other sales. Standard mode: 5% all transactions. Gold: 0% on new payments; all memberships started before Gold keep 5%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002506494-Does-Ko-fi-take-a-fee"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "PayPal/Stripe processing applies separately and varies by account, country, and currency; Ko-fi says it is typically around 3% + $0.30.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002506494-Does-Ko-fi-take-a-fee"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payments go directly to PayPal or Stripe, without a Ko-fi payout step or minimum balance.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/4402945994001-Ko-fi-Memberships-and-Membership-Tiers"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://ko-fi.com/pricing", "label": "Plan comparison"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002506494-Does-Ko-fi-take-a-fee", "label": "Fees and payments"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/360005506873-What-is-Ko-fi-Gold", "label": "Gold price"}, {"url": "https://help.ko-fi.com/hc/en-us/articles/4402945994001-Ko-fi-Memberships-and-Membership-Tiers", "label": "Membership billing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Platform fee varies by payment type, account mode, and Gold status. Payments go directly to PayPal or Stripe.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":0,"card":{"tag": "Tips and support", "note": "Memberships started before Gold keep the 5% fee.", "take": {"label": "Tips, Free mode", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Gold", "value": "$12 a month", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "About 3% + 30¢", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Payouts", "value": "Straight to you", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Ko-fi", "groups": [{"label": "Ko-fi", "rates": [{"label": "Tips, Free mode", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Other sales, Free mode", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "All payments", "label": "Standard mode", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "New payments", "label": "Gold", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Other sales, Free mode", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--liberapay","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Liberapay","summary":"Collect recurring donations without a platform commission.","website_url":"https://liberapay.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/liberapay-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Recurring donations for public-benefit work; payments cannot promise a reward, and one-time giving is not fully supported.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://liberapay.com/about/faq"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Liberapay takes no cut of donations.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://liberapay.com/about/faq"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Processor fees vary by method, country and currency; Liberapay reports trailing-year averages of 3% for Stripe and 5% for PayPal.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://liberapay.com/about/faq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Funds go straight to Stripe or PayPal. Stripe auto-pays to bank by default; PayPal holds funds until the creator spends or withdraws them.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://liberapay.com/about/faq"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://liberapay.com/about/faq", "label": "Fees and rules"}, {"url": "https://liberapay.com/about/payment-processors", "label": "Payment processors"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Recurring donations; processing averages and creator availability depend on payment method and country.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Liberapay platform fee only; Stripe or PayPal processing fees apply.","sort_order":11,"card":{"tag": "Recurring donations", "note": "Donations cannot promise rewards.", "take": {"label": "Platform cut", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Donations", "value": "Recurring only", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Stripe fees", "value": "About 3%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Money goes", "value": "Straight to you", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Liberapay", "groups": [{"label": "Liberapay", "rates": [{"label": "Platform cut", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--open-collective","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Open Collective","summary":"Collect transparent community funding through a fiscal host.","website_url":"https://opencollective.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/opencollective-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Collectives have no organization subscription. New organization plans are $0, $60 or $320/month; extra costs depend on active collectives and paid expenses.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://opencollective.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Collective contributions have no platform fee with optional Platform Tips; organizations can choose a 5% Crowdfunding Fee instead. Fiscal hosts set separate fees, usually 4%–10%, sometimes higher.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://opencollective.com/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Stripe, PayPal, Wise and other processors set their own fees; Open Collective and fiscal hosts do not add a markup.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://documentation.opencollective.com/why-open-collective/pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Fiscal hosts receive and hold funds for hosted Collectives; independent Collectives use their own bank account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://opencollective.com/pricing"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://opencollective.com/pricing", "label": "Organization plans"}, {"url": "https://documentation.opencollective.com/why-open-collective/pricing", "label": "Platform and host fees"}, {"url": "https://documentation.opencollective.com/fiscal-hosts/platform-settlements", "label": "Settlement"}, {"url": "https://opencollective.com/ofico/updates/updated-pricing-for-organizations-designed-for-long-term-sustainability", "label": "Pricing update, 2026"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"New Organization USD plans from March 2026; crowdfunding uses optional Platform Tips or a 5% fee, and Fiscal Hosts set separate rates.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":12,"card":{"tag": "Community funding", "note": "Fiscal hosts hold the money for hosted collectives.", "take": {"label": "With optional tips", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Collectives", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Fiscal host", "value": "Usually 4–10%", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "No markup", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Open Collective", "groups": [{"label": "Open Collective", "rates": [{"label": "With optional tips", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Fixed fee option", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}, {"label": "Fiscal host", "rates": [{"note": "Set by each host", "label": "Typical host fee", "value": "4–10%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Fixed fee option", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--saweria","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Saweria","summary":"Collect livestream support in Indonesia and the Philippines.","website_url":"https://saweria.co/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/saweria-co.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "not_public", "value": "No monthly plan price is shown on the official pricing page.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://saweria.co/"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Official schedule: Indonesia 5%–6% per tip (min Rp150); Philippines 10% (min PHP1.50). Terms set 5% standard, but contracts may differ.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://saweria.co/"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Additional payment-gateway charges may apply on withdrawal; supported local wallets depend on country.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://saweria.co/terms"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Payout costs Rp5,000 in Indonesia or PHP50 in the Philippines. Terms allow up to 2 days and charge Rp10,000 monthly after six months of inactivity while funds remain.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://saweria.co/terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://saweria.co/", "label": "Fee schedule"}, {"url": "https://saweria.co/terms", "label": "Service terms"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Published creator-support rates in Indonesia and the Philippines; country rates differ and contracts may set other rates.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":6,"card":{"tag": "Stream tips, Indonesia", "note": "The inactive fee starts after six months without activity.", "take": {"label": "Indonesia", "value": "5–6%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Plan", "value": "None listed", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Payout fee", "value": "Rp5,000", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Inactive fee", "value": "Rp10,000 a month", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Saweria", "groups": [{"label": "Saweria", "rates": [{"note": "At least Rp150 per tip", "label": "Indonesia", "value": "5–6%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"note": "At least PHP1.50", "label": "Philippines", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Philippines", "value": "10%", "percent": 10, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--sociabuzz","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Sociabuzz","summary":"Receive fan tips and withdraw them to a bank or GoPay.","website_url":"https://sociabuzz.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/sociabuzz-com.ico","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "No registration or subscription fee for SociaBuzz TRIBE.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sociabuzz.com/tribe/platform"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "SociaBuzz charges 5% per transaction.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sociabuzz.com/tribe/platform"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "The 5% includes payment-gateway and operating costs.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sociabuzz.com/tribe/platform"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Withdrawals take up to 3 business days; minimum Rp50,000, with Rp4,500 bank or Rp1,000 GoPay charge.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.sociabuzz.com/tribe/platform"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.sociabuzz.com/tribe/platform", "label": "Pricing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"SociaBuzz TRIBE in Indonesia; 5% covers payment gateway and operating costs, with withdrawal charges extra.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"TRIBE support transactions; bank and GoPay withdrawal charges are separate.","sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Fan tips, Indonesia", "note": "Bank withdrawals cost Rp4,500. GoPay costs Rp1,000.", "take": {"label": "Each payment", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Gateway", "value": "Included", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Minimum payout", "value": "Rp50,000", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "SociaBuzz", "groups": [{"label": "SociaBuzz", "rates": [{"note": "Gateway costs included", "label": "Each payment", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--streamelements","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"StreamElements","summary":"Collect livestream tips through PayPal.","website_url":"https://streamelements.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/streamelements-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Razer says creators should connect PayPal to continue earning tips.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.razer.com/streamelements/acquisition"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "StreamElements takes no commission on tips.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.streamelements.com/hc/en-us/articles/10474710869394-Tipping-Overview"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Payment-provider processing fees apply; StreamElements does not publish a current rate table.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.streamelements.com/hc/en-us/articles/10474710869394-Tipping-Overview"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Existing SE.Pay balance can be withdrawn until Dec 31, 2026; connect PayPal to continue earning tips.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.razer.com/streamelements/acquisition"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.streamelements.com/hc/en-us/articles/10474710869394-Tipping-Overview", "label": "Tipping fees"}, {"url": "https://support.streamelements.com/hc/en-us/articles/10474949509138-SE-Pay-Stripe-FAQ", "label": "SE.Pay migration"}, {"url": "https://support.streamelements.com/hc/en-us/articles/10474426240914-SE-Pay-Overview", "label": "SE.Pay payouts"}, {"url": "https://www.razer.com/streamelements/acquisition", "label": "Razer notice"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"StreamElements says it takes no commission on tips; payment providers charge their own processing fees. Razer says creators should connect PayPal to keep earning tips. Existing SE.Pay balances can be withdrawn until Dec 31, 2026.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"StreamElements tip commission only; PayPal or Stripe processing fees remain.","sort_order":8,"card":{"tag": "Stream tips", "note": "Connect PayPal to keep receiving tips. SE.Pay balances can be withdrawn until the end of 2026.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Payments", "value": "PayPal", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "SE.Pay balance", "value": "Until 31 Dec 2026", "fact_key": "fact-4"}, {"label": "Processing", "value": "Not published", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "StreamElements", "groups": [{"label": "StreamElements", "rates": [{"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--streamlabs","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Streamlabs","summary":"Add one-time and monthly tip pages to livestreams.","website_url":"https://streamlabs.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/streamlabs-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Tip pages are free; creators can accept one-time and monthly tips. Ultra is optional for extra design and domain options.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://streamlabs.com/donations"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Streamlabs takes no commission on tips.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://streamlabs.com/donations"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Stripe card tips: standard US rate 2.9% + $0.30; rates vary by creator and donor country. Different-currency tips add 2%. Withdrawals under $2,000 cost 0.5%; over $2,000 cost $10, capped at $10 monthly. The FAQ does not state the fee at exactly $2,000. PayPal fees vary by account.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.streamlabs.com/hc/en-us/articles/42349792511771-Stripe-Tipping-FAQs"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal tips go to the linked PayPal account; Stripe card tips are withdrawn to the linked bank. Streamlabs does not hold tips.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.streamlabs.com/hc/en-us/articles/50635504413467-Quick-Guide-Setting-Up-Tipping-on-Streamlabs"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://streamlabs.com/donations", "label": "Tipping fees"}, {"url": "https://streamlabs.com/content-hub/post/quick-guide-setting-up-tipping-on-streamlabs", "label": "Setup and payouts"}, {"url": "https://support.streamlabs.com/hc/en-us/articles/42349792511771-Stripe-Tipping-FAQs", "label": "Stripe tipping"}, {"url": "https://support.streamlabs.com/hc/en-us/articles/50635504413467-Quick-Guide-Setting-Up-Tipping-on-Streamlabs", "label": "Tip page setup"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"US Stripe card rate; processor rates and currency fees vary by country. Tips go directly to PayPal or a linked bank account through Stripe.","fee_percent":0,"fee_basis":"Streamlabs tip commission only; standard payment-processing fees still apply.","sort_order":7,"card":{"tag": "Stream tips", "note": "Streamlabs does not hold tips. PayPal tips go straight to your PayPal.", "take": {"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Tip pages", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Card fees", "value": "2.9% + 30¢ Stripe", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Withdrawal", "value": "0.5% under $2,000", "fact_key": "fact-3"}], "owner": "Streamlabs", "groups": [{"label": "Streamlabs", "rates": [{"label": "Commission", "value": "0%", "percent": 0, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--tipeee","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Tipeee","summary":"Collect recurring and one-time tips from your audience.","website_url":"https://www.tipeee.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-tipeee-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Registration and use are free; the platform lists no fixed upfront or subscription charge.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tipeee.com/hc/en-150/articles/360010326780-What-is-the-cost-of-the-service"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Tipeee takes 8% including tax from amounts collected each month.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tipeee.com/hc/en-150/articles/360010326780-What-is-the-cost-of-the-service"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal takes 1% of post-commission payouts, capped at €6; other provider fees may vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tipeee.com/hc/en-150/articles/360010326780-What-is-the-cost-of-the-service"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "PayPal tips go to PayPal and card tips go to a bank account; creators need both to receive both types.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://help.tipeee.com/hc/en-150/articles/28568916140188-What-payout-methods-are-available-on-Tipeee"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://help.tipeee.com/hc/en-150/articles/360010326780-What-is-the-cost-of-the-service", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://help.tipeee.com/hc/en-150/articles/28568916140188-What-payout-methods-are-available-on-Tipeee", "label": "Payout methods"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Tipeee creator tips; commission includes tax, with extra payout and provider fees where applicable.","fee_percent":8,"fee_basis":"Monthly collected tips; Tipeee’s 8% commission includes tax.","sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "Recurring tips", "note": "You need both PayPal and a bank account to receive both kinds of tips.", "take": {"label": "Monthly tips", "value": "8%", "percent": 8, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Start", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "PayPal payout", "value": "1%, max €6", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Card tips", "value": "Paid to your bank", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Tipeee", "groups": [{"label": "Tipeee", "rates": [{"note": "Tax included", "label": "Monthly tips", "value": "8%", "percent": 8, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tips-and-creator-support--trakteer","section_id":"tips-and-creator-support","name":"Trakteer","summary":"Accept Indonesian fan support and sell digital products.","website_url":"https://trakteer.id/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/trakteer-id.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Creator pages, fan support, posts, goals, stream gifts and a digital-product Shop.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://new.trakteer.id/feature-and-pricing"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "Trakteer charges a 5% platform fee on each support payment.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://new.trakteer.id/feature-and-pricing"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "Gateway rates: OVO/DANA/LinkAja 1.65%, Jenius 2.2%, QRIS 0.77%, GoPay/ShopeePay 2%, bank VA Rp4,000, BCA VA Rp3,900, cards 3.4%; Balance/Coin Rp0. Creators may pass gateway fees to supporters.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://new.trakteer.id/feature-and-pricing"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "Terms say Rp5,000 per withdrawal; Help Center says queued withdrawals are free and instant withdrawals cost Rp5,000. Official sources conflict.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://new.trakteer.id/terms"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://new.trakteer.id/feature-and-pricing", "label": "Pricing"}, {"url": "https://new.trakteer.id/terms", "label": "Terms and withdrawals"}, {"url": "https://help.trakteer.id/help-center/articles/28/tentang-instant-withdrawal", "label": "Withdrawal fees"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Indonesian creator support in IDR; gateway and withdrawal costs are separate from the 5% support fee.","fee_percent":5,"fee_basis":"Creator support payments before payment-gateway and withdrawal charges; the page does not state this rate for Shop sales.","sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Fan support, Indonesia", "note": "Payment method fees are extra, and you can pass them to supporters.", "take": {"label": "Support payments", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "QRIS fee", "value": "0.77%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Card fee", "value": "3.4%", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Withdrawal", "value": "Free or Rp5,000", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "Trakteer", "groups": [{"label": "Trakteer", "rates": [{"label": "Support payments", "value": "5%", "percent": 5, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching--amazingtalker","section_id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching","name":"AmazingTalker","summary":"Tutors set prices and teach students online.","website_url":"https://en.amazingtalker.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/en-amazingtalker-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Tutor sets lesson prices", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://en.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/english"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "Official regional teacher page lists commission from 0% to 30%, declining as monthly lesson income rises; it does not give a readable exact tier table.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://cn.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/programming/html"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Tutor sets trial lesson price", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://en.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/english"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "verified", "value": "Profile listed at no cost", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://en.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/english"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Tutor application reviewed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://en.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/english"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://en.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/english", "label": "Pricing and application"}, {"url": "https://amazingtalker.elevio.help/en/articles/402-how-to-calculate-your-actual-income-while-you-teach-on-amazingtalker", "label": "Income guide"}, {"url": "https://cn.amazingtalker.com/apply-to-teach/programming/html", "label": "Regional tutor page"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Official regional teacher page lists commission from 0% to 30%, declining as monthly lesson income rises; exact calculation tiers are not publicly readable.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":4,"card":{"tag": "Online tutoring", "note": "AmazingTalker does not publish its exact tiers.", "take": {"label": "Falls as income rises", "value": "0–30%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Trials", "value": "You set the price", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Listing", "value": "Free", "fact_key": "fact-4"}], "owner": "AmazingTalker", "groups": []}}, {"id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching--cambly","section_id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching","name":"Cambly","summary":"English tutors earn a fixed rate per chat minute.","website_url":"https://www.cambly.com/tutors","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-cambly-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Fixed per-minute tutor pay", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://email-proxy.cambly.com/english/tutors"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "verified", "value": "$0.17/min adult; $0.20/min Kids", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://email-proxy.cambly.com/english/tutors"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "not_public", "value": "Trial pay not published separately", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://studentsupport.cambly.com/hc/en-us/articles/360048840311-Try-Cambly"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Tutor signup fee not stated", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://email-proxy.cambly.com/english/tutors"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "New tutor intake limited; no degree needed", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://email-proxy.cambly.com/english/tutors"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://email-proxy.cambly.com/english/tutors", "label": "Tutor pay"}, {"url": "https://studentsupport.cambly.com/hc/en-us/articles/360048840311-Try-Cambly", "label": "Student trial"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Fixed pay per connected minute: $0.17 for Cambly and $0.20 for Cambly Kids; weekly payouts.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":3,"card":{"tag": "English tutoring, fixed pay", "note": "Cambly pays a fixed rate per minute. It does not publish how much it keeps.", "take": {"label": "Your pay an hour, adults", "value": "$10.20", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Adults", "value": "17¢ a minute", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Kids", "value": "20¢ a minute", "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Degree", "value": "Not needed", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Cambly", "groups": [{"label": "Cambly pays you", "rates": [{"label": "Your pay an hour, adults", "value": "$10.20", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, {"label": "Your pay an hour, Kids", "value": "$12", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}], "second": {"label": "Your pay an hour, Kids", "value": "$12", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}}}, {"id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching--italki","section_id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching","name":"italki","summary":"Language tutors set prices for online lessons.","website_url":"https://teach.italki.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/teach-italki-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Current official Google Play listing says teachers set their own lesson prices.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?hl=en-US&id=com.italki.app"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "The official 2021 teacher handbook says italki took 15% of completed lessons, excluding trials. Current rate is unconfirmed; the 2025 commission update and Help Center page were inaccessible.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f6c06ea5780254500e94751/612cad97d81cf83b991de98b_Handbook%20for%20New%20Teachers%20-%20English%20%282021%29.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "variable", "value": "The 2021 handbook says trials are 30 minutes and paid; completed-lesson commission did not apply. Current trial terms are unconfirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f6c06ea5780254500e94751/612cad97d81cf83b991de98b_Handbook%20for%20New%20Teachers%20-%20English%20%282021%29.pdf"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "No current teacher signup fee is listed in the accessible official public sources.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://teach.italki.com/"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "variable", "value": "The 2021 handbook says teacher profiles need approval after setup. Current openings and approval requirements vary by language and are not confirmed.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f6c06ea5780254500e94751/612cad97d81cf83b991de98b_Handbook%20for%20New%20Teachers%20-%20English%20%282021%29.pdf"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.italki.com/hc/en-us/articles/206352068-How-does-italki-charge-a-commission", "label": "Commission article"}, {"url": "https://support.italki.com/hc/en-us/community/posts/41864760366617-Important-Updates-Commission-Structure-and-New-Rewards-Program", "label": "2025 commission update"}, {"url": "https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f6c06ea5780254500e94751/612cad97d81cf83b991de98b_Handbook%20for%20New%20Teachers%20-%20English%20%282021%29.pdf", "label": "Teacher handbook, 2021"}, {"url": "https://teach.italki.com/", "label": "Teacher application"}, {"url": "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?hl=en-US&id=com.italki.app", "label": "App listing"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Current teachers set their own prices, but current commission terms are unconfirmed. The last directly readable official handbook (2021) lists 15% on completed lessons, excluding 30-minute paid trials; current payment processing fees/options and the 2025 commission update could not be confirmed.","fee_percent":null,"fee_basis":null,"sort_order":2,"card":{"tag": "Language tutoring", "note": "The current italki rate could not be confirmed. 15% comes from the 2021 handbook.", "take": {"label": "2021 rate", "value": "15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Trials", "value": "Paid, 30 min in 2021", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Approval needed", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "italki", "groups": [{"label": "2021 teacher handbook", "rates": [{"note": "Completed lessons; trials excluded", "label": "2021 rate", "value": "15%", "percent": null, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching--lessonface","section_id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching","name":"Lessonface","summary":"Teach private lessons or group classes with different rates.","website_url":"https://www.lessonface.com/","icon_path":"/platform-fees/icons/www-lessonface-com.png","facts":[{"key": "fact-1", "state": "verified", "value": "Teachers set private-lesson rates.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lessonface.com/about-teaching"}, {"key": "fact-2", "state": "variable", "value": "5–30% by format; current fee table lists a 10% referred group fee, while teacher terms say 20%.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lessonface.com/content/lessonface-fees-and-formats"}, {"key": "fact-3", "state": "verified", "value": "Teachers may offer one free 15- or 30-minute trial.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lessonface.com/teacherfaq"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "variable", "value": "No signup fee listed. US bank payout is free; FAQ says $3/check, older payment page says $1 US/$2 international; PayPal fees vary.", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lessonface.com/teacherfaq"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Teacher approval; US background badge is optional", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://www.lessonface.com/teacherfaq"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://www.lessonface.com/about-teaching", "label": "Pricing and application"}, {"url": "https://www.lessonface.com/content/lessonface-fees-and-formats", "label": "Fee table"}, {"url": "https://www.lessonface.com/terms", "label": "Teacher terms"}, {"url": "https://www.lessonface.com/teacherfaq", "label": "Teacher FAQ"}, {"url": "https://www.lessonface.com/teacherpayment", "label": "Payouts"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basi