-does-Verbling-work-and-what-should-I-know"}, {"key": "fact-4", "state": "not_public", "value": "Signup fee not stated", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.verbling.com/hc/en-us/articles/360007839277-I-am-a-language-teacher-and-would-like-to-teach-on-Verbling-How-do-I-apply"}, {"key": "fact-5", "state": "verified", "value": "Teacher application required", "checked_at": "2026-09-30", "source_url": "https://support.verbling.com/hc/en-us/articles/360007839277-I-am-a-language-teacher-and-would-like-to-teach-on-Verbling-How-do-I-apply"}],"sources":[{"url": "https://support.verbling.com/hc/en-us/articles/360007886158-NEW-TEACHERS-How-does-Verbling-work-and-what-should-I-know", "label": "Fee and trial terms"}, {"url": "https://support.verbling.com/hc/en-us/articles/360007886078-How-do-I-set-my-hourly-rates", "label": "Price setting"}, {"url": "https://support.verbling.com/hc/en-us/articles/360007839277-I-am-a-language-teacher-and-would-like-to-teach-on-Verbling-How-do-I-apply", "label": "Application steps"}],"checked_at":"2026-09-30","comparison_basis":"Verbling deducts 15% from the tutor’s listed rate; teachers can cash out once per week.","fee_percent":15,"fee_basis":"Tutor’s listed lesson rate","sort_order":5,"card":{"tag": "Language tutoring", "note": "Verbling takes 15% of each lesson.", "take": {"label": "Lessons", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}, "lines": [{"label": "Pricing", "value": "You set it", "fact_key": "fact-1"}, {"label": "Trials", "value": "Optional, 30 min", "fact_key": "fact-3"}, {"label": "Access", "value": "Application", "fact_key": "fact-5"}], "owner": "Verbling", "groups": [{"label": "Verbling", "rates": [{"label": "Lessons", "value": "15%", "percent": 15, "fact_key": "fact-2"}]}]}}, {"id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching--wyzant","section_id":"tutoring-and-live-teaching","name":"Wyzant","summary":"Tutors set rates for online or in-person lessons.","website_url":"https://www.wyzant.com/tutorsignupstart","icon_